(12918, 1, '2021-03-31 11:43:25', '2021-03-31 11:43:25', '<h2>About Us</h2>		\n			<h2>Home > About</h2>		\n		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yGDwk4z9EEg		\n			<style>\n.elementor-widget.elementor-widget-video {\n     transition: .4s ease-in-out;\n}\n.elementor-widget.elementor-widget-video:hover {\n   box-shadow: 0px 5px 20px rgb(39 57 101 / 30%);\n    border-radius: 8px;\n}\n</style>		\n			<h2>There’s no system too big to reimagine—not even the criminal justice system</h2>		\n		<p>Do you ever scroll through images of beautiful lettering on Instagram and think to yourself that if you could do the same?</p><p>Nam eget faucibus felis. Vivamus quis enim lectus. Phasellus justo mi, ornare id venenatis ac, gravida sed ante. Fusce eget nisl id nisi tempus blandit.</p>		\n			<h2>Things that make us proud</h2>		\n		<p>Choose your learning level</p>		\n				<h3>\n					Beginner\n				</h3>\n								<p>With analytics tools, to help you share with current and future clients.</p>\n				<h3>\n					Advanced\n				</h3>\n								<p>All services for our team of industry experts, personal training.</p>\n				<h3>\n					Intermediate\n				</h3>\n								<p>Total collections, quoting, enrollment, and reporting in Italian and English.</p>\n				<h3>\n					Mastery\n				</h3>\n								<p>We can help you set up and manager your groups if you are become our partner.</p>\n			<h2>Meet our President</h2>		\n		<p>Do you ever scroll through images of beautiful lettering on Instagram and think to yourself that if you could do the same?</p><p>Nam eget faucibus felis. Vivamus quis enim lectus. Phasellus justo mi, ornare id venenatis ac, gravida sed ante. Fusce eget nisl id nisi tempus blandit.</p>		\n										<img width=\"430\" height=\"531\" src=\"https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/president.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/president.png 430w, https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/president-243x300.png 243w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 100vw, 430px\" />											\n			<h2>People committed to public purpose</h2>		\n										<img width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/instructor-2-1.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/instructor-2-1.png 500w, https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/instructor-2-1-300x300.png 300w, https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/instructor-2-1-150x150.png 150w, https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/instructor-2-1-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" />											\n			<h2>Devon Lane</h2>		\n		<p>Professor</p>		\n										<img width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/instructor-4.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/instructor-4.png 500w, https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/instructor-4-300x300.png 300w, https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/instructor-4-150x150.png 150w, https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-university/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/instructor-4-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" />											\n			<h2>Courtney Henry</h2>		\n		<p>Assistant Professor</p>		\n										<img src=\"https://preview.tutorlms.com/elementor-starter/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/04/instructor-3.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" />											\n			<h2>Jane Cooper</h2>		\n		<p>Assistant Professor</p>		\n										<img width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"https: