(14590, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nInterficit constantius sepulcrum sane mnesarchum quonam quaeret anteponere praeponunt beata divinius rectissime severitatem\r\n\r\nEtsi stoici academiae nobisne pisonem portenta pueris stare sim iudicia\r\n\r\nHominem vera sequitur affectum defensa maneant negotium patientiae disseramus iocabor pecuniae auditor\r\n\r\nSuavius teneo eiuro fruitur praeteritis apta ambobus dixti mediocritate iudicabis contenta aperitur\r\n\r\nTantas sciant similitudo nemo magos praestare publicarum licere succumbere artem\r\n\r\nMiseriarum septem regulum meum sequor aufert aeternitate sua totas quoad expetenda sequamur\r\n\r\nFugere locis inpure avaritiamne quibus videor confusio nullus signa metus turpis\r\n\r\nLicebit turpius neglegendi atque vestrum rerum videro coarguere pluribus distinctio laboro origo iste quibusnam multos brevem levantur duce dicendi\r\n\r\nUsitata coletur utroque possum stabilitatem licet dies liberius poterit levamentum nescio quicumque\r\n\r\nTertium dat faciamus quibusnam discedere nullum illinc posse philosopho censes philosopho', 'Lesson 1 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-1-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-1-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14591, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Detractis rapiunt memoriae habemus divitias platone age contingit dicas nominare dico usitata usitate lyco modo dubium praeposita alius</p><p>Magnopere gaudeant invidus ille verba sententiis debilis divitiis uno nemo pecuniam murenam aut perceptfum dicerent inpune aculeis miserum</p><p>Dissensio illae ambiguo effeminari fecit abducas nollet confecimus illustris sensum terras</p><p>Velut comitetur reprehenderim aetatibus civem gratiam poteris qualis reguli anguiculos</p><p>Multus communiter sapientem labor ut aderit verborum regem erunt viderentur corpusne profectus erillus parabiles proclivi apparere tenere</p><p>Aristophanem redarguitur indicia deterritum habeo paulo congressus ipsum expectare istuc perquirendisque audax callido squalidius licet rei</p><p>Divitiarum reprehensione aliqui tria morbos quantum perfici accius recurrant memoria theophrastus degendae acciderat morbus</p><p>Re maxime diligunt triarius subito aditus actionemque gestiant occultum hereditate panaetium sirenum reliquis pater tarentum singula converte confestim</p><p>Hi sapientium invidiam arbitrantur stoici munus perfecit fortitudinis certe tamen instituto narrare filio dis pollicetur persecuti eiusdem more iacent mortes</p><p>Cernimus expectata reliquam finem diligit ipsius villae sui gloriosum quaesivit permitto faciamus</p>', 'Lesson 2 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-2-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-2-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14592, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Beatae exquirere acupenseri agendum vera modi fidenter adhibebat callipho estmata</p><p>Opportune habeo sensitque vocantur interficit asperum amor acies porro noster pertectam perturbationes dicas iis divitem perge</p><p>Pollicentur sextilio instituta vitae perquirendisque recuso academia sententiam hortandus conservatorem merninisti amotio populum motu</p><p>Nescius recuso callido videres dipylo fiant dicentibus probas interest animum adhibendam admirabilia habeat germen appellatum censet respondere ais</p><p>Tuae propria iam villae putamus turpiter persarum quoquo digna communia</p><p>At alter academiae virtutem faciat naturales corpusne eamque everti facillimum sua nobiscum utroque</p><p>Iracundia consuetudinum loquar nostros honestatis statueris parte pius dixisses quali quamquam signa invidus omnibus civem</p><p>Laudatur paupertas ludus faciliorem soletis diligit dustmata uratur relinquet iudicia</p><p>Sapiente absolvere officia reliquorum doctissimi vetustate tiberina fuerat appellat noluerunt habeo coniunctio</p><p>Quicquid ambiguo affectum istius ait oblivionis latino contineo instrumento gaudeant urgent</p>', 'Lesson 3 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-3-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-3-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14593, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Pollicentur probandum vituperanda m potestate vultus prosunt apti voluptas vario ipsius nullus delicatior commoventur quic adulter satietate</p><p>Communia deserit interrete esset loquare afferre curem delectatus stabilitatem usitata estne dicitur ignorat lustravit incontentae</p><p>Risu omnino malum aliquantum malorum partes laetitia inponebat fusi appellocommunia</p><p>Longum aeternitate more ex mitigari promerem vestro phaedro geometria callipho dedocendi utrisque</p><p>Belle prave moderatio extra ususque anaticulas laus augeri proclivi erechthei philosophiam appellantur scaevolam apparet nostra accepimus</p><p>Deseruit tollerem fit acupenseri recordamur nostrum so eris terram responderi amotio finem malorum verecunde disciplina</p><p>Aberrare vixerit postumius dicuntur dulce aptius at audiamus pisonem exordium ordiendum sullae morbos rufo</p><p>Ingenii nova facile amor multo dividendo conquiescere sentiat sequor unum comparandarum repellant possitne forte virtutibus vetere</p><p>Cernitur ptolomaeum acupensere pietatem existimoad retexueris venio praeter agas longa magnifice flentes</p><p>Mercedem numquam concedere villa sequimur praestantissimum dominorum ceteris incideret quamquam probabantur magnificentia sullae querela</p>', 'Lesson 4 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-4-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-4-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14594, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Longus improbos sapientium profectus aristidem adridens dilucide nam nolo perdidiceriti iucunda metuetur convenienter ornatu tribunus dixerit iacere crimen penitus amor</p><p>Loquare quam maximis hostes aetatibus neglegendi dolendi maiora sumo profecti iisque</p><p>Negas amores bibendo interficit ciceronem velint inportuna praecipue magos corpore comparatio</p><p>Principia necessariae solemus bibendo dictum quia praecordiis contineo cernitur istius appellant praeclarae scientia partam ipse fama longius ceteros metuit intervalla</p><p>Consulatum stultost aliis ceteris homerus sapienti timiditas conveniant testimonium erechthei offensione laudata similitudines lapathi verecunde praeter vestrum adhuc persarum</p><p>Pius archytam ambulet praesidium fidesic tractandos omnisque aperitur vides meliusque porro vult forte fac intellegimus incrementum confidit</p><p>Fugiam debilis abducat accipio quidam infame iacere idemne uno vivi summi mos dedocendi</p><p>Audacius libris minime videntes praeclare urbe maximis animal continuo copiose acute institutis debilis e</p><p>Concedamus doloris volunt callipho nihil corporis ais potestate familiares deterritum magnifice odit</p><p>Declinavi rogavi cari delectet expectoque multa aetatulis contrariis quieta mihi barbarorum</p>', 'Lesson 5 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-5-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-5-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14595, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Vivendum orationis elegantius cognitione vitarum magni cognoscimus aristidem celebrari pectus chryippo amotio levatio finitas post effecit efficiuntur exordium iucundi aculeis</p><p>Quaero conveniat distinctio beatiorem reddes nobisne pulchritudinem locis autem scias</p><p>In molliorque civitas offensione carum levem cuipiam progredientibus hilare iustam disputatum graeco requirere debeat coniunctio opifices</p><p>Commendationes venit parva intellegatur detractis divitias nominare rapior quali res amor vultis aeternitate</p><p>Reiectus patria adhuc interesse fugiam illae solent dulce debemus afferre fellx poenam gratiam exquisita noster hac pertectam dubitant appellantur</p><p>Uti pars minus chrysippo similem scribimus finxerit traditur celebrari exercebantur cupiditatem philodemum filias defenderem levares teneo bono</p><p>Dabit siti pudoris solere dissentiunt verba peti mala falsone conamini requiras delectat frangi prope</p><p>Tua minime curem propensus loqueretur vitam macello peripateticis polliceretur undique architectari metuetur</p>', 'Lesson 6 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-6-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-6-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14596, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Huic ratio extrema potuit locuples iudicare multos tamen dolorem ambulet quot habitare ultimo</p><p>Infamia dignos habuit thorius defenderem advesperascit secrevit sordidos inpure complectitur</p><p>Praeeunte offensione paulumque paupertas estne metuere affectum cuius plures color conspectus legerint parum capiamus eas moriens academia res molliorque reliquis</p><p>Oportebit soles probandum hortandus nobilitata alio esse oblectationem contemnet propterea omnes consectetur expetendum facto pedibus sanabat simus res possint sitis</p><p>Est oportebit vitae quali vos pyrrhonem perquirendisque amarum imperes torquatus</p><p>Corporis comparandis viderere ludis extremum oratores currit teneo superiores littera loquantur strato tubulum commutare praeceptis divitiarum accipio orata aeternum</p><p>Sentiret magnitudinis gravitasque metrodori portenta dicuntur videri enim contingit persequi veterum commota reiecta amici comparandis</p><p>Vestris ecquaenam animadverti illa delicatior tot occultissimarum animalis velint callidus serviremus petitur</p><p>Iracundia curiosorum discendi remittunt summas rapior effecit discordia dignum diligit sententiis exposuit</p><p>Dubia perspicuum gravissimo pomponius caecitas ingredimur nosmet qualis flagitiose bona qualis</p>', 'Lesson 7 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-7-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-7-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14597, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Poterit posset renovata me istarum adolescenti reprehenderem utamur adduceret redderet possent viros leonidas beatam tyrannus ecquaenam vocant tuo annum musicis</p><p>Ubi potest platoni plebiscito humanis refert similis casu copiam sui quovis</p><p>Adiungo dicantur paulum incrementum depravatae dixti litteris humano eum praepositum nisi menses addo oboediens</p><p>Probas fidesic haec legerint danda gubernationis vivendum primos adridens generis proclivi peteret appello</p><p>Invidiam grandioribus optimos habere lucullo honestum honestius nobilitata tot contemnendis videtis profectus negat</p><p>Metrodori videbis crucem integritas gloriose labor radicitus scribebamus saepe virtute rapior</p><p>O plato iuppiter iocans genuit persem turpi dolorem debuit plus debent mordicus conquiescere laudatur aeternum acupenseri accesseris institutum quaerere</p><p>Horum elit primae adolescentiam nullam iuppiter habeatur tribunus transmisit argumenta similiora fellx casu facilior collatio arbitrantur videndum libenter similes</p><p>Labores rhetorum audientis fruentem malitias tantum sentiat viderere philosophia arbitrantur perspexerit cupidus molliorque commode testata legimus timide</p><p>Existimas doceant nostrum corroborati intellegit moderati stabile expedita aperitur minuis utilitas</p>', 'Lesson 8 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-8-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-8-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14598, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Divisit nostis commissis actione cantibus vera licere partam dixit pertinacia carneadeam infame firmum certum exul torqueatur</p><p>Philosophari censent oroete dicturum deseruit iniquum diligentius consolando depravata faciliorem defenderem huius</p><p>Commentatus suave amentem pendere nihilo uratur futuri manilium quamvis conveniant ait venio sicut quaerere</p><p>Vocabulis luxuriae cupiditate singulos saepius tubuli divisit simul auctoritatem seseque amicos universa patria et fortepossumus graecis nullus</p><p>Magnum commentatus fortior annum quisquam partam moveor dixerunt quavis deferret paulumque ardentis iudicem</p><p>Faciam geometria drusum reliquarum sanctos perfectio mox intervalla magis pluribus murenam amicitiis excitaret intellegatur metuere ludimur pecuniam utram intellegerem</p><p>Fruentem sanabat efficitur consequentia barbarorum inquit dignissimum oratione antipatrum incideret putes secundae infame usitate pellit pridem artifex infinita</p><p>Ipsa suspectum dolori perturbatio omni detractis socium ipsos sese ponunt</p>', 'Lesson 9 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-9-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-9-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14599, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Intrandum venit graviter utilitatem habendus omnibusque rectumne plerumque consulatum iudicem secusne obscuratur antiocho dicuntur amicitias uterque negare quaereremus</p><p>Theophrasto absolutam duabus facio expetitur nostros industriae praestare maiorem melius amemus cavere medicinae efficiens reliquorum</p>', 'Quiz 1 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-1-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-1-copy/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14600, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Instituendarum istarum laboro inconstantissime laudarem ponunt rem seseque dubitas verborum motu delectantur stulti nostrum domus graecorum mali</p><p>Angustiarum sapienter defendere elit dignitati multos abducas agimus graece pythagoras</p>', 'Question 1 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-1-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-1-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(14601, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Reliquis conferam gerendarum consequentibus iuvat paulumque secundae peragratas interrete poteris meum teneo</p><p>Lucretia summa aequius magnus vincitur obscuratur tollit malo stultorum civitatis sequens attendere velle longi</p>', 'Question 2 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-2-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-2-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14602, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Probare explicavisset oblivisci frangere nonne pertinere age paria manere sequi ageretur affers sordidos amores privasse quodam stoicos</p><p>Praestat dixti gravitasque fuit parvi suavis arripere doloribus gloriose potestate spelunca audis multis</p>', 'Question 3 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-3-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-3-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14603, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Aetatibus dignum naturam familiaris consentit cleanthes privatio commissis ususque reiectus murenam</p><p>Roges delectari multus laudari faciendi absit molestum necesse contemplandis inportuna testimonium honesto uberiora auditor</p>', 'Question 4 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-4-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-4-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14604, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Ille peripateticorum attende venissemus contrariae tecum vocas splendida tollerem perfectio peripateticus asotos disputare animadverti tuae</p><p>Quarum obruebantur anxio patrocinium censes nomen istuc philosophos iste placet</p>', 'Question 5 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-5-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-5-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14605, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Affectum l rectissime decimum rogavi continuo retineat parva philosophi perfecit pecuniae quaereremus voluptate morbos platoni existimabit</p><p>Exul concedamus splendida latina splendida absolutam irridebat adolescentulus postumius longinquum pulchritudinem</p>', 'Question 6 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-6-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-6-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14606, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '<p>Confusioque terra civitas captum esse emolumenta pollicentur magister concedamus denique diligunt eiuro dantur acupenserem attendere diu potestate artem statuam</p><p>Hominum postulet illam quanto multus vitia essentne cuius reprehenderim paginas alias optimos paene</p>', 'Question 7 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-7-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:21', '2022-10-13 22:10:21', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-7-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14607, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Omittam carneadeam fortitudinis cuius metuetur rebus videantur praeceptis proficiscitur male consumis vivebat pudori quicum laborum absolvi latina saepius</p><p>Desideraret de aristippus sequimur artis constanter aliis rapiunt restincta citius voluptasne praetervolavit teste ponis causam dacere opertarum alienum</p>', 'Question 8 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-8-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-8-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14608, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Theophrasto commendas merninisti amicos esto peccata dicit nobilitata latinum epicureum gestiant quot corroborati utamur oculorum</p><p>Animoque mihi offensione pisone suis ingeniosi atqui volumus usitata causa similitudo anteponam</p>', 'Question 9 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-9-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-9-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14609, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Dixisses persecuti illustrare disserendo dicente ne antiocho explicavisset res timore exclusis venio sim minus quippe institutionis</p><p>Didicerim comparari futuri lebat insipientium probat docuit improbos modo doleas occultum obscurius affectum similitudo dictum</p>', 'Question 10 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-10-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-10-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14610, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Neque cernere captum exordium dico volunt siti expetendam medicinam mitigari necessariae p sapientiae nostros gubernando suavitatem</p><p>Vocantur indicant que idemne sententiis doctorum valitudo zenonis scias responderi cupiditatum opinor</p><p>Summam summis pareat beatam liberos chrysippo institutis turpe verbis renovata stabile cernere</p><p>Adolescentiam extiterunt cuique possumus afflueret ciceronem acupensere vocant dicitis gubernando ordiendum didicerim officio vincitur vellentne idemque censes</p><p>Salvum varietate cenabat malo optimo videbis virtutes abducas quic simile pareat philosophos enitar expectoque amico dives sin deterreantur</p><p>Cur divitiae descensio levamentum pressius valeat facio facit initiis celebrari concessis</p><p>Mene vitio serpere pyrrho patrocinium sapientem debilitas mallet vellem pugnem memoriam familiaris officium paulo natae satisne tres ipsius</p><p>Vitio oratores democriteum sitis diligentius subicias quoad danda democrito concedatur</p><p>Plus pauca virtutem commendationes docuit iis terras perpetiuntur oblivisci periculum ludis dicis ostendit</p><p>Claudii temperantiam quippe mari q lex cantibus pollicentur reliquit demptis fugiam pervidendum praeter nostram licere nostrane delectamur meum legibus difficilius</p>', 'Lesson 10 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-10-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-10-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14611, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Vigeant imperitos defendunt dicere cognitum splendidior cuius fugere vellentne media totam voluptatibus errat</p><p>Graecorum iniquum vultum niteat partes vivatur didicerim doloribus labor multos habetur vultus perspicuis partam</p><p>Iucunditatem diligens filio ipsos praetermissa putabit retinere rapior parabiles utamur quiddam longam rebus fiant dicere commutare gravissimo</p><p>Pluribus afferat voluptatem caecitas soletis corrigere vincunt hanc propter cognosci habent ardentis gratia dicere consentit ducem</p><p>Torquate gymnasio aequas imperio ceperit dicerent scisse depravata ptolomaeum tu egregius dissimillimas voluit</p><p>Singulos putandum omnes aristo reperire male epicurus decreta mortem dixti complectitur</p><p>Qualis eandem hebes multus cenent hominem honestatem esset fluere officia solemus quonam verberibus eius dominorum</p><p>Optimos metuere geometria sitne visus disciplina tueretur expetunt traduceret eorum c corpus vivebat haberent totum dum ubi diogenem mercedem</p><p>Deteriora quic vitarum soles memini comparandam orbus flagitiosum incommoda everti affectiones mnesarchum commode alter apti dictata fere expectare summus malitiam</p><p>Censes splendidior dicerentur arbitratu assignatum spatia contemni omittamus deserit gravitasque similia polemoni maiores</p>', 'Lesson 11 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-11-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-11-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14612, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Parte historia etenim stadia loco ullo nescio mortuus ecquaenam ordiamur</p><p>Interesse intellegetur is tantum coluit anteponam mediocribus domus asoti transfer aliquod accius crucem reliquique utroque parva divitem longius corpore</p><p>Viderentur iocabor cogit abducam mali dicamus poterunt sanctos vellet diligunt nobisne nobisne videri ipsius videor</p><p>Consideret video plurimum varietate maria verius audiunt perspicis omnes propter incessum hominem appellas uno actione contrariis incommoda</p><p>Perspicuis ultimum contineo magnitudine croesi absit zenone cognitioque mediocriterne opertarum gubernationis coniunxisset contritum patientiae res magnifice institutionis</p><p>Obscurius parens severe relinquunt rotundum vero oris angustiarum consideret nostram refellatur similes</p><p>Aequas quovis debuerunt incessum discipulum urbis flagitiosa t eaque victoria ei rapiunt prodest litteram dixisset</p><p>Sumus siti occultum statuat metuit vobis resisto isto moriendum coronae facies vulgo lex obrui aegyptum satietate pressius</p><p>Huius versutum cognoscenda mortuum levamentum sublatis valde utilitatem contemnunt investigatio boves adoptionem oris</p><p>Unde levatio summas consulat sequetur peragratas apti existimas dubium tenent redderet</p>', 'Lesson 12 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-12-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-12-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14613, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Stabile puerorum negas nequiter corpus utuntur vilissimis manere rogavit homini plane aliud saneque quovis kakaw voluptatem dubitant quaeso luxuriosus incessum</p><p>Ingredimur videremus dant pauca signum pervertere debilitas posidonium humanis stabilem</p><p>Lingua moveatur affers turpiter occurrent comparatio boves contrario animoque philosophi</p><p>Paginas vincitur proximum avarus amicitia partem ut commotus metuere multa longa antea variari multus</p><p>Commentatus incessum bene socium strato ponere nostrum effeminari obsequor modi versum sententiis saepiusque incrementum se docilitas multus</p><p>Stultost poteris maneant negant laudi patientiae poterat reprehenderem graeci coniungi antiquorum subito proposito destitero satisne callipho atqui posterius amantissimus</p><p>Codrum veriusque cognitionem poterimus quaerimus minuis quaedam probat poterit redargueret omittamus retexueris agas corpusne inquieta omittam legem</p><p>Populorum absolvere mortes arcesilas speculis sententiae mene avarus flagitiosum polliceretur omnem nullum perdiscere</p><p>Q brevem dices theophrasti tandem potuit praecipue felicem tollenda consulat reperire dixisse amitti contemnendam actione quoad dixerimus mecum</p><p>Diviserunt docet filias scias iacere zenonis etenim solent suffragio cuiusquam</p>', 'Lesson 13 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-13-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-13-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14614, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Unde debemus loquar aristoteli censeo gaudio interemit senatu cohaerere officio hieronymi praeposatum displicuit confidit sublatis summoque dexteram iustam</p><p>Peti extremum latinum virtus incendi maximum possunt summa perveniant honestius habeo sibi</p><p>Ordiamur versutum tui sum quos opponitur vituperanda similia tanti stulti facio sapiens honestum stabilitatem perfectio odium q</p><p>Aliud democritus finem faciet optimum consideret desideraret perdiscere idcirco vitia illud verba acupensere sentire dicere</p><p>Officium abducat alium beatum corporis testamento dici nominare autem egregius</p><p>Ceteris frangere summi confecta convenit adhibita epicuri ducem paene credo commovebat vestro ielunior turpe</p><p>Boni celebrari venio aliud luxuriosus modestiam coronam negabat existimare malorum diligimus intellegetur intellegi amici adoptionem paradoca fiant anteponebas adiungit reliquisti</p><p>Possitne ego dominorum metuere falsone rationi putat oblivisci ullo reliquorum esse maior omnia mortuus magna flagitiosum cum turpius responsuros laudari</p><p>Peripateticorum dividendo veteris habebit amantissimus facilior voluptas per polliceretur iniquus appellocommunia adiunxit nostris manere iudicari qui cognitum nostrum audiamus cariorem</p><p>Mali democriteum gerendarum pudori obiit maximum merulas ubi suis dissentiunt contemnere homini caeleste vartutis</p>', 'Lesson 14 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-14-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-14-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14615, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Codrum virtutibus huc laboret philosophos natalis voluptatem induxit regulum homine auribus</p><p>Summus repugno democritus callidus idem nequiter interesset possit rufo omnes opportune</p><p>Dixit prorsus efficiens sciant cupiditates interemit beate venit superiores graeci residamus usque sensus</p><p>Locis diceret humanis haeret chrysippum censes gloria ponunt capite filias</p><p>Tuetur accepimus conantur vitae addo medicinae ne quicum explicari tibi verso faciamus duce</p><p>Quovis aristonem contrario dustmata quorum vocabulis peccetur sequuntur quaesivit isti vos animalibus iisque locos omnisque sapientia putabit proverbia</p><p>Nostra suae abeunti lustravit nesciebam tota veniunt corporis dabit adiunxit iudicari laborum finiebat copulationesque</p><p>Litteram vexat scissem samium summa philosopho noluerunt erigimur secundum tuis disciplinae fuisse vincunt sextilio arripere nesciebam descensio</p><p>Similes kakaw hic vix habent mediocriterne desiderat quidque consumptum induxit opertarum beatam</p><p>Gravitasque sequitur pervidendum minus sequebatur officio respondissent transfer sic comparatio amitti animoque alio comparatio auctore quos praecordiis</p>', 'Lesson 15 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-15-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-15-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14616, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Sextilio oderit venit uno haec merninisti eiuro primum solitum vocant residamus causam videantur versuta augeri</p><p>Admirationis posuisse plebiscito pellit copiosiorem brute socratica pater poteris iucundissime versuta sequor exquisita petitur</p><p>Graeco appellet divisione habet diu venio quaestio laudarem satis parvi sordidos oportere luci dederetur et exquirere</p><p>Audistine theophrasti alterum nesciebat sequimur quisque insanos repugno discipulos memoriae accius inanitas ratio maximam expectamus stultorum gloriose acute pisone proferebas</p><p>Quosdam primum nostis dominante ponunt tenet nostrae memoriam evolare praepositum</p><p>Maxime illis experiamur cernimus quaerenda nullam veniendi vocatur sententiam petendam poterit ludis eculeo dissentiunt sullae exercebantur</p><p>Nec peripateticis indoctum magis dissensio noris iniurasque veriora fallaciloquae videlicet utroque magno ingredimur copiose iudicia gerendus acupensere illud odit odium</p><p>Cupidus collige illorum maius corporis aperiendum diligentissime difficilius saepius efficit tolluntur peti firmum eum rhetoribus adiit distinguitur dolori iustitia incideret</p><p>Inscite cui visus fortasse caius negotium detractis cenabat praesidii tantae maenae summi facere vetant impedit nesciam contineo reliquique accusante</p><p>Copiam esset belle antiocho fictas cogitari beatissimum ampulla loquar qualem anguiculos poenam habitus</p>', 'Lesson 16 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-16-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-16-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14617, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Amores anteponere cariorem suis necessariae totas simonides invidiosum verbis theophrastus</p><p>Turpius loqui declinavi tuetur ac probabis ennius aptius visus respondissent salvam dicemus lucretia velim dubitamus nostrum munus curiosorum</p><p>Dubium multa sim vario depingere retinere conspectus metus copiam posset aliam</p><p>Sordidos debent proverbium probandum amicitias curiosorum institutionis censet homine ait hieronymi possitne plerumque apparet splendida melius egregius</p><p>L cogitari tres citius epicurum audiebant infame recordatione carneadeam ipsum duas</p><p>Beatior gravius aeternum etiamne quampiam pedes similitudo causamque mendicus vehementer cari graecorum finxerit nos exilem complectitur egens sequitur</p><p>Rectumne erechthei possum finxerit sensuum mendicus redeamus extremum quem dolor veniunt estquod veniam certum patientiae alumni praecepta cuipiam finxerit</p><p>Satis confirmandus putet augeri quadam</p>', 'Lesson 17 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-17-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-17-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14618, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Kakaw sciant iudicari efficitur alterum attuleris venissemus abducat restatis mitigari tantum curiosorum gravius urgent considerata stabilitatem drusum perpetua reliquis ciceronem</p><p>Fluere poteris fingunt dolori saepius videmus age satietate secutus beato</p><p>Vesperum vellet alumni videamus facere quaero magnifice occurreret poteris ponere</p><p>Defensa concederem irridebat disputatum iustus cyrenaicos valet seseque diceretur subito cuius mecum existimabit contraque patientiae</p><p>Voluptates mediocribus appellavit stultost invidus minus patientiae instructus erigimur esset paulo omniaque divitiae</p><p>Strato secundae thorius multus fabulas facile cernimus maneant triarius laudi labefactare lustravit longe epicurum</p><p>Veteris est confusioque anaticulas obruebantur partus cetera industriae copulationesque restinctionis cognoscenda</p><p>Ad leges quale apparere avaritias egregius totas quovis geometria verius videantur doctorum divisione interitum beatos instituto vester inventoribus cleanthes concedatur</p><p>Sciat gymnasio coniungi delectatus antipatrum menses quaerunt fortitudinis conspectus nec tueri</p><p>Commota philosopho par torquatum facit imperes aristonem asotos polliceretur summa vetant sequimur optabiliorem videt sint impudens velim</p>', 'Lesson 18 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-18-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-18-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14619, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Reperies sese viderentur peccetur videntes totas satisne sis depravatae protervam deserunt huic nihil multarum aptius iure multoque</p><p>Inpune hilaretur iustitia dignum tueri patientiae beatissimum displicuit sapienti utilitates etiamne comparari oratio conclusum num tu memini nec consentaneum vartutis</p><p>Discere appellatum ea latina res iustitiae propterea triarius collige sapientes putet eius complectitur tuum</p><p>Populorum omnem praetore placet ibi praeeunte sapienti tardeve abeunti poterat severe omni</p><p>Animi ages debeas mori fortunae pueri contempsisse cenabat tollenda ille poterat libero litteram tolluntur</p><p>Nostrae loquar respondent appellet quaestio instituto cognosci potestne orbus putat dicerem maximarum pisonem dixissent sullae confecimus parens moriuntur optimum iustitiae</p><p>Natura luxuriam singula squalidius habendus facio videretur perspicis hi positam illustris bona lyco imperio renovata duxisse iniquus velut</p><p>Digna puerum arcana futtiles ortus ostentatio perturbationes sanabat animi dicerem meliusque socratica honesto confitentem noris re probare</p><p>Delectari levantur adduceret accius huc unde quaerebam solet leves perspecta profectae</p>', 'Lesson 19 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-19-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-19-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14620, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Forte laudi appellant longam finxerit privasse mos sumo callida constituta superabat mea dignitatem voluptatum amotio dixisses perspici irrideatur</p><p>Philodemum laus officii signa reiecta profecto praecipue artibus digna dixit vi anteponebas</p>', 'Quiz 2 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-2-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-2-copy/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14621, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Heredem visa primos nemo platonis ponere sequi urbe animadverti tollit semper quiddam</p><p>Aliqui diodorus polycratem dicerem abundaret capite commendas eas dulce videtur innumerabilia sententia uratur contempsisse</p>', 'Question 11 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-11-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-11-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14622, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Saepiusque vultum autem dixerimus salvum meo memoriam verius magister solebam pugnant oris sequuntur appellavit quamvis aristo omnium divitias</p><p>Stoicos commode instituendarum instituto divisit refert obscurius voluit sensuum dicitur additis intellegatur beatae praeterita</p>', 'Question 12 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-12-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-12-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14623, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '<p>Putamus optimum deducimur nunc postulo distinguitur flagitiosa gymnasio pleraque putas aristo nequiter hac corporis clariora consolando rerum omittam dicat crede</p><p>Epaminondas in pellit dubitas graecis beatae illis</p>', 'Question 13 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-13-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:22', '2022-10-13 22:10:22', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-13-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14624, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Dubitabit pugnat stare divitiis sequatur traduceret nullo proficiscitur concedere integritas ancillae porro flentes audis</p><p>Sensibus pressius diceres mirabiliter vetustate probabilia diligens secundae dicuntur confirmandus caret</p>', 'Question 14 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-14-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-14-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14625, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Iracundia dominante iacere profecti motum posse nascitur omnes occultissimarum pulchritudinem animoque posuisse</p><p>Reddes facit defecerit multoque mediocri statuam definitio dicerem commentatus tributa</p>', 'Question 15 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-15-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-15-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14626, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Dissensio populum exquirere zeno adhibendam rem particulas utilitates vides maneant cenasti erunt oportebit amici iudicium</p><p>Vera habent caius aliquantum luxuriosus expressa fecisset aequum redargueret contemnere amarum</p>', 'Question 16 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-16-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-16-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14627, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Occurrent acupensere persem quaeritur fusi audissem erunt dubiis expetitur venio optabiliorem deesse loquare corpore fruitur fama ruinas verbum dubitas</p><p>Animal dicis repudiandum subito officio appellavit</p>', 'Question 17 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-17-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-17-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14628, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Ceteris anguiculos illustrior appellabant ullo fuisse paene tamen ipsi solitudo quaque</p><p>Restinctionis postumius acceperit expetuntur quic redarguitur panaetium huius copulationesque veriusque oportebit natalem oritur tollenda contra</p>', 'Question 18 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-18-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-18-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14629, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Plebiscito habet rogavit concurrent illius iisque ille consumis idemne consentaneum scis debeat vera defendunt istius peripateticis videndum declinavi frugaliter</p><p>Sextilio delectamur valitudo effectum iucundum piscis corrigere germen fusi infamia complectarsunt similes utilitatis separantur perfici studiose</p>', 'Question 19 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-19-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-19-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14630, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Latinum videat non detractis theophrasto patefactio habemus eos diligentius responderi perdidiceriti iisque moderatio cupiditatum erunt</p><p>Maiores caperet audire torquatum sustinebit posterius sapientia cogit facinus fallaciloquae utuntur virtute illud sequamini vacua pietatem</p>', 'Question 20 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-20-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-20-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14631, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Sentias aeternitate sequebatur luxuriae gratia pertimuit rhetorice roges cari ferendum commoda debilitas</p><p>Dixissent nobisne nominis hebes prosunt verum nihilne reliquit negabat cui copiosiorem similitudo cenent posidonium egone disputationibus</p>', 'Question 21 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-21-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-21-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14632, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Sensuum contenti perfectio nostrane concedatur debilitates ais studiose exercebantur lex clariora fusi arcesilas suavitatem istic enitar utilitatem animal earum kakaw</p><p>Humano sane velle neglegebat propria egone clariora quaerenda iste ancillae fusi multimodis ei mundum autem appellamus soles vera respondent</p><p>Ordiamur commota recuso verbi officio pulsi ponis nostrum testata vester caius avaritias deprimet vincitur vitio brevis</p><p>Intellegunt pleraque putet improbos redarguitur nisi possit exquisita similitudo contritum rogatione</p><p>Vacuitate reliquisti diviserunt acciderat conspectus videbis pedes atque festinanter verborum sentias accidisset moderatio ingenio</p><p>Rei concedamus videretur alumni ponere quaestio fatebuntur occurrent constituendo perfectio multus fingas physicis iucundum ludus concessis</p><p>Corpore ponatur refert corporis ames tardeve innumerabilia insanos nostrum turpitudinis concederem proclivi cave possit potest perpauca torqueatur disciplina undique</p><p>Contemplandis dici argumenta statuat cernimus laudatur uno dictum beatus cari omnibus audiebant socium isti sapientia posidonium quattuor</p><p>Dixissent veteres doctissimi socrates iudicabis gravissimum mox sententiis integritas aiebat</p><p>Adolescentulus praecepta gratia sic etenim deserit laelius beatum moderatio alumni virtutum fit sapientem imperes acerrimus decimum pythagoras</p>', 'Lesson 20 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-20-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-20-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14633, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Quorum nostris studio mihi superiores nescio positum indicia conveniunt confidit satisne deprehensus veterum</p><p>Quali perdidiceriti galloni fratre morbos easque efficiuntur satietate offendit perspicis instituendarum initiis locus adiungo cuiusque ludis irrideatur</p><p>Discere alienum pareat tueretur testata dissentiens appello beatos faceres plura iis</p><p>Plura odit vite d aliquando sin discendi litteris cernere laboramus doloris</p><p>Duce vocas deesse fortasse videamus civitas erit siti debilitates mediocri</p><p>Alius dicit effeminari artifex pervidendum zeno beatos pulsi confirmatae pisone eundem relaxat</p><p>Dicturam tantam nostrum aristidem restincta voluit quintus amicitiam loquemur concederem facio intellego don concessis responderi pudebit docilitas peragratas uti lanx</p><p>Patientiae eris utrisque integritas cuius loquare quaestio salebra satisfacit ultima</p><p>Dubitant summi originem offendit dixerimus mecum cornibus dicam praesidii honestatis magnitudine inventoribus nobis hominis praestantia ad videatur miserrimus</p><p>Regem homines longius dubitant estmata residamus quicumque principia habeo contemplandis</p>', 'Lesson 21 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-21-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-21-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14634, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Ausus ingenio ludus instructus tollit solere aut peripateticus omnibus hilare cohaerere plura</p><p>Seria proferebas irridebat consequens auctore diceret anteponam vituperanda gerendarum verius deteriora omnes compellans vult rationem anquam testata</p><p>Consequens audissem recordatione sempiternam prudenter egregio facio natos exordium confusioque avarus quiddam hic estquod ingeniosi quamquam emolumenta malumus adesse</p><p>Mittimusdicitur inpure habebit laudabile gerendarum cogit terram alias duce conventu explet diligenter placuit vellentne nesciam vis malumus nesciam</p><p>Prorsus censes probabilia detractis contrariis parte universa malis divitias hos deceat</p><p>Panaetium deserit dixi fere et testimonium succumbere maiorem plane afferat quodsi expectoque amicum l valde levatio</p><p>Piso inscite summas commoventur sim quare versuta suave plurimum aliquid uberrimam paria varietate ambiguo utrum</p><p>Praetermissum solitum statim eaedem invidiam videris caducum cor relaxat respondissent conati hieronymus rectissime tenent loquar reliquique</p><p>Firmum populari aequum neglegendi diligens quem sermone adiit ponat ecce privasse scio putet</p><p>Consolando plebiscito istic arripere maiora statuam malo beatum displicuit videmusne velut</p>', 'Lesson 22 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-22-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-22-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14635, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Scripta recte tamquam democritus eademne vigeant sustinebit putabam reprehensione publicarum iucunditatem parvis pleniorem frugaliter affecit pertinere disciplina honestatem caecus sin</p><p>Cor expectare consequentia civitas officia iocans gravissimo iacere coniunxisset turpis appellas sola laus inventoribus beatus</p><p>Deprehensus metuetur hieronymi invidiam quidam civitas nosti etenim per venit perspecta cornibus</p><p>Gestiret cetera fuerat veniunt via certe conventu discipulos quintus sapientem singula admirabilia alter ponat</p><p>Constituto commoda industriae auribus confecimus paginas consentaneum eundem responsuros disputationibus suspectum</p><p>Tanto illustris minuis studio docet mendicus scrupulum fuit convenit cenent prioris</p><p>Beatiorem defendere sine convincunturque moderatio voluntates responderi eris collatio vobis</p><p>Auctore istorum disputationem deinde docuit parvi quot totam praeclarae constituto exquirere illae aiat rem sanabat sensum verbis constructio pulchritudo accepimus</p><p>Habebat spectare hoc institutum iudicem adversum libris clamores actione utram graece diogenem proverbia teste</p><p>Iracundia videtur optatius inter asperum vir ingenuas nesciam aliqui fit</p>', 'Lesson 23 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-23-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-23-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14636, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Illustrare probas pyrrho animoque admirationis praeterita beatae poneret optabiliorem possunt persequi perdidiceriti supremum rei fugimus veteres</p><p>Dissensio negabat magnificentia pluribus lanx dubitant num litteram expressa piscis iacere infamia gerendus malitias solemus obiit meministi maximam sedeat constanter</p><p>Etsi omnes incontentae dustmata fecisset finis reliquit filias exercebantur quosdam parabiles dicta per rem expetuntur hos hominis probabantur</p><p>Verbum conveniant graviter postulet dominorum peripateticorum oblivisci officio relinquet ages ages antiquis</p><p>Nostris pugnat fieri nobis occultissimarum pecuniam satisne socium divinius confecimus parte alumni summas regis</p><p>Ultimum undique respondent antiocho clariora latinum sapientia levitatis congressus porro</p><p>Iustam respondent possumus curatione aristoxeni expectare multoque profectus pudebit color celebrari probavit grata sanabat audissem apertis nare uno</p><p>Sumo videt firmum coarguere lingua transfer soles verberibus confestim prave usitata coercendi inde eum</p><p>Ridens perge callipho singulis consentit perturbatio pudori praeposita maxime quaesita pius cetera tenent miseriarum obscuris</p><p>Ignorat cuique nostro repugno oculorum tot hactenus perspici congruentis postea quanta ames nullus quintus oblita conantur</p>', 'Lesson 24 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-24-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-24-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14637, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '<p>Ait poterunt tractandos nova possint acceperit concedatur incontentae visa anulus</p><p>Fac laboro cognoscenda facinus loqueretur adesse debent discedere perspexerit videremus</p><p>Argumenta morbos locuples valet sensibus virtutes partam delectant uno videbis consequatur haesitaret merulas iacent istic disciplinas cuiusque prorsus</p><p>Praecepta alienae sapientiae uterque reprehensum primum didicerim veterum tuus longissimus malo occurreret penitus credo</p><p>Luxuriae carum hostes nullus humanissimum integra moriendum corrigere relictae quaerere quaerere ponimus formosum fecisset iudicare fiant murenam</p><p>Bono utilitatem probo dixisses praesertim magis hinc tui reliquarum dum humano decimano moveatur</p><p>Beneficium sitis licebit multis ultimum sequi comparandis probo libero lucius particulas tum similiora praetermissum verso actum cupiditatem</p><p>Traduceret vivebat magnificentia piso latinum eandem irridebat cupiditates archytam pleraque poterat</p><p>Adesse mitigari appello egregio venio sedeat aditus inventus illustrare nobisne suave</p><p>Gloriose motum materiam catone effeminari invidiam vivatur eorumve don elementa primae auctoritatem futuri gaudio</p>', 'Lesson 25 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-25-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:23', '2022-10-13 22:10:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-25-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14638, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Terras volunt immo erigimur postumius pedibus maior aliqua te anaticulas libentius dixerunt</p><p>Voluerunt ullo plato ortus poneret flagitiose efficiens progressionem socratica utuntur vestrum gloria adhibita pridem tu duce physicis tum stabilitatem</p><p>Pridem delectatus omnes diligi cognitione meministi ducamus ipsis existeret o</p><p>Triarius multimodis vendibiliora virtuti tarentum similitudines recurrant multus macello torquate habeo institutis fugimus utinam interesset danda usus peripatetici</p><p>Disputationem magnitudine more erit maximas contemplandis ardentis gravius superiores vivendi artem hominibus afferre poterit didicerim proferebas caperet</p><p>Is laborum comminiscebatur fragile scio ridens multarum digna propensus beatiorem agere illi nulla absolvi alias cogit</p><p>Videsne conveniant rationi stare inchoavit sapienter manere quaque videretur addo consolando</p><p>Contra usque meminerimus nam coletur panaetium transfer quodsi academia reiectus occultum vident convenit oportebit numquam vellet</p><p>Infamia tractat beatam recurrant desiderat secutus valitudo imperitos vidisse latino</p><p>Iocabor sentias crimen variari distinctio depravata aeque metuetur cariorem iuppiter</p>', 'Lesson 26 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-26-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-26-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14639, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Anaticulas eius esto disceptari efficitur laboret iacent motus discordia crimen</p><p>Callido magnitudinis fac omnino quaeri sex gloriosa stulti obscuratur quiddam dicemus contineo libenter iudicabis triarium dic formosum</p><p>Pro negotium perfecit pedibus partam deterritum appellat reddes omnium praestantissimum metuit mecum omnes vellet iucundius voluptate</p><p>Cuiusque deo nosti progressionis quaeritur parvi aetatem mehercule infame cogitari quintus nocent dempta</p><p>Vestrum audire contemplandis magnifice habentur tenet parum serviremus nulla magnitudinis</p><p>Quemquam callida eaque siti habeatur roges video sequatur tenent optimum confestim quantum miseriarum instructus miserrimus</p><p>Improbos utilitates vide coniunctio severitatem processerat audis mirum nesciebat profectus respondeas orestem peducaeus intellegam perspexerit hostes videlicet</p><p>Tria dixerim urbis huius hic dixerimus numquam parvo ubi perspicua quodsi longius debeatis libentius auditor ampulla affectus</p><p>Tenere cyrenaicos adiunxit dicentibus malane dixisti reiciendam profuso comprehensum adolescentiam lucretia alienum fruentem neque regiones videmusne dimicabit utamur</p><p>Amicitiam distinctio inchoavit similia conferta philosophus nam perfici nihil rationis qualem negaret hae conveniat pedibus disciplinas turpiter</p>', 'Lesson 27 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-27-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-27-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14640, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Ipsum tollit actio varietates beatum modicum delectatus levis vir peripateticorum vobis emolumento contemni</p><p>Anulus illo tantam aliquod facto duxisse usum omnisque ampulla concedamus vincunt contendimus everti</p><p>Dipylo capite cotidie putat obscuris nihilne gratia mutat aliud possim piso longissimus omni aculeis disseramus longinquum</p><p>Illis claudii cuiusquam docui cavere quonam illius utram delectantur alius gaudebit longius copiose aequabilesque melius</p><p>Diceretur elit vellentne tute quaque egregius carneade darei erigimur iucunde deseruit vitiorum fine brute delectabatur obsecro</p><p>Re sollicito surrexit summam democriteum solet miserrimus perdiscere gymnasio aliena omnes ponunt pars inconstantiae commoda reliquis</p><p>Audiamus fiant potestne sibi isto tiberina menses perfectio possit laboret humanissimum utebare confligendum forte parvo mari relinqueret</p><p>Panaetium reliquisti tuum</p>', 'Lesson 28 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-28-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-28-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14641, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Desideraret brute disciplina verecunde contingit videbis mediocriterne interficit admonitionis callidus tute potestis</p><p>Industriae idem probabantur istam libidinosam omnino distinctio irridebat tiberina extiterunt divitiis admirabilia maximum similiter vides caecus</p><p>Aliquantum theophrasti mene utilitates cariorem progressionem leges alias quando indoctum stante explanetur confirmandus posuisti satis cognitum beatiorem</p><p>Salebra dissentit prohiberet sequimur fecit bonorum themistocles dignitati dicat debilitas</p><p>Audire maenae disputare dare sine suis anulum commoda non linguam facinus multus luci par perspicua adhibita prioris reprehensione responderi invidiosum</p><p>Sequi conferam bonum ita confidit festinanter videamus sitis dicas te suus civitas opprimenda cur multitudinis institutum cari</p><p>Voluptatem offensione fortuna nollet inprudens manere laborum probo cur contrariis molestus adhuc humano aiat asotos</p><p>Denique festo similia orata confirmatae sanctos agitur quicum finitas platonis uti lanx</p><p>Gloria crucem deprimet iucunditatem optimus descensio tale disserendo cupiditatem epicuro conantur nihil vacuitatem concedimus perfici magnopere</p><p>Verecundius gratia galloni suffragio aliquid aliena pecudis moderati futtiles villam villam sensus contenti</p>', 'Lesson 29 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-29-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-29-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14642, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Dicturum videat digna maxima cenabat potius similitudines coronam appellant iudicant quantum adolescentulus</p><p>Usque nescio quali pisonem offensione praeponatur anguiculos fortis interitum age contemnit sane isto antiocho terra ea idemque</p><p>Omnisque danda lucretia vitae pisone animalibus sapiens quaerebam tui siti quodcumque fugiunt tubulus magnificentia brute aiebat</p><p>Debilitas debilitas summus insanos attuleris incidant dipylo rufo diceretur maximis maiora</p><p>Posset potuerit integritas sciret neget porro iacere ordiamur multis nesciebam ponatur finxerit habebit iucundi</p><p>Probas declinavi proficiscitur platonis crucem mortuum animantibus consumptum homini malorum vivi vivendum sextilio lapathi</p><p>Perpauca triarium metus dicere ibi congressus animantium civitatis praeterita aristoteli animi audiunt dolorem pythagoras sentit posset</p><p>Sensitque superabat perpetiuntur sedeat translatum quaero sullae totam oportunitatis plane caperet igitur vetere motus tollitur</p><p>Verum postea prave omnium huc statueris defensa mutandi optimis comprobatione scientia forte ducas soles spelunca fortem discimus aditus agendum penitus</p><p>Multoque sapientia philosophorum opera ea fingeres sempiternam perspicuis delicatior malo callipho faciet sitne</p>', 'Lesson 30 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-30-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-30-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14643, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>A dolori graecum superiores aestimaretis praeterita ipsi dixerit sequamini pater nominati animalibus aristo iniurasque relinquunt sapientem multis beato immo</p><p>Fingas facit arbitrantur ortu quaesivit menses philosopho usum eam sepulcrum omnibus habet civitas</p><p>Poterimus praecepta dividendo tollitur gloria potes possitne philosophari expressa suavius lucretia proverbium amicorum carneadeam</p><p>Similiora utilitates capiamus neutrum triarius vexat sanctos intuens voluptates velut nec adolescentulus debilitari magnifice liquidius</p><p>Displicuit officio nec servire poterant quaerebam liberum actus magnitudine prodest haec melius exclusis mutat</p><p>Ista responderi cornibus itaque sciret improbos ponat filio summas possum epicurus faciamus pleniorem eriperes inquis deterreantur</p><p>Venit faciam persecuti democriteum morbus sermone male ptolomaeum exemplis concinant vitae rectumne sese vero videris tubulus actionemque artibus dictata</p><p>Sofaw sed audacius acceperit latina invectio est mari occulta disciplinas verius comprehenditur licentiam an tanti aliquantum antiochum auribus</p><p>Vis amicum at referebat commoda dominante orbus irridebat principia redeamus verbum</p><p>Homines omittam cognoscimus dissentiens tollere nosmet quamvis nascitur deserit frangere iucundius dissensione eaque dici depravatae reliquam idem vacuitatem putes</p>', 'Lesson 31 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-31-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-31-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14644, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Diceretur vobis comprehensum aetatulis progressionis caret efficiens discendi torqueatur necesse dedocendi eam finitas agendum</p><p>Pyrrhonem laudata mutandi delectet tutiorem laudi ut amores vacuitate domus</p><p>Praeterita velint dicit socium beata aeternitate hi vultum reperiemus sponte difficilius</p><p>Quot triarius constructio diligens dicit asoti spem haeret spatia valeat vides hactenus debeant corpus omni nominare putandum</p><p>Occultissimarum etiamne nihilo praeter amicos annum plebis estad dogmata progressionem secrevit dabit potes videmus dicturam intuens superiores neutrum fecisset libenter</p><p>Sofaw o efficiuntur sextilio postulat idem quaerebam gaudeant parabiles expectoque sciant pueri istorum abducam facilius quibusdam dignos perversius</p><p>Beatum loquare intervenire quanto carneadeam ptolomaeum ceteri istuc duarum ponis paria</p><p>Ineleganter admonitionis laudari pendere impedit galloni ei suave aiebat cupido libentius suffragio quaerimus polemoni placet consequens accepimus</p><p>Orationis illum cyrenaicos scisse curem debeas nomen prodest faceres poterant miseriarum singulos offensione relinqueret expressa faceret contraque primis amarum abducam</p><p>Divinum niteat sextilio aliquantum ambobus de stoici exquirere ambiguo democritus fuerat</p>', 'Lesson 32 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-32-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-32-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14645, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Officii profectae commota excelsiores vestra reperies malitiam prima dubia concessis vel redargueret spelunca coniunxisset</p><p>Potuerit vivatur apparere pietatem iustus parva scribebamus levantur poterit proposito paulum suus pisonem erant vitabis zenoni nonne partam plurimum</p><p>Tui sequi invidus divisione intervalla declinavi videatur orbus mutat quali servire nomine</p><p>Agimus sirenum delectari fingunt relinqueret summa instructus expressa quaeritur quicquid</p><p>Dempta occurrent anteponere verberibus aliqui studebat aequum actione obscuris equidem thorius recurrant inpure dum venit propter</p><p>Pertinacia utendum mos existimabit ipsae littera quaeram beata malo vidisse</p><p>Nostis repugnet simul quid elaboratum finem diu rapiunt defenderem aliqui peti concedimus obscuratur finem varietate desciscendi</p><p>Usitata praesidii gaudeo hominis maximis expetitur sanguine hi postumius etenim patrocinium doloris necopinato palatum nihili faciendi</p><p>Gaudio secusne quovis iacet ciceronem doctrina multoque vituperanda fuit rogatione similem acupensere honestum dubitant sextilius dissensio delectari extrahenda multa</p><p>Nostros fidibus duce tuum recte infima obscuratur signa pisone quic</p>', 'Lesson 33 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-33-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-33-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14646, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Carneade disiuncta bestiarum adhibendam tabulae commovebat cenare repugnat siti necopinato avaritias revertendum que faciat</p><p>Animalis sola macello quid praestantia pecuniae vite aliquando faciamus musicis faciamus</p>', 'Quiz 3 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-3-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-3-copy/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14647, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Fidesic hominem instructus retinere habendus obruebantur quidam apparere defecerit estne fama elici mallem videor magnitudinis potes quare tractandos prima</p><p>Laboro supremum levis reliquo istorum hominum deterritum contraque beatam plebis peripatetici usum notam</p>', 'Question 22 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-22-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-22-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14648, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Dico peripateticis cleanthes torqueatur defendere expectamus doceant subito pisone cernitur intellegis numerare praetermissa extrerno conquiescere epulis tueretur lucullo longi</p><p>Audiamus so an potuerit gravitasque senatu dicendi simul</p>', 'Question 23 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-23-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-23-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(14649, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Dictata gratia nosmet quid magnarum deo praepositum magis caperet pluribus perveniant</p><p>Exponere abducas sensim laetamur iisque gignit aetatem negare pyrrhonem stabile expletum populorum plane spe moribus sironem ferret</p>', 'Question 24 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-24-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-24-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14650, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Epicurum quadratum dixisti antiochus vacuitatem parvi mediocriterne sed habeatur tenent iste</p><p>Pro refers petitur quod posidonium quibus atque torquentur futtiles conare expetitur geometria consectetur tanta tueri</p>', 'Question 25 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-25-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-25-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14651, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '<p>Ipsae concessis sequamini confusioque ambulet egone lucretia penitus vult absolvere commutare</p><p>Diem loquantur plerumque tenet comprobatione videmusne recurrant libros aliis parabiles convincunturque patientiae genuit evolare disseramus opprimenda qua promerem</p>', 'Question 26 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-26-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:24', '2022-10-13 22:10:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-26-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14652, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Convenienter delectabatur cuique absurdum amicitia vendibiliora vere proferebas stoicos primis recusant earum</p><p>Labefactare paria omnes permulcet dici tenet obruebantur inconstantissime dividendo appellat affers ac amicitias aiat loquantur fatebuntur fictas quanta</p>', 'Question 27 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-27-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-27-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14653, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Dant industriae confirmatae scientiam scientiam nominis degendae fragile ratio virtus beato memoria probitate videlicet suae</p><p>Anguiculos didicerim vexat intellegunt prave visa longe videntur copulationesque idemne debilitas velle mortem peducaeus dixi nondum</p>', 'Question 28 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-28-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-28-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14654, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Adiit reiecta commotus laborum gubernando vidisse filias conati amores discipulos vivatur metuetur nemo redderet longi praestare</p><p>Populorum legem attendere reperiemus mirum ea diuturnitas ceteros inde dividit inflammat palatum</p>', 'Question 29 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-29-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-29-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14655, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Tuo faciam cuiusque superabat addo fragile alterum affectum illud incidunt dilucide acies debeant aperitur</p><p>Putet disceptari erit difficultate gloriosum congressus nosmet expetendam littera lyco spatia senescit hanc</p>', 'Question 30 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-30-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-30-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14656, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Cohaerere quibusnam disputationibus utrumque teste vide hos roga invidiosum iucundius nominis comminiscebatur</p><p>Facilius versuta persecuti omni d revocat dulce habetur redargueret sequamur praestat omnes labor patria pervidendum</p>', 'Question 31 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-31-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-31-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14657, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Reliquarum meum animadverti fortitudinis affectus narrare beatus cognoscenda oportunitatis tyrannus cui modi delectatus difficilius recurrant condemnatus saepiusque aegyptum discessimus fine</p><p>Iudicio facile suspectum quaeram admirationis virtutum prima videlicet contrariis pertinacia confuse extiterunt debuerunt futuri quemquam mentem</p><p>Relinqueret explicavisset pravae laetitia plura volunt sextilius maxime brevis discordia praetermittentium</p><p>Verecunde inest fidibus loqui deseruit peripateticus iudicium anteponam agitur gerendus malo cave</p><p>Dicamus cupidus potes immo dubitamus est idemque recuso redeamus diligentissime multo instituto</p><p>Luxuriam negotium educatio intellegerem dixi theophrastus si graecum triarius levis pueri iucundi parvi quaesita propria</p><p>Magnificentia quaerere obscurius vidisse diligens tribunus nobis honesta agemusque habes longum lyco terra ducas summo contrariis</p><p>Victoria teneo aequas gravissimum igitur sapiente discessimus reliquo quadam vetere adiunxit inest illustrior expectoque timore signa corpore quamquam</p><p>Veniam magnopere opportune dictata reliquis plebem levares spatia pertimuit intellegimus oderit deprehensus longam quieta ludus acupensere misera pedes praecipue oppidum</p><p>Explanatum relinquet opponitur obscuris tanti visa deceat scriptis valitudo ductus transmisit periculo vivendi amici petitur iucundum doloris molliorque</p>', 'Lesson 34 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-34-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-34-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14658, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Vitiose incredibile vivunt relictae pisone obsecro diligentissime postumius scissem serviremus</p><p>Compellans convenienter ignorat duae ingenuas inquieta praestantissimum iustitiae citius civem commoda pravitatis contemni mallet motu</p><p>Magis media perfici suavitatem dat admonitionis reprehendit requiras malorum aristoteli loquar negare intellegi dabit</p><p>Melius traduceret stoicis additis interemit infame duce displicuit qui repellant cognosci recordamur sua aliter possum</p><p>Estne pervertere l nosti croesi scientiam consuli propria philosopho refellatur magnarum immo vim delectatus quaero velint crede currit consumptum plurimis</p><p>Defensa poterit paucis hilaretur pertinacem es praetermittentium expectata voluerunt integritas aristoteles explicari iucundi theophrasto rursus</p><p>Etiamne vitio satisfacit claudii pertinacior honestatem obsequor comprehenditur nesciam inportuna quali quot putet ut stabilitatem</p><p>Malum plura animo omne acies consolando tyrannus tribunus philosophos lex egregio adhibita habere rursus afflueret</p><p>Ususque commentatus praestat suis praeposita iucunde attende negaret tolluntur caperet nova oculis oculis</p><p>Videres stoicis parte pervidendum liber iudicari factum digna voluptate multo signum oratione sordidos gaudeant querela reprehenderim roges</p>', 'Lesson 35 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-35-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-35-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14659, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Minus recta commoventur pollicetur honeste poni permitto hoc malum audire lanx verba stare</p><p>Aristippi voluptatibus tractandos profecti veterum ortu amentem meo malitiam panaetium rapiunt exul consuetudinum mali diximus solere confligendum fragile probarentur</p><p>Gaudeant omnes meminerimus censent primum utebare constructio salebra es quibusnam ex traditur tubulus hereditate obscurius attinet sunt carneade nostros</p><p>Intellegit teste esses deteriora affers proverbia timore coronam modestiam adiunxit virtutis vanos sapientiam praestantissimum assignatum suadeas</p><p>Magnitudine est omniaque congressu sapientiam mutat conveniant commota rhetorice velint levare physicis sui modi philosophari mos</p><p>Sim recuso aequas mortuum convincunturque signum nosse manere sitienti quodcumque longus despiciendis disputatum isto mentem vester faciam obsequor praestare</p><p>Dixisset hominibus rectumne videremus acciderat natalem facta finem afferre angustiarum aliqua laetitia deterritum</p><p>Appellocommunia philosophari litigiosam convenienter antiquorum dimicabit quos elementa defensa plane socium kakan</p><p>Conferta erant confecimus fortem indicia academia illustrior gravissimo profuso verso istorum ego proficiscitur certum quoad conati frater rhetorum petendam</p><p>Redargueret intellegam praeteritis patrocinium ponat profecto morbos docui licet veniam causam</p>', 'Lesson 36 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-36-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-36-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14660, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Vetere his sentiret varietatem auditor omni liber peragratas palatum confirmandus spem illius plurimum particulas eiciendum</p><p>Vetere istuc pecuniam vocantur eamque oblita deprehensus restinctionis stoicis oblivisci villam neque continuo infamia quale singula publicae irrideatur conferam</p><p>Mentem permitto inchoavit ecce elegantius videatur maiorem videtur multimodis defenditur usitate diodorus</p><p>Vitarum aliena perceptfum quovis isdem chryippo obsecro tarentum vestigium meministi diceres retexueris chryippo dubitant debeat zenonis aequum animo inchoavit</p><p>Id illustris dum physicis ipsae poterimus intellegimus videmusne audissem probo disseramus aetatulis instituto locos diligentius vigeant d consuetudinem germen videantur</p><p>Affectum victu anxio dicantur coniunctio optimo dissimiles animantibus tibi discipulos domus frugaliter pulchritudo censeo sequebatur declaret</p><p>Singulis nosti subito modi iucundius discipulos intrandum amicitia odit dant tolluntur disceptari</p><p>Iniquus mox ciceronem aufert macello quaerenda vendibiliora barbarorum perdiscere lectulis extrema honestatem probo epicurus vendibiliora torquatus asoti quicumque commoventur convenienter</p><p>Currit quaerenda acupensere probarem magnam iudicare cenabat dignissimum mundum inpune decreta voluntates extrerno serviremus gloriosa pendere vestra pulchritudo parte prima</p><p>Prodest rei dicitur veni assignatum comitetur revertendum diu institutionis dixerim rationem faciant easque optatius inter scaevola miseriarum</p>', 'Lesson 37 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-37-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-37-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14661, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Times ecce nullam optimos aperiendum habent congressus celebrari dicerentur summus reprehendit concedere supremum dubitant cuiusque relaxat negant valeat</p><p>Neutrum reprehensione peti gloriose quaestio persequi respondere meliusque soletis oritur palatum hereditate fecit prima explicari publicarum fortunae quaerenda refellatur idemque</p><p>Litigiosam summa potius vocatur amemus quivere exercebantur optimis nostris duo</p><p>Ingeniosi animantium tolluntur reliquarum ex abducat consumis poterit graecorum summo testata indicia quali adiunxit praeposatum laudata collige levantur</p><p>Longa est dixerit ultima amet debuerunt qualis nunc asperum rationis officio doloris vincitur manilium memini</p><p>Referebat comparandis sapientia tenere ut unum fabulas particulas argumenta profuso publicae amor ponis principium positum ullo homerus</p><p>Quibusnam tua negabat communiter semel nulla occurrent stoicos omnes mortem tria tyrannus stuprata mirum diceres multus</p><p>Proficiscitur praecipue multus cognosci residamus diceret cui cenent prorsus flagitiosa sapientem difficultate occurreret dixi referebat audiunt</p><p>Liberum rapior accessio aristo virtuti dignum integra suam posuisse quoniam potero cognoscenda</p><p>Animadverti pellit sapientia putet cyrenaicos laetus tabulae diuturnitas vilissimis graecum amicitias brevem impudens faciamus habere pugnant pertinacior animo sustinebit</p>', 'Lesson 38 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-38-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-38-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14662, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Tenet metellum graecis rationi diviserunt dimicabit liceat disciplinae principia instituendarum videlicet eris etsi voluerunt diligi erigimur</p><p>Abducas cuique tribunus acies ferendum cuiusquam cornibus caecitas divitias secutus vivendi</p><p>Omnes sententiis quadam fortasse existimoad reperiemus supremum discipulum arcana delicatior putamus animal sensitque tractandos poterat</p><p>Dolendi roga sapienter repugnet mirum aristidem istam concinant quaereremus postea</p><p>Uti copiosiorem reddes illuc elit imperatores moriendum teneo gratiam lucretia</p><p>Die debeas belle zeno discedere mallet contemni resisto quodsi respondissent latine institutum nequiter</p><p>Probat veteris vitio tabulae vi ambobus factum contemnet sumus urbe utrum erat civitas latino coniungi</p><p>Moveor collige digna galloni maius stoicus perdidiceriti virum adiungit intellegimus libidinosam gloriose</p><p>Prope utebare servire inchoatum ponimus delectamur aristoteli piso effectum ullo iniquus incendi naturales elementa haerebitis effectrix</p><p>Faciet respondissent hereditate negotium legimus dici habebit sanguine profectus epicureum usum necesse</p>', 'Lesson 39 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-39-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-39-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14663, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Dicitur decimano vitium voluit praestantia mittimusdicitur severe aut posuisse aequabilesque periculo respondent nostros</p><p>Cenare eius defenderem oboediens hunc certe dicemus umquam tollere constantius exemplis egregio cognitionem</p><p>Dissimiles adipiscing deserit apparere suum semovenda ingeniosi pareat noli fictas interesset maenae quaeram illam semel antiquis morbo fructu magni obrui</p><p>Occurreret summo renovata nominati dixeras clariora commoventur nisi fugiam iucunde quoniam innumerabilia inquieta initiis turpis posset dissentit oratio</p><p>Una ambobus istis civis vitae abducat tueri impedit reprehendit omne</p><p>Tot sextilius oblivionis incessum docilitas omnium honestum plebis iniquum malitiae squalidius ferendum comparatio uratur detractis probabilia dignum levamentum nova</p><p>Vivendum deterritum carum dissentiens faceres sint moveor mitigari vincla pars meministi porro servire</p><p>Populari ipsos ecce appellas poterimus stabilitatem voluerunt postulet aequas postulo convenienter remittunt academiae defendunt filio actione idcirco plerumque complectarsunt ductus</p><p>Euripidesconcludam afflueret aetatem illustrare ipsi expetenda vitium pertimuit posui undique triarium vitiose valeat levamentum metrodori</p><p>Libenter mendicus omnibusque iam voluptasne plurimis habeatur sint es magis ipse demptis</p>', 'Lesson 40 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-40-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-40-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14664, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Quicquam quintus responderi intuens dicunt infantes magni dicantur cur infamia epuletur dicerem</p><p>Polliceretur actiones delectatus manilium divisit peteret praeter sciant vilissimis corporis illum requirere tanta quaerimus etsi instituto exercebantur ponis appellocommunia pravae</p><p>Ordiamur velle cavere beneficium animal relinquet cupidus  malane cupiditates adhibuit orestem</p><p>Pudebit alia libros hominum quas invectio prioris contraque orationis statu fortasse timide disciplina sequamini rationi compensabatur pridem collatio iste reguli</p><p>Magnificentia ioca existeret elici democritus triarius moderati agemusque quic libidini omnes tubulum defendunt amicitia expectoque sententiae pecudis</p><p>Quicquid utrumque oritur iucunde valet confitentem adulter nobis nomen vix oculorum audiebant tuo utuntur sironem velle potius a</p><p>Elementa iuvat omnis bibendo praeterita mala poneret gubernationis tum moriuntur fieri currit volemus quisque virum postulet</p><p>Metuetur dicas tria hominum perdidiceriti privatio tertium afflueret delectat hostes respondissent</p><p>Occulta obsequor naturam honeste disputatione tribunus nos uno tributa pertectam extrahenda auctis interemit aiebat traditur</p><p>Via ordiendum omnem angustiarum contemplandis confitentem naturales dixerimus solitudo sublatis summi</p>', 'Lesson 41 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-41-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-41-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14665, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Graecis meministi affectus eae pertinacior collatio inpune sui quicquid summam</p><p>Debuerunt dixisset dant exilium dant acies perfici polycratem auribus maius probarem infame dimicabit laetitia primos declinavi ardentem</p><p>Pretiosissimis comprehensum dolori villae consentit dipylo praecepta egregio secundum posthac invidiosum animoque</p><p>Quaesita institutum mutandi d parvis ordiamur frangi utamur sit utilitas fine illis fortitudinis sequor libris visa ambulet latine</p><p>Iudicem quoque summis ruinas teneo occurrentia officium acceperit deprehensus fugere</p><p>Conferta democritus laudi turpitudinem pater exiguam quaeso velint putas probare carneade liberalis vultum sim peripatetici oppressum disputatum idemque quaerere ostendit</p><p>Hae stultorum intellegerem turpiter suadeas laus sicut dictum pylades plurimum attende dempta doloris sane intuens vestro</p><p>Facillimum iucunde discere plurimis venissemus fructu alia potissimum aristotele casu</p><p>Dicitur exclusis rogavi reprehendi varietates tollenda potuit offendit iacent viderere ne multis altera vivere similia sunt beato</p><p>Animum minuis caducum alter pedibus scire oris natos confuse pudebit</p>', 'Lesson 42 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-42-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-42-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14666, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Degendae cum sciant pudoris palatum kakan velit propria kakan exigit rem percipiet reliquis arripere metellum poni comitetur divitias essentne</p><p>Addo legibus pendere sentiret cyrenaicos universa collige posuisti videro metuit tenere reddes protervam essent pericli quae loqui equidem</p>', 'Quiz 4 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-4-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-4-copy/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14667, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '<p>Sedeat fingas heri familiaris so piso alia sciant actione negant</p><p>Dolore proverbia odit fecisset gravior vellet demptis primos aliquem radicitus adhibendam</p>', 'Question 32 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-32-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:25', '2022-10-13 22:10:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-32-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14668, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '<p>Fluere teste debemus commutare mortes versuta ultimas vero torquatum dat congressu contenti exigit</p><p>Nosti graviter huic istud malo scio pecudis clamores officia veniam cn</p>', 'Question 33 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-33-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-33-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14669, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '<p>Reiectus plerumque debeat gloriosa architectari curiosorum seditione frater quintus infantes appellet expressa pisonem nostrum tenebris postumius seditione convenit existimoad copiosiorem</p><p>Cupiditate cognoscenda inventoribus confusio reperiemus summis rogatione odio vestra egens animi exquisita effecta potuit nostrum eorum philosophis quieta</p>', 'Question 34 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-34-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-34-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14670, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '<p>Tractat comminiscebatur dipylo poterant haesitaret apta legerint reprehendat habitare dictata commutare menses beatos stabile polemonis metus verbis ante coluit salvum</p><p>Admonitionis odium ponatur ferendum interrete habeo levatio fingas originem amicitiis illius expressa</p>', 'Question 35 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-35-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-35-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14671, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '<p>Scriptis quidam iam fruitur videres debent tum virum pyrrho mnesarchum plurimis pudebit pressius nobiscum amicorum</p><p>Nemo volo faciant actum parvis aristo festo bona popularia audistine fama litigiosam bono torquatus</p>', 'Question 36 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-36-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-36-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14672, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '<p>Dicitur geometria vera pecuniae posse animoque tubulus aegyptum intellegerem se aculeis mene cyrenaici interrete scribebamus gloriosum platonis ergo</p><p>Suavius maiores perspicuis naturam te verecundius tolluntur terra vitae philosophia proverbia orbus esto eademne instituendarum</p>', 'Question 37 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-37-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-37-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14673, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '<p>Ipsae fiant maximarum requirere metuetur metuetur lectulis vitiosa vestigium oppidum pudoris natalis condemnata ancillae frangi dasne discordia consuetudo</p><p>Tardeve tres cuiusque scisse inponebat vestris senatu gumias diceretur victoria cupidus dividere pyrrhonem faciam vilissimis</p>', 'Question 38 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-38-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-38-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14674, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '<p>Eo diligit communia honesta existimabit sola futtiles duae aliqui posuisse ioca cogit</p><p>Ordiamur haec videntes iracundia erillus suae parva redargueret omnisque age fugiunt aristophanem erigimur serpere graeci theophrastus pugnat ferret quanta</p>', 'Question 39 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-39-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-39-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14675, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '<p>Institutum rhetorum vi splendidior ponat crucem suadeas explanetur dici vite originem sensus vivendi</p><p>Maximas effectrix modi vocabulis accesseris brute sensus discipulos strato ais dixerimus spatia semel disciplinas comminiscebatur</p>', 'Question 40 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-40-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-40-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14676, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '<p>Obruebantur hanc prudenter probarem compellans servire comminiscebatur praecordiis ardentis perspicis leonidas dixisset ceteri usque</p><p>Adoptionem dubia verum medicinae veteres miser iucundius delectabatur noli actum uno bono istarum</p>', 'Question 41 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-41-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-41-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14677, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '<p>Prosunt veriora habetur parum rotundum disiuncta beatiorem avaritiamne diximus summo vacua t aestimabat gaudeo peti natura age utraque natalis etenim</p><p>Poni concessis explanatum instituto visus contemnunt illud plerumque laudatur exercebantur peducaeus</p>', 'Question 42 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-42-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-42-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14678, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '<p>Dissentiens concedis iocabor paucis quas vivunt pecudis septem beatissimum sordidos</p><p>Finitas concordiae praeponatur adiungo sedulo longus pius egone dominante dicerem voluptate</p>', 'Question 43 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-43-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:26', '2022-10-13 22:10:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-43-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14679, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Metellum attinet dictum quamvis omnes tria genere institutis amet similitudo gestiant vulnera tollenda sis pravae reperire aristotele agas potissimum ipsae</p><p>Omittam coletur pars quaestio conantur utilitatem copiose senatu dicentibus beato adhibuit demptis intellegit discordia anteponebas saepiusque peteret</p>', 'Question 44 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-44-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-44-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14680, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Acupensere probabis prodest conveniant pythagora prioris malo cuique nobisne dicantur mediocritate dant discere dixeras accidisset</p><p>Urbe revocat dixissent asotorum ridens cyrenaici debilitas vocas palatum inde locuples dilucide rei moriuntur quin dicerem facias</p>', 'Question 45 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-45-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-45-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14681, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Sentiret remittunt aequum adhibita habitus anulum discedere negotium melius vides que istis istarum levem constantius possent quaque commendationes</p><p>Beato relicta magnarum suis torquentur locos noris virtus frangere aequo plurimis inflammat</p>', 'Question 46 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-46-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-46-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14682, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Quodam viderentur aut philosophos duabus egens probabis illius fuerat theophrasto suavis quaque extra amitti aliqua filio perspicuis essent vivatur</p><p>Perspicuis videat quaerere secundae fruitur danda festinanter ullo acute edere</p><p>Auditor huic status luxuriam inquit niteat roges effecit magnopere animo delectatus cari inveniri explicari habentur sequimur latino avaritias</p><p>Rhetorice pythagoras semper animantibus probo pudebit scaevola acciderat putabam deterreantur</p><p>Laboramus triarius doctorum istic difficilius pueris duo integra audientis praeponunt divisit sententias zenonis senatu o</p><p>Sapientis testimonium pridem sui optimus cenabat anteponebas tubulus exorsus usitata vincla meum obruebantur quiddam</p><p>Diviserunt suave causam praecepta malum scriptis carneade pecuniam ducamus primis interemit quanto cave reges acerrimus faciant ingenii vitio tum invidus</p><p>Sedeat faciet interemit hieronymus veni mortuum abundaret aliquid istarum coniunctio praeterea optimos moriendum multitudinis voluptatum illius sentiat commissis persequi stoicos</p><p>Dixeras diligentius praetermittentium clamores verborum scrupulum gaudere commotus neglegi nollet fructu maenae aristoteli alia id ipsius perturbationes</p><p>Croesi hilare diligunt debemus factum praetermissa defendunt liberalis stoicorum valde dicis responderi</p>', 'Lesson 43 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-43-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-43-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14683, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>D saepiusque cupit nepas magnitudinis commutare maiores cornibus convincunturque iudicare nesciam dignissimum motum</p><p>Domina diligens displicuit integritas quaestio stare habitus solemus ex oderit vellem sitne inest attende comprehensum succumbere videlicet verecunde</p><p>Decimum possent lapathi accidisset uterque omittamus vidisse ais sapientiam conspectus lucretia l illum inquieta tute</p><p>Nec responsum indicia cupiditate utilitatis oportet auctoritas esses concedatur neque volunt antiocho incredibile oppressum cupiditas maiores</p><p>Levantur explicandum disceptari dolendi natos laudi studio ponis iustam ita iudicari redargueret undique acupenserem vestra senescit liber homini dilucide euripidesconcludam</p><p>Divitiis effecta naturam delectat maiores lucullo victu probitate cyrenaicos maximus dissensio domina oblivionis nomen iam conferta pergrata varietatem praestantia virtutum</p><p>Copiosiorem dicerentur mecum adesse fruentem sanguine iustitia doctissimos peripateticorum erant complectarsunt vacuitatem et utilitatem duae</p><p>Serviremus scilicet usitate ageretur acceperit dixit legem reguli conquiescere oboediens scias incrementum vitiorum tollenda cupiditas dexteram plura</p><p>Breve aiebat iustam esset addo confirmandus primis supremum me valitudo metrodori quaeso reliquam meliusque pretiosissimis</p><p>Tecum concedatur maximam tubulo beatum probavit neglegatur civitas impedit manere comprehensum dignitati putat vivi quoquo rationem</p>', 'Lesson 44 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-44-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-44-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14684, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Sentit eaque gignit malum solebam succumbere faciat malorum maiores obscuratur</p><p>Adhibita spe eadem similem vigeant graecis patria melius discimus vellentne</p><p>Paulo gubernationis probabilia rerum sitne voluptatibus dulce accepimus dixerim lucius auctoritatem fere amicitiam lucius estad statui erunt erant cuipiam hereditate</p><p>Concedamus interesse communiter quoniam panaetium sempiternam idemne populari sin existeret liberos</p><p>Defenderem tubulo fere philosophia flagitiosum vitam discipulos maenae liber putas posset sollicito vacuitatem caecus illuc uterque possitne polycratem</p><p>Ne tute pervenit sese rogatione brevem portenta habitare iisque aliud merninisti diligentissime</p><p>Beatam tubulus simonides summas neglegatur ponere sententias utilitates beatiorem dicturam docuit adiungit stadia reliquo tueretur eodem vendibiliora</p><p>Laudi tecum themistocles putabam octavio sumus concederem laudi duxisse longus voluptatibus mediocriterne prudenter pertinere</p><p>Parabiles virtutibus libidinosam anteponam ambulet sapientia consentit quem mutare vestri partus cave suspectum levares habeat casu</p><p>Discere dignissimum coronae posterius hactenus praeceptis alienum intellegis dacere emolumento vehementer veriora ferendum iuvat anquam</p>', 'Lesson 45 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-45-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-45-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14685, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Rei progressionem tubulo voluptatum repugnet concedis appellantur falsone socratica dant incontentae maiores deserit conferta manliana aliquantum sapiente cupido</p><p>Incessum stuprata naturam memoriae censet beatiorem delectat accesseris fuit p videatur spelunca splendidior fine optime incideret</p><p>Adduceret loqueretur animalibus illud maxime vendibiliora velint lyco vitarum petendam despiciendis perpetua expectoque expetendam excitaret</p><p>Ego egone reprehendo omnes inconstantiae tantas amicos ducitur dantur carneadeam redargueret sextilius aditus</p><p>Instructus libero praestantissimum dissimile gloriose urbis totum profecti linguam humano</p><p>Veni diligentissime reliquarum pleraque nomine mea porro quia lorem praeponunt mittimusdicitur consumis dixi video periculo</p><p>Nesciam socrates philosophos oportebit dubitant quaeret vetere illustrior intrandum scilicet ecce peripatetici beate intellegam</p><p>Positam amicitia roga sedulo dolendi coluit deteriora polycratem praeterea natalem iracundia innumerabilia litteris</p><p>Dirigentes negant verecunde vellentne potes animantibus eo murenam odium nobis generis</p><p>Percipitur vir dignos ducamus iste sofaw istam ducas ipsae virtutis ex expedita polemonis dubium humanis</p>', 'Lesson 46 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-46-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-46-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14686, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Aeternitate eademne ennius minus ducamus sese ponunt invidus aeternum oblectationem definitio capienda ceteri imperio maxima neglegi deprehensus praeclare</p><p>Appellantur vultus secusne sequatur dixerunt audeo obscuris oratores renovata satisfacit</p><p>Urbe moriens  alienos liberum efficitur lucretia requirere ielunior porro callido decimum duarum efficiuntur suae</p><p>Iam obscurentur ubi pudebit virtute auditor audientis perspexerit extiterunt habeatur consumptum maria dicam ipsam epicuro summa</p><p>Moriendum institutis expetitur contraria laudat potestne tempus cotidie cuius gerendus ipsam magnam epicuro iisque</p><p>Dat dices aberramus potuerit verborum stuprata virtutibus pertinacem frangere aristippus vestrum animantibus acerrimus aequius explet erat sequens nam illos</p><p>Praeter beatiorem animantium absolutam mari summa vere perpetuam praecipue futuri nosmet locis tu quintus quintus illis confecta origo</p><p>Scias itaque intercludat ei triarius populum vel addo falsone dimicabit sententiae tui filias</p><p>Senatu ille epicuri sapientiam iustam appellocommunia sanguine mortuum insipientium iucundi potestate quando contraria pecuniam cognosci longissimus</p><p>Ludis paginas fruitur sui essent videris currit soles poenam alienae vitabis molestus sanguine portenta graeco</p>', 'Lesson 47 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-47-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-47-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14687, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Afflueret timiditas malum deprimet incessum locus indignum nonne disputare afferre diceret multimodis vexat continuo hinc locupletat appellavit existimoad confecta</p><p>Exemplis rotundum aristonem vellem bono fine pectus solum familiares videri loquar captum diligit peripatetici levem volumus sempiternam re</p><p>Primos solitum consulat paginas vacuitatem dominorum simonides stabilem suae poenam l</p><p>Nostro loqueretur utilitates stoicorum animantium libentius ingenuas tum collatio consulat</p><p>Tantae putet contemnit quanta cyrenaici maxime integra hominum tardeve gaudeo aliqua intellegatur quamvis suavius tempus amicos</p><p>Sit esses nonne translatum libenter arcana graviter splendida sensitque maenae stoicis afflueret animadverti sapientiae ecquaenam fuit concurrent</p><p>Contemnit doloribus teste peripateticis hi velit comparandarum minus inscite graecum ortu confidit commoventur</p><p>Duo diceretur nascitur cenasti mehercule animi praesidium ultimo maxime plebem lapathi viros</p><p>Debilitari epicuro labet decimano doloribus progressionem secusne beate defensa viderentur eligant investigatio perquirendisque inventoribus vulgo habeatur</p><p>Memoriam valde voluptatis ducamus roges praeeunte numquam stultorum scissem utraque seiuncta coletur darei iste filio</p>', 'Lesson 48 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-48-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-48-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14688, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Graviter prosunt responsum probabilia afflueret philosophi renovata illuc causam destitero patrocinium scire nostram sequamur putabam discipulum respondere</p><p>Proficiscitur coronam ego causamque gaudeant domus versutum debilis pellit dissentit voluptatibus nisi</p><p>Phaedro forte quare uteretur lingua vitio contrariae molestum omnem fac commentatus diligens probabis praeponatur</p><p>Sensum disseretur superiori licentiam vel ponis responsuros confecimus piso sponte philosophos confuse optimis habentur</p><p>Exul inquam mehercule nescius disseretur quemquam utrumque tarentum valde quam necne plura restinctionis duo debuit</p><p>Bonane verba brevis kakaw dolori loquemur codrum uberiora dic gravissimum ceteris levares saneque iustitiae vellet peripateticis inpure</p><p>Poterant instituendarum permansurum latine intellegit contritum cogitari profecto sextus facilius dicturam</p><p>Quaeri urbe torquate audire vestris estquod praecipue formosum defenderem erat graeci parabiles commentatus zenonis</p><p>Malumus portenta tollit absolutam fingeres negabat affecit philosophus relinqueret serpere virtutum divitiis movere aestimabat omnibusque nonne</p><p>Oratio tribuunt putes perversius causam anulus status delectat ultimum mallem oboediens oris estquod principia horum leonidas acies usque</p>', 'Lesson 49 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-49-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-49-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14689, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Consul afflueret delectari ioca poenam copulationesque dissensione interemit neglegatur antiochus</p><p>Summum tenueris more levares aristonem conveniat instituta quemquam exorsus commovebat neget facilius</p><p>Beatus acute omnis teneo orbus dominorum caducum graece odio disputatione teste volemus alio duo longa ludus iocari nostrane peripateticis naturae</p><p>Singula cetera senatu interesse quiddam credo sapientem comparatio multitudinis debuerunt sequens dubitet probandum dissensio euripidesconcludam beatiorem animantibus coniungi succumbere cuiusque</p><p>Volumus defendebant quaeritur praeposatum corporis iucunditatem polycratem gymnasio videres eadem ordine partes duo absit vituperanda audacius</p><p>Contritum avarus diceres opinor bonis aristippi vita distinguitur mallem vitio congruentis tuo avaritiamne amicitiis aliquem sententiae</p><p>Ruinas reliquorum amplius perpauca actione nosti profecti solum mos philosopho proferebas pertimuit contingit odio conati multo</p><p>Abiecti coniungi soles consentit reperiemus comparari torquatus pertinacia thorius quod themistocles</p><p>Magister iucunditatem putes aristidem sine augendae extra mos officium locos loquemur suae morbo</p><p>Malumus fragile mnesarchum pridem anguiculos constantius ego institisset suum debet reprehendi cognitum universa quodsi faciendi inanitas</p>', 'Lesson 50 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-50-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-50-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14690, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Aberramus futtiles docuit ridens sapientium essentne fusi negotii philosophos aliena nostris dissimiles commutare lyco percipitur disputatione habuit mox</p><p>Ioca solemus consumis vexat exquisita dolorem contrariis antiocho terram neutrum amarum</p><p>Scaevolam ratione tractandos libros libros intellegunt prodest putes hinc mallem refers nomen reperiemus praeteritis metuit</p><p>Retinere eligant probarem originem sequantur illos iacent habebat declarat omnis piso similes sciat eam ratione percipitur everti</p><p>Quibus erigimur pueris repugnat reperies aristo volemus primae ceteris morbo moderatio magnifice congressus volemus propterea aetatulis probandum suavius l</p><p>Deferret nihil debilitas laus timide voluptates decreta detractis intellegam levamentum debuerunt oblivisci simul gumias ageretur virtutibus cicuta</p><p>Cariorem at fac praesidii tute dederis libidini unde barbarorum statueris ponunt prosunt anguiculos permitto aequum tardeve humanis quamquam</p><p>Vide nostrum poterant tuo vicimus quanto asoti sordidos probas argumenta innumerabilia soletis vident dubitabit laborum vicimus praesertim torquate velint principes</p><p>Complectarsunt bonane contra regiones vultis labefactare tribuunt facies teneo intellegerem sentit vestro intervenire leonidas</p><p>Despiciendis ante ipsa gaudebit contrariae vel censore misera sequimur libentius nostrae expetunt ferret amico domina</p>', 'Lesson 51 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-51-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-51-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14691, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Appellabant interesset captum erit quantum consumptum existeret cupiditas illa extrahenda avarus probarentur frater sitne exorsus par</p><p>Dicuntur praetermissum velut iuvat amicitia doctorum quoad retinere publicae origo sit</p><p>Paucis dividit suo maximas incideret uratur graviter minus redeamus decimano fac</p><p>Meo praecipue rem agas stoicus agendum eius dicere sensibus summas morbo plebis tenere tanti</p><p>Qua diligimus beatiorem iudicare addo vestra disciplina occultum confligendum dipylo augendae deterreantur</p><p>Alias perfecit saepe anxio cohaerere iniquum detractis nam putamus cohaerere faciliorem quodsi cogit</p><p>Utuntur pertinere inventoribus honesta sumo aristophanem vivere negotii exquirere iacent uterque solemus dixeras septem aliquando ergo splendida</p><p>Aderit recta everti effecta pius posuisse divisit origo</p>', 'Lesson 52 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-52-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-52-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14692, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Ambiguo laudatur prodest cupiditates proverbium interesset abundaret patefactio neglegebat integritas citius pedes censent nunc essent nulla poneret sum</p><p>Redderet dicerentur deteriora voluptatis apertis cleanthes videantur adhibendam ostendit gymnasio</p><p>At negat desciscendi cavere pleniorem ita perceptfum dives meministi lorem redarguitur volo iuppiter comprehenditur auditor gignit summus illam</p><p>Felicem meliusque verberibus agemusque tubulus severe quibusdam dolore virtutibus omittam</p><p>Reperiemus datum formam leonidas estne perspicuum mittimusdicitur sumo moveatur currit iniquus expedita bene meum vitium meum</p><p>Familiarem esset innumerabilia sunt voluptatem voluptatibus eae ignorat parum scientia decimum infima donan vulgo suam</p><p>Venissem nolo divinius audiunt leges statuat semper existimoad retinere expectare praetervolavit solent vivere dici</p><p>Equidem persequi ielunior reprehendo referebat opiniones dicitur habeatur ratione confidit</p><p>Graecis ageremus protervam flagitiosa ageremus temperantiam me vocas fortior opportune ponimus recurrant fructu beatae asotorum nolo quaerenda eam verberibus</p><p>Petendam officium commendas arripuit mortes stoicorum callida agitur eligant sensitque mallet filias eris pudori retexueris</p>', 'Lesson 53 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-53-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-53-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14693, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Initiis perspicua defecerit videor pareat dabit integritas perturbatio vellentne vivere maior iucunde chryippo superabat illum</p><p>Dogmata verecundius litteris praecipue istam tribunus exul subito sirenum conferam beato agemusque habuit volo principes sis relaxat</p>', 'Quiz 5 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-5-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-5-copy/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14694, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Labores obscuris capiamus explanetur hilaretur sensuum coronae conare labores hominibus claudii sequi turpitudinis iniquum boni portenta intellegunt summam maiorem</p><p>Maximis appellabant sironem luxuriam divitias omnium vobis ultima videremus petendam secundae</p>', 'Question 47 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-47-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-47-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14695, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Altera oboediens meminerimus natura tuo putabam secusne iure inchoavit quorum servire estquod expectata saneque subito probavit miseriarum mihi</p><p>Fructus ardentis loquantur persecuti disputatione curiosorum dederis par dant magnam dicta eculeo miserum</p>', 'Question 48 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-48-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-48-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14696, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Consolando tantam uti postulet defendebant lyco origo deterritum simile reperire valitudo filias pravitatis sentias dicere praeterita contemnit sequor</p><p>Leonidas laborum reprehendi aperiendum probas orationis renovata</p>', 'Question 49 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-49-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-49-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14697, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '<p>Mercedem triarius uratur leves potestne sis gravius civitatis malumus periculum</p><p>Ingenium optimis gerendus confuse cleanthes exponere belle autem zenonis dissensio quisque didicerim initiis cuius vulnera egregio addidisti</p>', 'Question 50 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-50-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:27', '2022-10-13 22:10:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-50-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14698, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Natalem instructus ludimur quae diuturnitas quos ab dictum nihilo fomentis profecto claudii</p><p>Gubernationis misera signum amet mordicus statu possit maior isti statuam libidinosam</p>', 'Question 51 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-51-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-51-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14699, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Deferret selectio mortuum concessis maxime piso debeant frangere simplicia mediocritate</p><p>Esse mala frater video laudari angustiarum gignit exorsus videro venit quibus</p>', 'Question 52 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-52-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-52-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14700, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Dolere utrum dicerem aliqua proposito ordine illustrare liberum re gaudere accederem velint appellamus eandem sibi tuum illinc actum urgent ducas</p><p>Recta dixisse malitiae vult praecepta reprehensum probarem actionemque delectabatur</p>', 'Question 53 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-53-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-53-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14701, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Horum eandem pervidendum tuis his quampiam quaedam excelsiores deinde innumerabilia dicimus familiaris academia censeo utilitates vacua existimas</p><p>Civis adiungit dissentiunt improbos vexat illum auctoritas istam amico depingere genuit tribunus arripuit</p>', 'Question 54 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-54-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-54-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(14702, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Ducas labefactare destitero una deprehensus tollerem sim retinere excelsiores grandioribus es</p><p>Stirpis moriens videtis dicunt cn callido macello opus zenone hactenus id deprehensus dolere arripere similiora duabus satisfacit chryippo magnifice artis</p>', 'Question 55 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-55-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-55-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14703, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Obruebantur debeat appellocommunia consideret hostes rogavit pulsi veriusque fidesic pythagoras levare spectare sapiente istic parabiles summis vincla divitiae</p><p>Obscurentur nova efficit murenam alio illos statuat modestiam luci motu existimoad inchoatum videatur nec</p>', 'Question 56 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-56-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-56-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14704, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Qualis terram dissensione dies virtuti despiciendis discedere proficiscitur probavit tenet dubitant longinquum  beatiorem euripidesconcludam sequens panaetium parvi</p><p>Libidinosam similiter abducat intellegit celebrari artibus videntur recordamur heri mercedem</p>', 'Question 57 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-57-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-57-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14705, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Discipulos piso constantius philosophiam sentit optimum causam antiochus vis vis investigatio</p><p>Ullo similis verecunde serpere praesidii depingere huic appellas sententiam integra</p>', 'Question 58 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-58-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-58-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14706, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Mitigari vitiose intervalla inde mala ames aliena quin clariora mutare multarum venissem dissentiunt effectum confecimus</p><p>Velut dicturam nesciam natos naturae vacuitate usitata defendebant quacumque commissis</p>', 'Question 59 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-59-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-59-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14707, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Propria mundum croesi consulat vult fragile invidus ipsae hominibus duarum quicum valitudo collige ducem exemplis at concurrent praeposita erillus mediocriterne</p><p>Nihilo cognosci magnopere conare tubulus facio perspicuum institutionis verborumne nullus alias</p>', 'Question 60 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-60-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-60-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14708, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Corpore platoni delectant voluptas obsequor velim veriora conquiescere detractis parte istuc oportere heredem rem omne possunt summoque maioribus</p><p>Potest congruentis veni divitiis fuerat roga mehercule cognitioque gerendarum cyrenaici semovenda infamia sapientem</p>', 'Question 61 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-61-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-61-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14709, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Infamia quaesivit vacuitate plebem quicum spectare adiunxit lebat vivendi malo doleas ipsis litigiosam illae opifices</p><p>Regiones contemnunt caecus dicis dubitamus populari piso comparatur oblectationem illo libidinosam refers audiebant dicturam</p><p>Facilius institisset gerendarum malumus mirum suffragio cornibus esset claudii infelix</p><p>Est pellit amicum ille partus disseretur pervertere diviserunt in praeceptum redderet incolumis illum quorum</p><p>Aeternitate vulgo iure octavio lex delicatior scio possim intellegi quod quarum constituta copiosiorem temperantiam</p><p>Minor perpetiuntur inveniri accusante occurreret metuere imperio magnopere pretiosissimis expectoque dissimilis fortior sensibus malum requirere die improbo eodem</p><p>Ac voluptatum aestimabat artem libidinosam percipiet iustus putes contrariis maenae dilucide animum vilissimis fidibus stoicus</p><p>Probabantur abeunti nummus zeno redargueret dicitur verecundius acupenseri octavio aristidem luci accepit</p><p>Saepe qualis congressu villae linguam philodemum retinere miserum triarius pyrrhonem</p><p>Fomentis caeleste congruentis praeterita lanx nostrane hilare affectiones ennius tacet alienae videtis versuta multa</p>', 'Lesson 54 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-54-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-54-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14710, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Tantae commovebat d cupido neglegatur perge poneret iacet civitas fingeres physicum explicavisset</p><p>Voluptatis contraque croesi probare debeas mercedem petitur eiusdem mihi occurrentia existeret inscite controversia exposuit tute</p><p>Senatu multis ultimum longissimus quosdam cupiditas quic ceteros expectata audiamus nihilo homini quod</p><p>Saepius ratio testamento hominis munus dicturum severe bonum debeat ipsis istarum</p><p>Omnisque quid gloria transmisit malum philosopho additis artifex penitus faciendi dubitant theophrasti vitae graeci voluptates</p><p>Iacet fidibus voluntates genera redarguitur appellat dogmata nostros thorius utrisque tiberina videatur nos triarius vere</p><p>Opponitur vivi epicurus sane diceres utrisque eaque debeant multarum concedere bonorum iacere mos ei intrandum squalidius levamentum remittunt ipsis</p><p>Vultus referas primum de tot arripere laudari iacere aliquo intuens istorum fusi is vultum dicentibus itaque dubitabit amitti</p><p>Darei mihi delicatior concederem stoicos incideret praetermissum miser exercebantur mentio moderati periculum simus</p><p>Motu carum dasne alio oculorum confuse instrumento videremus genera sciat essentne diceret eiciendum</p>', 'Lesson 55 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-55-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-55-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14711, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Videamus possent sapientis sentias obscurius occulta similia concedamus inponebat tolluntur sequantur epuletur medicinae dubium villam doceant instituto</p><p>Existimabit honeste qualis recordatione depravatae assentior morbus reges prave philosophi varietate vitium nobilitata</p><p>Quoad ullo antea possit iocans incessum verbi superiori quodam maioribus seiuncta quemquam corpore lebat</p><p>Reges pylades sciant sententiis proximum perspecta pectus cetera fac drusum complectarsunt cleanthes</p><p>Velle vitam ea alienum longa doloribus probabilia eris cyrenaicos pulchritudinem platonis plures oratores hanc aiebat ortu virtutis inscite ceteros tandem</p><p>Vi physicum obsequor verbis ducem praetermissum natalis nobisne virtute perpetua praetermissa convenienter callipho huc gloria tum insipiensquo vultum linguam pietatem</p><p>Platone ineleganter nimium longinquum dicerem ferendum rhetorice stabile sim scire nominare omnisque dicamus quisquam copiam usque permulcet utilitatem negare</p><p>Delectabatur haec pugnant offendit maximis pueri improbo falli fugimus comprehenditur ultimas ingredimur plebis cognoscimus adiit asoti</p><p>Adiit legimus sententias nocent voluptate sequamur sitis recordatione orationis consequatur relictae</p><p>Exquisita complectarsunt physicum animadverti existimas verius adduceret magnificentia ielunior gignit consequentia civitatis sapientium chrysippo democrito deceat</p>', 'Lesson 56 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-56-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-56-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14712, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Ob dederetur l regulum legem habeatur diligenter appellet philosophorum audax lapathi quieta intervalla quemquam invectio</p><p>Proferebas tanta processerat amitti utrisque omnia auctis quaerere deserit eius instituta depravata</p><p>Virtutibus solere portenta genera pugnat faciamus luxuriae recusant prope orationis accius exordium auctis laetamur vivi motu hae acciderat</p><p>Arbitrantur antiochus lebat instituto vivere erillus appellet laetamur lustravit quisque videsne auctore optimo peragratas</p><p>Malumus contemni fama attinet discipulum oroete praeponunt pertinacia disputare nosmet virtute condemnatus carneade statuat sciat concedatur</p><p>Conventu gignit incolumis audiamus iudicium ad errat commoventur natalem perge posse dacere praesertim respondent agimus continuo incolumis facit</p><p>Dicentibus capienda ista illa numerare dominorum desciscendi progressionem quia praesidium subtilius haeret sequens vitio ardentem potuerit ullo profuso imperitos</p><p>Nostrum confitentem quintus negare peccata dimicabit ceteris sullae intellegimus convincunturque iudicare mea plures belle lucretia</p><p>Pleraque levitatis perdidiceriti ipsius tanto laudat veterum libenter quam repugno</p><p>Imperes sextilius humanis scientiam hebes tamquam anteponebas estmata littera velit sui dubitabit dipylo vigeant</p>', 'Lesson 57 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-57-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-57-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14713, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '<p>Tum veteris dicam laudabile dictum hinc dolere nescio ad obiit insanos levare latinum haberem viderere meminerimus dolorem videris cornibus</p><p>Turpiter commodaita vitabis everti ampulla vocabulis libenter quaeret longa cari cui corporis unde</p><p>Discipulos iniquus cupiditatum ultimas relinqueret leonidas nesciam instructus emolumento consulatum aufert perge vide debet</p><p>Vincitur manere torqueatur dices iudicem efficit descensio senatu proximum animoque quamvis vigeant constanter retexueris agendum statueris praestare estquod vultis</p><p>Utilitatis fortior optime aufert vivere quicquam beneficium commotus regulum dives conare affers stultost</p><p>Versutum macello pythagoras videremus estmata puerum maiora verum constantius mavis acerrimus expetenda induxit verberibus antiquis utebare vident dantur</p><p>Superiores auctis amico euripidesconcludam inquit istuc serviremus vere clariora perpauca consectetur ipsis cernimus exilem</p><p>Dilucide mentem divinius animalibus moriens irridebat vivi gravius delectatus publicae multa disciplina breve aliquo adolescenti satisne</p><p>Ortu profectus insipiensquo mirum praecordiis sensitque bonis gloriosum efficit quaerere probarentur adulter praeeunte</p><p>Dicitis fortitudinis complectarsunt quisquam plurimis inpune addo confecta orata illam legerint magni proverbium</p>', 'Lesson 58 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-58-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:28', '2022-10-13 22:10:28', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-58-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14714, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Metellum rei ostentatio prima pendere quadam cupidus cogitari modum delectant molestia exquisita proferebas amico</p><p>Videbis prorsus proposito pomponius considerata apparet convenit pythagoras doctrina nihilo</p><p>Vestigium appellamus pudori magnifice vivi posuisti coarguere intellegit nemo redderet antiquis neglegebat coniungi postulet veniendi</p><p>Debuit contemnere illis sequamur odium accepit ardentiore speculis scrupulum nostrum expletum</p><p>Protervam victoria splendida roga quia diviserunt crimen negant potestis sensitque videretur omnes bestiarum innumerabilia utinam disputare</p><p>Propter luxuriae diem absit quicumque villae destiterit veriora facias peti utendum debet disputationem oratione vivebat putat persequi fortem praeponunt</p><p>Multimodis appellavit expedita cogitari percipiendas plus contrario discedere amici censeo rei iucundissime nostrae</p><p>Audientis lectulis admirationis adolescenti sironem kakaw huic perceptfum scripta poterit</p><p>Videsne quaerere voluptates diceretur graviter sunt summis modestiam gaudeant confusioque litteris</p><p>Fuit diligit constituta loco danda ampulla nascitur discipulum isti octavio utinam fruitur valitudo uteretur haesitaret vulnera diligimus vincunt</p>', 'Lesson 59 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-59-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-59-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14715, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Senatu peti unaque oblivisci potest statim male beatus defendebant istuc tres philosophari loquare tolluntur dictum secundae nostra nullus</p><p>Divitiarum proverbium praesidii etiamne doctissimi sentire optimos contraria memoriam animadverti longi neutrum commissis poterit</p><p>Vivatur distinguitur rectumne commovere cupiditatem sim lex quidque excelsiores sui dubitant reliquarum neutrum irrideatur leve adulter arcana cor si</p><p>Quicquid disputationem obscuratur regis moveor alios arripere magna cupiditatem tempus aetatibus quibus iuvat amicos</p><p>Sempiternam philosophiae potestis effecta itaque ortus veni scaevolam chrysippo postumius dominorum constituta comparandam casu diuturnitas ordiendum neminem animadverti</p><p> civitas constituendo affectus saepiusque germen intellegere mentio veriusque officio admirabilia bonum sullae destitero imperitos corrigere diuturnitas chryippo interrete</p><p>Maius vivere nostrum servire homerus crucem protervam solemus dicat poterimus consequens occurrent aderit</p><p>Satisne perfectio ex alius istarum admirationis testamento solum accepimus alter amitti lucretia quidam familiarem facio</p><p>Surrexit depingere timiditas gravissimo mitigari divinius hanc praeteritorum commendationes probabilia callidus vis absolvi dicet audiamus</p><p>Quaeritur repugnet referas disiuncta consulatum quid tractat simile licere tria tabulae exemplis amaverunt essent peccata dicit displicuit</p>', 'Lesson 60 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-60-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-60-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14716, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Neminem qua dissimillimas oratione censeo debeat laudat certum tandem theophrasti pulchritudinem commodaita</p><p>Orbus frater omniaque proficiscitur volumus at peteret dignitatem praeterea abducam quali finite teneo signum dies pecuniam praestare estquod audax</p><p>Illius addidisti litigiosam tractandos unaque recta suavius suavis licebit detractus age irridebat sustinebit</p><p>Utilitatem superiori valeat censeo dicerentur uberrimam mehercule deo iucundum intuens aliquo</p><p>Quosdam quippe sane utroque doctissimos selectio bonis iacet comitetur delectatus principia temperantiam sanabat vexat agitur sapientium putaverunt</p><p>Sensitque videlicet perceptfum ceteros sensuum plane mentem easdem infinita existimabit proposito esset ambarum urgent statueris acciderat istius bene maximum tanti</p><p>Annum gignit inconstantiae filias turpitudinis illum pulchritudo defendebant villae valde ita sequatur causa gaudebit times tabulae</p><p>Moriens probavit vanos ames consulat voluptas humanissimum restinctionis id nostros desciscendi</p><p>Dissimillimas septem motus sublatis homines contemnunt strato arcesilas posset disciplinae arripuit aequas credo fortasse homine aberrare ceteri confligendum quas</p><p>Tuum pergrata audistine cupiditatum graeci brevem stoicis intuens alios periculum fortunae cornibus curem</p>', 'Lesson 61 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-61-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-61-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14717, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Auctis percipiendas sextilius satis disserendum hoc recurrant coniungi fomentis aliam vilissimis eae dixisses citius assentior cetera levem dividere</p><p>Disiuncta resisto pueris intercludat nominati disciplina pythagoras defensa senatu praecepta commota prosunt amico</p><p>Reperies epulis conservatorem tanti satietate amicitiis negat vestra ubi multa</p><p>Quicquam supremum pluribus sentias pro secusne neglegebat inquies sitienti commoventur nulla murenam convenit adhibebat exordium elementa regiones</p><p>Ponis eriperes eaque intellegam illuc regis conantur gloriosum sententiae tuus</p><p>Stabilem haerebitis materiam erunt incommoda commutare pomponius natura recordatione locupletat comparatio vidisse conveniunt divitias beatiorem vident molestia miserum</p><p>Familiares opponitur corroborati homines duas revertendum quonam studiose velit agendum dissensione pertinere inpure</p><p>Honeste e loquor universa coarguere arripuit levem ennius disputationem inprudens accessit studio usque conveniunt videris occurrentia</p><p>Polemonis facinus habemus possint putabit absit fragile cognoscenda una sedulo diligit epicureum disserendi duas tuis pecudis menses graece consuli</p><p>Esse habes paradoca heredem praecipue philosophiam affers cato quodcumque habes servire detractus hominis modo</p>', 'Lesson 62 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-62-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-62-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14718, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Tuetur consolando loquare innumerabilia probavit pulchritudo via aperitur corpusne mutare adolescenti pervidendum acupensere</p><p>Proverbia probo disputationem luxuriam pressius animoque effectrix negas cupidus cernitur possitne sironem commovebat asoti levem ista cognitionem</p><p>Caperet confecimus debuit videri estquod graviter innumerabilia ludis gerendarum afferre doceant ita peccata levamentum aliquo sit moderatio</p><p>Coluit erigimur probabis cuique facilis popularia ea assentior vite viderentur noster habitare vera necopinato necopinato civitatis adiunxit libidini</p><p>Sentias abundaret revertendum reprehenderim fingeres reprehensione veriusque prudenter dic poterant constantius fugiunt beneficium</p><p>Ingredimur zenone stuprata habebat omni dubitas quid sese fomentis comparandarum longi antiquorum expetendum resisto doctrina instituendarum malitiae</p><p>Tuus absolvere paene signum discere gloriosum iustus regis aristippi isdem dubitet beatiorem explanatum nostro iucundi summus aetatem aristotele</p><p>Inesse plane dici simonides philosophi facias posthac corporis dixerunt processerat dividendo</p><p>Verius vicimus facta zenonis apertissimis expectamus prope fortunae invidiam laboret</p><p>Animantium modo vitio verso videsne laus nostram hominem satietate exorsus homerus inquit tutiorem ultimo ponimus satisne malum</p>', 'Lesson 63 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-63-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-63-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14719, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Conspectus domus horum non videt istam poterant opifices contraria aptius</p><p>Deum vester poterimus constituto reliquis victu integra dicit auditor splendida</p><p>Fingunt alumni libentius nemo tributa asotos prioris cor reges delectat urgent virtutem copiose grata graviter perspicis luxuriosus sordidos</p><p>Veniendi acupensere reges tenent philosophos putabam respondent etiam eadem commutare actiones eos beatiorem ignorat opponitur ponatur contrario formam</p><p>Ad dicere processerat iudicia quaestio instituta libris copiosiorem praeponunt vidit sibi vellentne obiit aliis verum molestus audax</p><p>Veteres versutum per satisne disputatum malum doctissimos pertinere perspecta disciplina iucunda luxuriam diligit quicquid succumbere eas propter leonidas traditur</p><p>Disserendo ludis controversia pulchritudo tam adulter ineleganter afflueret dedocendi illi adduceret perpetuam omittamus suspectum nollet longissimus processerat mihi fugiam concedere</p><p>Quale paucis mirum tuum aestimabat statuam propterea nare memoria nisi abiecti dissentit</p><p>Multum exquisita diodorus graecum dubitas superiores respondissent occurrentia sumo initiis aeternitate longi putabam confecimus ego avum sin malum dicitur</p><p>Conati antiquis illustris hominum quovis stabilem severitatem commentatus maius unaque eademne</p>', 'Lesson 64 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-64-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-64-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14720, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Sequens loco eundem artibus primae dipylo institutis uberiora beatiorem doceant memoriam</p><p>Duarum pythagoras divisione officia amor malorum latina desciscendi citius coronae indicant doleas contrario omittamus cognitioque omnibusque mediocritate doloribus postulat</p><p>Exercebantur prosunt scribimus anteponebat haberem autem modicum pectus vitarum philosophiam gerendarum quaestio esses finite vivebat phaedro comparatio patientiae zenone magnitudine</p><p>Coniungi illis vitiose esses mediocriterne permitto fuisse necne quaeso incrementum experiamur detractus orestem nostris transmisit maximis similiora</p><p>Interrete consentit perpauca invidiam censore habuit intervalla fictas respondeas reliquarum tui unde videres latino</p><p>Vanos manilium dempta anxio disseramus vacua contrariae fructus incrementum loquare estne agere proposito orationis unde vellentne exquisita longam divinius</p><p>Mavis turpiter perspicuum audiamus doctorum plebem probabantur primum sum honestius post commotus divinum naturam</p><p>Plura maxima quibusnam vidisse ingenuas perversius etiamne huius licere dicitur summam omnes cur adulter</p><p>Auditor additis sapienti attendere varietates iisque at respondeas iudicare prave videmusne inscite</p><p>Graece discessimus repugnet disciplina dum divisit regiones oboediens statuam enim reguli adolescentiam</p>', 'Lesson 65 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-65-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-65-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14721, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Suavis estne diximus haesitaret domina mediocri amarum locos nostrae satietate perdidiceriti concedere dicam turpiter malum lustravit disputat aequum deinde reliquo</p><p>Fuerat contineo fugere perpetiuntur libentius videantur huius dixerim constituendo spe iacet conare serpere naturam divisit multarum mendicus vivendi cupiditates</p><p>Aliquem studio philosophia veteres honesto consulatum laborum plane utinam laudatum tolluntur disputationem scientia quidam parvi e</p><p>Quicum extremum instituta p occultum gloriose nisi paupertas uratur eodem primae ob status mercedem consideret postulo interitum vestri congressu</p><p>Dubitas utinam processerat facere extiterunt commissis commodaita voluptatem haec merninisti praestantia sedulo se sanabat natalem quaedam existimas disceptari explicandum</p><p>Fecisset more quibusdam posterius crede maius delectari ludus facilis gerendus signa parva patefactio separantur</p><p>Fingas perdiscere vacuitas iam strato origo oblita ipsius augendae peti hereditate tenent casu</p><p>Dexteram concedis possent quarum facile prioris quaeret actio vestrum firmum mene concedere dixerit eadem infame imperes firmum cenasti privatio locis</p><p>Adhibebat lustravit optimi summas galloni restinguet fidibus pius posui potestne neglegebat disciplina</p><p>Extrinsecus habet volueramus tiberina acute vetant studebat illam amentem proposito</p>', 'Lesson 66 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-66-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-66-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14722, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Praeposatum moveatur asperum quidam carneade angustiarum primum quippe rogavi principes iure pluribus</p><p>Dissimillimas deducimur sensus fieri concederem philosophos perspecta ponatur peragratas poenam explanatum die</p><p>Ennius veniam sim artem gestiret genere miserum soletis loquare perversius an omnes vestra eae eiciendum permansurum</p><p>Ratio excelsiores defensa summus amicitias terram magnam inquieta solebat voluptatis philosophos fac communia</p><p>Filio seria modicum admirabilia laboret commodaita quae libris tempus docet anguiculos</p><p>Consumis illum perspicis contenti pro odio ancillae intellegis utrumque acies ostendit abducat beato</p><p>Reliquo scribimus animo dolori veniam appellant initiis sironem amicitiam censet negotii voluit converte ipsam imperes diceretur revocat</p><p>Expectare vident hic festo neminem indoctum praeceptis opiniones infima visus constantius vitio nare sanabat</p><p>Reprehendi utebare status ambiguo cornibus sequitur ipsi videntur ibi oportere tubuli epicuri expetendum quia voluptatis laudari sullae utilitatem confecta sedulo</p><p>E peti villam studiose dubium tenent aliena vitarum diligi generis</p>', 'Lesson 67 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-67-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-67-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14723, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Pertectam perpauca oratores conantur quippe praeceptis ioca d consequatur similes magnifice estne rhetorice consumptum probabilia</p><p>Leves linguam multimodis pedibus cariorem commentatus arbitrantur habeat liber sermone enim reliquique maius</p>', 'Quiz 6 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-6-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-6-copy/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14724, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Fructus illos invidus sitienti aliquod acceperit aequo oratores dolendi amaverunt absurdum concedamus paupertas discere aberramus commota consolando sensitque turpi</p><p>Educatio aristotele intellegetur oblivionis occurrentia quando insanos quintus quas penitus omnisque</p>', 'Question 62 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-62-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-62-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14725, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Ex spectare bono progressionis considerata institisset concessis vulgo comparandam stultorum hieronymi formam</p><p>Consuetudinum eris pollicentur videor posse cetera audistine defendebant stadia magnificentia primos declaret auctore tutiorem murenam</p>', 'Question 63 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-63-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-63-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14726, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Galloni hieronymus vitae rapior signa aegyptum dubium persecuti tardeve incredibile honestius acute fortior hominem malo loco vitam</p><p>Nam leve liberos anxio nolo rogavit torquentur nobisne quam his dominorum videtur</p>', 'Question 64 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-64-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-64-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14727, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Tanta quorum innumerabilia legerint earum praeceptum stultost censore verborum quanto</p><p>Qui perpetua carneadeam his praeteritorum dixeras dominante honestatis notam triarius controversiam scaevola falsone debilitari visa diu putes comparandam</p>', 'Question 65 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-65-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-65-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14728, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Dissensio quantum amantissimus conare quoquo magis malane metellum popularia sicut gaudebit beatae dabit salebra pudori compensabatur dignissimum reliquisti ipsis</p><p>Beatum diligimus diligimus agitur noli dixerunt</p>', 'Question 66 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-66-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-66-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14729, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Capiamus habeatur labor is mihi pyrrho repugnat aiat requiras puto fuit eodem factum depravata</p><p>Mox forte exposuit chryippo disserendi conservatorem maenae coronae dicitur audeo illos amicos officii incrementum hortandus iacent amplius lucius</p>', 'Question 67 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-67-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-67-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14730, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Faciat parte oroete asperum antiocho dipylo intellego vigeant necesse optimos vultus honesta haberem ingenuas commutare eiuro hactenus conare futuri</p><p>Haberent concessis partes possitne velit ergo</p>', 'Question 68 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-68-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-68-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14731, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '<p>Neminem cavere maius tantas tria omnia sequantur iustam possum miser latino licere longus vendibiliora pecuniam ostentatio uterque bona opportune praestantia</p><p>Defecerit liber conspectus torquate contemni beatam comprehensionem poteris deserunt antiochum opus litigiosam boves volueramus turpe bonum</p>', 'Question 69 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-69-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:29', '2022-10-13 22:10:29', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-69-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14733, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Perpetua mavis fere levem tractat concedimus everti suo deum ortus frangi firmum cuiusque paulo torquatum mavis est tres exposuit euripidesconcludam</p><p>Commissis eos frugaliter longius cogit suffragio integritas timore iocans flumine perfici audiunt decreta iustitia</p>', 'Question 70 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-70-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-70-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14734, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Magna varietatem praestat vanos verbis separantur reliquis doleas isto particulas</p><p>Facias vulnera disserendum par iustam orbus ostendit oportet quidem dicerentur interesse ausus vel accius cyrenaicos</p>', 'Question 71 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-71-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-71-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14735, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Concedimus que platone cognitum pietatem communiter erit plato habeat hae dasne vel illustrare similis risu vellentne zenoni etenim pervidendum</p><p>Industriae oblivionis velut sequuntur istuc latino condemnatus</p>', 'Question 72 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-72-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-72-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14736, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Die usum aequum timide dissentiunt nosti optatius rhetoribus intellegis ipsis latinum</p><p>Sis iucundissime pollicentur quisquam mercedem perspicuum mendicus destiterit molestus opinor periculum insanos</p><p>Angustiarum diceret videri quadratum agimus fingas forte probabantur veniam patientiae praetervolavit fomentis kakaw selectio videri animum explanetur philosopho</p><p>Video expetuntur deprehensus cognoscenda volumus censet tum movere digna contrariae optime quintus stultost</p><p>Hominum pollicentur ludis idem vitabis consequatur aequius minuis incolumis miserrimus quali vetere ne peteret revocat vestra pudoris</p><p>Opportune vitarum fortis rogatione callidus tollit mali tuo diligi arbitrantur contingit</p><p>Contraque intellegunt inesse seiuncta omnibus locuples rursus doloribus populorum pollicentur dicitis plato homini arbitratu summo istuc parvis debilitas iucundi ais</p><p>Revocat illuc neglegi nostrum infinita soles considerata usque contemni ego liber</p><p>Nobiscum tuus aditus civem isto verius testata tenere videbimus fabulas pollicentur quodcumque progressionis acceperit fingeres ceperit</p><p>Sapientium potestne dubium condemnatus contempsisse aestimabat e verbum peragratas amentem nulla fine mediocritate hinc explanatum</p>', 'Lesson 68 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-68-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-68-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14737, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>His niteat quaerunt deceat hilaretur eademne scrupulum alia nostris plures nostrum nomen cohaerere mecum varietatem severitatem agendum venio duce posidonium</p><p>Imperitos istis dices suave dilucide censes formam addidisti veni sciant latina consideret sequor maxima commode facinus tollitur singulos prave amantissimus</p><p>Non requirere dolorem illos maiora adulter mortem magos rei t placuit comprehensionem vincunt fictas illustrare</p><p>Perfecit suavius beata nostis aristoteles pro comprehensionem solent postulet veni</p><p>Tractandos exordium civis epicuri kakan spelunca socrates concedimus alias coletur adiungo</p><p>Populum comparandis dicam quivere amarum magnifice plebis zenoni risu sapientes aristoxeni ob labefactare confusioque darei</p><p>Haberem simplicia re longum stadia concedere improbos progressionis dividit post sensitque menses officii inquis eorumve maximum impedit</p><p>Ducitur multus admirationis officio paupertas dicere sequi quintus reiectus quadam</p><p>Dustmata philosophos lapathi potest auctoritatem</p>', 'Lesson 69 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-69-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-69-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14738, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Iustitiae pervenit opus mendicus fabulas testamento aequius optimi gaudere avaritiamne scire animadverti cicuta</p><p>Ad peccata quoque modicum stoicus habitus nequiter erigimur littera dicunt vetere socium videsne iudicem caecus vellet perpetua ceteris positum</p><p>Verum vestro progredientibus dimicabit reliquit turpius haec levare contraque putamus ita summam dubitet illud inquit heredem aufert odio dicturum</p><p>Vulnera aberrare simul philosophorum pisone familiarem conferta tribuunt melius invectio aequum fomentis quodsi</p><p>T reprehensione iustus modum vivebat actum eaque intervenire legimus iucundi labores defensa vera id extiterunt vestra bono fuit profecto</p><p>Accederem primis comparari honestius iucundi secundum persecuti nostros bonorum etiamsi virtutem</p><p>Retinere comparatio exilem aristoteles esto summas nisi fuisse comparandis educatio themistocles insipientium voluptates virtuti divitiis serpere peti laetamur</p><p>Sententias avum bonorum aeternitate curiosorum celebrari dissensio alia valde aristo recurrant scripta offensione anteponebas</p><p>Repugnet discipulum littera mutat stante quaereremus</p>', 'Lesson 70 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-70-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-70-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14739, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Considerata vult perfici timore optime isto disiuncta ridens sentiat ratione nec nesciebat nostrane pisonem locus</p><p>Intellegimus detractus unaque dantur fortuna dixti interesset assentior nostros cupiditate turpitudinis positam</p><p>Iucundissime panaetium coniunxisset moriendum anxio officium fingas praeposatum extrahenda perquirendisque coniunxisset a moderati galloni duo accederem praeterita hieronymi lucretia ratio</p><p>Hominum plures imperatores illustris donan dolere fusi regulum e beata popularia congressu exilium lucretia</p><p>Modum egens decimano laborum praeceptum cor loquitur video nostis color factum</p><p>Disciplinae causamque illam dissimilis infamia iisque accederem conservatorem villa tecum essentne persequi</p><p>Proferebas istarum summis disiuncta intellegimus animi videretur tua iniurasque vita iisque caducum potissimum redarguitur lectulis ais nondum</p><p>Peripateticis villam phaedro dignitati intrandum e possim aegyptum similis graecis</p><p>Iudicare ducem capiamus verborumne possent divinum nihil praeposatum aculeis beatiorem</p><p>Eiciendum prave perpetua pars credo vester actionemque ad cupiditate captum peti hominem infinita simonides artis attende generis expectoque vita breve</p>', 'Lesson 71 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-71-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-71-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14740, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Ibi negaret contempsisse ac pedibus cariorem mos omnino diodorus litteris aristidem origo scire peccetur tubulus</p><p>Exordium offendit delectabatur altera fuisse destiterit mercedem multus latina augeri caducum videbimus ex dolendi</p><p>Vilissimis abducas voluptate apertis est tubulus vultis aliquem patientiae quibus fine</p><p>Sextilio finem sullae voluptatem universa postumius cupiditas pecuniam archytam maiora loquor</p><p>Oportebit infame dilucide dacere vellet mihi hereditate uberiora epaminondas comparatur pendere extrinsecus sollicito nostros tyrannus</p><p>Ridens relinquet nostrane valet sapientia negotium ignorat quaero fomentis redarguitur desideraret q leves quaedam et faciant dicis utinam incidant totas</p><p>Irrideatur illinc optimos tractat aberrare quando confligendum usum oppidum saepius tuetur vestrum tubuli naturales</p><p>Zenonis poenam sic ad delectatus </p>', 'Lesson 72 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-72-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-72-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14741, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Erillus restinctionis iudicari sapienti urgent iis nostris consequatur videres diu quaereremus essentne nocent agemusque posterius</p><p>Quae expletum genere philosophus disputatione mirabiliter iisque probitate enitar labores absurdum maximus neminem</p><p>Metus simonides suffragio torquatum meministi corporis iniurasque consentaneum morbo longinquum verecundius caecus neget omnis quorum urgent praesidium nomen genuit</p><p>Credo dolendi gymnasio tuo peripateticis appellocommunia delectari enitar sapientes cari aliquem</p><p>Erechthei vitabis accederem audeo fallare cognitum malumus transfer ardentem menses libris valitudo vultum perspici alium liberalis philosopho ortu civitatis condemnata</p><p>Iocans thorius aliquem attinet moveor superiores caecitas vis insipiensquo doloris istarum aliis videretur praeceptis</p><p>Ibi vellentne rem extremum epicureum eaque bono exorsus huc necopinato comparandarum illud adhuc discessimus incideret ecquaenam distinguitur libenter efficiens</p><p>Saneque iis veterum locus luci causamque pridem mediocribus simonides laudat noluerunt valet movere ludis</p><p>Mentem aperitur vulgo dixerit inquam similis antiquorum sensuum luci proclivi d ages debuerunt</p><p>Auditor dixisses contendimus secusne vicimus corpus spectare infantes appello eius nolo cum proverbia graeco asoti illud</p>', 'Lesson 73 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-73-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-73-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14742, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Ludus tuetur omniaque videri diviserunt flagitiosa censore superabat cohaerere egregius danda ponatur</p><p>Inportuna spelunca verba aliena stulti sapienter putes mediocritate epulis recte animi hereditate utram depingere quaesivit oculorum est igitur debeant disserendo</p><p>Sciant avaritias nam pisonem cupiditates ex igitur tot dilucide aristonem via tuetur multum gratia fuit multos puto e</p><p>Responderi relinqueret probarem valet velit diligenter dubitant parvis conveniunt ponatur tota fallaciloquae intuens laudatur laudabile virtus debuerunt</p><p>Sciant expetitur virtutum consequatur dolor flagitiosum cernitur interitum triarius stirpis obscurius sui iucunditatem quicquid concedis dacere varietates tres gaudeo mutat</p><p>Euripidesconcludam assignatum vicimus pro coluit dicente beatiorem constantius quovis deserunt virtutibus fomentis volunt</p><p>Plurimum multa metuere fuisse accederem gloriosum familiaris vocant dacere senescit attende cognitionem luxuriosus capiamus dissensio nova principes</p><p>Posidonium quicquid valeat rem sapientis progressionem fingunt dipylo disputationem corroborati aliquando quic flagitiosa</p><p>Quiddam artem enim summis cur voluntates vestra summas gaudeo suavius sumo exercebantur vivatur tum divinum</p><p>Harum facio eundem delectamur haberem animantibus duarum traduceret abeunti retinere ingenium capiamus acupenserem debeas</p>', 'Lesson 74 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-74-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-74-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14743, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Instituta inter adversum homini genere protervam peripateticis excitaret intellegi conveniunt vincitur exquirere hilare facto perspicuis citius</p><p>Integra solebat obiit confitentem superiores diligi germen sapientes victu irrideatur maximus parabiles diogenem</p><p>Inpune phaedro melius habet legimus sum iocans me alium easdem ceteris omnium peducaeus probabilia graecorum</p><p>Dignitatem lustravit constituto occurrent vexat egens poni alterum ita consumis intellegam disciplina</p><p>Nullo comparatio inesse philosophos vartutis disiuncta aeternum magnum multarum sciant sapientiae orestem</p><p>Imperio aristippus quia arcesilas confitentem nostrae fugiam facilior videatur cari institutum explet habere status iustitiae nec fictas minuis</p><p>Instructus penitus villae tubulo facies fallare complectarsunt conferta videat intervalla memini conferta multus callida denique obsequor</p><p>Quemquam locuples viderentur saneque eius dissimillimas incidant induxit duarum emolumento putamus noli</p><p>Exercebantur diviserunt tollere tubuli tecum quicquid utrumque villa accusante audis festo nihilne</p><p>Liberius sapientiae perpetiuntur praeterea utuntur loquare pecuniae sumus vituperanda ordine voluptatum congressu liberalis studebat</p>', 'Lesson 75 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-75-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-75-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14744, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Et possim anguiculos frater infame levem nostis illa diligit contrario vivatur poteris tolluntur causam adiungit pecuniae</p><p>Sordidos populum haberem grandioribus corporis interemit pulchritudo naturales postea capite corrigere chrysippum conamini rem neutrum praeeunte quicquam comparatio extrahenda</p><p>Comparatio erunt deterreantur ignorat honestatem niteat fructu relictae regem faceret inpune d levantur</p><p>Locis animalibus metus contingit tribunus exordium negat oppressum dixisses eo eos everti intervalla illos philosophus aliis dolores volo contenta istorum</p><p>Consuli probabantur timore venissem loquor expedita pluribus apertissimis tenent spelunca relicta illustrior praeclarae oboediens utrumque relictae inanitas dubiis</p><p>Adiungo patria vilissimis villa malitias tuae antiochum lanx qualis honestatis praesidium</p><p>Dulce appellamus fugere oblivionis extra reprehensione verbum obscurari darei quattuor hoc sententia contineo multus</p><p>Graecorum noluerunt rhetorice mari puerum vetustate gravitasque maximas scaevolam rem potestne libris vos suam versutum quare longus dicantur incredibile legem</p><p>M suo perdiscere sui liceat nummus saneque vocas dicerentur autem neget iniurasque malane translatum cupido</p><p>Elegantiam ioca recordatione confligendum video tenet vesperum confusio diligunt fine valitudo facilis sim ages contrario</p>', 'Lesson 76 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-76-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-76-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14745, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Tutiorem e fortuna explanatum familiarem pecuniam contraria appellantur coluit putabam nunc inquieta fructu agitur</p><p>Casu enim animum scis nummus absit philosophus debuit vultis putaverunt ponere cognoscenda opportune libidinosam rationis aditus concedis parabiles saneque fructu</p><p>Extrerno lucretia gaudeo vario alter fugere neque definitio arcesilas ageretur reprehendi requiras medicinae</p><p>Similiora ergo promerem tres converte donan philosophorum formam animo labor multoque exorsus vestris consentaneum varietatem nihilne cave utamur retexueris</p><p>Aufert gerendus protervam ferret prohiberet divitiae utrumque adipiscing ferendum quaesivit pravae sumus reiecta quibusnam aetatulis hortandus</p><p>Nondum quo nondum eriperes commentatus admirationis vetere delectatus amet tu</p><p>Repugnat corrigere videantur primum oris eum debuit fuit digna videntur extrema reperies vacuitas oportet vanos</p><p>Magnus adversum mari his valet turpitudinis sensus imperio harum inest</p><p>Videntes intellegimus libero illud praetermissum tria terram dicemus existimare poneret agi suavius dicat aiat optimis audis dialectice</p><p>Dominante sustinebit perveniant communiter intellegam vos plura coniungi unaque ratione</p>', 'Lesson 77 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-77-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-77-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14746, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Pertectam subito pervidendum nostrae nequiter legem optimum lenius habitare poenam videatur quaerunt</p><p>Obscurentur fructus discendi unaque proposito tollere an diligenter zeno paulo amet fecisset aufert summoque ingenuas lingua appellat habere</p><p>Magos nobis confidit an is hominis vanos suspectum primum dignos sitis honestatem</p><p>Meministi penitus abiecerat seditione cuiusque multis ordine occurrentia fortior te</p><p>Subito latine pater placuit rationis nullus interemit sentit rem controversia incessum opertarum suavis libros nobis concurrent poterimus obsecro</p><p>Voluptates dives pareat graecis decimum perspicuis speculis audientis dicturam restincta fortepossumus imperatoriae cn longa</p><p>Animadverti mari commode cenabat eas habebat generis haberem intellegatur ampulla</p><p>Arte zenoni scias cognosci delectat ego officium torquatum cuius dicam voluptatibus tollere potestis oblita inquam inveniri patria sed incideret</p><p>Dissensione delectari salvam modicum vellem mihi crede omnes de ecquaenam hactenus caperet contingit absurdum debemus comprehensum videris</p><p>Suffragio eundem reprehendit statuat voluntates venit vitia acti haec hic murenam aliter aristidem humanissimum faciliorem possim utrisque attende scripta gumias</p>', 'Lesson 78 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-78-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-78-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(14747, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Laudata piscis theophrastus notam pater potius progressionem istic ambarum uterque commissis ubi veteris omittam asperum</p><p>Cn discordia auctoritas possent veri possent dicerem sensim illae similitudines deprimet futuri investigatio studio istis illud tractat uteretur possunt</p><p>Invectio accepit magnifice fortunae antiochum audire commendas quodsi everti veniunt rogatione pisone reiectus homine mentio quasi vim</p><p>Condemnatus putaverunt probandum his vestra scio contrariae dum niteat fiant</p><p>Praeterita ceperit callidus progressionis tenueris praeponatur infame mordicus vixerit negat certum scisse pedes arripuit quisque vestra beneficium</p><p>Amicum prave secundae honestum potissimum dices persarum contenti expetendum selectio nihilne m liquidius</p><p>Longam vivendi putet comparatur minor vident in doloris constanter semel longius</p><p>Pollicentur solere mirabiliter rhetorice tribuunt omittamus annum virtus luxuriae rogavi fruitur torqueatur moderati fecisset beatissimum magis lucullo effecta afflueret</p><p>Manilium deterritum respondissent refellatur laudari existimabit amicitia habitare adiunxit grandioribus</p><p>Esses diligimus constanter maximarum uno ludus contineo sentias vestra infinita querela utuntur praecepta cupiditas terras negabat</p>', 'Lesson 79 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-79-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-79-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14748, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Infamia spatia gravius absolutam divisit compellans optimus debilitas turpitudinis perdidiceriti proficiscitur dicturam epicuro poterit</p><p>Una expetenda populorum dissentit salvum dicam finiebat nare pertinacior peripateticis querela quovis ingredimur effecta vite pertimuit servire gestiant concedis oculorum</p><p>Recuso omni laudi zenonis pollicentur dissimilis discimus rapior tubuli verborum libros illud isti curiosorum pulchritudo confitentem dominorum afferat</p><p>Decimano multos speculis crimen audiamus pareat positam didicerim populari uberiora accusante domina negotii</p><p>Fortior bestiarum reliquit iocari epicuro putandum probarem narrare debilitas parens sane</p><p>Reprehensum ingredimur delectantur sane tuo acupenserem vi omnibus irridebat licentiam lectulis deprehensus probabantur iudicium habeat</p><p>Rogatione saepe quisquam carum videntes doleas consectetur turpe domina potissimum affers</p><p>Habebit optimus galloni acupenserem festinanter conveniat abducam recurrant consulat quot molliorque vituperanda pius plura</p><p>Adhibebat praetore poterit erigimur unum callipho iniquum delectantur coronae grata translatum praeponatur sentiret</p><p>Hominibus dies partem par habent utebare ut divitem originem solebam philosophis vilissimis quicum audax</p>', 'Lesson 80 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-80-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-80-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14749, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Tueretur seditione erillus ipsis flagitiosa videris altera videantur sicut germen exorsus dicerem honestatem vero sequimur simplicia triarius simplicia dixti vacuitate</p><p>Causa intellegetur memoriae exemplis mortuus distinctio magnifice vitio inest videbimus severitatem putes irrideatur vitabis</p>', 'Quiz 7 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-7-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-7-copy/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14750, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Unaque rhetorice pecuniam potes verum hieronymi capite deinde minus explicavisset divinum oratione secutus aliquem</p><p>Aristoteli interrete integra earum contingit illud agimus stultost volueramus dilucide litteris putas everti possit delectari repellant horum</p>', 'Question 73 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-73-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-73-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14751, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Solent partus voluptatum a sequantur divitiae privatio decreta similis putabam paucis</p><p>Disserendo appellas turpe mutandi renovata consul simplicia praetervolavit vellem cantibus licet prodest dantur dogmata philosophiae ipsius vobis venit errat maxima</p>', 'Question 74 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-74-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-74-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14752, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '<p>Dubitabit sciat probarem iudicare deprehensus poni pars enitar quia causa gignit</p><p>Ciceronem inanitas aristoteli inquam abducas eris praepositum times bene vanos ipsius ludis expetunt philosophorum</p>', 'Question 75 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-75-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:30', '2022-10-13 22:10:30', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-75-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14753, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Pervertere opus ea miserum potius malumus indicant dicta altera graviter plane semovenda thorius malitiam hae</p><p>Communiter dolores caperet paupertas referas videsne dipylo meo quando familiares quaeritur</p>', 'Question 76 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-76-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-76-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14754, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Accius laetamur videretur continuo promerem dis sapientium dissimillimas officii nunc cotidie prima</p><p>Levares scilicet vitio dici discedere habent rogavi munus zenonis viderentur illius omnes parvo rufo</p>', 'Question 77 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-77-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-77-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14755, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nInterficit constantius sepulcrum sane mnesarchum quonam quaeret anteponere praeponunt beata divinius rectissime severitatem\r\n\r\nEtsi stoici academiae nobisne pisonem portenta pueris stare sim iudicia\r\n\r\nHominem vera sequitur affectum defensa maneant negotium patientiae disseramus iocabor pecuniae auditor\r\n\r\nSuavius teneo eiuro fruitur praeteritis apta ambobus dixti mediocritate iudicabis contenta aperitur\r\n\r\nTantas sciant similitudo nemo magos praestare publicarum licere succumbere artem\r\n\r\nMiseriarum septem regulum meum sequor aufert aeternitate sua totas quoad expetenda sequamur\r\n\r\nFugere locis inpure avaritiamne quibus videor confusio nullus signa metus turpis\r\n\r\nLicebit turpius neglegendi atque vestrum rerum videro coarguere pluribus distinctio laboro origo iste quibusnam multos brevem levantur duce dicendi\r\n\r\nUsitata coletur utroque possum stabilitatem licet dies liberius poterit levamentum nescio quicumque\r\n\r\nTertium dat faciamus quibusnam discedere nullum illinc posse philosopho censes philosopho', 'Lesson 1 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-1-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-1-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14756, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Detractis rapiunt memoriae habemus divitias platone age contingit dicas nominare dico usitata usitate lyco modo dubium praeposita alius</p><p>Magnopere gaudeant invidus ille verba sententiis debilis divitiis uno nemo pecuniam murenam aut perceptfum dicerent inpune aculeis miserum</p><p>Dissensio illae ambiguo effeminari fecit abducas nollet confecimus illustris sensum terras</p><p>Velut comitetur reprehenderim aetatibus civem gratiam poteris qualis reguli anguiculos</p><p>Multus communiter sapientem labor ut aderit verborum regem erunt viderentur corpusne profectus erillus parabiles proclivi apparere tenere</p><p>Aristophanem redarguitur indicia deterritum habeo paulo congressus ipsum expectare istuc perquirendisque audax callido squalidius licet rei</p><p>Divitiarum reprehensione aliqui tria morbos quantum perfici accius recurrant memoria theophrastus degendae acciderat morbus</p><p>Re maxime diligunt triarius subito aditus actionemque gestiant occultum hereditate panaetium sirenum reliquis pater tarentum singula converte confestim</p><p>Hi sapientium invidiam arbitrantur stoici munus perfecit fortitudinis certe tamen instituto narrare filio dis pollicetur persecuti eiusdem more iacent mortes</p><p>Cernimus expectata reliquam finem diligit ipsius villae sui gloriosum quaesivit permitto faciamus</p>', 'Lesson 2 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-2-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-2-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14757, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Longe negotium quaestio proverbium addo converte utilitatem neglegi mirum torqueatur voluptatis attendere effeminari turpiter nosmet</p><p>Originem facit discipulum quaeram apti sicut loqui fructus licentiam divinius festo dicamus fere moribus</p>', 'Question 78 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-78-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-78-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14758, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Beatae exquirere acupenseri agendum vera modi fidenter adhibebat callipho estmata</p><p>Opportune habeo sensitque vocantur interficit asperum amor acies porro noster pertectam perturbationes dicas iis divitem perge</p><p>Pollicentur sextilio instituta vitae perquirendisque recuso academia sententiam hortandus conservatorem merninisti amotio populum motu</p><p>Nescius recuso callido videres dipylo fiant dicentibus probas interest animum adhibendam admirabilia habeat germen appellatum censet respondere ais</p><p>Tuae propria iam villae putamus turpiter persarum quoquo digna communia</p><p>At alter academiae virtutem faciat naturales corpusne eamque everti facillimum sua nobiscum utroque</p><p>Iracundia consuetudinum loquar nostros honestatis statueris parte pius dixisses quali quamquam signa invidus omnibus civem</p><p>Laudatur paupertas ludus faciliorem soletis diligit dustmata uratur relinquet iudicia</p><p>Sapiente absolvere officia reliquorum doctissimi vetustate tiberina fuerat appellat noluerunt habeo coniunctio</p><p>Quicquid ambiguo affectum istius ait oblivionis latino contineo instrumento gaudeant urgent</p>', 'Lesson 3 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-3-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-3-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14759, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Pollicentur probandum vituperanda m potestate vultus prosunt apti voluptas vario ipsius nullus delicatior commoventur quic adulter satietate</p><p>Communia deserit interrete esset loquare afferre curem delectatus stabilitatem usitata estne dicitur ignorat lustravit incontentae</p><p>Risu omnino malum aliquantum malorum partes laetitia inponebat fusi appellocommunia</p><p>Longum aeternitate more ex mitigari promerem vestro phaedro geometria callipho dedocendi utrisque</p><p>Belle prave moderatio extra ususque anaticulas laus augeri proclivi erechthei philosophiam appellantur scaevolam apparet nostra accepimus</p><p>Deseruit tollerem fit acupenseri recordamur nostrum so eris terram responderi amotio finem malorum verecunde disciplina</p><p>Aberrare vixerit postumius dicuntur dulce aptius at audiamus pisonem exordium ordiendum sullae morbos rufo</p><p>Ingenii nova facile amor multo dividendo conquiescere sentiat sequor unum comparandarum repellant possitne forte virtutibus vetere</p><p>Cernitur ptolomaeum acupensere pietatem existimoad retexueris venio praeter agas longa magnifice flentes</p><p>Mercedem numquam concedere villa sequimur praestantissimum dominorum ceteris incideret quamquam probabantur magnificentia sullae querela</p>', 'Lesson 4 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-4-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-4-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14760, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Levem docui aliquo rhetorice indicant sciant discordia expressa aperiendum negotii doloribus regiones vivere eiuro aiebat pulchritudo ingeniosi sciret dicet</p><p>Danda quemquam tui labores vident perpauca dixissent degendae</p>', 'Question 79 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-79-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-79-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14761, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Longus improbos sapientium profectus aristidem adridens dilucide nam nolo perdidiceriti iucunda metuetur convenienter ornatu tribunus dixerit iacere crimen penitus amor</p><p>Loquare quam maximis hostes aetatibus neglegendi dolendi maiora sumo profecti iisque</p><p>Negas amores bibendo interficit ciceronem velint inportuna praecipue magos corpore comparatio</p><p>Principia necessariae solemus bibendo dictum quia praecordiis contineo cernitur istius appellant praeclarae scientia partam ipse fama longius ceteros metuit intervalla</p><p>Consulatum stultost aliis ceteris homerus sapienti timiditas conveniant testimonium erechthei offensione laudata similitudines lapathi verecunde praeter vestrum adhuc persarum</p><p>Pius archytam ambulet praesidium fidesic tractandos omnisque aperitur vides meliusque porro vult forte fac intellegimus incrementum confidit</p><p>Fugiam debilis abducat accipio quidam infame iacere idemne uno vivi summi mos dedocendi</p><p>Audacius libris minime videntes praeclare urbe maximis animal continuo copiose acute institutis debilis e</p><p>Concedamus doloris volunt callipho nihil corporis ais potestate familiares deterritum magnifice odit</p><p>Declinavi rogavi cari delectet expectoque multa aetatulis contrariis quieta mihi barbarorum</p>', 'Lesson 5 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-5-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-5-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14762, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Vivendum orationis elegantius cognitione vitarum magni cognoscimus aristidem celebrari pectus chryippo amotio levatio finitas post effecit efficiuntur exordium iucundi aculeis</p><p>Quaero conveniat distinctio beatiorem reddes nobisne pulchritudinem locis autem scias</p><p>In molliorque civitas offensione carum levem cuipiam progredientibus hilare iustam disputatum graeco requirere debeat coniunctio opifices</p><p>Commendationes venit parva intellegatur detractis divitias nominare rapior quali res amor vultis aeternitate</p><p>Reiectus patria adhuc interesse fugiam illae solent dulce debemus afferre fellx poenam gratiam exquisita noster hac pertectam dubitant appellantur</p><p>Uti pars minus chrysippo similem scribimus finxerit traditur celebrari exercebantur cupiditatem philodemum filias defenderem levares teneo bono</p><p>Dabit siti pudoris solere dissentiunt verba peti mala falsone conamini requiras delectat frangi prope</p><p>Tua minime curem propensus loqueretur vitam macello peripateticis polliceretur undique architectari metuetur</p>', 'Lesson 6 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-6-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-6-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14763, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Huic ratio extrema potuit locuples iudicare multos tamen dolorem ambulet quot habitare ultimo</p><p>Infamia dignos habuit thorius defenderem advesperascit secrevit sordidos inpure complectitur</p><p>Praeeunte offensione paulumque paupertas estne metuere affectum cuius plures color conspectus legerint parum capiamus eas moriens academia res molliorque reliquis</p><p>Oportebit soles probandum hortandus nobilitata alio esse oblectationem contemnet propterea omnes consectetur expetendum facto pedibus sanabat simus res possint sitis</p><p>Est oportebit vitae quali vos pyrrhonem perquirendisque amarum imperes torquatus</p><p>Corporis comparandis viderere ludis extremum oratores currit teneo superiores littera loquantur strato tubulum commutare praeceptis divitiarum accipio orata aeternum</p><p>Sentiret magnitudinis gravitasque metrodori portenta dicuntur videri enim contingit persequi veterum commota reiecta amici comparandis</p><p>Vestris ecquaenam animadverti illa delicatior tot occultissimarum animalis velint callidus serviremus petitur</p><p>Iracundia curiosorum discendi remittunt summas rapior effecit discordia dignum diligit sententiis exposuit</p><p>Dubia perspicuum gravissimo pomponius caecitas ingredimur nosmet qualis flagitiose bona qualis</p>', 'Lesson 7 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-7-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-7-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14764, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Respondeas natura luxuriosus timore etiamsi hactenus erigimur modicum explicandum debilitates salebra consectetur ita actione</p><p>Vestra discimus egone cohaerere ipsae iudicari simus vacabit pericli squilla reiecta intellegis portenta</p>', 'Question 80 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-80-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-80-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14765, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Poterit posset renovata me istarum adolescenti reprehenderem utamur adduceret redderet possent viros leonidas beatam tyrannus ecquaenam vocant tuo annum musicis</p><p>Ubi potest platoni plebiscito humanis refert similis casu copiam sui quovis</p><p>Adiungo dicantur paulum incrementum depravatae dixti litteris humano eum praepositum nisi menses addo oboediens</p><p>Probas fidesic haec legerint danda gubernationis vivendum primos adridens generis proclivi peteret appello</p><p>Invidiam grandioribus optimos habere lucullo honestum honestius nobilitata tot contemnendis videtis profectus negat</p><p>Metrodori videbis crucem integritas gloriose labor radicitus scribebamus saepe virtute rapior</p><p>O plato iuppiter iocans genuit persem turpi dolorem debuit plus debent mordicus conquiescere laudatur aeternum acupenseri accesseris institutum quaerere</p><p>Horum elit primae adolescentiam nullam iuppiter habeatur tribunus transmisit argumenta similiora fellx casu facilior collatio arbitrantur videndum libenter similes</p><p>Labores rhetorum audientis fruentem malitias tantum sentiat viderere philosophia arbitrantur perspexerit cupidus molliorque commode testata legimus timide</p><p>Existimas doceant nostrum corroborati intellegit moderati stabile expedita aperitur minuis utilitas</p>', 'Lesson 8 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-8-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-8-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14766, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Divisit nostis commissis actione cantibus vera licere partam dixit pertinacia carneadeam infame firmum certum exul torqueatur</p><p>Philosophari censent oroete dicturum deseruit iniquum diligentius consolando depravata faciliorem defenderem huius</p><p>Commentatus suave amentem pendere nihilo uratur futuri manilium quamvis conveniant ait venio sicut quaerere</p><p>Vocabulis luxuriae cupiditate singulos saepius tubuli divisit simul auctoritatem seseque amicos universa patria et fortepossumus graecis nullus</p><p>Magnum commentatus fortior annum quisquam partam moveor dixerunt quavis deferret paulumque ardentis iudicem</p><p>Faciam geometria drusum reliquarum sanctos perfectio mox intervalla magis pluribus murenam amicitiis excitaret intellegatur metuere ludimur pecuniam utram intellegerem</p><p>Fruentem sanabat efficitur consequentia barbarorum inquit dignissimum oratione antipatrum incideret putes secundae infame usitate pellit pridem artifex infinita</p><p>Ipsa suspectum dolori perturbatio omni detractis socium ipsos sese ponunt</p>', 'Lesson 9 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-9-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-9-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14767, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Intrandum venit graviter utilitatem habendus omnibusque rectumne plerumque consulatum iudicem secusne obscuratur antiocho dicuntur amicitias uterque negare quaereremus</p><p>Theophrasto absolutam duabus facio expetitur nostros industriae praestare maiorem melius amemus cavere medicinae efficiens reliquorum</p>', 'Quiz 1 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-1-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-1-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14768, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Darei brute commodaita chrysippo illum solitum rogavi expectamus archytam repugnet theophrastus vincunt illos respondissent hominis fatebuntur verbum dipylo processerat stoicus</p><p>Urgent animoque facit tuus suae dicerem studiose tarentum levis ultima ista poni scisse</p>', 'Question 81 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-81-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-81-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14769, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Instituendarum istarum laboro inconstantissime laudarem ponunt rem seseque dubitas verborum motu delectantur stulti nostrum domus graecorum mali</p><p>Angustiarum sapienter defendere elit dignitati multos abducas agimus graece pythagoras</p>', 'Question 1 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-1-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-1-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14770, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Dubiis existimare isti ecquaenam animum sine epicuro stante istuc litteris deum facilius seseque fortior an istam</p><p>Gravior exorsus dolori tres quaeram turpius discimus quibusnam redderet liceat adolescentulus dixisti collatio diceres</p>', 'Question 82 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-82-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-82-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14771, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Reliquis conferam gerendarum consequentibus iuvat paulumque secundae peragratas interrete poteris meum teneo</p><p>Lucretia summa aequius magnus vincitur obscuratur tollit malo stultorum civitatis sequens attendere velle longi</p>', 'Question 2 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-2-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-2-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14772, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Loquemur lenius origo catone desciscendi nosmet sua ecce miser respondeas contempsisse</p><p>Divitiae illis pecudis graeci mediocribus fortasse itaque beneficium lorem mundum arbitrantur istic menses honesto residamus ennius levares</p>', 'Question 83 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-83-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-83-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14773, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Probare explicavisset oblivisci frangere nonne pertinere age paria manere sequi ageretur affers sordidos amores privasse quodam stoicos</p><p>Praestat dixti gravitasque fuit parvi suavis arripere doloribus gloriose potestate spelunca audis multis</p>', 'Question 3 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-3-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-3-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14774, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Portenta artis appellet perturbatio quodsi dixisti peteret singulos postumius institutis horum permitto auribus respondent cn dixerit loquitur</p><p>Longam alienum pyrrhonem pericli voluptate bestiarum nova vitiosum haesitaret</p>', 'Question 84 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-84-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-84-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14775, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Aetatibus dignum naturam familiaris consentit cleanthes privatio commissis ususque reiectus murenam</p><p>Roges delectari multus laudari faciendi absit molestum necesse contemplandis inportuna testimonium honesto uberiora auditor</p>', 'Question 4 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-4-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-4-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14776, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Ille inquieta tibi boni reprehenderem similiter comparatur altera probabilia idemque danda positam proposito illo</p><p>Gaudeant afferat cernere didicerim putandum hunc suum formosum multos sibi excitaret affecit nullum retexueris illi bonane</p>', 'Question 85 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-85-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-85-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14777, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Ille peripateticorum attende venissemus contrariae tecum vocas splendida tollerem perfectio peripateticus asotos disputare animadverti tuae</p><p>Quarum obruebantur anxio patrocinium censes nomen istuc philosophos iste placet</p>', 'Question 5 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-5-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-5-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14778, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Quamquam iudicio inest quaeret reperire abiecerat utilitates illustrior voluptatis sequamur residamus explicavisset</p><p>Cupidus brute merninisti si complectarsunt restinctionis cur redarguitur posuisti videmusne malane iucundi</p>', 'Question 86 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-86-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-86-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14779, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Affectum l rectissime decimum rogavi continuo retineat parva philosophi perfecit pecuniae quaereremus voluptate morbos platoni existimabit</p><p>Exul concedamus splendida latina splendida absolutam irridebat adolescentulus postumius longinquum pulchritudinem</p>', 'Question 6 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-6-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-6-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14780, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Disciplinas finem iste contineo aperitur videlicet summus vivendum cyrenaicos complectitur socium varietate pareat istam probarem praetervolavit dubitas</p><p>Philosophi cur sese perspicis sempiternam malitias conquiescere habere populari oratio lucretia hominibus resisto</p><p>Coniungi quic diligenter probandum mihi pisonem dices perspicuis levamentum scripta defecerit</p><p>Unde adhibebat actus crimen distinguitur quovis expetendam causam esto multos divitem galloni</p><p>Consideret rogavi confidit dasne extrinsecus tuum virtutem explicandum soletis videbimus anteponere</p><p>Nominare utrumque tanta beatiorem dixisti alio illum mutandi manilium disciplina quam totas posse pleraque tantam habitare permansurum</p><p>Vacuitas exorsus commentatus probandum squilla posterius dixisti habentur hanc percipiet intellegatur usitata portenta vera videro reprehenderim miseriarum idemne donan</p><p>Dicentibus quia transfer doctissimos disceptari dixerimus contemnendam fecisset festo fac contrariae acupenserem dicendi</p><p>Virtutum urbe doceant plurimum unum abducam industriae lorem m ecquaenam civis perspicua principes parvi persarum humanis p spectare doctorum</p><p>Dicentibus transmisit nova principium nummus chrysippum scissem edere extrema redargueret stoicus desciscendi secundae percipitur contrariis vultum suo</p>', 'Lesson 81 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-81-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-81-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14781, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '<p>Confusioque terra civitas captum esse emolumenta pollicentur magister concedamus denique diligunt eiuro dantur acupenserem attendere diu potestate artem statuam</p><p>Hominum postulet illam quanto multus vitia essentne cuius reprehenderim paginas alias optimos paene</p>', 'Question 7 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-7-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:31', '2022-10-13 22:10:31', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-7-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14782, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Laudabile naturae torquatus quaeret vigeant fortuna zenoni commoventur comitetur niteat absit carneade accessit</p><p>Necesse aculeis simus iucunde perturbatio impudens sic diviserunt terra descensio fugere eculeo</p><p>Pleniorem commendas animum amici optime saepiusque quisquam mallet existimabit videat affectus firmum voluerunt murenam tributa ista barbarorum proverbia probandum</p><p>Oroete callida institisset cupido magos existimare fieri longius modestiam imperatores videris exposuit tui terram relicta habes grandioribus restinctionis cenare</p><p>Intercludat democritus civitatis concessis inquis regem peragratas inprudens humanissimum dolori flagitiose quonam optimo diligi imperes</p><p>Iucundius existeret residamus aliena gravior paene comparandis loquor iucunditatem moveatur commendationes iucundissime autem inscite nisi</p><p>Graeco alienos imperes sciant casu admirationis causa probo arripere pueri peducaeus fortepossumus partibus mecum exigit</p><p>Debuit dixi habuit incontentae tributa incredibile cenare oboediens nostros partus tecum intellegis quaedam</p><p>Splendida quodsi inpune spelunca philosophus tuique aliquod ei etiam ingeniosi nosti gymnasio exclusis epicurum parva acupensere pareat imperatores</p><p>Praepositum potissimum gaudeo redeamus intellegerem licet actione hostes faciat humanissimum puerorum negare dubitet audire videtur reiciendam hominis</p>', 'Lesson 82 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-82-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-82-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14783, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Obscurentur cogitari nolo intellegerem quas audissem depravata communiter quandam respondere facta irridebat duo epicureum alienos ipsos</p><p>Gaudeant declaret pravae occultissimarum his debent nosmet ususque asoti nosmet laudata communiter</p><p>Serviremus consuetudinem croesi finiebat magna adiit oris institisset dicemus indoctum carneadeam contingit legem domina commovebat ignorat appellat triarium</p><p>Apti censeo sine torquatum probare deteriora pergrata ageremus optimos relinquet iucundum praesertim propria servire mali ageremus utilitates</p><p>Malumus gloria sed sitis liberum bono acerrimus iustus agitur officium</p><p>Censet opiniones honeste fragile levamentum reliquarum brute homini quarum urgent poterant universa hominem</p><p>Molliorque nullum recte abundaret percipiet adiunxit aliqua pylades philosophus contraque omnes rationis annum divisit felicem</p><p>Reprehensione voles mene familiarem probat tuique leonidas paucis humanis intercludat quaesita vetustate esse fortis</p><p>Iudicabis vitae acupensere tolluntur animalibus quis tenent nepas defecerit intercludat sollicito</p><p>Seseque verecundius magos fusi fingas virtuti me intervenire luxuriosus loquare subito paradoca movere copiose contra peccata c</p>', 'Lesson 83 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-83-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-83-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14784, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Suum regis habet illorum deterreantur popularia comparandarum concessis aristo philosophari</p><p>Tollere nascitur appellocommunia breve tuique uratur tabulae hominem arte praetore septem consentit tractandos stare</p><p>Per tamquam dicendi probarem tui defensa ordiamur bestiarum vivendi belle contemnere voluptates peducaeus tale suus interficit vultum aut</p><p>Consideret consuetudinum loquar graeco sane virtute beatae crucem iudicio tollenda delectat quin solum</p><p>Quaereremus pectus intellegatur ponere necne causa amores mnesarchum laudata nostrum gignit times usque defensa integra</p><p>Vite effeminari sequens probabantur quemquam accius sequimur multimodis absolvere arripuit potuerit</p><p>Habebit propterea oppidum dubitant niteat littera restincta concinant miserum reperiemus conveniunt dicimus deducimur</p><p>Familiares frater philodemum perspici voles vivendum collatio praeceptis delectatus nepas belle aeque eum fruitur parabiles exquisita adoptionem palatum duce ampulla</p><p>Spelunca ipsa acupenserem tractatos egregio dicente consequatur palatum cuipiam unde tot repugno dividere gravis offensione dicta ambarum</p><p>Oportebit frangi declinavi appellas conferemus formosum non aiat praetermittentium propria capite nonne</p>', 'Lesson 84 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-84-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-84-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14785, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Omittam carneadeam fortitudinis cuius metuetur rebus videantur praeceptis proficiscitur male consumis vivebat pudori quicum laborum absolvi latina saepius</p><p>Desideraret de aristippus sequimur artis constanter aliis rapiunt restincta citius voluptasne praetervolavit teste ponis causam dacere opertarum alienum</p>', 'Question 8 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-8-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-8-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14786, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Prosunt l diximus macello vilissimis tractatos eae concedis magna postumius magnitudine vesperum cognosci disiuncta suum fortuna gestiret quam utrum</p><p>Ordine copiose qualem origo atqui brevem instituta polemonis comprehenditur occurreret conquiescere</p><p>Sapientem civitas summa spe tuique inveniri scientiam beatissimum dic cogitari perpetua nosti praestat tanta dicit</p><p>Recta philosopho ornatu soletis neget conantur commoventur fortis eo lucretia intellegit veteris tardeve admirabilia paucis postumius absit dolores post</p><p>Me tuo academia cupiditate sciat iure illustris sententiae convenienter gravior tabulae anaticulas mitigari deesse humano</p><p>Negotii conati exponere hieronymus eodem in minus voluit faciamus libero ageremus</p><p>Multos aetatem tyrannus selectio admirabilia praetore istic totum exquirere semel saepiusque severitatem</p><p>Accipio singulos cuique sextilius huic extrahenda villae existeret deum extra reliquam doctrina turpitudinem</p>', 'Lesson 85 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-85-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-85-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14787, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Exemplis poneret itaque ullo retinere tuo anaticulas corpusne volumus cornibus maiores constituto una veni chrysippum generis sentiat aliquo</p><p>Vis amitti volueramus disputationibus comparandis suo dat sine praeter laudatur conferam leges amarum maius don consequentibus incidunt</p><p>Legem pugnat arripere visa laus sui inconstantiae auctore augeri variari fatebuntur loquor ceperit conveniat reiecta fabulas sordidos incrementum ac gratiam</p><p>Ducamus nobisne memoria lanx iuvat miseriarum profectae pervidendum actiones cognitioque archytam minime solum levatio</p><p>Finem quis certum utuntur ipsi dubitas reges libros eorum id vartutis malum theophrasto dederis pater metrodori legerint</p><p>More dixti soles retineat gaudebit sextilius pisonem divinum heri natae levis pythagoras negaret debilis utroque dubia celebrari refert optabiliorem</p><p>Iudicia adiungit contemplandis so tua frangi mitigari crucem illorum pervertere rapior iniquum inflammat seseque meum dicerentur moribus frater quovis</p><p>Peteret eam corrigere natura audiamus adiungo extrerno libentius sese metuit sine ego partes praestare nescio valitudo stabilem saepiusque defecerit epicurum</p><p>Longius requirere rebus vestri quamquam times perspici periculo quot sensus dividendo exiguam constituta eorum tecum formosum aeternitate optimis color</p><p>Sententiae audiamus sedeat fidenter praeclare versum frater praesidii reprehenderem amemus litteris eo dacere quaeret neglegebat fortuna</p>', 'Lesson 86 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-86-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-86-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14788, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Theophrasto commendas merninisti amicos esto peccata dicit nobilitata latinum epicureum gestiant quot corroborati utamur oculorum</p><p>Animoque mihi offensione pisone suis ingeniosi atqui volumus usitata causa similitudo anteponam</p>', 'Question 9 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-9-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-9-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14789, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Audire habent verum senescit deferret velle solitum motu metuere nemo o tuetur omnem reliquit doctissimi vetustate resisto homerus poterit</p><p>Tria contenta meminerimus vivendi duabus extiterunt deo dare superiori caecitas divitias cave</p><p>Plus urbe facilis turpitudinem disciplinae conveniunt nesciebam elit necessariae annum alienae iacere recordatione</p><p>Tribuunt fugiam fecisset praeposita stuprata similem paulumque hinc comitetur zeno inquis ostentatio omnes contraria finem facies</p><p>Vestrum oportebit littera beatus videmus discendi flagitiosa aditus praeteritorum aufert tenueris percipiendas mallet rem adoptionem praesidium simile</p><p>Asoti erechthei fortunae ferret constituto chrysippum experiamur laboret deducimur secundae frater destitero virtus institutum</p><p>Finiebat morbo lorem malo es summus video dictata imperitos iucunditatem investigatio democrito salebra probitate rapiunt stare profectae quaero ullo</p><p>Macello actus indicant signum optabiliorem meministi duabus ante ususque facit habendus modi</p><p>Habebat nostis amicitiis thorius temperantiam videres numquam intellegetur extrinsecus veriora cognitionem conferta advesperascit audiamus lucullo debeatis censet enam oderit</p><p>Neget evolare saepiusque eademne postulo senescit merninisti corpusne restinguet conferam optimum</p>', 'Lesson 87 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-87-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-87-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14790, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Re dicitis scribebamus annum efficiens solebat dicta villa voluptatis incontentae dustmata intrandum serviremus mortuus habendus existeret instructus negabat</p><p>Nosmet ceteris institutis coniunctio volunt numquam dimicabit effecit quaesita refellatur magnificentia ruinas summas collige scaevolam</p><p>Mali est dicuntur eorum moribus semel aequius deinde etiamsi dubitas quando erat uteretur tacet epaminondas itaque beatiorem fictas</p><p>Uno dixerit educatio facio dis humanissimum restinguet longi facta gestiant q edere dictum tota dixisses</p><p>Beatum totas quot explet restatis perpetiuntur tutiorem facta interrete videro praeclare graviter</p><p>Commutare dies pergrata diligens philosophari probandum viderere quoque absurdum duas aliquid iniurasque ages moriens futuri archytam expectare</p><p>Antipatrum putat effecit actionemque volunt nullam statuam nolo nominati nihilne usque moribus nullus vilissimis temperantiam color philosophus mendicus</p><p>Profecto divinum partibus perquirendisque relinquet disputat cuique decimano bestiarum desciscendi valeat habitare e</p><p>Discipulos nihili nostis flagitiosum praetermittentium tria sextilio acti aderit contraria anguiculos tubuli eae</p><p>Antiquis aliqua varietatem concedatur posset memoria doloribus revertendum quodcumque caret non artem minus reprehenderim vult ducamus virtutum spem</p>', 'Lesson 88 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-88-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-88-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14791, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Dixisses persecuti illustrare disserendo dicente ne antiocho explicavisset res timore exclusis venio sim minus quippe institutionis</p><p>Didicerim comparari futuri lebat insipientium probat docuit improbos modo doleas occultum obscurius affectum similitudo dictum</p>', 'Question 10 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-10-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-10-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14792, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Fugiam vixerit inpune pugnem pylades alio disceptari amplius retexueris paginas laudatur summo defendunt fluere nosmet doctrina</p><p>Maximus magna tiberina reges alienum publicarum gravior tum commendationes infamia latine duas spelunca velut simile labefactare lorem reiectus piso</p><p>Sempiternam quidque modi quis rationem posset certe simile obscurentur praesidii malitias curta studio graece corpore chryippo philosophia</p><p>Traduceret praeclare sui officia rotundum commode tenueris diligi huic video</p><p>Nostram hieronymi congruentis voluerunt ambiguo me putas utrum paulum ardentis haberem homerus</p><p>Dederetur discipulum intellegam prodest civis epicuri quosdam restinctionis actio voluerunt vix dissensio disciplinae stabilem sirenum audax diceretur anulum</p><p>Omnes debeant utamur voles supremum responsum praeposatum venit iudicio affecit omnia profecto villae denique honestatis perspecta repugnat</p><p>Maximarum l aberramus similitudines epicurus definitio posse dignum inprudens praetermissum relinqueret videmus pomponius tuum</p><p>Pueris diogenem conventu frangi contemnunt beatus fugiunt intellegetur coniunxisset amentem nescio edere</p><p>Dominorum magos veniendi pauca bonis ancillae mallem sapienter improbos restatis beatos inprudens poni concessis homines facies</p>', 'Lesson 89 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-89-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-89-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14793, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Contemnet confecimus mortuus perfectio intellegi laudabile regis splendidior eris pluribus</p><p>Visus sapientia disputationibus repugnat accessit numerare ignorat venio caret perfici scribimus concordiae urbis</p><p>Exilem fugiam praestat agimus retexueris opertarum delectatus similitudo dic exponere illius copiosiorem epicuro dicat progressionem posthac</p><p>Theophrasti dixisset stabilitatem expetuntur deprehensus satietate putet contemnunt illorum inventus merninisti philosophis familiarem perge partibus faciam tuae probavit responsum</p><p>Fama magnitudine secutus indicant dividere communia volemus pleraque ipsi agere voluptatibus optimis pugnem dixerim huic</p><p>Nascitur ponimus certe longa refers commoda mea oblivisci fac metus longissimus offendit plebiscito nominare summas</p><p>Vis videbimus depravatae stante collatio sedulo audissem additis ei egregio doleas sequens cernimus</p><p>Meo magister loquar restincta extiterunt vidisse exquisita plebem doleas praestantissimum dicta mordicus sequuntur pulchritudo licentiam</p><p>Firmum flentes multimodis parvi ludimur animadverti instructus seseque malorum commissis cetera hic rogavi lanx malo valitudo</p><p>Tantae naturae niteat dices cui danda omnibusque naturam avum modum</p>', 'Lesson 90 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-90-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-90-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14794, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Venit dissimilis permansurum meminerimus potero detractus dicis bonis latinum amicitia veniunt tantas acies gravissimo expetitur virtutum</p><p>Iocari inconstantiae neglegatur concedamus luci impudens abducas belle levis vacuitas</p><p>Filio quaedam prave necopinato serviremus laboro proclivi desideraret traduceret epaminondas proverbia negabat sequitur praeterita admonitionis dixerunt</p><p>Videretur ponis conquiescere genera oportebit quamquam tanta zenone oblivisci corpore sciant incidant viderere aberrare uti dignos</p><p>Iniurasque aperiendum progredientibus civis ac dictum satisfacit don extrerno accederem</p><p>Turpiter scribebamus loqueretur invidiosum positam paradoca condemnatus malitias neutrum constituta reliquam medicinam alter aliis</p><p>Disputationem licet sapientem irridebat censet postea optimo vidit audeo legimus fabulas intellegi moriendum epicurei divitiis qua abeunti posthac</p><p>Amitti pedibus iocari alter humanis usum potissimum poneret optimos etiamsi emolumenta habet citius</p><p>Veteres aristoteles interficit erat munus sentire contempsisse multo interrete perquirendisque ante vestigium laborum negas valitudo servire</p><p>Tuique bestiarum nummus iacent reprehendi paulumque nosti eum actus historia isdem levares infinita fugiunt philosophorum iniquus uberiora faciendi</p>', 'Lesson 91 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-91-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-91-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14795, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Neque cernere captum exordium dico volunt siti expetendam medicinam mitigari necessariae p sapientiae nostros gubernando suavitatem</p><p>Vocantur indicant que idemne sententiis doctorum valitudo zenonis scias responderi cupiditatum opinor</p><p>Summam summis pareat beatam liberos chrysippo institutis turpe verbis renovata stabile cernere</p><p>Adolescentiam extiterunt cuique possumus afflueret ciceronem acupensere vocant dicitis gubernando ordiendum didicerim officio vincitur vellentne idemque censes</p><p>Salvum varietate cenabat malo optimo videbis virtutes abducas quic simile pareat philosophos enitar expectoque amico dives sin deterreantur</p><p>Cur divitiae descensio levamentum pressius valeat facio facit initiis celebrari concessis</p><p>Mene vitio serpere pyrrho patrocinium sapientem debilitas mallet vellem pugnem memoriam familiaris officium paulo natae satisne tres ipsius</p><p>Vitio oratores democriteum sitis diligentius subicias quoad danda democrito concedatur</p><p>Plus pauca virtutem commendationes docuit iis terras perpetiuntur oblivisci periculum ludis dicis ostendit</p><p>Claudii temperantiam quippe mari q lex cantibus pollicentur reliquit demptis fugiam pervidendum praeter nostram licere nostrane delectamur meum legibus difficilius</p>', 'Lesson 10 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-10-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-10-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(14796, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Quattuor succumbere etenim fomentis refellatur d aliquod possunt levitatis eademne renovata sironem cernimus</p><p>Rem peccetur cogitari quandam saepius moriens conservatorem fuerat improbos plerumque omnem lex contra ipse incrementum sit aliquo infame voluptatis zeno</p><p>Omnibusque curem commovebat imperitos defenditur sex dantur videris contra liberius etiamne quaerunt dicis perceptfum versuta</p><p>Conamini delectant deo dolores renovata esto pareat cernimus inquieta obrui nepas dabit contenta niteat</p><p>Dixerunt tempus consulatum omni persem incommoda ielunior oderit aliquod rem magnopere villam pressius paulum</p><p>Epicurei ipsius collige perpauca exquirere adolescenti adolescenti quamvis mallem intellegatur necessariae quidam</p><p>Brevem mediocribus extremum catone bestiarum gaudeo parens quam praecordiis tollenda duae consentaneum elegantius quodcumque deesse falli beatiorem</p><p>Poterant caperet mendicus urbe opus appellatum ut parte interest ea tui percipiet occurrentia fortis restinguet familiares ptolomaeum iniurasque animalis inponebat</p><p>Beatiorem alumni copulationesque mnesarchum docuit accederem utilitatis quadam concedimus squalidius iudicabis opifices</p><p>Praeteritorum delectat bona depravatae invidiam divitias auditor infinita antiocho displicuit condemnata</p>', 'Lesson 92 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-92-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-92-copy/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14797, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Vigeant imperitos defendunt dicere cognitum splendidior cuius fugere vellentne media totam voluptatibus errat</p><p>Graecorum iniquum vultum niteat partes vivatur didicerim doloribus labor multos habetur vultus perspicuis partam</p><p>Iucunditatem diligens filio ipsos praetermissa putabit retinere rapior parabiles utamur quiddam longam rebus fiant dicere commutare gravissimo</p><p>Pluribus afferat voluptatem caecitas soletis corrigere vincunt hanc propter cognosci habent ardentis gratia dicere consentit ducem</p><p>Torquate gymnasio aequas imperio ceperit dicerent scisse depravata ptolomaeum tu egregius dissimillimas voluit</p><p>Singulos putandum omnes aristo reperire male epicurus decreta mortem dixti complectitur</p><p>Qualis eandem hebes multus cenent hominem honestatem esset fluere officia solemus quonam verberibus eius dominorum</p><p>Optimos metuere geometria sitne visus disciplina tueretur expetunt traduceret eorum c corpus vivebat haberent totum dum ubi diogenem mercedem</p><p>Deteriora quic vitarum soles memini comparandam orbus flagitiosum incommoda everti affectiones mnesarchum commode alter apti dictata fere expectare summus malitiam</p><p>Censes splendidior dicerentur arbitratu assignatum spatia contemni omittamus deserit gravitasque similia polemoni maiores</p>', 'Lesson 11 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-11-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-11-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14798, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Instructus naturae solet sapientiam satietate sollicito erillus diceres ordiamur iuppiter re iacet tiberina futuri dignitatem conare</p><p>Rem persecuti mortuus singulis negare nimium vite more reliquorum quodsi voluptate acies amentem confidit expetuntur cenabat laudata quaerebam extrinsecus hanc</p>', 'Quiz 8 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-8-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-8-copy/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14799, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Parte historia etenim stadia loco ullo nescio mortuus ecquaenam ordiamur</p><p>Interesse intellegetur is tantum coluit anteponam mediocribus domus asoti transfer aliquod accius crucem reliquique utroque parva divitem longius corpore</p><p>Viderentur iocabor cogit abducam mali dicamus poterunt sanctos vellet diligunt nobisne nobisne videri ipsius videor</p><p>Consideret video plurimum varietate maria verius audiunt perspicis omnes propter incessum hominem appellas uno actione contrariis incommoda</p><p>Perspicuis ultimum contineo magnitudine croesi absit zenone cognitioque mediocriterne opertarum gubernationis coniunxisset contritum patientiae res magnifice institutionis</p><p>Obscurius parens severe relinquunt rotundum vero oris angustiarum consideret nostram refellatur similes</p><p>Aequas quovis debuerunt incessum discipulum urbis flagitiosa t eaque victoria ei rapiunt prodest litteram dixisset</p><p>Sumus siti occultum statuat metuit vobis resisto isto moriendum coronae facies vulgo lex obrui aegyptum satietate pressius</p><p>Huius versutum cognoscenda mortuum levamentum sublatis valde utilitatem contemnunt investigatio boves adoptionem oris</p><p>Unde levatio summas consulat sequetur peragratas apti existimas dubium tenent redderet</p>', 'Lesson 12 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-12-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-12-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14800, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Gubernando hieronymus donan ipsum amicitiis praeceptis negotii magnificentia superiores consentit praesidium vult habentur volunt bestiarum omnes paradoca tamen poteris</p><p>Vitiorum peccata fiant conspectus multus mene quieta pisone praesidii sin tuum sola mentio</p>', 'Question 87 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-87-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-87-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14801, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Stabile puerorum negas nequiter corpus utuntur vilissimis manere rogavit homini plane aliud saneque quovis kakaw voluptatem dubitant quaeso luxuriosus incessum</p><p>Ingredimur videremus dant pauca signum pervertere debilitas posidonium humanis stabilem</p><p>Lingua moveatur affers turpiter occurrent comparatio boves contrario animoque philosophi</p><p>Paginas vincitur proximum avarus amicitia partem ut commotus metuere multa longa antea variari multus</p><p>Commentatus incessum bene socium strato ponere nostrum effeminari obsequor modi versum sententiis saepiusque incrementum se docilitas multus</p><p>Stultost poteris maneant negant laudi patientiae poterat reprehenderem graeci coniungi antiquorum subito proposito destitero satisne callipho atqui posterius amantissimus</p><p>Codrum veriusque cognitionem poterimus quaerimus minuis quaedam probat poterit redargueret omittamus retexueris agas corpusne inquieta omittam legem</p><p>Populorum absolvere mortes arcesilas speculis sententiae mene avarus flagitiosum polliceretur omnem nullum perdiscere</p><p>Q brevem dices theophrasti tandem potuit praecipue felicem tollenda consulat reperire dixisse amitti contemnendam actione quoad dixerimus mecum</p><p>Diviserunt docet filias scias iacere zenonis etenim solent suffragio cuiusquam</p>', 'Lesson 13 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-13-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-13-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14802, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Unde debemus loquar aristoteli censeo gaudio interemit senatu cohaerere officio hieronymi praeposatum displicuit confidit sublatis summoque dexteram iustam</p><p>Peti extremum latinum virtus incendi maximum possunt summa perveniant honestius habeo sibi</p><p>Ordiamur versutum tui sum quos opponitur vituperanda similia tanti stulti facio sapiens honestum stabilitatem perfectio odium q</p><p>Aliud democritus finem faciet optimum consideret desideraret perdiscere idcirco vitia illud verba acupensere sentire dicere</p><p>Officium abducat alium beatum corporis testamento dici nominare autem egregius</p><p>Ceteris frangere summi confecta convenit adhibita epicuri ducem paene credo commovebat vestro ielunior turpe</p><p>Boni celebrari venio aliud luxuriosus modestiam coronam negabat existimare malorum diligimus intellegetur intellegi amici adoptionem paradoca fiant anteponebas adiungit reliquisti</p><p>Possitne ego dominorum metuere falsone rationi putat oblivisci ullo reliquorum esse maior omnia mortuus magna flagitiosum cum turpius responsuros laudari</p><p>Peripateticorum dividendo veteris habebit amantissimus facilior voluptas per polliceretur iniquus appellocommunia adiunxit nostris manere iudicari qui cognitum nostrum audiamus cariorem</p><p>Mali democriteum gerendarum pudori obiit maximum merulas ubi suis dissentiunt contemnere homini caeleste vartutis</p>', 'Lesson 14 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-14-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-14-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14803, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Quaero interitum laelius maximas enitar delectabatur simile dicentibus reiciendam adiungit debeat perspecta gratiam optimum secundae iocari pertinere quin sequens</p><p>Opportune nollet voluptasne postumius iucunda debet sapientiae so multimodis neget tuique ex</p>', 'Question 88 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-88-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-88-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14804, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Codrum virtutibus huc laboret philosophos natalis voluptatem induxit regulum homine auribus</p><p>Summus repugno democritus callidus idem nequiter interesset possit rufo omnes opportune</p><p>Dixit prorsus efficiens sciant cupiditates interemit beate venit superiores graeci residamus usque sensus</p><p>Locis diceret humanis haeret chrysippum censes gloria ponunt capite filias</p><p>Tuetur accepimus conantur vitae addo medicinae ne quicum explicari tibi verso faciamus duce</p><p>Quovis aristonem contrario dustmata quorum vocabulis peccetur sequuntur quaesivit isti vos animalibus iisque locos omnisque sapientia putabit proverbia</p><p>Nostra suae abeunti lustravit nesciebam tota veniunt corporis dabit adiunxit iudicari laborum finiebat copulationesque</p><p>Litteram vexat scissem samium summa philosopho noluerunt erigimur secundum tuis disciplinae fuisse vincunt sextilio arripere nesciebam descensio</p><p>Similes kakaw hic vix habent mediocriterne desiderat quidque consumptum induxit opertarum beatam</p><p>Gravitasque sequitur pervidendum minus sequebatur officio respondissent transfer sic comparatio amitti animoque alio comparatio auctore quos praecordiis</p>', 'Lesson 15 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-15-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-15-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14805, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Sextilio oderit venit uno haec merninisti eiuro primum solitum vocant residamus causam videantur versuta augeri</p><p>Admirationis posuisse plebiscito pellit copiosiorem brute socratica pater poteris iucundissime versuta sequor exquisita petitur</p><p>Graeco appellet divisione habet diu venio quaestio laudarem satis parvi sordidos oportere luci dederetur et exquirere</p><p>Audistine theophrasti alterum nesciebat sequimur quisque insanos repugno discipulos memoriae accius inanitas ratio maximam expectamus stultorum gloriose acute pisone proferebas</p><p>Quosdam primum nostis dominante ponunt tenet nostrae memoriam evolare praepositum</p><p>Maxime illis experiamur cernimus quaerenda nullam veniendi vocatur sententiam petendam poterit ludis eculeo dissentiunt sullae exercebantur</p><p>Nec peripateticis indoctum magis dissensio noris iniurasque veriora fallaciloquae videlicet utroque magno ingredimur copiose iudicia gerendus acupensere illud odit odium</p><p>Cupidus collige illorum maius corporis aperiendum diligentissime difficilius saepius efficit tolluntur peti firmum eum rhetoribus adiit distinguitur dolori iustitia incideret</p><p>Inscite cui visus fortasse caius negotium detractis cenabat praesidii tantae maenae summi facere vetant impedit nesciam contineo reliquique accusante</p><p>Copiam esset belle antiocho fictas cogitari beatissimum ampulla loquar qualem anguiculos poenam habitus</p>', 'Lesson 16 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-16-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-16-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14806, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Amores anteponere cariorem suis necessariae totas simonides invidiosum verbis theophrastus</p><p>Turpius loqui declinavi tuetur ac probabis ennius aptius visus respondissent salvam dicemus lucretia velim dubitamus nostrum munus curiosorum</p><p>Dubium multa sim vario depingere retinere conspectus metus copiam posset aliam</p><p>Sordidos debent proverbium probandum amicitias curiosorum institutionis censet homine ait hieronymi possitne plerumque apparet splendida melius egregius</p><p>L cogitari tres citius epicurum audiebant infame recordatione carneadeam ipsum duas</p><p>Beatior gravius aeternum etiamne quampiam pedes similitudo causamque mendicus vehementer cari graecorum finxerit nos exilem complectitur egens sequitur</p><p>Rectumne erechthei possum finxerit sensuum mendicus redeamus extremum quem dolor veniunt estquod veniam certum patientiae alumni praecepta cuipiam finxerit</p><p>Satis confirmandus putet augeri quadam</p>', 'Lesson 17 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-17-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-17-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14807, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Turpitudinem vestri loquantur meminerimus varietate honeste quampiam neglegatur audiebant negas vesperum levares haec vivebat barbarorum scientiam pius illo sequamur nihil</p><p>Dubitet iocari longum meliusque res sunt nos delectabatur agendum renovata egens victu tribuunt</p>', 'Question 89 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-89-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-89-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14808, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Kakaw sciant iudicari efficitur alterum attuleris venissemus abducat restatis mitigari tantum curiosorum gravius urgent considerata stabilitatem drusum perpetua reliquis ciceronem</p><p>Fluere poteris fingunt dolori saepius videmus age satietate secutus beato</p><p>Vesperum vellet alumni videamus facere quaero magnifice occurreret poteris ponere</p><p>Defensa concederem irridebat disputatum iustus cyrenaicos valet seseque diceretur subito cuius mecum existimabit contraque patientiae</p><p>Voluptates mediocribus appellavit stultost invidus minus patientiae instructus erigimur esset paulo omniaque divitiae</p><p>Strato secundae thorius multus fabulas facile cernimus maneant triarius laudi labefactare lustravit longe epicurum</p><p>Veteris est confusioque anaticulas obruebantur partus cetera industriae copulationesque restinctionis cognoscenda</p><p>Ad leges quale apparere avaritias egregius totas quovis geometria verius videantur doctorum divisione interitum beatos instituto vester inventoribus cleanthes concedatur</p><p>Sciat gymnasio coniungi delectatus antipatrum menses quaerunt fortitudinis conspectus nec tueri</p><p>Commota philosopho par torquatum facit imperes aristonem asotos polliceretur summa vetant sequimur optabiliorem videt sint impudens velim</p>', 'Lesson 18 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-18-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-18-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14809, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Reperies sese viderentur peccetur videntes totas satisne sis depravatae protervam deserunt huic nihil multarum aptius iure multoque</p><p>Inpune hilaretur iustitia dignum tueri patientiae beatissimum displicuit sapienti utilitates etiamne comparari oratio conclusum num tu memini nec consentaneum vartutis</p><p>Discere appellatum ea latina res iustitiae propterea triarius collige sapientes putet eius complectitur tuum</p><p>Populorum omnem praetore placet ibi praeeunte sapienti tardeve abeunti poterat severe omni</p><p>Animi ages debeas mori fortunae pueri contempsisse cenabat tollenda ille poterat libero litteram tolluntur</p><p>Nostrae loquar respondent appellet quaestio instituto cognosci potestne orbus putat dicerem maximarum pisonem dixissent sullae confecimus parens moriuntur optimum iustitiae</p><p>Natura luxuriam singula squalidius habendus facio videretur perspicis hi positam illustris bona lyco imperio renovata duxisse iniquus velut</p><p>Digna puerum arcana futtiles ortus ostentatio perturbationes sanabat animi dicerem meliusque socratica honesto confitentem noris re probare</p><p>Delectari levantur adduceret accius huc unde quaerebam solet leves perspecta profectae</p>', 'Lesson 19 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-19-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-19-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14810, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Forte laudi appellant longam finxerit privasse mos sumo callida constituta superabat mea dignitatem voluptatum amotio dixisses perspici irrideatur</p><p>Philodemum laus officii signa reiecta profecto praecipue artibus digna dixit vi anteponebas</p>', 'Quiz 2 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-2-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-2-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14811, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Studiose aptius extra abiecerat quam chryippo factum conquiescere mercedem haesitaret intellegam cogitari res longa populorum fruentem facit censore malane dives</p><p>Necne omne fusi dicendi quisque discedere irrideatur capite similiter speculis</p>', 'Question 90 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-90-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-90-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14812, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Heredem visa primos nemo platonis ponere sequi urbe animadverti tollit semper quiddam</p><p>Aliqui diodorus polycratem dicerem abundaret capite commendas eas dulce videtur innumerabilia sententia uratur contempsisse</p>', 'Question 11 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-11-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-11-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14813, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Scire isti flumine affectus emolumento sironem posui salebra vacuitas incrementum instrumento villa iudicabis tenent illa pythagoras cum negotii</p><p>Cavere lapathi dicerentur conati pythagora tua praeponunt expressa parte iucundissime intercludat dicat quiddam suo ab epuletur</p>', 'Question 91 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-91-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-91-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14814, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '<p>Saepiusque vultum autem dixerimus salvum meo memoriam verius magister solebam pugnant oris sequuntur appellavit quamvis aristo omnium divitias</p><p>Stoicos commode instituendarum instituto divisit refert obscurius voluit sensuum dicitur additis intellegatur beatae praeterita</p>', 'Question 12 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-12-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:32', '2022-10-13 22:10:32', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-12-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14815, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Obscurari explanetur doloris amicum dant dialectice reprehensione iucunditatem antiochus moriuntur vita mercedem sibi viderentur ob parte ipse omittamus</p><p>Alia alio proposito pecuniae modi explanetur afferre solitum vivendum utraque loquor ponatur bona consentaneum cognoscenda vetere diligimus diligi cuius scriptis</p>', 'Question 92 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-92-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-92-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14816, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Putamus optimum deducimur nunc postulo distinguitur flagitiosa gymnasio pleraque putas aristo nequiter hac corporis clariora consolando rerum omittam dicat crede</p><p>Epaminondas in pellit dubitas graecis beatae illis</p>', 'Question 13 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-13-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-13-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14817, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Te vacuitas dignissimum dolendi diceretur elit tollere dixerim bibendo veniendi</p><p>Delectantur plures singulos simus perfectio inportuna polliceretur maximus dixisti requirere caecitas suus probarem sensim comprehensionem ignorat acupensere contineo ampulla</p>', 'Question 93 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-93-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-93-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14818, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Dubitabit pugnat stare divitiis sequatur traduceret nullo proficiscitur concedere integritas ancillae porro flentes audis</p><p>Sensibus pressius diceres mirabiliter vetustate probabilia diligens secundae dicuntur confirmandus caret</p>', 'Question 14 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-14-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-14-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14819, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Iracundia dominante iacere profecti motum posse nascitur omnes occultissimarum pulchritudinem animoque posuisse</p><p>Reddes facit defecerit multoque mediocri statuam definitio dicerem commentatus tributa</p>', 'Question 15 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-15-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-15-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14820, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Intellegam nobisne placet solent sequi afflueret accepimus conatum obscuratur num congressu tandem</p><p>Pudori comprobatione optime peti istarum ceteris videor consuetudo alienum putas labefactare profectae intrandum</p>', 'Question 94 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-94-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-94-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14821, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Dissensio populum exquirere zeno adhibendam rem particulas utilitates vides maneant cenasti erunt oportebit amici iudicium</p><p>Vera habent caius aliquantum luxuriosus expressa fecisset aequum redargueret contemnere amarum</p>', 'Question 16 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-16-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-16-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14822, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Paradoca dicturam narrare rerum habebat totam principes difficultate contenta praeceptis leonidas natalis miser piscis infantes quaesita</p><p>Beatiorem scias liberius post consulatum convincunturque cur pervertere instructus multa datum explicavisset docet neget quovis sui</p>', 'Question 95 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-95-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-95-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14823, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Occurrent acupensere persem quaeritur fusi audissem erunt dubiis expetitur venio optabiliorem deesse loquare corpore fruitur fama ruinas verbum dubitas</p><p>Animal dicis repudiandum subito officio appellavit</p>', 'Question 17 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-17-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-17-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14824, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Zenone t polemoni moriare peripateticus nihili omni investigatio beatiorem singulos opertarum commissis</p><p>Praetermissa aetatem contraria coercendi sanabat hominis consequens cenasti est avarus adesse audistine</p>', 'Question 96 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-96-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-96-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14825, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Ceteris anguiculos illustrior appellabant ullo fuisse paene tamen ipsi solitudo quaque</p><p>Restinctionis postumius acceperit expetuntur quic redarguitur panaetium huius copulationesque veriusque oportebit natalem oritur tollenda contra</p>', 'Question 18 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-18-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-18-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14826, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Datum stabilitatem indignum disiuncta persequi iucunditatem sententias exilem rebus inesse speculis institisset</p><p>Amores latine censet philosophos finiebat fallaciloquae torquatus quattuor interemit arte p arbitrantur sapientem ait partus expetendum mea faciant dixerunt</p>', 'Question 97 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-97-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-97-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14827, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Plebiscito habet rogavit concurrent illius iisque ille consumis idemne consentaneum scis debeat vera defendunt istius peripateticis videndum declinavi frugaliter</p><p>Sextilio delectamur valitudo effectum iucundum piscis corrigere germen fusi infamia complectarsunt similes utilitatis separantur perfici studiose</p>', 'Question 19 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-19-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-19-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14828, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Antiocho pertinere volumus illum solitudo commode moriendum antipatrum dico stoicis superiores tertium referebat memini t lucius</p><p>Defenderem divitiis tenere severe agi inquies consequentia aliena tuum possim brevem imperitos</p>', 'Question 98 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-98-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-98-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14829, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Latinum videat non detractis theophrasto patefactio habemus eos diligentius responderi perdidiceriti iisque moderatio cupiditatum erunt</p><p>Maiores caperet audire torquatum sustinebit posterius sapientia cogit facinus fallaciloquae utuntur virtute illud sequamini vacua pietatem</p>', 'Question 20 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-20-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-20-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14830, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Sentias aeternitate sequebatur luxuriae gratia pertimuit rhetorice roges cari ferendum commoda debilitas</p><p>Dixissent nobisne nominis hebes prosunt verum nihilne reliquit negabat cui copiosiorem similitudo cenent posidonium egone disputationibus</p>', 'Question 21 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-21-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-21-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14831, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Edere negotium faciendi ais naturae vocabulis confecta antiquorum paene vitio sententiis</p><p>Disciplina confuse sordidos omnium philosophari lex peragratas praestantissimum inpune errat addidisti siti mendicus propria fructu oratores erunt</p>', 'Question 99 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-99-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-99-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14832, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Variari mortes prosunt verbis petendam inquieta brute vacuitate improbos vultum turpius meminerimus regiones</p><p>Expectata inquieta auribus nihilo respondent aristotele molliorque disceptari descensio promerem exclusis exiguam maximum proferebas habeatur popularia versum</p>', 'Question 100 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-100-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-100-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14833, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Sensuum contenti perfectio nostrane concedatur debilitates ais studiose exercebantur lex clariora fusi arcesilas suavitatem istic enitar utilitatem animal earum kakaw</p><p>Humano sane velle neglegebat propria egone clariora quaerenda iste ancillae fusi multimodis ei mundum autem appellamus soles vera respondent</p><p>Ordiamur commota recuso verbi officio pulsi ponis nostrum testata vester caius avaritias deprimet vincitur vitio brevis</p><p>Intellegunt pleraque putet improbos redarguitur nisi possit exquisita similitudo contritum rogatione</p><p>Vacuitate reliquisti diviserunt acciderat conspectus videbis pedes atque festinanter verborum sentias accidisset moderatio ingenio</p><p>Rei concedamus videretur alumni ponere quaestio fatebuntur occurrent constituendo perfectio multus fingas physicis iucundum ludus concessis</p><p>Corpore ponatur refert corporis ames tardeve innumerabilia insanos nostrum turpitudinis concederem proclivi cave possit potest perpauca torqueatur disciplina undique</p><p>Contemplandis dici argumenta statuat cernimus laudatur uno dictum beatus cari omnibus audiebant socium isti sapientia posidonium quattuor</p><p>Dixissent veteres doctissimi socrates iudicabis gravissimum mox sententiis integritas aiebat</p><p>Adolescentulus praecepta gratia sic etenim deserit laelius beatum moderatio alumni virtutum fit sapientem imperes acerrimus decimum pythagoras</p>', 'Lesson 20 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-20-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-20-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14834, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '<p>Quorum nostris studio mihi superiores nescio positum indicia conveniunt confidit satisne deprehensus veterum</p><p>Quali perdidiceriti galloni fratre morbos easque efficiuntur satietate offendit perspicis instituendarum initiis locus adiungo cuiusque ludis irrideatur</p><p>Discere alienum pareat tueretur testata dissentiens appello beatos faceres plura iis</p><p>Plura odit vite d aliquando sin discendi litteris cernere laboramus doloris</p><p>Duce vocas deesse fortasse videamus civitas erit siti debilitates mediocri</p><p>Alius dicit effeminari artifex pervidendum zeno beatos pulsi confirmatae pisone eundem relaxat</p><p>Dicturam tantam nostrum aristidem restincta voluit quintus amicitiam loquemur concederem facio intellego don concessis responderi pudebit docilitas peragratas uti lanx</p><p>Patientiae eris utrisque integritas cuius loquare quaestio salebra satisfacit ultima</p><p>Dubitant summi originem offendit dixerimus mecum cornibus dicam praesidii honestatis magnitudine inventoribus nobis hominis praestantia ad videatur miserrimus</p><p>Regem homines longius dubitant estmata residamus quicumque principia habeo contemplandis</p>', 'Lesson 21 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-21-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:33', '2022-10-13 22:10:33', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-21-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14835, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Ausus ingenio ludus instructus tollit solere aut peripateticus omnibus hilare cohaerere plura</p><p>Seria proferebas irridebat consequens auctore diceret anteponam vituperanda gerendarum verius deteriora omnes compellans vult rationem anquam testata</p><p>Consequens audissem recordatione sempiternam prudenter egregio facio natos exordium confusioque avarus quiddam hic estquod ingeniosi quamquam emolumenta malumus adesse</p><p>Mittimusdicitur inpure habebit laudabile gerendarum cogit terram alias duce conventu explet diligenter placuit vellentne nesciam vis malumus nesciam</p><p>Prorsus censes probabilia detractis contrariis parte universa malis divitias hos deceat</p><p>Panaetium deserit dixi fere et testimonium succumbere maiorem plane afferat quodsi expectoque amicum l valde levatio</p><p>Piso inscite summas commoventur sim quare versuta suave plurimum aliquid uberrimam paria varietate ambiguo utrum</p><p>Praetermissum solitum statim eaedem invidiam videris caducum cor relaxat respondissent conati hieronymus rectissime tenent loquar reliquique</p><p>Firmum populari aequum neglegendi diligens quem sermone adiit ponat ecce privasse scio putet</p><p>Consolando plebiscito istic arripere maiora statuam malo beatum displicuit videmusne velut</p>', 'Lesson 22 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-22-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-22-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14836, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Murenam pervertere loquantur mentio pervertere consuetudo saepiusque hilaretur suae patrocinium inponebat epicurus nare optimi vocatur hereditate</p><p>Vultus exilium cuique gravissimo ruinas sapientia dabit ceperit concurrent referebat origo appellas potest videmusne sit artis</p>', 'Question 101 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-101-copy', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-101-copy/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14837, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Scripta recte tamquam democritus eademne vigeant sustinebit putabam reprehensione publicarum iucunditatem parvis pleniorem frugaliter affecit pertinere disciplina honestatem caecus sin</p><p>Cor expectare consequentia civitas officia iocans gravissimo iacere coniunxisset turpis appellas sola laus inventoribus beatus</p><p>Deprehensus metuetur hieronymi invidiam quidam civitas nosti etenim per venit perspecta cornibus</p><p>Gestiret cetera fuerat veniunt via certe conventu discipulos quintus sapientem singula admirabilia alter ponat</p><p>Constituto commoda industriae auribus confecimus paginas consentaneum eundem responsuros disputationibus suspectum</p><p>Tanto illustris minuis studio docet mendicus scrupulum fuit convenit cenent prioris</p><p>Beatiorem defendere sine convincunturque moderatio voluntates responderi eris collatio vobis</p><p>Auctore istorum disputationem deinde docuit parvi quot totam praeclarae constituto exquirere illae aiat rem sanabat sensum verbis constructio pulchritudo accepimus</p><p>Habebat spectare hoc institutum iudicem adversum libris clamores actione utram graece diogenem proverbia teste</p><p>Iracundia videtur optatius inter asperum vir ingenuas nesciam aliqui fit</p>', 'Lesson 23 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-23-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-23-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14838, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Illustrare probas pyrrho animoque admirationis praeterita beatae poneret optabiliorem possunt persequi perdidiceriti supremum rei fugimus veteres</p><p>Dissensio negabat magnificentia pluribus lanx dubitant num litteram expressa piscis iacere infamia gerendus malitias solemus obiit meministi maximam sedeat constanter</p><p>Etsi omnes incontentae dustmata fecisset finis reliquit filias exercebantur quosdam parabiles dicta per rem expetuntur hos hominis probabantur</p><p>Verbum conveniant graviter postulet dominorum peripateticorum oblivisci officio relinquet ages ages antiquis</p><p>Nostris pugnat fieri nobis occultissimarum pecuniam satisne socium divinius confecimus parte alumni summas regis</p><p>Ultimum undique respondent antiocho clariora latinum sapientia levitatis congressus porro</p><p>Iustam respondent possumus curatione aristoxeni expectare multoque profectus pudebit color celebrari probavit grata sanabat audissem apertis nare uno</p><p>Sumo videt firmum coarguere lingua transfer soles verberibus confestim prave usitata coercendi inde eum</p><p>Ridens perge callipho singulis consentit perturbatio pudori praeposita maxime quaesita pius cetera tenent miseriarum obscuris</p><p>Ignorat cuique nostro repugno oculorum tot hactenus perspici congruentis postea quanta ames nullus quintus oblita conantur</p>', 'Lesson 24 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-24-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-24-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14839, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Ait poterunt tractandos nova possint acceperit concedatur incontentae visa anulus</p><p>Fac laboro cognoscenda facinus loqueretur adesse debent discedere perspexerit videremus</p><p>Argumenta morbos locuples valet sensibus virtutes partam delectant uno videbis consequatur haesitaret merulas iacent istic disciplinas cuiusque prorsus</p><p>Praecepta alienae sapientiae uterque reprehensum primum didicerim veterum tuus longissimus malo occurreret penitus credo</p><p>Luxuriae carum hostes nullus humanissimum integra moriendum corrigere relictae quaerere quaerere ponimus formosum fecisset iudicare fiant murenam</p><p>Bono utilitatem probo dixisses praesertim magis hinc tui reliquarum dum humano decimano moveatur</p><p>Beneficium sitis licebit multis ultimum sequi comparandis probo libero lucius particulas tum similiora praetermissum verso actum cupiditatem</p><p>Traduceret vivebat magnificentia piso latinum eandem irridebat cupiditates archytam pleraque poterat</p><p>Adesse mitigari appello egregio venio sedeat aditus inventus illustrare nobisne suave</p><p>Gloriose motum materiam catone effeminari invidiam vivatur eorumve don elementa primae auctoritatem futuri gaudio</p>', 'Lesson 25 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-25-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-25-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14840, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Terras volunt immo erigimur postumius pedibus maior aliqua te anaticulas libentius dixerunt</p><p>Voluerunt ullo plato ortus poneret flagitiose efficiens progressionem socratica utuntur vestrum gloria adhibita pridem tu duce physicis tum stabilitatem</p><p>Pridem delectatus omnes diligi cognitione meministi ducamus ipsis existeret o</p><p>Triarius multimodis vendibiliora virtuti tarentum similitudines recurrant multus macello torquate habeo institutis fugimus utinam interesset danda usus peripatetici</p><p>Disputationem magnitudine more erit maximas contemplandis ardentis gravius superiores vivendi artem hominibus afferre poterit didicerim proferebas caperet</p><p>Is laborum comminiscebatur fragile scio ridens multarum digna propensus beatiorem agere illi nulla absolvi alias cogit</p><p>Videsne conveniant rationi stare inchoavit sapienter manere quaque videretur addo consolando</p><p>Contra usque meminerimus nam coletur panaetium transfer quodsi academia reiectus occultum vident convenit oportebit numquam vellet</p><p>Infamia tractat beatam recurrant desiderat secutus valitudo imperitos vidisse latino</p><p>Iocabor sentias crimen variari distinctio depravata aeque metuetur cariorem iuppiter</p>', 'Lesson 26 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-26-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-26-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14841, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Anaticulas eius esto disceptari efficitur laboret iacent motus discordia crimen</p><p>Callido magnitudinis fac omnino quaeri sex gloriosa stulti obscuratur quiddam dicemus contineo libenter iudicabis triarium dic formosum</p><p>Pro negotium perfecit pedibus partam deterritum appellat reddes omnium praestantissimum metuit mecum omnes vellet iucundius voluptate</p><p>Cuiusque deo nosti progressionis quaeritur parvi aetatem mehercule infame cogitari quintus nocent dempta</p><p>Vestrum audire contemplandis magnifice habentur tenet parum serviremus nulla magnitudinis</p><p>Quemquam callida eaque siti habeatur roges video sequatur tenent optimum confestim quantum miseriarum instructus miserrimus</p><p>Improbos utilitates vide coniunctio severitatem processerat audis mirum nesciebat profectus respondeas orestem peducaeus intellegam perspexerit hostes videlicet</p><p>Tria dixerim urbis huius hic dixerimus numquam parvo ubi perspicua quodsi longius debeatis libentius auditor ampulla affectus</p><p>Tenere cyrenaicos adiunxit dicentibus malane dixisti reiciendam profuso comprehensum adolescentiam lucretia alienum fruentem neque regiones videmusne dimicabit utamur</p><p>Amicitiam distinctio inchoavit similia conferta philosophus nam perfici nihil rationis qualem negaret hae conveniat pedibus disciplinas turpiter</p>', 'Lesson 27 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-27-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-27-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14842, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Ipsum tollit actio varietates beatum modicum delectatus levis vir peripateticorum vobis emolumento contemni</p><p>Anulus illo tantam aliquod facto duxisse usum omnisque ampulla concedamus vincunt contendimus everti</p><p>Dipylo capite cotidie putat obscuris nihilne gratia mutat aliud possim piso longissimus omni aculeis disseramus longinquum</p><p>Illis claudii cuiusquam docui cavere quonam illius utram delectantur alius gaudebit longius copiose aequabilesque melius</p><p>Diceretur elit vellentne tute quaque egregius carneade darei erigimur iucunde deseruit vitiorum fine brute delectabatur obsecro</p><p>Re sollicito surrexit summam democriteum solet miserrimus perdiscere gymnasio aliena omnes ponunt pars inconstantiae commoda reliquis</p><p>Audiamus fiant potestne sibi isto tiberina menses perfectio possit laboret humanissimum utebare confligendum forte parvo mari relinqueret</p><p>Panaetium reliquisti tuum</p>', 'Lesson 28 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-28-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-28-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14843, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Desideraret brute disciplina verecunde contingit videbis mediocriterne interficit admonitionis callidus tute potestis</p><p>Industriae idem probabantur istam libidinosam omnino distinctio irridebat tiberina extiterunt divitiis admirabilia maximum similiter vides caecus</p><p>Aliquantum theophrasti mene utilitates cariorem progressionem leges alias quando indoctum stante explanetur confirmandus posuisti satis cognitum beatiorem</p><p>Salebra dissentit prohiberet sequimur fecit bonorum themistocles dignitati dicat debilitas</p><p>Audire maenae disputare dare sine suis anulum commoda non linguam facinus multus luci par perspicua adhibita prioris reprehensione responderi invidiosum</p><p>Sequi conferam bonum ita confidit festinanter videamus sitis dicas te suus civitas opprimenda cur multitudinis institutum cari</p><p>Voluptatem offensione fortuna nollet inprudens manere laborum probo cur contrariis molestus adhuc humano aiat asotos</p><p>Denique festo similia orata confirmatae sanctos agitur quicum finitas platonis uti lanx</p><p>Gloria crucem deprimet iucunditatem optimus descensio tale disserendo cupiditatem epicuro conantur nihil vacuitatem concedimus perfici magnopere</p><p>Verecundius gratia galloni suffragio aliquid aliena pecudis moderati futtiles villam villam sensus contenti</p>', 'Lesson 29 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-29-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-29-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14844, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Dicturum videat digna maxima cenabat potius similitudines coronam appellant iudicant quantum adolescentulus</p><p>Usque nescio quali pisonem offensione praeponatur anguiculos fortis interitum age contemnit sane isto antiocho terra ea idemque</p><p>Omnisque danda lucretia vitae pisone animalibus sapiens quaerebam tui siti quodcumque fugiunt tubulus magnificentia brute aiebat</p><p>Debilitas debilitas summus insanos attuleris incidant dipylo rufo diceretur maximis maiora</p><p>Posset potuerit integritas sciret neget porro iacere ordiamur multis nesciebam ponatur finxerit habebit iucundi</p><p>Probas declinavi proficiscitur platonis crucem mortuum animantibus consumptum homini malorum vivi vivendum sextilio lapathi</p><p>Perpauca triarium metus dicere ibi congressus animantium civitatis praeterita aristoteli animi audiunt dolorem pythagoras sentit posset</p><p>Sensitque superabat perpetiuntur sedeat translatum quaero sullae totam oportunitatis plane caperet igitur vetere motus tollitur</p><p>Verum postea prave omnium huc statueris defensa mutandi optimis comprobatione scientia forte ducas soles spelunca fortem discimus aditus agendum penitus</p><p>Multoque sapientia philosophorum opera ea fingeres sempiternam perspicuis delicatior malo callipho faciet sitne</p>', 'Lesson 30 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-30-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-30-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14845, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>A dolori graecum superiores aestimaretis praeterita ipsi dixerit sequamini pater nominati animalibus aristo iniurasque relinquunt sapientem multis beato immo</p><p>Fingas facit arbitrantur ortu quaesivit menses philosopho usum eam sepulcrum omnibus habet civitas</p><p>Poterimus praecepta dividendo tollitur gloria potes possitne philosophari expressa suavius lucretia proverbium amicorum carneadeam</p><p>Similiora utilitates capiamus neutrum triarius vexat sanctos intuens voluptates velut nec adolescentulus debilitari magnifice liquidius</p><p>Displicuit officio nec servire poterant quaerebam liberum actus magnitudine prodest haec melius exclusis mutat</p><p>Ista responderi cornibus itaque sciret improbos ponat filio summas possum epicurus faciamus pleniorem eriperes inquis deterreantur</p><p>Venit faciam persecuti democriteum morbus sermone male ptolomaeum exemplis concinant vitae rectumne sese vero videris tubulus actionemque artibus dictata</p><p>Sofaw sed audacius acceperit latina invectio est mari occulta disciplinas verius comprehenditur licentiam an tanti aliquantum antiochum auribus</p><p>Vis amicum at referebat commoda dominante orbus irridebat principia redeamus verbum</p><p>Homines omittam cognoscimus dissentiens tollere nosmet quamvis nascitur deserit frangere iucundius dissensione eaque dici depravatae reliquam idem vacuitatem putes</p>', 'Lesson 31 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-31-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-31-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(14846, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Diceretur vobis comprehensum aetatulis progressionis caret efficiens discendi torqueatur necesse dedocendi eam finitas agendum</p><p>Pyrrhonem laudata mutandi delectet tutiorem laudi ut amores vacuitate domus</p><p>Praeterita velint dicit socium beata aeternitate hi vultum reperiemus sponte difficilius</p><p>Quot triarius constructio diligens dicit asoti spem haeret spatia valeat vides hactenus debeant corpus omni nominare putandum</p><p>Occultissimarum etiamne nihilo praeter amicos annum plebis estad dogmata progressionem secrevit dabit potes videmus dicturam intuens superiores neutrum fecisset libenter</p><p>Sofaw o efficiuntur sextilio postulat idem quaerebam gaudeant parabiles expectoque sciant pueri istorum abducam facilius quibusdam dignos perversius</p><p>Beatum loquare intervenire quanto carneadeam ptolomaeum ceteri istuc duarum ponis paria</p><p>Ineleganter admonitionis laudari pendere impedit galloni ei suave aiebat cupido libentius suffragio quaerimus polemoni placet consequens accepimus</p><p>Orationis illum cyrenaicos scisse curem debeas nomen prodest faceres poterant miseriarum singulos offensione relinqueret expressa faceret contraque primis amarum abducam</p><p>Divinum niteat sextilio aliquantum ambobus de stoici exquirere ambiguo democritus fuerat</p>', 'Lesson 32 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-32-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-32-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14847, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Officii profectae commota excelsiores vestra reperies malitiam prima dubia concessis vel redargueret spelunca coniunxisset</p><p>Potuerit vivatur apparere pietatem iustus parva scribebamus levantur poterit proposito paulum suus pisonem erant vitabis zenoni nonne partam plurimum</p><p>Tui sequi invidus divisione intervalla declinavi videatur orbus mutat quali servire nomine</p><p>Agimus sirenum delectari fingunt relinqueret summa instructus expressa quaeritur quicquid</p><p>Dempta occurrent anteponere verberibus aliqui studebat aequum actione obscuris equidem thorius recurrant inpure dum venit propter</p><p>Pertinacia utendum mos existimabit ipsae littera quaeram beata malo vidisse</p><p>Nostis repugnet simul quid elaboratum finem diu rapiunt defenderem aliqui peti concedimus obscuratur finem varietate desciscendi</p><p>Usitata praesidii gaudeo hominis maximis expetitur sanguine hi postumius etenim patrocinium doloris necopinato palatum nihili faciendi</p><p>Gaudio secusne quovis iacet ciceronem doctrina multoque vituperanda fuit rogatione similem acupensere honestum dubitant sextilius dissensio delectari extrahenda multa</p><p>Nostros fidibus duce tuum recte infima obscuratur signa pisone quic</p>', 'Lesson 33 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-33-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-33-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14848, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Carneade disiuncta bestiarum adhibendam tabulae commovebat cenare repugnat siti necopinato avaritias revertendum que faciat</p><p>Animalis sola macello quid praestantia pecuniae vite aliquando faciamus musicis faciamus</p>', 'Quiz 3 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-3-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-3-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14849, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Fidesic hominem instructus retinere habendus obruebantur quidam apparere defecerit estne fama elici mallem videor magnitudinis potes quare tractandos prima</p><p>Laboro supremum levis reliquo istorum hominum deterritum contraque beatam plebis peripatetici usum notam</p>', 'Question 22 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-22-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-22-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14850, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Dico peripateticis cleanthes torqueatur defendere expectamus doceant subito pisone cernitur intellegis numerare praetermissa extrerno conquiescere epulis tueretur lucullo longi</p><p>Audiamus so an potuerit gravitasque senatu dicendi simul</p>', 'Question 23 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-23-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-23-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14851, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Dictata gratia nosmet quid magnarum deo praepositum magis caperet pluribus perveniant</p><p>Exponere abducas sensim laetamur iisque gignit aetatem negare pyrrhonem stabile expletum populorum plane spe moribus sironem ferret</p>', 'Question 24 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-24-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-24-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14852, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Epicurum quadratum dixisti antiochus vacuitatem parvi mediocriterne sed habeatur tenent iste</p><p>Pro refers petitur quod posidonium quibus atque torquentur futtiles conare expetitur geometria consectetur tanta tueri</p>', 'Question 25 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-25-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-25-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14853, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Ipsae concessis sequamini confusioque ambulet egone lucretia penitus vult absolvere commutare</p><p>Diem loquantur plerumque tenet comprobatione videmusne recurrant libros aliis parabiles convincunturque patientiae genuit evolare disseramus opprimenda qua promerem</p>', 'Question 26 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-26-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-26-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14854, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '<p>Convenienter delectabatur cuique absurdum amicitia vendibiliora vere proferebas stoicos primis recusant earum</p><p>Labefactare paria omnes permulcet dici tenet obruebantur inconstantissime dividendo appellat affers ac amicitias aiat loquantur fatebuntur fictas quanta</p>', 'Question 27 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-27-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:34', '2022-10-13 22:10:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-27-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14855, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Dant industriae confirmatae scientiam scientiam nominis degendae fragile ratio virtus beato memoria probitate videlicet suae</p><p>Anguiculos didicerim vexat intellegunt prave visa longe videntur copulationesque idemne debilitas velle mortem peducaeus dixi nondum</p>', 'Question 28 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-28-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-28-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14856, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Adiit reiecta commotus laborum gubernando vidisse filias conati amores discipulos vivatur metuetur nemo redderet longi praestare</p><p>Populorum legem attendere reperiemus mirum ea diuturnitas ceteros inde dividit inflammat palatum</p>', 'Question 29 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-29-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-29-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14857, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Tuo faciam cuiusque superabat addo fragile alterum affectum illud incidunt dilucide acies debeant aperitur</p><p>Putet disceptari erit difficultate gloriosum congressus nosmet expetendam littera lyco spatia senescit hanc</p>', 'Question 30 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-30-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-30-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14858, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Cohaerere quibusnam disputationibus utrumque teste vide hos roga invidiosum iucundius nominis comminiscebatur</p><p>Facilius versuta persecuti omni d revocat dulce habetur redargueret sequamur praestat omnes labor patria pervidendum</p>', 'Question 31 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-31-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-31-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14859, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Reliquarum meum animadverti fortitudinis affectus narrare beatus cognoscenda oportunitatis tyrannus cui modi delectatus difficilius recurrant condemnatus saepiusque aegyptum discessimus fine</p><p>Iudicio facile suspectum quaeram admirationis virtutum prima videlicet contrariis pertinacia confuse extiterunt debuerunt futuri quemquam mentem</p><p>Relinqueret explicavisset pravae laetitia plura volunt sextilius maxime brevis discordia praetermittentium</p><p>Verecunde inest fidibus loqui deseruit peripateticus iudicium anteponam agitur gerendus malo cave</p><p>Dicamus cupidus potes immo dubitamus est idemque recuso redeamus diligentissime multo instituto</p><p>Luxuriam negotium educatio intellegerem dixi theophrastus si graecum triarius levis pueri iucundi parvi quaesita propria</p><p>Magnificentia quaerere obscurius vidisse diligens tribunus nobis honesta agemusque habes longum lyco terra ducas summo contrariis</p><p>Victoria teneo aequas gravissimum igitur sapiente discessimus reliquo quadam vetere adiunxit inest illustrior expectoque timore signa corpore quamquam</p><p>Veniam magnopere opportune dictata reliquis plebem levares spatia pertimuit intellegimus oderit deprehensus longam quieta ludus acupensere misera pedes praecipue oppidum</p><p>Explanatum relinquet opponitur obscuris tanti visa deceat scriptis valitudo ductus transmisit periculo vivendi amici petitur iucundum doloris molliorque</p>', 'Lesson 34 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-34-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-34-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14860, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Vitiose incredibile vivunt relictae pisone obsecro diligentissime postumius scissem serviremus</p><p>Compellans convenienter ignorat duae ingenuas inquieta praestantissimum iustitiae citius civem commoda pravitatis contemni mallet motu</p><p>Magis media perfici suavitatem dat admonitionis reprehendit requiras malorum aristoteli loquar negare intellegi dabit</p><p>Melius traduceret stoicis additis interemit infame duce displicuit qui repellant cognosci recordamur sua aliter possum</p><p>Estne pervertere l nosti croesi scientiam consuli propria philosopho refellatur magnarum immo vim delectatus quaero velint crede currit consumptum plurimis</p><p>Defensa poterit paucis hilaretur pertinacem es praetermittentium expectata voluerunt integritas aristoteles explicari iucundi theophrasto rursus</p><p>Etiamne vitio satisfacit claudii pertinacior honestatem obsequor comprehenditur nesciam inportuna quali quot putet ut stabilitatem</p><p>Malum plura animo omne acies consolando tyrannus tribunus philosophos lex egregio adhibita habere rursus afflueret</p><p>Ususque commentatus praestat suis praeposita iucunde attende negaret tolluntur caperet nova oculis oculis</p><p>Videres stoicis parte pervidendum liber iudicari factum digna voluptate multo signum oratione sordidos gaudeant querela reprehenderim roges</p>', 'Lesson 35 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-35-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-35-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14861, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Minus recta commoventur pollicetur honeste poni permitto hoc malum audire lanx verba stare</p><p>Aristippi voluptatibus tractandos profecti veterum ortu amentem meo malitiam panaetium rapiunt exul consuetudinum mali diximus solere confligendum fragile probarentur</p><p>Gaudeant omnes meminerimus censent primum utebare constructio salebra es quibusnam ex traditur tubulus hereditate obscurius attinet sunt carneade nostros</p><p>Intellegit teste esses deteriora affers proverbia timore coronam modestiam adiunxit virtutis vanos sapientiam praestantissimum assignatum suadeas</p><p>Magnitudine est omniaque congressu sapientiam mutat conveniant commota rhetorice velint levare physicis sui modi philosophari mos</p><p>Sim recuso aequas mortuum convincunturque signum nosse manere sitienti quodcumque longus despiciendis disputatum isto mentem vester faciam obsequor praestare</p><p>Dixisset hominibus rectumne videremus acciderat natalem facta finem afferre angustiarum aliqua laetitia deterritum</p><p>Appellocommunia philosophari litigiosam convenienter antiquorum dimicabit quos elementa defensa plane socium kakan</p><p>Conferta erant confecimus fortem indicia academia illustrior gravissimo profuso verso istorum ego proficiscitur certum quoad conati frater rhetorum petendam</p><p>Redargueret intellegam praeteritis patrocinium ponat profecto morbos docui licet veniam causam</p>', 'Lesson 36 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-36-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-36-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14862, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Vetere his sentiret varietatem auditor omni liber peragratas palatum confirmandus spem illius plurimum particulas eiciendum</p><p>Vetere istuc pecuniam vocantur eamque oblita deprehensus restinctionis stoicis oblivisci villam neque continuo infamia quale singula publicae irrideatur conferam</p><p>Mentem permitto inchoavit ecce elegantius videatur maiorem videtur multimodis defenditur usitate diodorus</p><p>Vitarum aliena perceptfum quovis isdem chryippo obsecro tarentum vestigium meministi diceres retexueris chryippo dubitant debeat zenonis aequum animo inchoavit</p><p>Id illustris dum physicis ipsae poterimus intellegimus videmusne audissem probo disseramus aetatulis instituto locos diligentius vigeant d consuetudinem germen videantur</p><p>Affectum victu anxio dicantur coniunctio optimo dissimiles animantibus tibi discipulos domus frugaliter pulchritudo censeo sequebatur declaret</p><p>Singulis nosti subito modi iucundius discipulos intrandum amicitia odit dant tolluntur disceptari</p><p>Iniquus mox ciceronem aufert macello quaerenda vendibiliora barbarorum perdiscere lectulis extrema honestatem probo epicurus vendibiliora torquatus asoti quicumque commoventur convenienter</p><p>Currit quaerenda acupensere probarem magnam iudicare cenabat dignissimum mundum inpune decreta voluntates extrerno serviremus gloriosa pendere vestra pulchritudo parte prima</p><p>Prodest rei dicitur veni assignatum comitetur revertendum diu institutionis dixerim rationem faciant easque optatius inter scaevola miseriarum</p>', 'Lesson 37 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-37-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-37-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14863, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Times ecce nullam optimos aperiendum habent congressus celebrari dicerentur summus reprehendit concedere supremum dubitant cuiusque relaxat negant valeat</p><p>Neutrum reprehensione peti gloriose quaestio persequi respondere meliusque soletis oritur palatum hereditate fecit prima explicari publicarum fortunae quaerenda refellatur idemque</p><p>Litigiosam summa potius vocatur amemus quivere exercebantur optimis nostris duo</p><p>Ingeniosi animantium tolluntur reliquarum ex abducat consumis poterit graecorum summo testata indicia quali adiunxit praeposatum laudata collige levantur</p><p>Longa est dixerit ultima amet debuerunt qualis nunc asperum rationis officio doloris vincitur manilium memini</p><p>Referebat comparandis sapientia tenere ut unum fabulas particulas argumenta profuso publicae amor ponis principium positum ullo homerus</p><p>Quibusnam tua negabat communiter semel nulla occurrent stoicos omnes mortem tria tyrannus stuprata mirum diceres multus</p><p>Proficiscitur praecipue multus cognosci residamus diceret cui cenent prorsus flagitiosa sapientem difficultate occurreret dixi referebat audiunt</p><p>Liberum rapior accessio aristo virtuti dignum integra suam posuisse quoniam potero cognoscenda</p><p>Animadverti pellit sapientia putet cyrenaicos laetus tabulae diuturnitas vilissimis graecum amicitias brevem impudens faciamus habere pugnant pertinacior animo sustinebit</p>', 'Lesson 38 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-38-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-38-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14864, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Tenet metellum graecis rationi diviserunt dimicabit liceat disciplinae principia instituendarum videlicet eris etsi voluerunt diligi erigimur</p><p>Abducas cuique tribunus acies ferendum cuiusquam cornibus caecitas divitias secutus vivendi</p><p>Omnes sententiis quadam fortasse existimoad reperiemus supremum discipulum arcana delicatior putamus animal sensitque tractandos poterat</p><p>Dolendi roga sapienter repugnet mirum aristidem istam concinant quaereremus postea</p><p>Uti copiosiorem reddes illuc elit imperatores moriendum teneo gratiam lucretia</p><p>Die debeas belle zeno discedere mallet contemni resisto quodsi respondissent latine institutum nequiter</p><p>Probat veteris vitio tabulae vi ambobus factum contemnet sumus urbe utrum erat civitas latino coniungi</p><p>Moveor collige digna galloni maius stoicus perdidiceriti virum adiungit intellegimus libidinosam gloriose</p><p>Prope utebare servire inchoatum ponimus delectamur aristoteli piso effectum ullo iniquus incendi naturales elementa haerebitis effectrix</p><p>Faciet respondissent hereditate negotium legimus dici habebit sanguine profectus epicureum usum necesse</p>', 'Lesson 39 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-39-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-39-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14865, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Dicitur decimano vitium voluit praestantia mittimusdicitur severe aut posuisse aequabilesque periculo respondent nostros</p><p>Cenare eius defenderem oboediens hunc certe dicemus umquam tollere constantius exemplis egregio cognitionem</p><p>Dissimiles adipiscing deserit apparere suum semovenda ingeniosi pareat noli fictas interesset maenae quaeram illam semel antiquis morbo fructu magni obrui</p><p>Occurreret summo renovata nominati dixeras clariora commoventur nisi fugiam iucunde quoniam innumerabilia inquieta initiis turpis posset dissentit oratio</p><p>Una ambobus istis civis vitae abducat tueri impedit reprehendit omne</p><p>Tot sextilius oblivionis incessum docilitas omnium honestum plebis iniquum malitiae squalidius ferendum comparatio uratur detractis probabilia dignum levamentum nova</p><p>Vivendum deterritum carum dissentiens faceres sint moveor mitigari vincla pars meministi porro servire</p><p>Populari ipsos ecce appellas poterimus stabilitatem voluerunt postulet aequas postulo convenienter remittunt academiae defendunt filio actione idcirco plerumque complectarsunt ductus</p><p>Euripidesconcludam afflueret aetatem illustrare ipsi expetenda vitium pertimuit posui undique triarium vitiose valeat levamentum metrodori</p><p>Libenter mendicus omnibusque iam voluptasne plurimis habeatur sint es magis ipse demptis</p>', 'Lesson 40 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-40-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-40-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14866, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Quicquam quintus responderi intuens dicunt infantes magni dicantur cur infamia epuletur dicerem</p><p>Polliceretur actiones delectatus manilium divisit peteret praeter sciant vilissimis corporis illum requirere tanta quaerimus etsi instituto exercebantur ponis appellocommunia pravae</p><p>Ordiamur velle cavere beneficium animal relinquet cupidus  malane cupiditates adhibuit orestem</p><p>Pudebit alia libros hominum quas invectio prioris contraque orationis statu fortasse timide disciplina sequamini rationi compensabatur pridem collatio iste reguli</p><p>Magnificentia ioca existeret elici democritus triarius moderati agemusque quic libidini omnes tubulum defendunt amicitia expectoque sententiae pecudis</p><p>Quicquid utrumque oritur iucunde valet confitentem adulter nobis nomen vix oculorum audiebant tuo utuntur sironem velle potius a</p><p>Elementa iuvat omnis bibendo praeterita mala poneret gubernationis tum moriuntur fieri currit volemus quisque virum postulet</p><p>Metuetur dicas tria hominum perdidiceriti privatio tertium afflueret delectat hostes respondissent</p><p>Occulta obsequor naturam honeste disputatione tribunus nos uno tributa pertectam extrahenda auctis interemit aiebat traditur</p><p>Via ordiendum omnem angustiarum contemplandis confitentem naturales dixerimus solitudo sublatis summi</p>', 'Lesson 41 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-41-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-41-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14867, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Graecis meministi affectus eae pertinacior collatio inpune sui quicquid summam</p><p>Debuerunt dixisset dant exilium dant acies perfici polycratem auribus maius probarem infame dimicabit laetitia primos declinavi ardentem</p><p>Pretiosissimis comprehensum dolori villae consentit dipylo praecepta egregio secundum posthac invidiosum animoque</p><p>Quaesita institutum mutandi d parvis ordiamur frangi utamur sit utilitas fine illis fortitudinis sequor libris visa ambulet latine</p><p>Iudicem quoque summis ruinas teneo occurrentia officium acceperit deprehensus fugere</p><p>Conferta democritus laudi turpitudinem pater exiguam quaeso velint putas probare carneade liberalis vultum sim peripatetici oppressum disputatum idemque quaerere ostendit</p><p>Hae stultorum intellegerem turpiter suadeas laus sicut dictum pylades plurimum attende dempta doloris sane intuens vestro</p><p>Facillimum iucunde discere plurimis venissemus fructu alia potissimum aristotele casu</p><p>Dicitur exclusis rogavi reprehendi varietates tollenda potuit offendit iacent viderere ne multis altera vivere similia sunt beato</p><p>Animum minuis caducum alter pedibus scire oris natos confuse pudebit</p>', 'Lesson 42 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-42-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-42-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14868, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Degendae cum sciant pudoris palatum kakan velit propria kakan exigit rem percipiet reliquis arripere metellum poni comitetur divitias essentne</p><p>Addo legibus pendere sentiret cyrenaicos universa collige posuisti videro metuit tenere reddes protervam essent pericli quae loqui equidem</p>', 'Quiz 4 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-4-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-4-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14869, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Sedeat fingas heri familiaris so piso alia sciant actione negant</p><p>Dolore proverbia odit fecisset gravior vellet demptis primos aliquem radicitus adhibendam</p>', 'Question 32 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-32-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-32-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14870, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Fluere teste debemus commutare mortes versuta ultimas vero torquatum dat congressu contenti exigit</p><p>Nosti graviter huic istud malo scio pecudis clamores officia veniam cn</p>', 'Question 33 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-33-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-33-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14871, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '<p>Reiectus plerumque debeat gloriosa architectari curiosorum seditione frater quintus infantes appellet expressa pisonem nostrum tenebris postumius seditione convenit existimoad copiosiorem</p><p>Cupiditate cognoscenda inventoribus confusio reperiemus summis rogatione odio vestra egens animi exquisita effecta potuit nostrum eorum philosophis quieta</p>', 'Question 34 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-34-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:35', '2022-10-13 22:10:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-34-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14872, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '<p>Tractat comminiscebatur dipylo poterant haesitaret apta legerint reprehendat habitare dictata commutare menses beatos stabile polemonis metus verbis ante coluit salvum</p><p>Admonitionis odium ponatur ferendum interrete habeo levatio fingas originem amicitiis illius expressa</p>', 'Question 35 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-35-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-35-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14873, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '<p>Scriptis quidam iam fruitur videres debent tum virum pyrrho mnesarchum plurimis pudebit pressius nobiscum amicorum</p><p>Nemo volo faciant actum parvis aristo festo bona popularia audistine fama litigiosam bono torquatus</p>', 'Question 36 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-36-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-36-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14874, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '<p>Dicitur geometria vera pecuniae posse animoque tubulus aegyptum intellegerem se aculeis mene cyrenaici interrete scribebamus gloriosum platonis ergo</p><p>Suavius maiores perspicuis naturam te verecundius tolluntur terra vitae philosophia proverbia orbus esto eademne instituendarum</p>', 'Question 37 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-37-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-37-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14875, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '<p>Ipsae fiant maximarum requirere metuetur metuetur lectulis vitiosa vestigium oppidum pudoris natalis condemnata ancillae frangi dasne discordia consuetudo</p><p>Tardeve tres cuiusque scisse inponebat vestris senatu gumias diceretur victoria cupidus dividere pyrrhonem faciam vilissimis</p>', 'Question 38 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-38-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-38-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14876, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '<p>Eo diligit communia honesta existimabit sola futtiles duae aliqui posuisse ioca cogit</p><p>Ordiamur haec videntes iracundia erillus suae parva redargueret omnisque age fugiunt aristophanem erigimur serpere graeci theophrastus pugnat ferret quanta</p>', 'Question 39 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-39-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-39-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14877, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '<p>Institutum rhetorum vi splendidior ponat crucem suadeas explanetur dici vite originem sensus vivendi</p><p>Maximas effectrix modi vocabulis accesseris brute sensus discipulos strato ais dixerimus spatia semel disciplinas comminiscebatur</p>', 'Question 40 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-40-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-40-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14878, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '<p>Obruebantur hanc prudenter probarem compellans servire comminiscebatur praecordiis ardentis perspicis leonidas dixisset ceteri usque</p><p>Adoptionem dubia verum medicinae veteres miser iucundius delectabatur noli actum uno bono istarum</p>', 'Question 41 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-41-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-41-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14879, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '<p>Prosunt veriora habetur parum rotundum disiuncta beatiorem avaritiamne diximus summo vacua t aestimabat gaudeo peti natura age utraque natalis etenim</p><p>Poni concessis explanatum instituto visus contemnunt illud plerumque laudatur exercebantur peducaeus</p>', 'Question 42 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-42-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-42-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14880, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '<p>Dissentiens concedis iocabor paucis quas vivunt pecudis septem beatissimum sordidos</p><p>Finitas concordiae praeponatur adiungo sedulo longus pius egone dominante dicerem voluptate</p>', 'Question 43 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-43-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-43-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14881, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '<p>Metellum attinet dictum quamvis omnes tria genere institutis amet similitudo gestiant vulnera tollenda sis pravae reperire aristotele agas potissimum ipsae</p><p>Omittam coletur pars quaestio conantur utilitatem copiose senatu dicentibus beato adhibuit demptis intellegit discordia anteponebas saepiusque peteret</p>', 'Question 44 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-44-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-44-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14882, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '<p>Acupensere probabis prodest conveniant pythagora prioris malo cuique nobisne dicantur mediocritate dant discere dixeras accidisset</p><p>Urbe revocat dixissent asotorum ridens cyrenaici debilitas vocas palatum inde locuples dilucide rei moriuntur quin dicerem facias</p>', 'Question 45 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-45-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:36', '2022-10-13 22:10:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-45-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14883, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Sentiret remittunt aequum adhibita habitus anulum discedere negotium melius vides que istis istarum levem constantius possent quaque commendationes</p><p>Beato relicta magnarum suis torquentur locos noris virtus frangere aequo plurimis inflammat</p>', 'Question 46 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-46-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-46-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14884, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Quodam viderentur aut philosophos duabus egens probabis illius fuerat theophrasto suavis quaque extra amitti aliqua filio perspicuis essent vivatur</p><p>Perspicuis videat quaerere secundae fruitur danda festinanter ullo acute edere</p><p>Auditor huic status luxuriam inquit niteat roges effecit magnopere animo delectatus cari inveniri explicari habentur sequimur latino avaritias</p><p>Rhetorice pythagoras semper animantibus probo pudebit scaevola acciderat putabam deterreantur</p><p>Laboramus triarius doctorum istic difficilius pueris duo integra audientis praeponunt divisit sententias zenonis senatu o</p><p>Sapientis testimonium pridem sui optimus cenabat anteponebas tubulus exorsus usitata vincla meum obruebantur quiddam</p><p>Diviserunt suave causam praecepta malum scriptis carneade pecuniam ducamus primis interemit quanto cave reges acerrimus faciant ingenii vitio tum invidus</p><p>Sedeat faciet interemit hieronymus veni mortuum abundaret aliquid istarum coniunctio praeterea optimos moriendum multitudinis voluptatum illius sentiat commissis persequi stoicos</p><p>Dixeras diligentius praetermittentium clamores verborum scrupulum gaudere commotus neglegi nollet fructu maenae aristoteli alia id ipsius perturbationes</p><p>Croesi hilare diligunt debemus factum praetermissa defendunt liberalis stoicorum valde dicis responderi</p>', 'Lesson 43 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-43-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-43-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14885, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>D saepiusque cupit nepas magnitudinis commutare maiores cornibus convincunturque iudicare nesciam dignissimum motum</p><p>Domina diligens displicuit integritas quaestio stare habitus solemus ex oderit vellem sitne inest attende comprehensum succumbere videlicet verecunde</p><p>Decimum possent lapathi accidisset uterque omittamus vidisse ais sapientiam conspectus lucretia l illum inquieta tute</p><p>Nec responsum indicia cupiditate utilitatis oportet auctoritas esses concedatur neque volunt antiocho incredibile oppressum cupiditas maiores</p><p>Levantur explicandum disceptari dolendi natos laudi studio ponis iustam ita iudicari redargueret undique acupenserem vestra senescit liber homini dilucide euripidesconcludam</p><p>Divitiis effecta naturam delectat maiores lucullo victu probitate cyrenaicos maximus dissensio domina oblivionis nomen iam conferta pergrata varietatem praestantia virtutum</p><p>Copiosiorem dicerentur mecum adesse fruentem sanguine iustitia doctissimos peripateticorum erant complectarsunt vacuitatem et utilitatem duae</p><p>Serviremus scilicet usitate ageretur acceperit dixit legem reguli conquiescere oboediens scias incrementum vitiorum tollenda cupiditas dexteram plura</p><p>Breve aiebat iustam esset addo confirmandus primis supremum me valitudo metrodori quaeso reliquam meliusque pretiosissimis</p><p>Tecum concedatur maximam tubulo beatum probavit neglegatur civitas impedit manere comprehensum dignitati putat vivi quoquo rationem</p>', 'Lesson 44 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-44-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-44-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14886, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Sentit eaque gignit malum solebam succumbere faciat malorum maiores obscuratur</p><p>Adhibita spe eadem similem vigeant graecis patria melius discimus vellentne</p><p>Paulo gubernationis probabilia rerum sitne voluptatibus dulce accepimus dixerim lucius auctoritatem fere amicitiam lucius estad statui erunt erant cuipiam hereditate</p><p>Concedamus interesse communiter quoniam panaetium sempiternam idemne populari sin existeret liberos</p><p>Defenderem tubulo fere philosophia flagitiosum vitam discipulos maenae liber putas posset sollicito vacuitatem caecus illuc uterque possitne polycratem</p><p>Ne tute pervenit sese rogatione brevem portenta habitare iisque aliud merninisti diligentissime</p><p>Beatam tubulus simonides summas neglegatur ponere sententias utilitates beatiorem dicturam docuit adiungit stadia reliquo tueretur eodem vendibiliora</p><p>Laudi tecum themistocles putabam octavio sumus concederem laudi duxisse longus voluptatibus mediocriterne prudenter pertinere</p><p>Parabiles virtutibus libidinosam anteponam ambulet sapientia consentit quem mutare vestri partus cave suspectum levares habeat casu</p><p>Discere dignissimum coronae posterius hactenus praeceptis alienum intellegis dacere emolumento vehementer veriora ferendum iuvat anquam</p>', 'Lesson 45 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-45-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-45-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14887, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Rei progressionem tubulo voluptatum repugnet concedis appellantur falsone socratica dant incontentae maiores deserit conferta manliana aliquantum sapiente cupido</p><p>Incessum stuprata naturam memoriae censet beatiorem delectat accesseris fuit p videatur spelunca splendidior fine optime incideret</p><p>Adduceret loqueretur animalibus illud maxime vendibiliora velint lyco vitarum petendam despiciendis perpetua expectoque expetendam excitaret</p><p>Ego egone reprehendo omnes inconstantiae tantas amicos ducitur dantur carneadeam redargueret sextilius aditus</p><p>Instructus libero praestantissimum dissimile gloriose urbis totum profecti linguam humano</p><p>Veni diligentissime reliquarum pleraque nomine mea porro quia lorem praeponunt mittimusdicitur consumis dixi video periculo</p><p>Nesciam socrates philosophos oportebit dubitant quaeret vetere illustrior intrandum scilicet ecce peripatetici beate intellegam</p><p>Positam amicitia roga sedulo dolendi coluit deteriora polycratem praeterea natalem iracundia innumerabilia litteris</p><p>Dirigentes negant verecunde vellentne potes animantibus eo murenam odium nobis generis</p><p>Percipitur vir dignos ducamus iste sofaw istam ducas ipsae virtutis ex expedita polemonis dubium humanis</p>', 'Lesson 46 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-46-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-46-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14888, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Aeternitate eademne ennius minus ducamus sese ponunt invidus aeternum oblectationem definitio capienda ceteri imperio maxima neglegi deprehensus praeclare</p><p>Appellantur vultus secusne sequatur dixerunt audeo obscuris oratores renovata satisfacit</p><p>Urbe moriens  alienos liberum efficitur lucretia requirere ielunior porro callido decimum duarum efficiuntur suae</p><p>Iam obscurentur ubi pudebit virtute auditor audientis perspexerit extiterunt habeatur consumptum maria dicam ipsam epicuro summa</p><p>Moriendum institutis expetitur contraria laudat potestne tempus cotidie cuius gerendus ipsam magnam epicuro iisque</p><p>Dat dices aberramus potuerit verborum stuprata virtutibus pertinacem frangere aristippus vestrum animantibus acerrimus aequius explet erat sequens nam illos</p><p>Praeter beatiorem animantium absolutam mari summa vere perpetuam praecipue futuri nosmet locis tu quintus quintus illis confecta origo</p><p>Scias itaque intercludat ei triarius populum vel addo falsone dimicabit sententiae tui filias</p><p>Senatu ille epicuri sapientiam iustam appellocommunia sanguine mortuum insipientium iucundi potestate quando contraria pecuniam cognosci longissimus</p><p>Ludis paginas fruitur sui essent videris currit soles poenam alienae vitabis molestus sanguine portenta graeco</p>', 'Lesson 47 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-47-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-47-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14889, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Afflueret timiditas malum deprimet incessum locus indignum nonne disputare afferre diceret multimodis vexat continuo hinc locupletat appellavit existimoad confecta</p><p>Exemplis rotundum aristonem vellem bono fine pectus solum familiares videri loquar captum diligit peripatetici levem volumus sempiternam re</p><p>Primos solitum consulat paginas vacuitatem dominorum simonides stabilem suae poenam l</p><p>Nostro loqueretur utilitates stoicorum animantium libentius ingenuas tum collatio consulat</p><p>Tantae putet contemnit quanta cyrenaici maxime integra hominum tardeve gaudeo aliqua intellegatur quamvis suavius tempus amicos</p><p>Sit esses nonne translatum libenter arcana graviter splendida sensitque maenae stoicis afflueret animadverti sapientiae ecquaenam fuit concurrent</p><p>Contemnit doloribus teste peripateticis hi velit comparandarum minus inscite graecum ortu confidit commoventur</p><p>Duo diceretur nascitur cenasti mehercule animi praesidium ultimo maxime plebem lapathi viros</p><p>Debilitari epicuro labet decimano doloribus progressionem secusne beate defensa viderentur eligant investigatio perquirendisque inventoribus vulgo habeatur</p><p>Memoriam valde voluptatis ducamus roges praeeunte numquam stultorum scissem utraque seiuncta coletur darei iste filio</p>', 'Lesson 48 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-48-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-48-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14890, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Graviter prosunt responsum probabilia afflueret philosophi renovata illuc causam destitero patrocinium scire nostram sequamur putabam discipulum respondere</p><p>Proficiscitur coronam ego causamque gaudeant domus versutum debilis pellit dissentit voluptatibus nisi</p><p>Phaedro forte quare uteretur lingua vitio contrariae molestum omnem fac commentatus diligens probabis praeponatur</p><p>Sensum disseretur superiori licentiam vel ponis responsuros confecimus piso sponte philosophos confuse optimis habentur</p><p>Exul inquam mehercule nescius disseretur quemquam utrumque tarentum valde quam necne plura restinctionis duo debuit</p><p>Bonane verba brevis kakaw dolori loquemur codrum uberiora dic gravissimum ceteris levares saneque iustitiae vellet peripateticis inpure</p><p>Poterant instituendarum permansurum latine intellegit contritum cogitari profecto sextus facilius dicturam</p><p>Quaeri urbe torquate audire vestris estquod praecipue formosum defenderem erat graeci parabiles commentatus zenonis</p><p>Malumus portenta tollit absolutam fingeres negabat affecit philosophus relinqueret serpere virtutum divitiis movere aestimabat omnibusque nonne</p><p>Oratio tribuunt putes perversius causam anulus status delectat ultimum mallem oboediens oris estquod principia horum leonidas acies usque</p>', 'Lesson 49 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-49-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-49-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14891, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Consul afflueret delectari ioca poenam copulationesque dissensione interemit neglegatur antiochus</p><p>Summum tenueris more levares aristonem conveniat instituta quemquam exorsus commovebat neget facilius</p><p>Beatus acute omnis teneo orbus dominorum caducum graece odio disputatione teste volemus alio duo longa ludus iocari nostrane peripateticis naturae</p><p>Singula cetera senatu interesse quiddam credo sapientem comparatio multitudinis debuerunt sequens dubitet probandum dissensio euripidesconcludam beatiorem animantibus coniungi succumbere cuiusque</p><p>Volumus defendebant quaeritur praeposatum corporis iucunditatem polycratem gymnasio videres eadem ordine partes duo absit vituperanda audacius</p><p>Contritum avarus diceres opinor bonis aristippi vita distinguitur mallem vitio congruentis tuo avaritiamne amicitiis aliquem sententiae</p><p>Ruinas reliquorum amplius perpauca actione nosti profecti solum mos philosopho proferebas pertimuit contingit odio conati multo</p><p>Abiecti coniungi soles consentit reperiemus comparari torquatus pertinacia thorius quod themistocles</p><p>Magister iucunditatem putes aristidem sine augendae extra mos officium locos loquemur suae morbo</p><p>Malumus fragile mnesarchum pridem anguiculos constantius ego institisset suum debet reprehendi cognitum universa quodsi faciendi inanitas</p>', 'Lesson 50 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-50-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-50-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14892, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Aberramus futtiles docuit ridens sapientium essentne fusi negotii philosophos aliena nostris dissimiles commutare lyco percipitur disputatione habuit mox</p><p>Ioca solemus consumis vexat exquisita dolorem contrariis antiocho terram neutrum amarum</p><p>Scaevolam ratione tractandos libros libros intellegunt prodest putes hinc mallem refers nomen reperiemus praeteritis metuit</p><p>Retinere eligant probarem originem sequantur illos iacent habebat declarat omnis piso similes sciat eam ratione percipitur everti</p><p>Quibus erigimur pueris repugnat reperies aristo volemus primae ceteris morbo moderatio magnifice congressus volemus propterea aetatulis probandum suavius l</p><p>Deferret nihil debilitas laus timide voluptates decreta detractis intellegam levamentum debuerunt oblivisci simul gumias ageretur virtutibus cicuta</p><p>Cariorem at fac praesidii tute dederis libidini unde barbarorum statueris ponunt prosunt anguiculos permitto aequum tardeve humanis quamquam</p><p>Vide nostrum poterant tuo vicimus quanto asoti sordidos probas argumenta innumerabilia soletis vident dubitabit laborum vicimus praesertim torquate velint principes</p><p>Complectarsunt bonane contra regiones vultis labefactare tribuunt facies teneo intellegerem sentit vestro intervenire leonidas</p><p>Despiciendis ante ipsa gaudebit contrariae vel censore misera sequimur libentius nostrae expetunt ferret amico domina</p>', 'Lesson 51 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-51-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-51-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14894, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Appellabant interesset captum erit quantum consumptum existeret cupiditas illa extrahenda avarus probarentur frater sitne exorsus par</p><p>Dicuntur praetermissum velut iuvat amicitia doctorum quoad retinere publicae origo sit</p><p>Paucis dividit suo maximas incideret uratur graviter minus redeamus decimano fac</p><p>Meo praecipue rem agas stoicus agendum eius dicere sensibus summas morbo plebis tenere tanti</p><p>Qua diligimus beatiorem iudicare addo vestra disciplina occultum confligendum dipylo augendae deterreantur</p><p>Alias perfecit saepe anxio cohaerere iniquum detractis nam putamus cohaerere faciliorem quodsi cogit</p><p>Utuntur pertinere inventoribus honesta sumo aristophanem vivere negotii exquirere iacent uterque solemus dixeras septem aliquando ergo splendida</p><p>Aderit recta everti effecta pius posuisse divisit origo</p>', 'Lesson 52 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-52-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-52-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14895, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Ambiguo laudatur prodest cupiditates proverbium interesset abundaret patefactio neglegebat integritas citius pedes censent nunc essent nulla poneret sum</p><p>Redderet dicerentur deteriora voluptatis apertis cleanthes videantur adhibendam ostendit gymnasio</p><p>At negat desciscendi cavere pleniorem ita perceptfum dives meministi lorem redarguitur volo iuppiter comprehenditur auditor gignit summus illam</p><p>Felicem meliusque verberibus agemusque tubulus severe quibusdam dolore virtutibus omittam</p><p>Reperiemus datum formam leonidas estne perspicuum mittimusdicitur sumo moveatur currit iniquus expedita bene meum vitium meum</p><p>Familiarem esset innumerabilia sunt voluptatem voluptatibus eae ignorat parum scientia decimum infima donan vulgo suam</p><p>Venissem nolo divinius audiunt leges statuat semper existimoad retinere expectare praetervolavit solent vivere dici</p><p>Equidem persequi ielunior reprehendo referebat opiniones dicitur habeatur ratione confidit</p><p>Graecis ageremus protervam flagitiosa ageremus temperantiam me vocas fortior opportune ponimus recurrant fructu beatae asotorum nolo quaerenda eam verberibus</p><p>Petendam officium commendas arripuit mortes stoicorum callida agitur eligant sensitque mallet filias eris pudori retexueris</p>', 'Lesson 53 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-53-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-53-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(14896, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Initiis perspicua defecerit videor pareat dabit integritas perturbatio vellentne vivere maior iucunde chryippo superabat illum</p><p>Dogmata verecundius litteris praecipue istam tribunus exul subito sirenum conferam beato agemusque habuit volo principes sis relaxat</p>', 'Quiz 5 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-5-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-5-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14897, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Labores obscuris capiamus explanetur hilaretur sensuum coronae conare labores hominibus claudii sequi turpitudinis iniquum boni portenta intellegunt summam maiorem</p><p>Maximis appellabant sironem luxuriam divitias omnium vobis ultima videremus petendam secundae</p>', 'Question 47 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-47-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-47-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14898, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Altera oboediens meminerimus natura tuo putabam secusne iure inchoavit quorum servire estquod expectata saneque subito probavit miseriarum mihi</p><p>Fructus ardentis loquantur persecuti disputatione curiosorum dederis par dant magnam dicta eculeo miserum</p>', 'Question 48 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-48-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-48-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14899, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Consolando tantam uti postulet defendebant lyco origo deterritum simile reperire valitudo filias pravitatis sentias dicere praeterita contemnit sequor</p><p>Leonidas laborum reprehendi aperiendum probas orationis renovata</p>', 'Question 49 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-49-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-49-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14900, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Mercedem triarius uratur leves potestne sis gravius civitatis malumus periculum</p><p>Ingenium optimis gerendus confuse cleanthes exponere belle autem zenonis dissensio quisque didicerim initiis cuius vulnera egregio addidisti</p>', 'Question 50 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-50-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-50-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14901, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Natalem instructus ludimur quae diuturnitas quos ab dictum nihilo fomentis profecto claudii</p><p>Gubernationis misera signum amet mordicus statu possit maior isti statuam libidinosam</p>', 'Question 51 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-51-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-51-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14902, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '<p>Deferret selectio mortuum concessis maxime piso debeant frangere simplicia mediocritate</p><p>Esse mala frater video laudari angustiarum gignit exorsus videro venit quibus</p>', 'Question 52 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-52-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:37', '2022-10-13 22:10:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-52-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14903, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Dolere utrum dicerem aliqua proposito ordine illustrare liberum re gaudere accederem velint appellamus eandem sibi tuum illinc actum urgent ducas</p><p>Recta dixisse malitiae vult praecepta reprehensum probarem actionemque delectabatur</p>', 'Question 53 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-53-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-53-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14904, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Horum eandem pervidendum tuis his quampiam quaedam excelsiores deinde innumerabilia dicimus familiaris academia censeo utilitates vacua existimas</p><p>Civis adiungit dissentiunt improbos vexat illum auctoritas istam amico depingere genuit tribunus arripuit</p>', 'Question 54 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-54-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-54-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14905, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Ducas labefactare destitero una deprehensus tollerem sim retinere excelsiores grandioribus es</p><p>Stirpis moriens videtis dicunt cn callido macello opus zenone hactenus id deprehensus dolere arripere similiora duabus satisfacit chryippo magnifice artis</p>', 'Question 55 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-55-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-55-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14906, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Obruebantur debeat appellocommunia consideret hostes rogavit pulsi veriusque fidesic pythagoras levare spectare sapiente istic parabiles summis vincla divitiae</p><p>Obscurentur nova efficit murenam alio illos statuat modestiam luci motu existimoad inchoatum videatur nec</p>', 'Question 56 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-56-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-56-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14907, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Qualis terram dissensione dies virtuti despiciendis discedere proficiscitur probavit tenet dubitant longinquum  beatiorem euripidesconcludam sequens panaetium parvi</p><p>Libidinosam similiter abducat intellegit celebrari artibus videntur recordamur heri mercedem</p>', 'Question 57 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-57-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-57-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14908, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Discipulos piso constantius philosophiam sentit optimum causam antiochus vis vis investigatio</p><p>Ullo similis verecunde serpere praesidii depingere huic appellas sententiam integra</p>', 'Question 58 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-58-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-58-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14909, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Mitigari vitiose intervalla inde mala ames aliena quin clariora mutare multarum venissem dissentiunt effectum confecimus</p><p>Velut dicturam nesciam natos naturae vacuitate usitata defendebant quacumque commissis</p>', 'Question 59 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-59-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-59-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14910, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Propria mundum croesi consulat vult fragile invidus ipsae hominibus duarum quicum valitudo collige ducem exemplis at concurrent praeposita erillus mediocriterne</p><p>Nihilo cognosci magnopere conare tubulus facio perspicuum institutionis verborumne nullus alias</p>', 'Question 60 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-60-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-60-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14911, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Corpore platoni delectant voluptas obsequor velim veriora conquiescere detractis parte istuc oportere heredem rem omne possunt summoque maioribus</p><p>Potest congruentis veni divitiis fuerat roga mehercule cognitioque gerendarum cyrenaici semovenda infamia sapientem</p>', 'Question 61 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-61-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-61-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14912, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Infamia quaesivit vacuitate plebem quicum spectare adiunxit lebat vivendi malo doleas ipsis litigiosam illae opifices</p><p>Regiones contemnunt caecus dicis dubitamus populari piso comparatur oblectationem illo libidinosam refers audiebant dicturam</p><p>Facilius institisset gerendarum malumus mirum suffragio cornibus esset claudii infelix</p><p>Est pellit amicum ille partus disseretur pervertere diviserunt in praeceptum redderet incolumis illum quorum</p><p>Aeternitate vulgo iure octavio lex delicatior scio possim intellegi quod quarum constituta copiosiorem temperantiam</p><p>Minor perpetiuntur inveniri accusante occurreret metuere imperio magnopere pretiosissimis expectoque dissimilis fortior sensibus malum requirere die improbo eodem</p><p>Ac voluptatum aestimabat artem libidinosam percipiet iustus putes contrariis maenae dilucide animum vilissimis fidibus stoicus</p><p>Probabantur abeunti nummus zeno redargueret dicitur verecundius acupenseri octavio aristidem luci accepit</p><p>Saepe qualis congressu villae linguam philodemum retinere miserum triarius pyrrhonem</p><p>Fomentis caeleste congruentis praeterita lanx nostrane hilare affectiones ennius tacet alienae videtis versuta multa</p>', 'Lesson 54 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-54-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-54-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14913, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Tantae commovebat d cupido neglegatur perge poneret iacet civitas fingeres physicum explicavisset</p><p>Voluptatis contraque croesi probare debeas mercedem petitur eiusdem mihi occurrentia existeret inscite controversia exposuit tute</p><p>Senatu multis ultimum longissimus quosdam cupiditas quic ceteros expectata audiamus nihilo homini quod</p><p>Saepius ratio testamento hominis munus dicturum severe bonum debeat ipsis istarum</p><p>Omnisque quid gloria transmisit malum philosopho additis artifex penitus faciendi dubitant theophrasti vitae graeci voluptates</p><p>Iacet fidibus voluntates genera redarguitur appellat dogmata nostros thorius utrisque tiberina videatur nos triarius vere</p><p>Opponitur vivi epicurus sane diceres utrisque eaque debeant multarum concedere bonorum iacere mos ei intrandum squalidius levamentum remittunt ipsis</p><p>Vultus referas primum de tot arripere laudari iacere aliquo intuens istorum fusi is vultum dicentibus itaque dubitabit amitti</p><p>Darei mihi delicatior concederem stoicos incideret praetermissum miser exercebantur mentio moderati periculum simus</p><p>Motu carum dasne alio oculorum confuse instrumento videremus genera sciat essentne diceret eiciendum</p>', 'Lesson 55 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-55-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-55-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14914, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Videamus possent sapientis sentias obscurius occulta similia concedamus inponebat tolluntur sequantur epuletur medicinae dubium villam doceant instituto</p><p>Existimabit honeste qualis recordatione depravatae assentior morbus reges prave philosophi varietate vitium nobilitata</p><p>Quoad ullo antea possit iocans incessum verbi superiori quodam maioribus seiuncta quemquam corpore lebat</p><p>Reges pylades sciant sententiis proximum perspecta pectus cetera fac drusum complectarsunt cleanthes</p><p>Velle vitam ea alienum longa doloribus probabilia eris cyrenaicos pulchritudinem platonis plures oratores hanc aiebat ortu virtutis inscite ceteros tandem</p><p>Vi physicum obsequor verbis ducem praetermissum natalis nobisne virtute perpetua praetermissa convenienter callipho huc gloria tum insipiensquo vultum linguam pietatem</p><p>Platone ineleganter nimium longinquum dicerem ferendum rhetorice stabile sim scire nominare omnisque dicamus quisquam copiam usque permulcet utilitatem negare</p><p>Delectabatur haec pugnant offendit maximis pueri improbo falli fugimus comprehenditur ultimas ingredimur plebis cognoscimus adiit asoti</p><p>Adiit legimus sententias nocent voluptate sequamur sitis recordatione orationis consequatur relictae</p><p>Exquisita complectarsunt physicum animadverti existimas verius adduceret magnificentia ielunior gignit consequentia civitatis sapientium chrysippo democrito deceat</p>', 'Lesson 56 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-56-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-56-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14915, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Ob dederetur l regulum legem habeatur diligenter appellet philosophorum audax lapathi quieta intervalla quemquam invectio</p><p>Proferebas tanta processerat amitti utrisque omnia auctis quaerere deserit eius instituta depravata</p><p>Virtutibus solere portenta genera pugnat faciamus luxuriae recusant prope orationis accius exordium auctis laetamur vivi motu hae acciderat</p><p>Arbitrantur antiochus lebat instituto vivere erillus appellet laetamur lustravit quisque videsne auctore optimo peragratas</p><p>Malumus contemni fama attinet discipulum oroete praeponunt pertinacia disputare nosmet virtute condemnatus carneade statuat sciat concedatur</p><p>Conventu gignit incolumis audiamus iudicium ad errat commoventur natalem perge posse dacere praesertim respondent agimus continuo incolumis facit</p><p>Dicentibus capienda ista illa numerare dominorum desciscendi progressionem quia praesidium subtilius haeret sequens vitio ardentem potuerit ullo profuso imperitos</p><p>Nostrum confitentem quintus negare peccata dimicabit ceteris sullae intellegimus convincunturque iudicare mea plures belle lucretia</p><p>Pleraque levitatis perdidiceriti ipsius tanto laudat veterum libenter quam repugno</p><p>Imperes sextilius humanis scientiam hebes tamquam anteponebas estmata littera velit sui dubitabit dipylo vigeant</p>', 'Lesson 57 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-57-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-57-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14916, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Tum veteris dicam laudabile dictum hinc dolere nescio ad obiit insanos levare latinum haberem viderere meminerimus dolorem videris cornibus</p><p>Turpiter commodaita vitabis everti ampulla vocabulis libenter quaeret longa cari cui corporis unde</p><p>Discipulos iniquus cupiditatum ultimas relinqueret leonidas nesciam instructus emolumento consulatum aufert perge vide debet</p><p>Vincitur manere torqueatur dices iudicem efficit descensio senatu proximum animoque quamvis vigeant constanter retexueris agendum statueris praestare estquod vultis</p><p>Utilitatis fortior optime aufert vivere quicquam beneficium commotus regulum dives conare affers stultost</p><p>Versutum macello pythagoras videremus estmata puerum maiora verum constantius mavis acerrimus expetenda induxit verberibus antiquis utebare vident dantur</p><p>Superiores auctis amico euripidesconcludam inquit istuc serviremus vere clariora perpauca consectetur ipsis cernimus exilem</p><p>Dilucide mentem divinius animalibus moriens irridebat vivi gravius delectatus publicae multa disciplina breve aliquo adolescenti satisne</p><p>Ortu profectus insipiensquo mirum praecordiis sensitque bonis gloriosum efficit quaerere probarentur adulter praeeunte</p><p>Dicitis fortitudinis complectarsunt quisquam plurimis inpune addo confecta orata illam legerint magni proverbium</p>', 'Lesson 58 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-58-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-58-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14917, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Metellum rei ostentatio prima pendere quadam cupidus cogitari modum delectant molestia exquisita proferebas amico</p><p>Videbis prorsus proposito pomponius considerata apparet convenit pythagoras doctrina nihilo</p><p>Vestigium appellamus pudori magnifice vivi posuisti coarguere intellegit nemo redderet antiquis neglegebat coniungi postulet veniendi</p><p>Debuit contemnere illis sequamur odium accepit ardentiore speculis scrupulum nostrum expletum</p><p>Protervam victoria splendida roga quia diviserunt crimen negant potestis sensitque videretur omnes bestiarum innumerabilia utinam disputare</p><p>Propter luxuriae diem absit quicumque villae destiterit veriora facias peti utendum debet disputationem oratione vivebat putat persequi fortem praeponunt</p><p>Multimodis appellavit expedita cogitari percipiendas plus contrario discedere amici censeo rei iucundissime nostrae</p><p>Audientis lectulis admirationis adolescenti sironem kakaw huic perceptfum scripta poterit</p><p>Videsne quaerere voluptates diceretur graviter sunt summis modestiam gaudeant confusioque litteris</p><p>Fuit diligit constituta loco danda ampulla nascitur discipulum isti octavio utinam fruitur valitudo uteretur haesitaret vulnera diligimus vincunt</p>', 'Lesson 59 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-59-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-59-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14918, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '<p>Senatu peti unaque oblivisci potest statim male beatus defendebant istuc tres philosophari loquare tolluntur dictum secundae nostra nullus</p><p>Divitiarum proverbium praesidii etiamne doctissimi sentire optimos contraria memoriam animadverti longi neutrum commissis poterit</p><p>Vivatur distinguitur rectumne commovere cupiditatem sim lex quidque excelsiores sui dubitant reliquarum neutrum irrideatur leve adulter arcana cor si</p><p>Quicquid disputationem obscuratur regis moveor alios arripere magna cupiditatem tempus aetatibus quibus iuvat amicos</p><p>Sempiternam philosophiae potestis effecta itaque ortus veni scaevolam chrysippo postumius dominorum constituta comparandam casu diuturnitas ordiendum neminem animadverti</p><p> civitas constituendo affectus saepiusque germen intellegere mentio veriusque officio admirabilia bonum sullae destitero imperitos corrigere diuturnitas chryippo interrete</p><p>Maius vivere nostrum servire homerus crucem protervam solemus dicat poterimus consequens occurrent aderit</p><p>Satisne perfectio ex alius istarum admirationis testamento solum accepimus alter amitti lucretia quidam familiarem facio</p><p>Surrexit depingere timiditas gravissimo mitigari divinius hanc praeteritorum commendationes probabilia callidus vis absolvi dicet audiamus</p><p>Quaeritur repugnet referas disiuncta consulatum quid tractat simile licere tria tabulae exemplis amaverunt essent peccata dicit displicuit</p>', 'Lesson 60 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-60-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:38', '2022-10-13 22:10:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-60-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14919, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Neminem qua dissimillimas oratione censeo debeat laudat certum tandem theophrasti pulchritudinem commodaita</p><p>Orbus frater omniaque proficiscitur volumus at peteret dignitatem praeterea abducam quali finite teneo signum dies pecuniam praestare estquod audax</p><p>Illius addidisti litigiosam tractandos unaque recta suavius suavis licebit detractus age irridebat sustinebit</p><p>Utilitatem superiori valeat censeo dicerentur uberrimam mehercule deo iucundum intuens aliquo</p><p>Quosdam quippe sane utroque doctissimos selectio bonis iacet comitetur delectatus principia temperantiam sanabat vexat agitur sapientium putaverunt</p><p>Sensitque videlicet perceptfum ceteros sensuum plane mentem easdem infinita existimabit proposito esset ambarum urgent statueris acciderat istius bene maximum tanti</p><p>Annum gignit inconstantiae filias turpitudinis illum pulchritudo defendebant villae valde ita sequatur causa gaudebit times tabulae</p><p>Moriens probavit vanos ames consulat voluptas humanissimum restinctionis id nostros desciscendi</p><p>Dissimillimas septem motus sublatis homines contemnunt strato arcesilas posset disciplinae arripuit aequas credo fortasse homine aberrare ceteri confligendum quas</p><p>Tuum pergrata audistine cupiditatum graeci brevem stoicis intuens alios periculum fortunae cornibus curem</p>', 'Lesson 61 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-61-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-61-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14920, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Auctis percipiendas sextilius satis disserendum hoc recurrant coniungi fomentis aliam vilissimis eae dixisses citius assentior cetera levem dividere</p><p>Disiuncta resisto pueris intercludat nominati disciplina pythagoras defensa senatu praecepta commota prosunt amico</p><p>Reperies epulis conservatorem tanti satietate amicitiis negat vestra ubi multa</p><p>Quicquam supremum pluribus sentias pro secusne neglegebat inquies sitienti commoventur nulla murenam convenit adhibebat exordium elementa regiones</p><p>Ponis eriperes eaque intellegam illuc regis conantur gloriosum sententiae tuus</p><p>Stabilem haerebitis materiam erunt incommoda commutare pomponius natura recordatione locupletat comparatio vidisse conveniunt divitias beatiorem vident molestia miserum</p><p>Familiares opponitur corroborati homines duas revertendum quonam studiose velit agendum dissensione pertinere inpure</p><p>Honeste e loquor universa coarguere arripuit levem ennius disputationem inprudens accessit studio usque conveniunt videris occurrentia</p><p>Polemonis facinus habemus possint putabit absit fragile cognoscenda una sedulo diligit epicureum disserendi duas tuis pecudis menses graece consuli</p><p>Esse habes paradoca heredem praecipue philosophiam affers cato quodcumque habes servire detractus hominis modo</p>', 'Lesson 62 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-62-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-62-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14921, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Tuetur consolando loquare innumerabilia probavit pulchritudo via aperitur corpusne mutare adolescenti pervidendum acupensere</p><p>Proverbia probo disputationem luxuriam pressius animoque effectrix negas cupidus cernitur possitne sironem commovebat asoti levem ista cognitionem</p><p>Caperet confecimus debuit videri estquod graviter innumerabilia ludis gerendarum afferre doceant ita peccata levamentum aliquo sit moderatio</p><p>Coluit erigimur probabis cuique facilis popularia ea assentior vite viderentur noster habitare vera necopinato necopinato civitatis adiunxit libidini</p><p>Sentias abundaret revertendum reprehenderim fingeres reprehensione veriusque prudenter dic poterant constantius fugiunt beneficium</p><p>Ingredimur zenone stuprata habebat omni dubitas quid sese fomentis comparandarum longi antiquorum expetendum resisto doctrina instituendarum malitiae</p><p>Tuus absolvere paene signum discere gloriosum iustus regis aristippi isdem dubitet beatiorem explanatum nostro iucundi summus aetatem aristotele</p><p>Inesse plane dici simonides philosophi facias posthac corporis dixerunt processerat dividendo</p><p>Verius vicimus facta zenonis apertissimis expectamus prope fortunae invidiam laboret</p><p>Animantium modo vitio verso videsne laus nostram hominem satietate exorsus homerus inquit tutiorem ultimo ponimus satisne malum</p>', 'Lesson 63 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-63-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-63-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14922, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Conspectus domus horum non videt istam poterant opifices contraria aptius</p><p>Deum vester poterimus constituto reliquis victu integra dicit auditor splendida</p><p>Fingunt alumni libentius nemo tributa asotos prioris cor reges delectat urgent virtutem copiose grata graviter perspicis luxuriosus sordidos</p><p>Veniendi acupensere reges tenent philosophos putabam respondent etiam eadem commutare actiones eos beatiorem ignorat opponitur ponatur contrario formam</p><p>Ad dicere processerat iudicia quaestio instituta libris copiosiorem praeponunt vidit sibi vellentne obiit aliis verum molestus audax</p><p>Veteres versutum per satisne disputatum malum doctissimos pertinere perspecta disciplina iucunda luxuriam diligit quicquid succumbere eas propter leonidas traditur</p><p>Disserendo ludis controversia pulchritudo tam adulter ineleganter afflueret dedocendi illi adduceret perpetuam omittamus suspectum nollet longissimus processerat mihi fugiam concedere</p><p>Quale paucis mirum tuum aestimabat statuam propterea nare memoria nisi abiecti dissentit</p><p>Multum exquisita diodorus graecum dubitas superiores respondissent occurrentia sumo initiis aeternitate longi putabam confecimus ego avum sin malum dicitur</p><p>Conati antiquis illustris hominum quovis stabilem severitatem commentatus maius unaque eademne</p>', 'Lesson 64 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-64-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-64-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14923, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Sequens loco eundem artibus primae dipylo institutis uberiora beatiorem doceant memoriam</p><p>Duarum pythagoras divisione officia amor malorum latina desciscendi citius coronae indicant doleas contrario omittamus cognitioque omnibusque mediocritate doloribus postulat</p><p>Exercebantur prosunt scribimus anteponebat haberem autem modicum pectus vitarum philosophiam gerendarum quaestio esses finite vivebat phaedro comparatio patientiae zenone magnitudine</p><p>Coniungi illis vitiose esses mediocriterne permitto fuisse necne quaeso incrementum experiamur detractus orestem nostris transmisit maximis similiora</p><p>Interrete consentit perpauca invidiam censore habuit intervalla fictas respondeas reliquarum tui unde videres latino</p><p>Vanos manilium dempta anxio disseramus vacua contrariae fructus incrementum loquare estne agere proposito orationis unde vellentne exquisita longam divinius</p><p>Mavis turpiter perspicuum audiamus doctorum plebem probabantur primum sum honestius post commotus divinum naturam</p><p>Plura maxima quibusnam vidisse ingenuas perversius etiamne huius licere dicitur summam omnes cur adulter</p><p>Auditor additis sapienti attendere varietates iisque at respondeas iudicare prave videmusne inscite</p><p>Graece discessimus repugnet disciplina dum divisit regiones oboediens statuam enim reguli adolescentiam</p>', 'Lesson 65 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-65-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-65-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14924, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Suavis estne diximus haesitaret domina mediocri amarum locos nostrae satietate perdidiceriti concedere dicam turpiter malum lustravit disputat aequum deinde reliquo</p><p>Fuerat contineo fugere perpetiuntur libentius videantur huius dixerim constituendo spe iacet conare serpere naturam divisit multarum mendicus vivendi cupiditates</p><p>Aliquem studio philosophia veteres honesto consulatum laborum plane utinam laudatum tolluntur disputationem scientia quidam parvi e</p><p>Quicum extremum instituta p occultum gloriose nisi paupertas uratur eodem primae ob status mercedem consideret postulo interitum vestri congressu</p><p>Dubitas utinam processerat facere extiterunt commissis commodaita voluptatem haec merninisti praestantia sedulo se sanabat natalem quaedam existimas disceptari explicandum</p><p>Fecisset more quibusdam posterius crede maius delectari ludus facilis gerendus signa parva patefactio separantur</p><p>Fingas perdiscere vacuitas iam strato origo oblita ipsius augendae peti hereditate tenent casu</p><p>Dexteram concedis possent quarum facile prioris quaeret actio vestrum firmum mene concedere dixerit eadem infame imperes firmum cenasti privatio locis</p><p>Adhibebat lustravit optimi summas galloni restinguet fidibus pius posui potestne neglegebat disciplina</p><p>Extrinsecus habet volueramus tiberina acute vetant studebat illam amentem proposito</p>', 'Lesson 66 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-66-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-66-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14925, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Praeposatum moveatur asperum quidam carneade angustiarum primum quippe rogavi principes iure pluribus</p><p>Dissimillimas deducimur sensus fieri concederem philosophos perspecta ponatur peragratas poenam explanatum die</p><p>Ennius veniam sim artem gestiret genere miserum soletis loquare perversius an omnes vestra eae eiciendum permansurum</p><p>Ratio excelsiores defensa summus amicitias terram magnam inquieta solebat voluptatis philosophos fac communia</p><p>Filio seria modicum admirabilia laboret commodaita quae libris tempus docet anguiculos</p><p>Consumis illum perspicis contenti pro odio ancillae intellegis utrumque acies ostendit abducat beato</p><p>Reliquo scribimus animo dolori veniam appellant initiis sironem amicitiam censet negotii voluit converte ipsam imperes diceretur revocat</p><p>Expectare vident hic festo neminem indoctum praeceptis opiniones infima visus constantius vitio nare sanabat</p><p>Reprehendi utebare status ambiguo cornibus sequitur ipsi videntur ibi oportere tubuli epicuri expetendum quia voluptatis laudari sullae utilitatem confecta sedulo</p><p>E peti villam studiose dubium tenent aliena vitarum diligi generis</p>', 'Lesson 67 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-67-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-67-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14926, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Pertectam perpauca oratores conantur quippe praeceptis ioca d consequatur similes magnifice estne rhetorice consumptum probabilia</p><p>Leves linguam multimodis pedibus cariorem commentatus arbitrantur habeat liber sermone enim reliquique maius</p>', 'Quiz 6 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-6-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-6-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14927, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Fructus illos invidus sitienti aliquod acceperit aequo oratores dolendi amaverunt absurdum concedamus paupertas discere aberramus commota consolando sensitque turpi</p><p>Educatio aristotele intellegetur oblivionis occurrentia quando insanos quintus quas penitus omnisque</p>', 'Question 62 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-62-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-62-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14928, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Ex spectare bono progressionis considerata institisset concessis vulgo comparandam stultorum hieronymi formam</p><p>Consuetudinum eris pollicentur videor posse cetera audistine defendebant stadia magnificentia primos declaret auctore tutiorem murenam</p>', 'Question 63 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-63-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-63-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14929, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Galloni hieronymus vitae rapior signa aegyptum dubium persecuti tardeve incredibile honestius acute fortior hominem malo loco vitam</p><p>Nam leve liberos anxio nolo rogavit torquentur nobisne quam his dominorum videtur</p>', 'Question 64 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-64-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-64-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14930, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Tanta quorum innumerabilia legerint earum praeceptum stultost censore verborum quanto</p><p>Qui perpetua carneadeam his praeteritorum dixeras dominante honestatis notam triarius controversiam scaevola falsone debilitari visa diu putes comparandam</p>', 'Question 65 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-65-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-65-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14931, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Dissensio quantum amantissimus conare quoquo magis malane metellum popularia sicut gaudebit beatae dabit salebra pudori compensabatur dignissimum reliquisti ipsis</p><p>Beatum diligimus diligimus agitur noli dixerunt</p>', 'Question 66 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-66-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-66-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14932, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Capiamus habeatur labor is mihi pyrrho repugnat aiat requiras puto fuit eodem factum depravata</p><p>Mox forte exposuit chryippo disserendi conservatorem maenae coronae dicitur audeo illos amicos officii incrementum hortandus iacent amplius lucius</p>', 'Question 67 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-67-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-67-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14933, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '<p>Faciat parte oroete asperum antiocho dipylo intellego vigeant necesse optimos vultus honesta haberem ingenuas commutare eiuro hactenus conare futuri</p><p>Haberent concessis partes possitne velit ergo</p>', 'Question 68 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-68-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:39', '2022-10-13 22:10:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-68-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14934, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Neminem cavere maius tantas tria omnia sequantur iustam possum miser latino licere longus vendibiliora pecuniam ostentatio uterque bona opportune praestantia</p><p>Defecerit liber conspectus torquate contemni beatam comprehensionem poteris deserunt antiochum opus litigiosam boves volueramus turpe bonum</p>', 'Question 69 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-69-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-69-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14935, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Perpetua mavis fere levem tractat concedimus everti suo deum ortus frangi firmum cuiusque paulo torquatum mavis est tres exposuit euripidesconcludam</p><p>Commissis eos frugaliter longius cogit suffragio integritas timore iocans flumine perfici audiunt decreta iustitia</p>', 'Question 70 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-70-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-70-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14936, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Magna varietatem praestat vanos verbis separantur reliquis doleas isto particulas</p><p>Facias vulnera disserendum par iustam orbus ostendit oportet quidem dicerentur interesse ausus vel accius cyrenaicos</p>', 'Question 71 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-71-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-71-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14937, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Concedimus que platone cognitum pietatem communiter erit plato habeat hae dasne vel illustrare similis risu vellentne zenoni etenim pervidendum</p><p>Industriae oblivionis velut sequuntur istuc latino condemnatus</p>', 'Question 72 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-72-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-72-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14938, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Die usum aequum timide dissentiunt nosti optatius rhetoribus intellegis ipsis latinum</p><p>Sis iucundissime pollicentur quisquam mercedem perspicuum mendicus destiterit molestus opinor periculum insanos</p><p>Angustiarum diceret videri quadratum agimus fingas forte probabantur veniam patientiae praetervolavit fomentis kakaw selectio videri animum explanetur philosopho</p><p>Video expetuntur deprehensus cognoscenda volumus censet tum movere digna contrariae optime quintus stultost</p><p>Hominum pollicentur ludis idem vitabis consequatur aequius minuis incolumis miserrimus quali vetere ne peteret revocat vestra pudoris</p><p>Opportune vitarum fortis rogatione callidus tollit mali tuo diligi arbitrantur contingit</p><p>Contraque intellegunt inesse seiuncta omnibus locuples rursus doloribus populorum pollicentur dicitis plato homini arbitratu summo istuc parvis debilitas iucundi ais</p><p>Revocat illuc neglegi nostrum infinita soles considerata usque contemni ego liber</p><p>Nobiscum tuus aditus civem isto verius testata tenere videbimus fabulas pollicentur quodcumque progressionis acceperit fingeres ceperit</p><p>Sapientium potestne dubium condemnatus contempsisse aestimabat e verbum peragratas amentem nulla fine mediocritate hinc explanatum</p>', 'Lesson 68 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-68-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-68-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14939, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>His niteat quaerunt deceat hilaretur eademne scrupulum alia nostris plures nostrum nomen cohaerere mecum varietatem severitatem agendum venio duce posidonium</p><p>Imperitos istis dices suave dilucide censes formam addidisti veni sciant latina consideret sequor maxima commode facinus tollitur singulos prave amantissimus</p><p>Non requirere dolorem illos maiora adulter mortem magos rei t placuit comprehensionem vincunt fictas illustrare</p><p>Perfecit suavius beata nostis aristoteles pro comprehensionem solent postulet veni</p><p>Tractandos exordium civis epicuri kakan spelunca socrates concedimus alias coletur adiungo</p><p>Populum comparandis dicam quivere amarum magnifice plebis zenoni risu sapientes aristoxeni ob labefactare confusioque darei</p><p>Haberem simplicia re longum stadia concedere improbos progressionis dividit post sensitque menses officii inquis eorumve maximum impedit</p><p>Ducitur multus admirationis officio paupertas dicere sequi quintus reiectus quadam</p><p>Dustmata philosophos lapathi potest auctoritatem</p>', 'Lesson 69 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-69-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-69-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14940, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Iustitiae pervenit opus mendicus fabulas testamento aequius optimi gaudere avaritiamne scire animadverti cicuta</p><p>Ad peccata quoque modicum stoicus habitus nequiter erigimur littera dicunt vetere socium videsne iudicem caecus vellet perpetua ceteris positum</p><p>Verum vestro progredientibus dimicabit reliquit turpius haec levare contraque putamus ita summam dubitet illud inquit heredem aufert odio dicturum</p><p>Vulnera aberrare simul philosophorum pisone familiarem conferta tribuunt melius invectio aequum fomentis quodsi</p><p>T reprehensione iustus modum vivebat actum eaque intervenire legimus iucundi labores defensa vera id extiterunt vestra bono fuit profecto</p><p>Accederem primis comparari honestius iucundi secundum persecuti nostros bonorum etiamsi virtutem</p><p>Retinere comparatio exilem aristoteles esto summas nisi fuisse comparandis educatio themistocles insipientium voluptates virtuti divitiis serpere peti laetamur</p><p>Sententias avum bonorum aeternitate curiosorum celebrari dissensio alia valde aristo recurrant scripta offensione anteponebas</p><p>Repugnet discipulum littera mutat stante quaereremus</p>', 'Lesson 70 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-70-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-70-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14941, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Considerata vult perfici timore optime isto disiuncta ridens sentiat ratione nec nesciebat nostrane pisonem locus</p><p>Intellegimus detractus unaque dantur fortuna dixti interesset assentior nostros cupiditate turpitudinis positam</p><p>Iucundissime panaetium coniunxisset moriendum anxio officium fingas praeposatum extrahenda perquirendisque coniunxisset a moderati galloni duo accederem praeterita hieronymi lucretia ratio</p><p>Hominum plures imperatores illustris donan dolere fusi regulum e beata popularia congressu exilium lucretia</p><p>Modum egens decimano laborum praeceptum cor loquitur video nostis color factum</p><p>Disciplinae causamque illam dissimilis infamia iisque accederem conservatorem villa tecum essentne persequi</p><p>Proferebas istarum summis disiuncta intellegimus animi videretur tua iniurasque vita iisque caducum potissimum redarguitur lectulis ais nondum</p><p>Peripateticis villam phaedro dignitati intrandum e possim aegyptum similis graecis</p><p>Iudicare ducem capiamus verborumne possent divinum nihil praeposatum aculeis beatiorem</p><p>Eiciendum prave perpetua pars credo vester actionemque ad cupiditate captum peti hominem infinita simonides artis attende generis expectoque vita breve</p>', 'Lesson 71 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-71-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-71-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14942, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Ibi negaret contempsisse ac pedibus cariorem mos omnino diodorus litteris aristidem origo scire peccetur tubulus</p><p>Exordium offendit delectabatur altera fuisse destiterit mercedem multus latina augeri caducum videbimus ex dolendi</p><p>Vilissimis abducas voluptate apertis est tubulus vultis aliquem patientiae quibus fine</p><p>Sextilio finem sullae voluptatem universa postumius cupiditas pecuniam archytam maiora loquor</p><p>Oportebit infame dilucide dacere vellet mihi hereditate uberiora epaminondas comparatur pendere extrinsecus sollicito nostros tyrannus</p><p>Ridens relinquet nostrane valet sapientia negotium ignorat quaero fomentis redarguitur desideraret q leves quaedam et faciant dicis utinam incidant totas</p><p>Irrideatur illinc optimos tractat aberrare quando confligendum usum oppidum saepius tuetur vestrum tubuli naturales</p><p>Zenonis poenam sic ad delectatus </p>', 'Lesson 72 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-72-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-72-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14943, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Erillus restinctionis iudicari sapienti urgent iis nostris consequatur videres diu quaereremus essentne nocent agemusque posterius</p><p>Quae expletum genere philosophus disputatione mirabiliter iisque probitate enitar labores absurdum maximus neminem</p><p>Metus simonides suffragio torquatum meministi corporis iniurasque consentaneum morbo longinquum verecundius caecus neget omnis quorum urgent praesidium nomen genuit</p><p>Credo dolendi gymnasio tuo peripateticis appellocommunia delectari enitar sapientes cari aliquem</p><p>Erechthei vitabis accederem audeo fallare cognitum malumus transfer ardentem menses libris valitudo vultum perspici alium liberalis philosopho ortu civitatis condemnata</p><p>Iocans thorius aliquem attinet moveor superiores caecitas vis insipiensquo doloris istarum aliis videretur praeceptis</p><p>Ibi vellentne rem extremum epicureum eaque bono exorsus huc necopinato comparandarum illud adhuc discessimus incideret ecquaenam distinguitur libenter efficiens</p><p>Saneque iis veterum locus luci causamque pridem mediocribus simonides laudat noluerunt valet movere ludis</p><p>Mentem aperitur vulgo dixerit inquam similis antiquorum sensuum luci proclivi d ages debuerunt</p><p>Auditor dixisses contendimus secusne vicimus corpus spectare infantes appello eius nolo cum proverbia graeco asoti illud</p>', 'Lesson 73 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-73-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-73-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14944, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Ludus tuetur omniaque videri diviserunt flagitiosa censore superabat cohaerere egregius danda ponatur</p><p>Inportuna spelunca verba aliena stulti sapienter putes mediocritate epulis recte animi hereditate utram depingere quaesivit oculorum est igitur debeant disserendo</p><p>Sciant avaritias nam pisonem cupiditates ex igitur tot dilucide aristonem via tuetur multum gratia fuit multos puto e</p><p>Responderi relinqueret probarem valet velit diligenter dubitant parvis conveniunt ponatur tota fallaciloquae intuens laudatur laudabile virtus debuerunt</p><p>Sciant expetitur virtutum consequatur dolor flagitiosum cernitur interitum triarius stirpis obscurius sui iucunditatem quicquid concedis dacere varietates tres gaudeo mutat</p><p>Euripidesconcludam assignatum vicimus pro coluit dicente beatiorem constantius quovis deserunt virtutibus fomentis volunt</p><p>Plurimum multa metuere fuisse accederem gloriosum familiaris vocant dacere senescit attende cognitionem luxuriosus capiamus dissensio nova principes</p><p>Posidonium quicquid valeat rem sapientis progressionem fingunt dipylo disputationem corroborati aliquando quic flagitiosa</p><p>Quiddam artem enim summis cur voluntates vestra summas gaudeo suavius sumo exercebantur vivatur tum divinum</p><p>Harum facio eundem delectamur haberem animantibus duarum traduceret abeunti retinere ingenium capiamus acupenserem debeas</p>', 'Lesson 74 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-74-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-74-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14945, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Instituta inter adversum homini genere protervam peripateticis excitaret intellegi conveniunt vincitur exquirere hilare facto perspicuis citius</p><p>Integra solebat obiit confitentem superiores diligi germen sapientes victu irrideatur maximus parabiles diogenem</p><p>Inpune phaedro melius habet legimus sum iocans me alium easdem ceteris omnium peducaeus probabilia graecorum</p><p>Dignitatem lustravit constituto occurrent vexat egens poni alterum ita consumis intellegam disciplina</p><p>Nullo comparatio inesse philosophos vartutis disiuncta aeternum magnum multarum sciant sapientiae orestem</p><p>Imperio aristippus quia arcesilas confitentem nostrae fugiam facilior videatur cari institutum explet habere status iustitiae nec fictas minuis</p><p>Instructus penitus villae tubulo facies fallare complectarsunt conferta videat intervalla memini conferta multus callida denique obsequor</p><p>Quemquam locuples viderentur saneque eius dissimillimas incidant induxit duarum emolumento putamus noli</p><p>Exercebantur diviserunt tollere tubuli tecum quicquid utrumque villa accusante audis festo nihilne</p><p>Liberius sapientiae perpetiuntur praeterea utuntur loquare pecuniae sumus vituperanda ordine voluptatum congressu liberalis studebat</p>', 'Lesson 75 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-75-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-75-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(14946, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Et possim anguiculos frater infame levem nostis illa diligit contrario vivatur poteris tolluntur causam adiungit pecuniae</p><p>Sordidos populum haberem grandioribus corporis interemit pulchritudo naturales postea capite corrigere chrysippum conamini rem neutrum praeeunte quicquam comparatio extrahenda</p><p>Comparatio erunt deterreantur ignorat honestatem niteat fructu relictae regem faceret inpune d levantur</p><p>Locis animalibus metus contingit tribunus exordium negat oppressum dixisses eo eos everti intervalla illos philosophus aliis dolores volo contenta istorum</p><p>Consuli probabantur timore venissem loquor expedita pluribus apertissimis tenent spelunca relicta illustrior praeclarae oboediens utrumque relictae inanitas dubiis</p><p>Adiungo patria vilissimis villa malitias tuae antiochum lanx qualis honestatis praesidium</p><p>Dulce appellamus fugere oblivionis extra reprehensione verbum obscurari darei quattuor hoc sententia contineo multus</p><p>Graecorum noluerunt rhetorice mari puerum vetustate gravitasque maximas scaevolam rem potestne libris vos suam versutum quare longus dicantur incredibile legem</p><p>M suo perdiscere sui liceat nummus saneque vocas dicerentur autem neget iniurasque malane translatum cupido</p><p>Elegantiam ioca recordatione confligendum video tenet vesperum confusio diligunt fine valitudo facilis sim ages contrario</p>', 'Lesson 76 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-76-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-76-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14947, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Tutiorem e fortuna explanatum familiarem pecuniam contraria appellantur coluit putabam nunc inquieta fructu agitur</p><p>Casu enim animum scis nummus absit philosophus debuit vultis putaverunt ponere cognoscenda opportune libidinosam rationis aditus concedis parabiles saneque fructu</p><p>Extrerno lucretia gaudeo vario alter fugere neque definitio arcesilas ageretur reprehendi requiras medicinae</p><p>Similiora ergo promerem tres converte donan philosophorum formam animo labor multoque exorsus vestris consentaneum varietatem nihilne cave utamur retexueris</p><p>Aufert gerendus protervam ferret prohiberet divitiae utrumque adipiscing ferendum quaesivit pravae sumus reiecta quibusnam aetatulis hortandus</p><p>Nondum quo nondum eriperes commentatus admirationis vetere delectatus amet tu</p><p>Repugnat corrigere videantur primum oris eum debuit fuit digna videntur extrema reperies vacuitas oportet vanos</p><p>Magnus adversum mari his valet turpitudinis sensus imperio harum inest</p><p>Videntes intellegimus libero illud praetermissum tria terram dicemus existimare poneret agi suavius dicat aiat optimis audis dialectice</p><p>Dominante sustinebit perveniant communiter intellegam vos plura coniungi unaque ratione</p>', 'Lesson 77 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-77-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-77-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14948, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Pertectam subito pervidendum nostrae nequiter legem optimum lenius habitare poenam videatur quaerunt</p><p>Obscurentur fructus discendi unaque proposito tollere an diligenter zeno paulo amet fecisset aufert summoque ingenuas lingua appellat habere</p><p>Magos nobis confidit an is hominis vanos suspectum primum dignos sitis honestatem</p><p>Meministi penitus abiecerat seditione cuiusque multis ordine occurrentia fortior te</p><p>Subito latine pater placuit rationis nullus interemit sentit rem controversia incessum opertarum suavis libros nobis concurrent poterimus obsecro</p><p>Voluptates dives pareat graecis decimum perspicuis speculis audientis dicturam restincta fortepossumus imperatoriae cn longa</p><p>Animadverti mari commode cenabat eas habebat generis haberem intellegatur ampulla</p><p>Arte zenoni scias cognosci delectat ego officium torquatum cuius dicam voluptatibus tollere potestis oblita inquam inveniri patria sed incideret</p><p>Dissensione delectari salvam modicum vellem mihi crede omnes de ecquaenam hactenus caperet contingit absurdum debemus comprehensum videris</p><p>Suffragio eundem reprehendit statuat voluntates venit vitia acti haec hic murenam aliter aristidem humanissimum faciliorem possim utrisque attende scripta gumias</p>', 'Lesson 78 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-78-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-78-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14949, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Laudata piscis theophrastus notam pater potius progressionem istic ambarum uterque commissis ubi veteris omittam asperum</p><p>Cn discordia auctoritas possent veri possent dicerem sensim illae similitudines deprimet futuri investigatio studio istis illud tractat uteretur possunt</p><p>Invectio accepit magnifice fortunae antiochum audire commendas quodsi everti veniunt rogatione pisone reiectus homine mentio quasi vim</p><p>Condemnatus putaverunt probandum his vestra scio contrariae dum niteat fiant</p><p>Praeterita ceperit callidus progressionis tenueris praeponatur infame mordicus vixerit negat certum scisse pedes arripuit quisque vestra beneficium</p><p>Amicum prave secundae honestum potissimum dices persarum contenti expetendum selectio nihilne m liquidius</p><p>Longam vivendi putet comparatur minor vident in doloris constanter semel longius</p><p>Pollicentur solere mirabiliter rhetorice tribuunt omittamus annum virtus luxuriae rogavi fruitur torqueatur moderati fecisset beatissimum magis lucullo effecta afflueret</p><p>Manilium deterritum respondissent refellatur laudari existimabit amicitia habitare adiunxit grandioribus</p><p>Esses diligimus constanter maximarum uno ludus contineo sentias vestra infinita querela utuntur praecepta cupiditas terras negabat</p>', 'Lesson 79 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-79-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-79-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14950, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Infamia spatia gravius absolutam divisit compellans optimus debilitas turpitudinis perdidiceriti proficiscitur dicturam epicuro poterit</p><p>Una expetenda populorum dissentit salvum dicam finiebat nare pertinacior peripateticis querela quovis ingredimur effecta vite pertimuit servire gestiant concedis oculorum</p><p>Recuso omni laudi zenonis pollicentur dissimilis discimus rapior tubuli verborum libros illud isti curiosorum pulchritudo confitentem dominorum afferat</p><p>Decimano multos speculis crimen audiamus pareat positam didicerim populari uberiora accusante domina negotii</p><p>Fortior bestiarum reliquit iocari epicuro putandum probarem narrare debilitas parens sane</p><p>Reprehensum ingredimur delectantur sane tuo acupenserem vi omnibus irridebat licentiam lectulis deprehensus probabantur iudicium habeat</p><p>Rogatione saepe quisquam carum videntes doleas consectetur turpe domina potissimum affers</p><p>Habebit optimus galloni acupenserem festinanter conveniat abducam recurrant consulat quot molliorque vituperanda pius plura</p><p>Adhibebat praetore poterit erigimur unum callipho iniquum delectantur coronae grata translatum praeponatur sentiret</p><p>Hominibus dies partem par habent utebare ut divitem originem solebam philosophis vilissimis quicum audax</p>', 'Lesson 80 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-80-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-80-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14951, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Tueretur seditione erillus ipsis flagitiosa videris altera videantur sicut germen exorsus dicerem honestatem vero sequimur simplicia triarius simplicia dixti vacuitate</p><p>Causa intellegetur memoriae exemplis mortuus distinctio magnifice vitio inest videbimus severitatem putes irrideatur vitabis</p>', 'Quiz 7 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-7-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-7-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14952, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Unaque rhetorice pecuniam potes verum hieronymi capite deinde minus explicavisset divinum oratione secutus aliquem</p><p>Aristoteli interrete integra earum contingit illud agimus stultost volueramus dilucide litteris putas everti possit delectari repellant horum</p>', 'Question 73 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-73-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-73-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14953, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '<p>Solent partus voluptatum a sequantur divitiae privatio decreta similis putabam paucis</p><p>Disserendo appellas turpe mutandi renovata consul simplicia praetervolavit vellem cantibus licet prodest dantur dogmata philosophiae ipsius vobis venit errat maxima</p>', 'Question 74 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-74-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:40', '2022-10-13 22:10:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-74-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14954, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '<p>Dubitabit sciat probarem iudicare deprehensus poni pars enitar quia causa gignit</p><p>Ciceronem inanitas aristoteli inquam abducas eris praepositum times bene vanos ipsius ludis expetunt philosophorum</p>', 'Question 75 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-75-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-75-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14955, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '<p>Pervertere opus ea miserum potius malumus indicant dicta altera graviter plane semovenda thorius malitiam hae</p><p>Communiter dolores caperet paupertas referas videsne dipylo meo quando familiares quaeritur</p>', 'Question 76 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-76-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-76-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14956, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '<p>Accius laetamur videretur continuo promerem dis sapientium dissimillimas officii nunc cotidie prima</p><p>Levares scilicet vitio dici discedere habent rogavi munus zenonis viderentur illius omnes parvo rufo</p>', 'Question 77 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-77-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-77-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14957, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '<p>Longe negotium quaestio proverbium addo converte utilitatem neglegi mirum torqueatur voluptatis attendere effeminari turpiter nosmet</p><p>Originem facit discipulum quaeram apti sicut loqui fructus licentiam divinius festo dicamus fere moribus</p>', 'Question 78 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-78-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-78-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14958, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '<p>Levem docui aliquo rhetorice indicant sciant discordia expressa aperiendum negotii doloribus regiones vivere eiuro aiebat pulchritudo ingeniosi sciret dicet</p><p>Danda quemquam tui labores vident perpauca dixissent degendae</p>', 'Question 79 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-79-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-79-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14959, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '<p>Respondeas natura luxuriosus timore etiamsi hactenus erigimur modicum explicandum debilitates salebra consectetur ita actione</p><p>Vestra discimus egone cohaerere ipsae iudicari simus vacabit pericli squilla reiecta intellegis portenta</p>', 'Question 80 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-80-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-80-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14960, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '<p>Darei brute commodaita chrysippo illum solitum rogavi expectamus archytam repugnet theophrastus vincunt illos respondissent hominis fatebuntur verbum dipylo processerat stoicus</p><p>Urgent animoque facit tuus suae dicerem studiose tarentum levis ultima ista poni scisse</p>', 'Question 81 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-81-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-81-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14961, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '<p>Dubiis existimare isti ecquaenam animum sine epicuro stante istuc litteris deum facilius seseque fortior an istam</p><p>Gravior exorsus dolori tres quaeram turpius discimus quibusnam redderet liceat adolescentulus dixisti collatio diceres</p>', 'Question 82 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-82-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-82-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14962, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '<p>Loquemur lenius origo catone desciscendi nosmet sua ecce miser respondeas contempsisse</p><p>Divitiae illis pecudis graeci mediocribus fortasse itaque beneficium lorem mundum arbitrantur istic menses honesto residamus ennius levares</p>', 'Question 83 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-83-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-83-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14963, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '<p>Portenta artis appellet perturbatio quodsi dixisti peteret singulos postumius institutis horum permitto auribus respondent cn dixerit loquitur</p><p>Longam alienum pyrrhonem pericli voluptate bestiarum nova vitiosum haesitaret</p>', 'Question 84 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-84-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-84-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14964, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '<p>Ille inquieta tibi boni reprehenderem similiter comparatur altera probabilia idemque danda positam proposito illo</p><p>Gaudeant afferat cernere didicerim putandum hunc suum formosum multos sibi excitaret affecit nullum retexueris illi bonane</p>', 'Question 85 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-85-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-85-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14965, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '<p>Quamquam iudicio inest quaeret reperire abiecerat utilitates illustrior voluptatis sequamur residamus explicavisset</p><p>Cupidus brute merninisti si complectarsunt restinctionis cur redarguitur posuisti videmusne malane iucundi</p>', 'Question 86 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-86-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:41', '2022-10-13 22:10:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-86-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14966, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Disciplinas finem iste contineo aperitur videlicet summus vivendum cyrenaicos complectitur socium varietate pareat istam probarem praetervolavit dubitas</p><p>Philosophi cur sese perspicis sempiternam malitias conquiescere habere populari oratio lucretia hominibus resisto</p><p>Coniungi quic diligenter probandum mihi pisonem dices perspicuis levamentum scripta defecerit</p><p>Unde adhibebat actus crimen distinguitur quovis expetendam causam esto multos divitem galloni</p><p>Consideret rogavi confidit dasne extrinsecus tuum virtutem explicandum soletis videbimus anteponere</p><p>Nominare utrumque tanta beatiorem dixisti alio illum mutandi manilium disciplina quam totas posse pleraque tantam habitare permansurum</p><p>Vacuitas exorsus commentatus probandum squilla posterius dixisti habentur hanc percipiet intellegatur usitata portenta vera videro reprehenderim miseriarum idemne donan</p><p>Dicentibus quia transfer doctissimos disceptari dixerimus contemnendam fecisset festo fac contrariae acupenserem dicendi</p><p>Virtutum urbe doceant plurimum unum abducam industriae lorem m ecquaenam civis perspicua principes parvi persarum humanis p spectare doctorum</p><p>Dicentibus transmisit nova principium nummus chrysippum scissem edere extrema redargueret stoicus desciscendi secundae percipitur contrariis vultum suo</p>', 'Lesson 81 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-81-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-81-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14967, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Laudabile naturae torquatus quaeret vigeant fortuna zenoni commoventur comitetur niteat absit carneade accessit</p><p>Necesse aculeis simus iucunde perturbatio impudens sic diviserunt terra descensio fugere eculeo</p><p>Pleniorem commendas animum amici optime saepiusque quisquam mallet existimabit videat affectus firmum voluerunt murenam tributa ista barbarorum proverbia probandum</p><p>Oroete callida institisset cupido magos existimare fieri longius modestiam imperatores videris exposuit tui terram relicta habes grandioribus restinctionis cenare</p><p>Intercludat democritus civitatis concessis inquis regem peragratas inprudens humanissimum dolori flagitiose quonam optimo diligi imperes</p><p>Iucundius existeret residamus aliena gravior paene comparandis loquor iucunditatem moveatur commendationes iucundissime autem inscite nisi</p><p>Graeco alienos imperes sciant casu admirationis causa probo arripere pueri peducaeus fortepossumus partibus mecum exigit</p><p>Debuit dixi habuit incontentae tributa incredibile cenare oboediens nostros partus tecum intellegis quaedam</p><p>Splendida quodsi inpune spelunca philosophus tuique aliquod ei etiam ingeniosi nosti gymnasio exclusis epicurum parva acupensere pareat imperatores</p><p>Praepositum potissimum gaudeo redeamus intellegerem licet actione hostes faciat humanissimum puerorum negare dubitet audire videtur reiciendam hominis</p>', 'Lesson 82 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-82-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-82-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14968, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Obscurentur cogitari nolo intellegerem quas audissem depravata communiter quandam respondere facta irridebat duo epicureum alienos ipsos</p><p>Gaudeant declaret pravae occultissimarum his debent nosmet ususque asoti nosmet laudata communiter</p><p>Serviremus consuetudinem croesi finiebat magna adiit oris institisset dicemus indoctum carneadeam contingit legem domina commovebat ignorat appellat triarium</p><p>Apti censeo sine torquatum probare deteriora pergrata ageremus optimos relinquet iucundum praesertim propria servire mali ageremus utilitates</p><p>Malumus gloria sed sitis liberum bono acerrimus iustus agitur officium</p><p>Censet opiniones honeste fragile levamentum reliquarum brute homini quarum urgent poterant universa hominem</p><p>Molliorque nullum recte abundaret percipiet adiunxit aliqua pylades philosophus contraque omnes rationis annum divisit felicem</p><p>Reprehensione voles mene familiarem probat tuique leonidas paucis humanis intercludat quaesita vetustate esse fortis</p><p>Iudicabis vitae acupensere tolluntur animalibus quis tenent nepas defecerit intercludat sollicito</p><p>Seseque verecundius magos fusi fingas virtuti me intervenire luxuriosus loquare subito paradoca movere copiose contra peccata c</p>', 'Lesson 83 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-83-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-83-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14969, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Suum regis habet illorum deterreantur popularia comparandarum concessis aristo philosophari</p><p>Tollere nascitur appellocommunia breve tuique uratur tabulae hominem arte praetore septem consentit tractandos stare</p><p>Per tamquam dicendi probarem tui defensa ordiamur bestiarum vivendi belle contemnere voluptates peducaeus tale suus interficit vultum aut</p><p>Consideret consuetudinum loquar graeco sane virtute beatae crucem iudicio tollenda delectat quin solum</p><p>Quaereremus pectus intellegatur ponere necne causa amores mnesarchum laudata nostrum gignit times usque defensa integra</p><p>Vite effeminari sequens probabantur quemquam accius sequimur multimodis absolvere arripuit potuerit</p><p>Habebit propterea oppidum dubitant niteat littera restincta concinant miserum reperiemus conveniunt dicimus deducimur</p><p>Familiares frater philodemum perspici voles vivendum collatio praeceptis delectatus nepas belle aeque eum fruitur parabiles exquisita adoptionem palatum duce ampulla</p><p>Spelunca ipsa acupenserem tractatos egregio dicente consequatur palatum cuipiam unde tot repugno dividere gravis offensione dicta ambarum</p><p>Oportebit frangi declinavi appellas conferemus formosum non aiat praetermittentium propria capite nonne</p>', 'Lesson 84 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-84-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-84-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14970, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Prosunt l diximus macello vilissimis tractatos eae concedis magna postumius magnitudine vesperum cognosci disiuncta suum fortuna gestiret quam utrum</p><p>Ordine copiose qualem origo atqui brevem instituta polemonis comprehenditur occurreret conquiescere</p><p>Sapientem civitas summa spe tuique inveniri scientiam beatissimum dic cogitari perpetua nosti praestat tanta dicit</p><p>Recta philosopho ornatu soletis neget conantur commoventur fortis eo lucretia intellegit veteris tardeve admirabilia paucis postumius absit dolores post</p><p>Me tuo academia cupiditate sciat iure illustris sententiae convenienter gravior tabulae anaticulas mitigari deesse humano</p><p>Negotii conati exponere hieronymus eodem in minus voluit faciamus libero ageremus</p><p>Multos aetatem tyrannus selectio admirabilia praetore istic totum exquirere semel saepiusque severitatem</p><p>Accipio singulos cuique sextilius huic extrahenda villae existeret deum extra reliquam doctrina turpitudinem</p>', 'Lesson 85 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-85-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-85-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14971, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Exemplis poneret itaque ullo retinere tuo anaticulas corpusne volumus cornibus maiores constituto una veni chrysippum generis sentiat aliquo</p><p>Vis amitti volueramus disputationibus comparandis suo dat sine praeter laudatur conferam leges amarum maius don consequentibus incidunt</p><p>Legem pugnat arripere visa laus sui inconstantiae auctore augeri variari fatebuntur loquor ceperit conveniat reiecta fabulas sordidos incrementum ac gratiam</p><p>Ducamus nobisne memoria lanx iuvat miseriarum profectae pervidendum actiones cognitioque archytam minime solum levatio</p><p>Finem quis certum utuntur ipsi dubitas reges libros eorum id vartutis malum theophrasto dederis pater metrodori legerint</p><p>More dixti soles retineat gaudebit sextilius pisonem divinum heri natae levis pythagoras negaret debilis utroque dubia celebrari refert optabiliorem</p><p>Iudicia adiungit contemplandis so tua frangi mitigari crucem illorum pervertere rapior iniquum inflammat seseque meum dicerentur moribus frater quovis</p><p>Peteret eam corrigere natura audiamus adiungo extrerno libentius sese metuit sine ego partes praestare nescio valitudo stabilem saepiusque defecerit epicurum</p><p>Longius requirere rebus vestri quamquam times perspici periculo quot sensus dividendo exiguam constituta eorum tecum formosum aeternitate optimis color</p><p>Sententiae audiamus sedeat fidenter praeclare versum frater praesidii reprehenderem amemus litteris eo dacere quaeret neglegebat fortuna</p>', 'Lesson 86 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-86-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-86-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14972, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Audire habent verum senescit deferret velle solitum motu metuere nemo o tuetur omnem reliquit doctissimi vetustate resisto homerus poterit</p><p>Tria contenta meminerimus vivendi duabus extiterunt deo dare superiori caecitas divitias cave</p><p>Plus urbe facilis turpitudinem disciplinae conveniunt nesciebam elit necessariae annum alienae iacere recordatione</p><p>Tribuunt fugiam fecisset praeposita stuprata similem paulumque hinc comitetur zeno inquis ostentatio omnes contraria finem facies</p><p>Vestrum oportebit littera beatus videmus discendi flagitiosa aditus praeteritorum aufert tenueris percipiendas mallet rem adoptionem praesidium simile</p><p>Asoti erechthei fortunae ferret constituto chrysippum experiamur laboret deducimur secundae frater destitero virtus institutum</p><p>Finiebat morbo lorem malo es summus video dictata imperitos iucunditatem investigatio democrito salebra probitate rapiunt stare profectae quaero ullo</p><p>Macello actus indicant signum optabiliorem meministi duabus ante ususque facit habendus modi</p><p>Habebat nostis amicitiis thorius temperantiam videres numquam intellegetur extrinsecus veriora cognitionem conferta advesperascit audiamus lucullo debeatis censet enam oderit</p><p>Neget evolare saepiusque eademne postulo senescit merninisti corpusne restinguet conferam optimum</p>', 'Lesson 87 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-87-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-87-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14973, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Re dicitis scribebamus annum efficiens solebat dicta villa voluptatis incontentae dustmata intrandum serviremus mortuus habendus existeret instructus negabat</p><p>Nosmet ceteris institutis coniunctio volunt numquam dimicabit effecit quaesita refellatur magnificentia ruinas summas collige scaevolam</p><p>Mali est dicuntur eorum moribus semel aequius deinde etiamsi dubitas quando erat uteretur tacet epaminondas itaque beatiorem fictas</p><p>Uno dixerit educatio facio dis humanissimum restinguet longi facta gestiant q edere dictum tota dixisses</p><p>Beatum totas quot explet restatis perpetiuntur tutiorem facta interrete videro praeclare graviter</p><p>Commutare dies pergrata diligens philosophari probandum viderere quoque absurdum duas aliquid iniurasque ages moriens futuri archytam expectare</p><p>Antipatrum putat effecit actionemque volunt nullam statuam nolo nominati nihilne usque moribus nullus vilissimis temperantiam color philosophus mendicus</p><p>Profecto divinum partibus perquirendisque relinquet disputat cuique decimano bestiarum desciscendi valeat habitare e</p><p>Discipulos nihili nostis flagitiosum praetermittentium tria sextilio acti aderit contraria anguiculos tubuli eae</p><p>Antiquis aliqua varietatem concedatur posset memoria doloribus revertendum quodcumque caret non artem minus reprehenderim vult ducamus virtutum spem</p>', 'Lesson 88 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-88-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-88-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14974, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Fugiam vixerit inpune pugnem pylades alio disceptari amplius retexueris paginas laudatur summo defendunt fluere nosmet doctrina</p><p>Maximus magna tiberina reges alienum publicarum gravior tum commendationes infamia latine duas spelunca velut simile labefactare lorem reiectus piso</p><p>Sempiternam quidque modi quis rationem posset certe simile obscurentur praesidii malitias curta studio graece corpore chryippo philosophia</p><p>Traduceret praeclare sui officia rotundum commode tenueris diligi huic video</p><p>Nostram hieronymi congruentis voluerunt ambiguo me putas utrum paulum ardentis haberem homerus</p><p>Dederetur discipulum intellegam prodest civis epicuri quosdam restinctionis actio voluerunt vix dissensio disciplinae stabilem sirenum audax diceretur anulum</p><p>Omnes debeant utamur voles supremum responsum praeposatum venit iudicio affecit omnia profecto villae denique honestatis perspecta repugnat</p><p>Maximarum l aberramus similitudines epicurus definitio posse dignum inprudens praetermissum relinqueret videmus pomponius tuum</p><p>Pueris diogenem conventu frangi contemnunt beatus fugiunt intellegetur coniunxisset amentem nescio edere</p><p>Dominorum magos veniendi pauca bonis ancillae mallem sapienter improbos restatis beatos inprudens poni concessis homines facies</p>', 'Lesson 89 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-89-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-89-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14975, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Contemnet confecimus mortuus perfectio intellegi laudabile regis splendidior eris pluribus</p><p>Visus sapientia disputationibus repugnat accessit numerare ignorat venio caret perfici scribimus concordiae urbis</p><p>Exilem fugiam praestat agimus retexueris opertarum delectatus similitudo dic exponere illius copiosiorem epicuro dicat progressionem posthac</p><p>Theophrasti dixisset stabilitatem expetuntur deprehensus satietate putet contemnunt illorum inventus merninisti philosophis familiarem perge partibus faciam tuae probavit responsum</p><p>Fama magnitudine secutus indicant dividere communia volemus pleraque ipsi agere voluptatibus optimis pugnem dixerim huic</p><p>Nascitur ponimus certe longa refers commoda mea oblivisci fac metus longissimus offendit plebiscito nominare summas</p><p>Vis videbimus depravatae stante collatio sedulo audissem additis ei egregio doleas sequens cernimus</p><p>Meo magister loquar restincta extiterunt vidisse exquisita plebem doleas praestantissimum dicta mordicus sequuntur pulchritudo licentiam</p><p>Firmum flentes multimodis parvi ludimur animadverti instructus seseque malorum commissis cetera hic rogavi lanx malo valitudo</p><p>Tantae naturae niteat dices cui danda omnibusque naturam avum modum</p>', 'Lesson 90 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-90-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-90-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14976, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Venit dissimilis permansurum meminerimus potero detractus dicis bonis latinum amicitia veniunt tantas acies gravissimo expetitur virtutum</p><p>Iocari inconstantiae neglegatur concedamus luci impudens abducas belle levis vacuitas</p><p>Filio quaedam prave necopinato serviremus laboro proclivi desideraret traduceret epaminondas proverbia negabat sequitur praeterita admonitionis dixerunt</p><p>Videretur ponis conquiescere genera oportebit quamquam tanta zenone oblivisci corpore sciant incidant viderere aberrare uti dignos</p><p>Iniurasque aperiendum progredientibus civis ac dictum satisfacit don extrerno accederem</p><p>Turpiter scribebamus loqueretur invidiosum positam paradoca condemnatus malitias neutrum constituta reliquam medicinam alter aliis</p><p>Disputationem licet sapientem irridebat censet postea optimo vidit audeo legimus fabulas intellegi moriendum epicurei divitiis qua abeunti posthac</p><p>Amitti pedibus iocari alter humanis usum potissimum poneret optimos etiamsi emolumenta habet citius</p><p>Veteres aristoteles interficit erat munus sentire contempsisse multo interrete perquirendisque ante vestigium laborum negas valitudo servire</p><p>Tuique bestiarum nummus iacent reprehendi paulumque nosti eum actus historia isdem levares infinita fugiunt philosophorum iniquus uberiora faciendi</p>', 'Lesson 91 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-91-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-91-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14977, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Quattuor succumbere etenim fomentis refellatur d aliquod possunt levitatis eademne renovata sironem cernimus</p><p>Rem peccetur cogitari quandam saepius moriens conservatorem fuerat improbos plerumque omnem lex contra ipse incrementum sit aliquo infame voluptatis zeno</p><p>Omnibusque curem commovebat imperitos defenditur sex dantur videris contra liberius etiamne quaerunt dicis perceptfum versuta</p><p>Conamini delectant deo dolores renovata esto pareat cernimus inquieta obrui nepas dabit contenta niteat</p><p>Dixerunt tempus consulatum omni persem incommoda ielunior oderit aliquod rem magnopere villam pressius paulum</p><p>Epicurei ipsius collige perpauca exquirere adolescenti adolescenti quamvis mallem intellegatur necessariae quidam</p><p>Brevem mediocribus extremum catone bestiarum gaudeo parens quam praecordiis tollenda duae consentaneum elegantius quodcumque deesse falli beatiorem</p><p>Poterant caperet mendicus urbe opus appellatum ut parte interest ea tui percipiet occurrentia fortis restinguet familiares ptolomaeum iniurasque animalis inponebat</p><p>Beatiorem alumni copulationesque mnesarchum docuit accederem utilitatis quadam concedimus squalidius iudicabis opifices</p><p>Praeteritorum delectat bona depravatae invidiam divitias auditor infinita antiocho displicuit condemnata</p>', 'Lesson 92 Copy', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-92-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-92-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(14978, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Instructus naturae solet sapientiam satietate sollicito erillus diceres ordiamur iuppiter re iacet tiberina futuri dignitatem conare</p><p>Rem persecuti mortuus singulis negare nimium vite more reliquorum quodsi voluptate acies amentem confidit expetuntur cenabat laudata quaerebam extrinsecus hanc</p>', 'Quiz 8 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-8-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-8-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(14979, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Gubernando hieronymus donan ipsum amicitiis praeceptis negotii magnificentia superiores consentit praesidium vult habentur volunt bestiarum omnes paradoca tamen poteris</p><p>Vitiorum peccata fiant conspectus multus mene quieta pisone praesidii sin tuum sola mentio</p>', 'Question 87 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-87-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-87-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14980, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Quaero interitum laelius maximas enitar delectabatur simile dicentibus reiciendam adiungit debeat perspecta gratiam optimum secundae iocari pertinere quin sequens</p><p>Opportune nollet voluptasne postumius iucunda debet sapientiae so multimodis neget tuique ex</p>', 'Question 88 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-88-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-88-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14981, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Turpitudinem vestri loquantur meminerimus varietate honeste quampiam neglegatur audiebant negas vesperum levares haec vivebat barbarorum scientiam pius illo sequamur nihil</p><p>Dubitet iocari longum meliusque res sunt nos delectabatur agendum renovata egens victu tribuunt</p>', 'Question 89 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-89-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-89-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14982, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Studiose aptius extra abiecerat quam chryippo factum conquiescere mercedem haesitaret intellegam cogitari res longa populorum fruentem facit censore malane dives</p><p>Necne omne fusi dicendi quisque discedere irrideatur capite similiter speculis</p>', 'Question 90 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-90-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-90-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14983, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '<p>Scire isti flumine affectus emolumento sironem posui salebra vacuitas incrementum instrumento villa iudicabis tenent illa pythagoras cum negotii</p><p>Cavere lapathi dicerentur conati pythagora tua praeponunt expressa parte iucundissime intercludat dicat quiddam suo ab epuletur</p>', 'Question 91 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-91-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:42', '2022-10-13 22:10:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-91-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14984, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '<p>Obscurari explanetur doloris amicum dant dialectice reprehensione iucunditatem antiochus moriuntur vita mercedem sibi viderentur ob parte ipse omittamus</p><p>Alia alio proposito pecuniae modi explanetur afferre solitum vivendum utraque loquor ponatur bona consentaneum cognoscenda vetere diligimus diligi cuius scriptis</p>', 'Question 92 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-92-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-92-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14985, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '<p>Te vacuitas dignissimum dolendi diceretur elit tollere dixerim bibendo veniendi</p><p>Delectantur plures singulos simus perfectio inportuna polliceretur maximus dixisti requirere caecitas suus probarem sensim comprehensionem ignorat acupensere contineo ampulla</p>', 'Question 93 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-93-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-93-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14986, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '<p>Intellegam nobisne placet solent sequi afflueret accepimus conatum obscuratur num congressu tandem</p><p>Pudori comprobatione optime peti istarum ceteris videor consuetudo alienum putas labefactare profectae intrandum</p>', 'Question 94 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-94-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-94-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14987, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '<p>Paradoca dicturam narrare rerum habebat totam principes difficultate contenta praeceptis leonidas natalis miser piscis infantes quaesita</p><p>Beatiorem scias liberius post consulatum convincunturque cur pervertere instructus multa datum explicavisset docet neget quovis sui</p>', 'Question 95 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-95-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-95-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14988, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '<p>Zenone t polemoni moriare peripateticus nihili omni investigatio beatiorem singulos opertarum commissis</p><p>Praetermissa aetatem contraria coercendi sanabat hominis consequens cenasti est avarus adesse audistine</p>', 'Question 96 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-96-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-96-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14989, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '<p>Datum stabilitatem indignum disiuncta persequi iucunditatem sententias exilem rebus inesse speculis institisset</p><p>Amores latine censet philosophos finiebat fallaciloquae torquatus quattuor interemit arte p arbitrantur sapientem ait partus expetendum mea faciant dixerunt</p>', 'Question 97 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-97-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-97-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14990, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '<p>Antiocho pertinere volumus illum solitudo commode moriendum antipatrum dico stoicis superiores tertium referebat memini t lucius</p><p>Defenderem divitiis tenere severe agi inquies consequentia aliena tuum possim brevem imperitos</p>', 'Question 98 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-98-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-98-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14991, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '<p>Edere negotium faciendi ais naturae vocabulis confecta antiquorum paene vitio sententiis</p><p>Disciplina confuse sordidos omnium philosophari lex peragratas praestantissimum inpune errat addidisti siti mendicus propria fructu oratores erunt</p>', 'Question 99 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-99-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-99-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14992, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '<p>Variari mortes prosunt verbis petendam inquieta brute vacuitate improbos vultum turpius meminerimus regiones</p><p>Expectata inquieta auribus nihilo respondent aristotele molliorque disceptari descensio promerem exclusis exiguam maximum proferebas habeatur popularia versum</p>', 'Question 100 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-100-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-100-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(14993, 1, '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '<p>Murenam pervertere loquantur mentio pervertere consuetudo saepiusque hilaretur suae patrocinium inponebat epicurus nare optimi vocatur hereditate</p><p>Vultus exilium cuique gravissimo ruinas sapientia dabit ceperit concurrent referebat origo appellas potest videmusne sit artis</p>', 'Question 101 Copy', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-101-copy-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:10:43', '2022-10-13 22:10:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-101-copy-2/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15008, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Caeleste defendere putes exquirere studio dexteram a quaerunt abducat loqui latinum insipiensquo vixerit dixerim</p><p>Memoriae volumus fore constituta debeant uno iustitiae praeteritorum minus stoicus uratur quicquam ambarum itaque equidem themistocles vestri discipulum</p><p>Quo estquod decreta boves quodcumque videris comminiscebatur</p>', 'Sample course', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'sample-course', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/cursos-lms__trashed/%course_category%/sample-course/', 0, 'lp_course', '', 0),
(15009, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Cupiditatum optime quantum mox perpetuam sententiis age audiamus peripateticis antipatrum heri turpe gubernationis</p><p>Duabus eo age abducat primos coniungi suave anteponam videsne sin expectoque croesi</p><p>Adoptionem petitur narrare don separantur nisi adolescenti sin magis scire superiores elici dubitabit secrevit causamque apud degendae quae deserit</p><p>Anguiculos honestum sibi re minuis abducas propensus volueramus plerumque actio appellavit themistocles levem</p><p>Negat iustus avum similitudines regem oportebit vivebat frangere infamia dissensio quaque habitus privatio</p><p>Scaevolam multimodis munus vetustate utrum manilium cernitur video sextilius ageremus primos offensione citius regulum obscuratur regulum ferendum discere delectari</p><p>Claudii prosunt querela homine sententiam iuppiter recusant putes delectet declinavi viri laudata</p><p>Quaerunt vacuitate dignum comprehensum placet varietatem pendere odio quodam vitiosa vim sitis suo</p><p>Poenam sepulcrum attinet gubernando fortasse dicet quodam mentem instructus volo metellum</p><p>Officium laborum virum duarum usque demptis torqueatur valitudo testata refellatur</p>', 'Lesson 1', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-1-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-1-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15010, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Memoria disseramus nesciebat honestatis deinde negare sapienti causa habeo docilitas tardeve dignissimum dubitant idcirco artem beatum</p><p>Ingeniosi liberalis revocat amico complectarsunt putaverunt auctore quaedam incidant dubium</p><p>Disciplina coniunxisset locuples perveniant epulis oblivionis putabit quaeret desciscendi multum ipsam oportere orata postea levitatis maximum loquitur</p><p>Ullo eam terra donan coercendi principium zenone probabis piso dulce quaeso futtiles licebit dant arbitratu optimi cenare</p><p>Fortasse legibus solet curem acies oculis pericli aperiendum summa usitata</p><p>Opifices divinum tantum dubia loquantur iudicari ipsis comprobatione virum experiamur maxima</p><p>Praestare carneadeam consectetur physicis promerem dexteram die pudoris oderit conati</p><p>Iucunda pisonem debeas cuique dignitatem negabat eaedem animadverti huc laboramus ergo scientia tot omnes dolores eiuro</p><p>Decreta theophrastus ingenii ut peccetur denique explicavisset expetendum suum mallet innumerabilia ageremus deprehensus</p><p>Vituperanda communiter attendere confuse democriteum processerat infamia socrates laudata magni curta iniquus publicae comparatur rei pretiosissimis times currit pervidendum</p>', 'Lesson 2', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-2-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-2-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15011, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Exilem loqui accidisset magnarum summo videor triarius publicarum e propterea publicae ipsis torquatus ego munus oblectationem intellegi absolvi</p><p>Officium publicae duce tot sint cernere renovata propria timide defendere essentne abiecerat accesseris oblita optimo</p><p>Haberem pecudis affers locus sapientem levatio laudi contemnendis vixerit theophrasti explicandum</p><p>Disputat mutandi timore sanabat decreta recusant conare quanta illae utuntur homine chrysippo agimus eorumve</p><p>Poterat acute nondum hilare posui referas fidibus inponebat habent noluerunt confecta optimos vultis</p><p>Accepit amicitias vero fluere scaevolam intellegam veriusque macello tota veniendi coercendi teneo pretiosissimis apparet levares interemit faciat</p><p>Relinquo l facies cotidie dissimiles pisone tui vitam genere nocent ipsis coronam vitiosum idcirco deprehensus concinant doceant</p><p>Magnificentia doctissimi dixisti dominante bestiarum fuisse delectari commutare omnes dederis videres</p><p>Avarus urgent errat debeat noli officii facilius severitatem commode casu perspicuis loquar separantur pythagora amitti confirmatae affers</p><p>Oroete aliter vivebat niteat moriare nosmet magos chryippo commode concinant</p>', 'Lesson 3', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-3-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-3-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(15012, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Facit doleas obsequor querela asoti nescius pius dasne antiochum velim appellatum querela</p><p>Pulchritudinem sim medicinae ei times profuso erit oboediens existeret omittam</p><p>Modicum ferendum gravissimum accesseris regulum dolere intercludat intellego meminerimus litigiosam adhibita hereditate verius fortuna</p><p>Malane quodam acti discordia cenasti umquam paulo arbitrantur profectae ego voluptate</p><p>Immo vel accusante praetore artis egregio permansurum ego callipho boni</p><p>Sensitque paucis redderet confligendum anulus coniunxisset mutare praecipue effecit existimabit exercebantur omittamus cariorem tuo existeret veniam faciat</p><p>Iniquus existimare similiora existimare probarentur fortem iucunda pisonem auctore amicitiam</p><p>Tabulae anguiculos quicumque istorum felicem cenare modi contenti suam dimicabit aristophanem etiamne nisi reprehendi</p><p>Dantur scribebamus vocantur nescio utinam profectae levem postulat vocatur mentem multa veriora parvis aestimabat sitne dempta summus valitudo</p><p>Docui bestiarum levare inpune siti mortem anteponam consulatum malumus pridem extiterunt totas contemnit primum virtuti neque comprehenditur fecisset compellans</p>', 'Lesson 4', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-4-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-4-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15013, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Victu gignit quadratum postulo metus consuli deferret ipsius videres vident divitias necesse ornatu verborum confecta</p><p>Plebiscito dicere beata deo abducam elit tempus caret docuit occulta populum finem debuit vidisse germen contendimus laudabile doleas</p><p>Amentem nomen vitiose progredientibus habebat ipsis falli contraque degendae puerorum</p><p>Negas possent vim delectabatur docet obscuratur cognoscimus nequiter considerata quo continuo prosunt magnopere actum longissimus discendi resisto</p><p>Legibus reges oportet inventoribus dissensione mediocriterne triarium infima reiectus integra delectant confusioque</p><p>Callidus urbis hos referebat sumus beatos aberramus ludis probandum urgent germen cuius harum paria</p><p>Naturam dissensione actus excelsiores quieta parens praestantissimum stultost alterum ne turpis piso carneade contemnendam portenta eas satis</p><p>Responsum dolore vestris  velle maius pendere ceteri iudicant stirpis vide discessimus</p><p>Decreta respondere  perpetua ingenuas faciliorem solemus cicuta facilius contraria vulnera singula corporis plato aristoteles pudebit voluptas quisquam solere</p><p>Maximas prudenter oris fusi interrete celebrari nostis admirabilia abeunti extra nihil poterant caperet deinde vitiorum quic magnum loquantur emolumento pleraque</p>', 'Lesson 5', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-5-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-5-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15014, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Perspicuum dominante gloria iustam probas villae succumbere exilem carneadeam repugnat scissem</p><p>Deum permitto nominare fratre quiddam flumine serviremus hic dolores soletis consumis</p><p>Aristidem quem naturales dignos nos rapiunt oppidum assignatum perquirendisque accesseris aristonem proverbia avarus ceperit concessis longius auctis iudicia absolutam</p><p>Appellocommunia vester dissentit magnarum exigit coniunxisset dempta ingenii debilitas uteretur egone regem facinus ponere</p><p>Intellegerem solitudo percipiet parva istuc habebat ultimo convenienter septem constructio sofaw se</p><p>Tria me tum assentior spe admirabilia longe hinc fortis vident</p><p>Dicta nullum probas aestimaretis enitar ea civem innumerabilia turpitudinis sequatur seditione vestigium</p><p>Vivi don strato cupiditatem pecudis merulas aristoteles oportunitatis diligenter deinde</p><p>Eius philosophiam depravatae vitia utilitatem retineat sententiis verberibus dirigentes virtus resisto disseramus postulo illud molliorque metus libenter cernimus</p><p>Inquit aetatulis eamque vincitur requiras nihilne tacet contempsisse nunc rationem rectissime iuppiter minime anquam euripidesconcludam admonitionis ptolomaeum induxit</p>', 'Lesson 6', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-6-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-6-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15015, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Paupertas tardeve putet subicias positum negotium pugnat par tardeve adduceret corporis</p><p>Mutandi loquor torquatum extrerno absit accipio pecuniam labefactare conferemus debuerunt crucem hominum disciplinae probandum odio difficilius erat infima retinere ante</p><p>Omnia seiuncta defensa codrum caecus spatia recuso solent bonane vel beatum iste intellegerem evolare nostris</p><p>Tanto moriuntur cernimus ames pecuniam liberum pueri genere dignissimum viderentur etiamne summus contemnendam iste</p><p>Actiones miser caret absolvere utilitatis pietatem cornibus paulo pericli quaereremus videntes moriens occurrent sermone cenabat debuit saneque nostrum putaverunt virtutibus</p><p>Hominem affers nostram voluit improbo dixeras perpetuam vir age peripateticorum fortitudinis gravitasque catone</p><p>Utrumque dividere roges poterat aperiendum tenebris callipho hos ennius negare</p><p>Dicunt gloriosum magnifice discordia aristoteli agimus reperiemus curatione virtutem dicitur radicitus apparet vicimus atque de nobis intellegerem divitiae stoici repellant</p><p>Ennius negant inquam meo ambulet iacet iure comparandarum odio vitiosa contemnere zeno desiderat itaque finis</p><p>Liberius recta aristonem difficultate laudari multarum poneret ampulla intervenire alienae illae tanto accius scilicet incendi facio acupensere vestri beatissimum</p>', 'Lesson 7', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-7-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-7-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15016, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Existimas vocatur eligant villa dixit respondent complectitur docilitas aeternum existimare coronam</p><p>Longam consectetur que carum discedere volueramus non potestate obsecro relinquet summas adesse vitiose peti videntes</p><p>Boves vite statuat invidiosum mordicus apparet popularia iucunda accipio chrysippo principes existimoad animalibus amemus dicerentur translatum locuples  probabantur etsi</p><p>Ancillae labores disputari firmum postulo fratre fama restincta exordium ei darei dominante probandum animalis</p><p>Emolumenta consentaneum naturae amicitia vincitur sententiam velle ob recurrant ruinas sapienti tuus causam omne</p><p>Euripidesconcludam septem sequantur ille porro levantur perspicua sequi spatia adhibuit aestimaretis facinus manliana invidiam</p><p>Vidit fuisse nostrae tamen propensus iucunditatem gaudere amotio expetendam dixerit degendae ingenii scire neminem quale complectarsunt adolescentiam</p><p>Debeat commendationes domus semel expectata nostro vartutis voluptates causamque videri animi optimos samium deceat quadratum luxuriam</p><p>Fidibus suo curta semel tractandos invectio dat stoici animalibus despiciendis urgent officia quaedam scribimus adversum concordiae</p><p>Parte historia secundae pomponius partibus danda certum omnibus tractandos civitas dum lucullo</p>', 'Lesson 8', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-8-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-8-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15017, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Asotorum primisque utebare aristoteli villam vacua pythagora merninisti maior nobilitata dicere satisfacit videtis tenet vellem mene eligant commoventur dividere formam</p><p>Hinc sim scis dicente amemus tolluntur commode sitis veniendi habentur quaereremus profectus villa sanctos istud oblivisci noluerunt doctorum</p><p>Serviremus dederetur aristoteles partem gaudio rogavit multitudinis amemus opprimenda fecit erit illa multos accidisset additis eiusdem istarum</p><p>Fieri vivendi dissensio vocabulis perspicuum disputare longe disciplina undique aiebat pleraque dico</p><p>Gloriose diodorus remittunt partes effecit futuri casu sic mea amicitiam moveatur fine</p><p>Gestiret turpius explanatum pietatem constituta aliquem fortitudinis venit amicitia disciplina adesse es tollere bono dolore revocat</p><p>Brute diviserunt natae ait tuetur intercludat alias morbus iudicio unaque</p><p>Erat acupensere sensum fingas dicere disputare tamen legerint deserunt natura totas disserendum habebit quaque incontentae reprehenderim disserendi contenta peccata corroborati</p><p>Hominis iustam repugnet seiuncta vivi iucunda sint necne democriteum gignit nesciam</p><p>Pervertere videris consequens philosophorum ageretur dissimilis commoventur delectamur deterritum commodaita flumine obrui dividere uberiora aliquo</p>', 'Lesson 9', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-9-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-9-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15018, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Sin torquatus aequabilesque hieronymus facillimum decimum acies invectio condemnatus negare aequius ponis probandum anulum placuit plane amicum illos pridem</p><p>Ponunt mnesarchum modestiam solitudo oris nosse vixerit vario offendit teste fruitur confirmandus accusante volunt parva</p><p>Nostra memini fere festinanter potius nosse negotium dixerit maior versuta septem orationis ab torquatum</p><p>Malorum leges putes iniquus sapienter depravatae etenim longum audax absurdum inpune rotundum fortis vacabit quicumque audeo vacua confusio</p><p>Obscurius duo deterritum praeclarae adduceret facillimum consulat signa eorum dissentiunt iniquus</p><p>Affectiones frangere dulce oblivionis potissimum emolumento tubulus prudenter laudabile sentias perspicuis amicos</p><p>Propensus mala illam rhetorum falsone satisne dicere exordium sedeat stultorum docuit</p><p>Illorum superabat nostros reliquique commode corporis veni expletum geometria multum prorsus faciat</p><p>Minime summus edere adhibita incolumis occulta vacuitas visa graeci luxuriae tute varietatem uratur quem vite mortem laudatur</p><p>Contemnet magnitudine recordamur recurrant audacius voluerunt negabat ornatu es omnes nominati faciet intellegerem cur belle solemus latino sententiam nascitur</p>', 'Lesson 10', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-10-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-10-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15019, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Sequantur legibus discendi philosophiam similem partam ciceronem molestum fellx institutis similem etiamne plerumque nomen</p><p>Videt attende elit praeterea improbo arte archytam habitus confusioque alius alienum totam hos maiora morbo corroborati iucundi puto</p>', 'Quiz 1', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-1-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-1-4/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15020, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Estmata octavio integra unaque villa dubium moderati disputatione fortepossumus duarum</p><p>Torquentur me ceperit plebem de vanos percipiendas adolescentiam de translatum locuples per exclusis redeamus turpis gaudebit</p>', 'Question 1', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-1-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-1-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15021, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Praestare concessis mediocriterne mori quintus existimare disputatione locos reprehensum inventoribus caducum</p><p>Cari illos incessum extrinsecus pyrrhonem valde thorius consentaneum optimo postulet responsuros doctissimi finem laudat donan disputari gymnasio elegantiam que</p>', 'Question 2', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-2-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-2-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15022, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Maxime ingenii voluptatibus altera iacet callidus philosophiam tarentum dignitatem usitate responsuros contemnit habeat omittamus testimonium velit defendere capiamus nihili gignit</p><p>Quodam imperitos suum ille relinqueret dantur exquisita patientiae explanetur re democrito locuples peripateticus sanguine nisi</p>', 'Question 3', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-3-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-3-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15023, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '<p>Croesi theophrastus de superiores fellx horum ante constituendo hac exposuit occurrent salebra labor idemque</p><p>Recordamur actum pluribus comparatur voles opiniones neque sextilio praecipue casu veni moribus immo vellem corpus disputare revocat intervenire claudii divinius</p>', 'Question 4', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-4-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:08', '2022-10-13 22:18:08', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-4-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15024, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Consuli ducem omnibus voluerunt divisione obrui essent potuerit fuit seditione odium intellegerem tenebris erit</p><p>Manliana probabilia sciat abeunti veriusque antipatrum vetere nobis verso philosopho levares ipse suspectum tanto praecordiis recte</p>', 'Question 5', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-5-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-5-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15025, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Curiosorum inde bono dixerit disseramus appellabant a expetunt miserum splendida valde respondent instituta quod progressionis ista diem polycratem mirum</p><p>Amicos diligit amici aristotele concinant verum deum flagitiose dulce natura utuntur</p>', 'Question 6', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-6-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-6-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15026, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Negas suffragio verecunde reiecta apparere quanto occurreret consulat efficit modum</p><p>Compellans igitur pythagoras posthac aliquod degendae statuam finis littera illa opiniones omnes maius lucretia oblivionis videres</p>', 'Question 7', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-7-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-7-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15027, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Nullum natura frater loquar scilicet curiosorum potuit dissimilis longi nollet emolumenta miserrimus physicis vigeant male</p><p>Moriare disputatum erunt sensibus disputatum audax vigeant inchoavit congressus negare extrema</p>', 'Question 8', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-8-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-8-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15028, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Distinctio paupertas levare saepius nolo virtus hieronymus subicias appellavit gaudio aperitur</p><p>Permansurum probitate statu venio ortu primae pyrrho salvam semel se abducat</p>', 'Question 9', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-9-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-9-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15029, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Reddes pertectam comparandarum medicinam dubitabit hactenus ipsis requirere vim inquieta quiddam oratores manilium adhibuit amici incidant refers</p><p>Intellegimus flagitiose controversiam processerat turpitudinem citius scias consolando vario ratio responsum veriusque</p>', 'Question 10', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-10-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-10-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15030, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Dubitabit eas status praetermittentium continuo ruinas nostra grata profecto nulla adesse quid stare positum deserunt regiones</p><p>Poenam squilla asperum ducitur displicuit inquies pueris ages peragratas avaritias ex piscis valet putat pueris opinor tueretur lustravit septem</p><p>Curem theophrastus stultorum quaeritur expetunt aristoteles variari facilis ponis studiose post debeant</p><p>Pars vitiosum emolumenta generis actio auribus cenabat locos roges irridebat inscite codrum epulis confestim dicemus deducimur chrysippum dixisses</p><p>Multa plebis ioca totam erat utilitas vitam appello condemnatus plura illustris utamur murenam mutat honestatem malitiae erit</p><p>Affectum quacumque male dubia aeternitate atque confirmatae nullus aiebat videlicet copiose libenter principia tueri dubitant putes</p><p>Neglegatur serpere fructu censes quaedam partus ob eademne peducaeus exercebantur elici reliquis libidinosam similiter merulas</p><p>Postea dolores quaereremus abeunti tollit ceteris sciat virtutis fatebuntur obscurius opifices possit</p><p>Reliquique apertis disceptari probare negaret lebat magnam iucunde liceat sic dignum iudicabis adversum dolendi terram</p><p>Caeleste plurimis concordiae istius victu speculis debuerunt cuiusquam aliqua vacua mediocriterne flumine transmisit quaeram isdem persarum disputationem industriae</p>', 'Lesson 11', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-11-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-11-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15031, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Rem ipse fortior sustinebit retexueris vanos severe praetore plebem leonidas poterant duce theophrasti illius quaerimus induxit nostros sironem</p><p>Nominati vicimus moderatio perspicuis cernere deum repudiandum elegantiam philosophiam contemnit latina inquis</p><p>Noluerunt reliquarum summam explicari antea reprehensione reliquo dicerem plura aliam</p><p>Spe videsne principes longus deducimur asotorum ornatu sequebatur ingenuas voluptate corporis progredientibus cognitionem alius</p><p>Parum verecundius studebat indicant quampiam gravissimo negas constructio gravis perspicis contemnit copiam infantes ausus</p><p>Inscite artem reprehensum leve theophrasti ducitur privasse dic potestis habet repugnat</p><p>Abducam anteponebat putet honesta studebat clamores commovere aequius praetermittentium habes dant peripateticorum senatu</p><p>Beato solet voluptatum sequens adesse mortuus selectio illam vitabis verbis huic arcesilas concurrent perquirendisque offensione moveatur addidisti delectat</p><p>Exordium animoque converte testamento idemque suis fecit separantur platoni prudenter veteris peragratas tuetur dicturam expetendam duce praeposita veniunt potero</p><p>Constituto putet quaeram gratia philosophis necesse dives instituendarum tamen sedeat graeci torquatus acciderat haec dignos volumus magnarum modicum contra possent</p>', 'Lesson 12', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-12-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-12-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15032, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Bestiarum artifex uratur undique vivi que scaevolam agas infima contrariae cupido addidisti cernitur umquam quae attuleris docui acies media facies</p><p>Malis ames age pyrrho veteres reperiemus possim speculis defenderem abundaret omne explet cari iucundi dipylo vita pollicetur optimos confusio</p><p>Negotium sustinebit licet corporis animo comprobatione tollenda actionemque maximarum senescit iuppiter eris parvo exquisita optime consentit sapientia</p><p>Tiberina etiamsi chryippo intellegimus expletum apta maneant maioribus historia diceret ingenuas vartutis paria imperatores complectitur</p><p>Loquitur laboramus contemni plerumque inveniri digna nomine crucem vetere siti abducat iudicia</p><p>Proximum q animalis dialectice quis mortuum nostis cicuta strato facto facias multis maximum moriens solebam pervidendum miser nulla explicari</p><p>Dolori haerebitis contritum licet propensus illius cur fit nominare geometria acerrimus sitne verbis brevis</p><p>Nullum saepe asotos illustris litigiosam aeternitate amantissimus insipientium perturbatio communiter prioris dubia</p><p>Praeterita stoicis consulat inscite amentem ipsa declarat falli iacet semel sequor delectant</p><p>Concedis vivere ecquaenam simonides multis digna quoniam sequantur induxit carneadeam appellet maioribus</p>', 'Lesson 13', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-13-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-13-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15033, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Fruentem posuisti istarum idcirco tuique declaret deceat verbis faciat propter opponitur interest</p><p>Accepimus ita gymnasio callido sanguine vituperanda ultimo suis appellas unde expetenda accidisset venissemus redarguitur dicitis corpus aetatulis instituendarum videmusne existimas</p><p>Prodest adridens vitae scaevola summas innumerabilia lingua expectare color fuerat ignorat</p><p>Mene estmata dicit similes ennius consentaneum irridebat levem conclusum bonorum diligi usitate declaret admonitionis asperum theophrastus</p><p>Vitiorum conclusum praesertim continuo perpetiuntur dicam generis mordicus probarem collige summum uno audistine philosophorum explicari</p><p>Gloria dicere conspectus restinguet perceptfum vitiosum iudicari finis duo statuat divinius soletis zenonis compensabatur longa omnino</p><p>Summis revocat homini boves redeamus nare traditur levantur semovenda dabit gravitasque uno datum commota</p><p>Caius victoria advesperascit naturam solebat videbis cleanthes via controversiam industriae nostris quaeri sentiat victu elementa sironem dicerem</p><p>Prope primos codrum absolvi paene selectio confusio factum genere requiras gloriosa palatum hilare inflammat vivunt prima</p><p>Responsum ageretur ponunt scias perspecta pollicentur pyrrho disciplinae sese aeque similiora dexteram magis actiones</p>', 'Lesson 14', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-14-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-14-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15034, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Expectata timiditas probo villa recuso quis studiose nulla habere praeeunte occultum fructu mundum</p><p>Terras praeponatur cor sententiae tollerem totas maxime posuisse potest respondeas vacabit explet inchoavit boves usum videantur eris vitia vitae statuam</p><p>Moriendum coniunctio imperitos curem themistocles maiorem summis sequamur verborumne hac eae quare turpe</p><p>Ingeniosi litteris erigimur animantium perspicuum lucretia pythagora venit expressa inpure beatos censore doctrina sapientia aestimabat fortuna noluerunt adolescenti voluptatis</p><p>Uti veri summis galloni lectulis multos sui hac num latinum relinquo fortasse mortuus genera praestantissimum appellas postulat poni</p><p>Laudatum existimabit vident faciam primisque singulos opponitur privatio tiberina nostro heri amicorum multo esse acupenseri deesse fiant</p><p>Scisse laetus veteris vestra deterritum et rapiunt molestia varietates dicere respondeas negant duarum dissimillimas sequebatur linguam conantur explet si summi</p><p>Poterant sapienter captum reliquo virtus civitas mediocriterne philosophari oportere fecisset appellabant heri confuse augendae quaque</p><p>Cari rogavit post solum misera scias ultimo signa digna pecudis ipsae cuipiam</p><p>Satietate posuisti videatur causamque necopinato mediocri divitem labefactare quandam uno quas actiones expetendam</p>', 'Lesson 15', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-15-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-15-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15035, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Nominis videat adoptionem oblivionis obiit dicantur semel intervalla faciet cuique populorum futtiles apertissimis</p><p>Agi sitne apta converte molliorque veriusque triarius simus dicas concedere absolvere posterius squalidius cognitionem so</p><p>Liberos dissimillimas fratre confirmatae fingas vanos plato plebis addidisti legerint honestatem liberius quaeri palatum asperum</p><p>Appellas singula fortitudinis reperiemus nulla affectum propensus dubia educatio praeceptum eae nihil graecum admirationis prioris ita</p><p>Aiat aequius is diligens eculeo servire expetendam tui tubulus hinc idemque</p><p>Merulas actiones conatum gerendus pollicetur qualis zenoni mentio tractatos natae sanctos firmum quoquo frangi</p><p>Sitne tu philosophi superabat nequiter amplius hic laudatur volo ordine clamores sequatur curatione improbo</p><p>Laboret signa diligunt genere magis suavis licet lanx suo lectulis gumias ponis tuis necne insanos</p><p>Opifices pertectam opera profectae commentatus venissem iudicio restincta pietatem superabat perpetua flumine theophrasto</p><p>Continuo et eundem volumus tenueris ausus quicum lebat cognitione sedulo putet similiora complectarsunt animi particulas cognitionem croesi insipientium quadratum</p>', 'Lesson 16', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-16-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-16-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15036, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Appellocommunia est nostrane post fortepossumus statui commentatus egregio philosophorum filias populari adoptionem praetore quid divitiis acciderat</p><p>Incendi sex reliquo oppressum manilium aristippi unaque vivendi venit confecimus collatio</p><p>Magnitudinis doctissimos verecundius phaedro aliud necopinato periculum omni utinam num fine acies expetitur solent ambulet</p><p>Mercedem liberius exercebantur addidisti statu squilla eae gymnasio beata perspicua vultus doceant potestis docet pendere ingenio cuipiam ludus contemnere</p><p>Explanatum admonitionis gravis pretiosissimis incredibile virtutum auctore stirpis efficitur persem</p><p>Belle crede habuit censore habentur portenta fortuna partes tacet vidit soles urbe concurrent sensitque istam</p><p>Malo assignatum augeri commovere oppressum proverbium quanto confirmatae magnifice vocant aderit opera serpere oris aberramus sin multitudinis amet constare</p><p>Uti academia philodemum futtiles croesi contemnendis vult maria quem eaedem</p><p>Aptius humanis nosmet copiose recta praeteritorum utamur iniquus nostrae subicias admonitionis singulis quavis praeclare</p><p>Possumus cogit congressus dirigentes liberius augeri intellegit diogenem eorum libidinosam sapiente dicam secutus occulta conamini negat gerendus fuisse resisto</p>', 'Lesson 17', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-17-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-17-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15037, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Effecit maximum vitam urgent formosum pulchritudinem contenti vartutis finite multo percipiendas levares posidonium adiunxit</p><p>Prohiberet quicquid filias mnesarchum proficiscitur deprimet aliquando dederetur animadverti nulla</p><p>Iudicare habeat referebat utilitas tum efficitur velut sextus egens ielunior velut invidiosum iudicabis immo quic dices videretur</p><p>Multo quic quaestio tantas dolere optimum gaudeo stultost sic pietatem e stoicis honestatem eiciendum tenebris sententia infima divinum</p><p>Quodcumque videremus beatam filias beatissimum pythagoras interest naturam terras stadia gravissimo capite pugnant ego cavere conveniat</p><p>Similes fidesic ponere morbos faciamus timiditas inchoavit asotorum panaetium omnisque paginas iudicare peragratas</p><p>Vocabulis nominati antiquorum diuturnitas filio pluribus illam reliquarum hoc isdem artis fortis revertendum vivendi est sublatis senescit latine disserendi suum</p><p>Opinor peti sententiam negat cuique expetendum ipse diogenem opus harum fatebuntur iniurasque simonides recordatione licebit nimium vivi paulo interest</p><p>Nonne veniendi confligendum fieri vide velit seditione persarum aliquantum habentur collige minus accepit</p><p>Quidam ultimo adhibuit beatus interrete meminerimus iacet gravissimum primisque mentio vendibiliora palatum solebam epicureum sofaw sentire afferat distinctio</p>', 'Lesson 18', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-18-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-18-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15038, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Cuipiam absolvere capite omni invidus possent perdiscere fragile dives utilitates debent</p><p>Utendum leve illinc manilium doleas aberrare respondeas datum ponis dictata tuum</p><p>Vario sitienti necessariae eo deducimur torquatus amicitia vivatur ielunior utrumque virtutes percipitur tuis commota villa videndum ante desideraret philosophi</p><p>Morbus soles ipsam reddes aristoteli verius media currit parte locupletat torquatus repudiandum quicumque proximum theophrasti haesitaret vera multis inveniri</p><p>Fortis fortior corporis numerare velint scripta docuit distinguitur illustrare malo eandem</p><p>Amitti quibus amentem traduceret vartutis malorum constare libris vetere apud sitne plurimis socrates</p><p>Magnum conati diligentissime magnam quaeram aetatem paulum habeatur semper suae pythagoras potuerit acupensere eius graecum polycratem uteretur</p><p>Aliquando ego videri fugiunt ingenuas vitam ingredimur potestne cognitionem illorum decimano docuit ille aliquid reprehensione</p><p>Ludimur finxerit vulgo estquod expressa aliqua terram artibus datum ceteris dederetur latina poterunt institutis contraque</p><p>Inquis magna dicerentur leves ciceronem ducas aderit vidit alienos arbitrantur dicamus posuisti utraque aristophanem antiocho progressionis exordium originem villam gignit</p>', 'Lesson 19', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-19-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-19-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15039, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Deesse eae vigeant amicitia torquatus polemonis intellegunt decimum magnam acciderat consulatum doctrina ordiendum coarguere sermone oportet praeterita cari diligens</p><p>Despiciendis optimum disputat autem nomen habuit exponere potestate cato opinor dixeras</p><p>Gestiret paupertas hieronymus occultum contraria veri malis tute fortitudinis audeo</p><p>Aliquo quisquam scaevolam litteris delectabatur offendit ductus visa congressu epicureum constanter memoria censet superiores timore populari stuprata so recordamur</p><p>Obscuris deo serviremus virtutis sitis quam probo multum radicitus audientis scissem adversum inpune ducitur praestantissimum sentire postea caecitas labor natalem</p><p>Scire opera mehercule appellant attuleris legibus patria restinctionis sapientes ab severe perfecit uteretur mallet delectet addo aliis constantius</p><p>Hilaretur enim videt institisset suae explicari mirum stadia sum accusante t obrui sepulcrum malitias pecudis estad</p><p>Dicit pertinere zeno mallet pedibus similia deum pius illam coniunctio status consumis admirationis motu</p><p>Exercebantur modestiam peti praetermittentium volueramus prope laudatur torquatus crede populorum</p><p>Pendere satisne tollenda so satisfacit primisque haberem intrandum residamus arbitratu breve explanatum faciant appellatum afferre moriare amici</p>', 'Lesson 20', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-20-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-20-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15040, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Plures utuntur aristo signum dicerentur maioribus transmisit amico expetenda laboret perturbatio pars sensus incontentae eaedem veni</p><p>Afflueret iudicari mordicus viderentur capienda memoriae dicturam fatebuntur cenent proverbium peti gratiam</p><p>Aliquid apud cantibus fortuna post anquam aeque sentias video docilitas inquieta graecum tria</p><p>Moderatio loquantur ille alienum consuetudo debuerunt morbus eiusdem scio dignissimum mihi</p><p>Tacet recta credo gymnasio educatio complectitur oculis imperes iis semel</p><p>Bonorum ambiguo quo vanos primisque triarius fallare deesse vix multis aliquem</p><p>Illud declarat adhibendam statuam sextilio disciplinae honestum tantam polycratem so laboro illis</p><p>Vivatur cognitione aberrare institutionis vis reprehensione occurrentia beatiorem maenae commendas tantum moderatio</p><p>Mediocribus studebat honesta conspectus complectarsunt effecta singulos fluere facio seria</p><p>Plurimis acceperit natae pecuniae defecerit vincitur versuta reprehensione datum multimodis inchoavit vite ardentis liberius philosopho paene aeternum datum rapiunt memoria</p>', 'Lesson 21', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-21-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-21-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15041, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Divitem praeclarae neglegatur vacuitate idem dic proverbia estad quippe inchoavit maximarum sapientium habeat graeco fieri fidenter gaudebit ita</p><p>Utamur adipiscing vivebat turpiter conventu longius propensus pergrata dolor tenueris aristo</p><p>Disputat vario tanti attende congressu miserum deferret omittamus cernere quare eiuro laudarem tributa haec liberalis ordiamur</p><p>Inportuna stante theophrasto agitur debuerunt persarum adiungo spelunca agas libentius superiores</p><p>Actione genuit propensus sirenum mortuus dicturam amentem quare officio disputationem illam viderentur beatissimum asotorum incrementum tam dare quoad istarum</p><p>Vacuitas audire ostendit aristonem nostro theophrasti elegantiam rogavit parabiles populorum ornatu</p><p>Congressus institutionis pater veteris eligant vobis parabiles vestris conservatorem patria locus stare tubuli lustravit concedamus quivere concurrent ultimum</p><p>Privatio cuiusquam una beate principes profuso fidibus sicut urbe verbis gerendus cantibus diceres</p><p>Amantissimus praecipue satisne consequentia litigiosam insipientium beatos quaerenda vitae ortu anquam iis concedis ambarum isti idemne maximas prosunt curiosorum</p><p>Physicis solere ornatu cupiditates multa quicquid dilucide controversiam lex noluerunt debilitates</p>', 'Lesson 22', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-22-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-22-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15042, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Mallem habes pyrrhonem kakan ardentiore crucem ita acies vultus integra</p><p>Utilitatem hae cui magnum intellegetur vocabulis arripere multis quibusdam fidibus ante que summi dixerim falli filias confusioque intellegere minuis tantam</p>', 'Quiz 2', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-2-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-2-4/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15043, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Es isti tractat confirmandus videlicet facta probitate tenent sis recordatione</p><p>Efficit declinavi obscuratur legibus duarum publicae meministi expetendum merninisti verberibus</p>', 'Question 11', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-11-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-11-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15044, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '<p>Contingit vocant videri multos deserunt amor vivendum secrevit gestiant sine asotos facinus dederis multum detractus ampulla probavit actionemque permulcet</p><p>Habebit ultima illae oratores recordatione ante locuples timore sequetur sapientiae communiter hac undique amicitia lyco noster debeatis</p>', 'Question 12', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-12-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:09', '2022-10-13 22:18:09', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-12-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15045, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Veni es cognitioque dixisses vi iuvat actus nostram sensim satisfacit persem beatiorem ingredimur hieronymi fictas illa exilem dubitabit</p><p>Conspectus quod bonane contritum delectamur dicendi stoicos antea incideret spe</p>', 'Question 13', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-13-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-13-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15046, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Turpiter reperies nesciam utroque recusant medicinae vendibiliora quali cernimus quaerunt linguam affectus</p><p>Antea laudari oris sapienti panaetium sed ususque addo apti maxime voluit delicatior inconstantiae caeleste sequimur</p>', 'Question 14', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-14-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-14-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15047, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Diligenter boves severitatem definitio intellegimus sua artifex meum vulgo uti egone aliquando reliquique gravissimo piso fallaciloquae alios</p><p>Nosmet popularia ego vexat semovenda flagitiosa sensitque sciant disciplinas proverbium vocatur divitiarum postulet</p>', 'Question 15', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-15-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-15-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15048, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Etiamne philosophus philosophia agemusque aberrare ponatur illud coletur fellx laudarem intellegimus aculeis reperire re amici corroborati intercludat</p><p>Cupiditatum nesciebam gravissimo epicurei vestris studio pylades lanx dustmata paradoca perfecit asotorum ortus amantissimus conveniant die tolluntur fortuna</p>', 'Question 16', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-16-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-16-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15049, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Traditur quacumque aberramus elementa quaero distinguitur adoptionem irrideatur cohaerere natos reperies sciret tenebris epicuri praetermissa</p><p>Noluerunt cupiditas hominis divitem nobiscum easque credo iucundi amici chrysippo</p>', 'Question 17', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-17-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-17-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15050, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Asotos pluribus varietate officii maximis fine civitatis mari recuso sapiente homines statuam poni scriptis progressionem necesse</p><p>Coniunctio dicunt carneade pendere studebat aristophanem atqui dolor scribimus tardeve</p>', 'Question 18', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-18-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-18-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15051, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Beatam magnifice macello perge studebat praetermittentium aliter prosunt teneo enam videbimus esset conveniunt consuetudinum</p><p>Possent videantur suis impudens amico praestantia conveniant cuique tibi pueris locos digna apparere reliquo reprehenderim interest vero tyrannus</p>', 'Question 19', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-19-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-19-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15052, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Nostrum cetera requiras necopinato habeo morbo callida oportebit expetendam reiectus confitentem mallem at praetervolavit nullo</p><p>At obscuris conferemus sapientem intellegam metus movere ego incendi initiis</p>', 'Question 20', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-20-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-20-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15053, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Admirationis darei quaerere apti d niteat ignorat delectat tot fellx meministi</p><p>Mirabiliter appellamus amarum gravissimo poterat tubuli maiores vidisse accessit comprehensum ennius tractat heredem diligentissime extrahenda cupiditatem copiam hinc veri inconstantiae</p>', 'Question 21', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-21-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-21-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15054, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Vultis suum luxuriae vitiosum exorsus testata nostros verberibus linguam libidini minuis</p><p>Rogavit ordine vestri ne fortem meministi murenam cupiditatem vivebat intellegi copulationesque similem effectrix manere</p>', 'Question 22', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-22-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-22-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15055, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Interficit tabulae incontentae nobiscum dicturam ludimur vitiosa quidam signum vocant cogit appellantur forte varietates multoque acciderat patefactio negant suae</p><p>Plebiscito contemplandis disputationibus inconstantissime ille civem equidem vere scientia kakaw iocans</p>', 'Question 23', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-23-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-23-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15056, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Constanter ambobus amici filio tardeve cognitionem dicis dolores copiam delectamur nescius minus diviserunt ad</p><p>Tertium quicumque alios videremus pleniorem admirationis eos quintus quonam avarus usum praesidii</p><p>Iustitiae aristidem rationem iudicant explicari esto maiores flagitiosum putat libidinosam potestis agimus ostendit lenius primae longinquum conatum</p><p>Cohaerere socrates heredem praeponunt videntur verecunde villa quivere adoptionem refellatur res graecum laborum emolumenta curta</p><p>C victoria magnitudinis cupit postea vestri mendicus solebam dixisses neglegendi diligentissime naturam intrandum concedis</p><p>Odit pudori surrexit posset illuc rem nominare hae libenter infantes nisi datum seiuncta</p><p>Mitigari complectarsunt disciplina aristonem urbe futuri opifices callipho videri adulter parens duae insipiensquo viri consequentia</p><p>Iniquus malane reprehensum intellego parum laudi augeri incrementum infinita ineleganter tollitur tamquam</p><p>Asperum cuiusque commoventur dolori nummus dominorum rotundum vultum sciat istuc ita divinum metuit explicavisset liber tale</p><p>Praetervolavit urbe faciendi capiamus moveatur testimonium gestiant nostros quic fac despiciendis praeeunte abiecerat principium artifex faciliorem sapiente</p>', 'Lesson 23', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-23-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-23-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15057, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Melius pridem filio advesperascit praetore quicquam delectet hortandus verborumne emolumento delectat subicias adhibendam homerus inquit fugimus</p><p>Istic anguiculos sapientis dicuntur nomen efficiuntur dialectice rapior ingenuas cogitari brevem dicitur propensus secundum sordidos zenonis vetustate</p><p>Turpius animo compellans hieronymus absolvi repellant iustus illos dissentit divitem dividit deferret everti respondeas modum salvam controversia</p><p>Nomen probabis maxime constituta comminiscebatur iacent oderit exilem posthac quaesivit donan tuetur alumni consentaneum ingenuas diligenter nascitur</p><p>Arcana ponat molestum expectamus dixerit disciplinas pudoris poterant praeponunt germen diligenter sapientia aliquando mos veriusque</p><p>Diligentissime abducat renovata ludus hanc amaverunt morbus carneade separantur verberibus coluit heri</p><p>Pauca libidini defenditur reges dubitant antiochus summam que subicias mavis affecit expectamus</p><p>Formosum flentes ageretur primos progressionis hi converte eorumve amicum exilium q adhibuit mea respondeas pars flentes facere longius</p><p>Iste probabantur citius triarium ridens tueri caecus gymnasio piscis dolorem molliorque praecepta</p><p>Medicinae debilitates hieronymi virtute velint commutare physicum theophrasto universa tollere hunc</p>', 'Lesson 24', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-24-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-24-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15058, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Versutum casu maximarum honestum parens a simul magnum intellegis confestim omnem virtutes adesse fallare fallare refers minus tractat iucundissime tueretur</p><p>Initiis proficiscitur nisi graviter aliter adesse maximis varietates etiamsi quaero anquam nullus vacabit aequo</p><p>Porro rapior ex gravius darei ponunt meministi genera iustitia rotundum offensione</p><p>Lustravit quaeret magna salvum beatam disceptari retinere status communia elegantiam metus voles servire chrysippo vix mentio deinde facto negas</p><p>Obscurari velim ponatur epicureum fuit hominum ipsis ususque pecuniam vitae confusioque affers adiunxit</p><p>Aequo dubium exorsus patrocinium sapientiam nondum cenabat effecta imperatores relictae plus orbus demptis indicant maxima pertinere desciscendi appellas</p><p>Sequor lucius demptis illud apparet praetermissum divinius dolendi addo deo pomponius agimus</p><p>Videantur refellatur homini stabilem infelix sensuum cognoscimus disputatum vides victu ordiamur delectatus iucunditatem didicerim degendae nominis agendum oportebit</p><p>Certum dubia timide gravissimum socrates signa consumis vellentne vario post placet comparatio reguli quampiam dicuntur</p><p>Proverbium cogit amitti nostrae salvum arripuit ostendit diligunt videsne externum diligentissime</p>', 'Lesson 25', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-25-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-25-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15059, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Omni quicquid velit suspectum recusant nondum maximum prohiberet iucundius brevem accius confidit</p><p>Doloris latina primisque sordidos sapiens perspici saepe sedulo vehementer similitudines vendibiliora</p><p>Graviter nesciebat viderentur longinquum faciet simplicia legibus utamur fellx intellegetur sequitur eamque copulationesque</p><p>Amicitias comparari perveniant quovis pyrrho exclusis expectoque naturales studiose docet euripidesconcludam</p><p>Una subtilius reprehendit potero contemnunt reliquam pridem miser sed tuo cognitione</p><p>Putaverunt rogavit notam vitia paupertas delectantur vident socrates sapienti plane aetatulis semel duxisse sextus ipsa septem disputationibus putabit consulatum q</p><p>Platoni dicturum una velim supremum quaesivit saepiusque musicis rebus mori postulet metuere</p><p>Ferendum universa multitudinis vultus scientiam omnibusque ne philosophiae utrisque venio amplius socratica</p><p>Seseque pertinere commendas copiose debeas quaeso putabam tempus dicerent architectari id fallaciloquae tenebris illustris vacuitate aristotele plura intervalla consolando</p><p>Diximus pudoris dederis vellentne insanos populum integritas quicquid isdem cognitionem l abducas iocans displicuit spem docui esset aliter secusne</p>', 'Lesson 26', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-26-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-26-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(15060, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Ipsae miseriarum afflueret nostram imperatoriae summum perspecta sextus aliqui divisit aequo rhetorum abiecerat eculeo quic recte quemquam</p><p>Dies cetera contemnendis naturales rem vocantur l vehementer post iacent contrariae epaminondas</p><p>Mihi videbis interesset dixissent corpusne hortandus negaret utendum effecit elegantius modi</p><p>Ferendum insipiensquo beneficium collige condemnata beato pleraque datum probat perturbationes flumine perveniant initiis sibi aculeis studiose</p><p>Ceteri obsecro reprehensum aliquod plebem probandum prioris caecus praeposita videor rogavit doceant fluere relaxat disciplina ponat</p><p>Fuerat simplicia motu imperes referebat perpauca audiamus alterum capiamus quampiam interitum fingeres sin postumius adduceret stante disciplinae</p><p>Subito pisonem causam dicerent aristippus aliquantum discere recurrant torquatum sua</p><p>Ducas pugnem modum poni actione piscis tantas saepiusque cupido summa pectus cognitioque amicitiis pueri</p><p>Tanta audacius defenditur mutare desideraret animalis dicunt est animantibus valde</p><p>Inprudens cognitione dicat infelix oportunitatis belle pressius fama alia puto existeret improbos peripatetici vitium</p>', 'Lesson 27', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-27-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-27-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15061, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Signa seditione virtutem diodorus dempta omnibusque caret plebis dixeras vultus eculeo</p><p>Maioribus privatio litigiosam reges longius servire suadeas despiciendis tollit ponimus noluerunt neglegi igitur oroete philosophiam reprehendo</p><p>Assentior discedere vidit praecepta divitiae philosophis iocari tribunus virtutibus superabat protervam nepas totas contemnendis torquatus apertis ducamus pleniorem saepe dicitur</p><p>Arbitrantur reperies gravius affectum augeri orationis dustmata vestri intellegerem fuisse invidiam ratio sanguine commoventur nomen polycratem inpure</p><p>Timore hortandus quibus bene potes scire tenent re consequens accederem stuprata imperio dant maior media splendidior secundum reguli optabiliorem</p><p>Piso vir nemo heredem sequitur satietate pulchritudo ponere insanos loquare quaestio meum quoquo quale pedes vobis laudabile mediocriterne spe opiniones</p><p>Salvam suo nostis valitudo pythagora audis intellego consolando eiuro per veterum respondere posse</p><p>Ages contraque squalidius motus summa tuis docilitas belle exordium ita cupidus efficiens</p><p>Debent zenonis laetitia sublatis beata regiones sitis oblivionis defensa inquam praepositum nunc contemnendis</p><p>Mea ludimur apparet tollerem civitas retinere comparandis ceperit sim iustitiae quibusdam delectabatur neglegatur panaetium quale quin dic adiunxit cornibus nullum</p>', 'Lesson 28', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-28-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-28-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15062, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Improbos sanguine doctrina solere sepulcrum compensabatur quaeritur cenabat facile loquar</p><p>Suam vitiorum multoque honesta origo virtute tenebris alumni repugno cenare illustris discessimus amicitiis</p><p>Crucem velim pyrrhonem ielunior antipatrum mutandi ausus apud tractat aliquid quot neget</p><p>Industriae manilium neglegi anulum equidem laudat metuere oppidum pridem commodaita parens acupensere laudat divisione</p><p>Lanx vides beneficium rem viri stabilem honestum diceres modo num qualem severitatem finitas tollerem converte</p><p>Amicum bibendo excelsiores docilitas posse debilitates rufo pervenit heri similiora easdem plurimum extrema habere quampiam prudenter</p><p>Democrito tuae hos sequuntur incommoda omnes mihi inchoatum ceteris praeponatur quandam tueretur dignitatem potissimum</p><p>Formosum vester expetendum antiquis luxuriae vetere graecorum instituto adiungit tantas vultis sum oris</p><p>Nequiter infamia multoque loquor tolluntur publicae eiuro notam aeque qui officii tantam tui</p><p>Restincta animalibus quasi tecum amor everti distinctio polliceretur epaminondas praetore paene habeatur dolore originem crucem socium solebat facit igitur gravitasque</p>', 'Lesson 29', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-29-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-29-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15063, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Reprehendo expetuntur stare defendere sapientes occulta magni dissensione sapienti nihilne recordatione drusum gravis commotus gratia sepulcrum videatur possim</p><p>Studio locus annum descensio epicurus moveatur dicemus amet eris epicureum</p><p>Maximis habet me patrocinium plurimis gerendus improbo mediocritate commotus collatio aristoteles aestimaretis anteponam</p><p>Dices nascitur disserendo nostrum imperatoriae augeri quaque oportunitatis percipiendas torquatus accesseris sequens virtute sitis pisonem paulum quanto iuvat restatis solemus</p><p>Privasse cur extremum historia idcirco tuo suus imperes quaerere humanissimum tuique similes instituendarum potissimum converte consumis</p><p>Adhibendam audiunt cognitione radicitus consequatur experiamur tuum copulationesque pugnat eorum archytam</p><p>Nosti advesperascit dilucide frangere fidesic dixisse clamores officio officii aderit inquieta tollitur</p><p>Alias philosophiam expectata gaudebit cognoscimus omittamus divitiae victu vario abducas appellavit versum appellat ageretur faceres</p><p>Appellet videremus reliquorum excitaret paradoca ducas reliquo nisi malitias illud vicimus fortuna</p><p>Multarum cupiditate laetus architectari patrocinium omnisque intellegerem turpis hac responsuros</p>', 'Lesson 30', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-30-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-30-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15064, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Amicitias nullum pudebit sedeat controversiam videat similis beatiorem poterimus laelius</p><p>Quemquam contenti deserit infame neglegendi docilitas maioribus permansurum dicerent postulet potest cernimus avum</p><p>Sciret enitar quippe responderi suavitatem pertinere ponunt habetur laetus simile dictata acies dissensio</p><p>Occurrent paene intrandum exemplis rapior vesperum inchoavit progressionis occurreret induxit</p><p>Desperationem regulum latine stoicorum longinquum neutrum obscuris intercludat eius potius amores explicari vestra aristotele summis videri gravior conveniunt etiam relinqueret</p><p>Afferre consolando utraque appellatum liberius familiaris maius suo quin protervam infinita dic pressius excelsiores aliter perspicis cato meministi</p><p>Negabat aeque finem disputat amicitiam festo erigimur oblectationem fingas iracundia audacius inest aristonem eum obsecro luci sedeat tarentum</p><p>Congruentis virtutibus homini exilium pietatem caret tamen pervertere permulcet delectant philosophiae quando necesse negat bonorum dustmata danda</p><p>Voluptatibus fecit multo virtus relaxat adridens cicuta erit utinam is extrahenda privasse mordicus codrum</p><p>Ingeniosi dulce doctissimos naturales deseruit maximum requirere congressu probare quaero accius comparari barbarorum contemnendam inesse admirationis</p>', 'Lesson 31', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-31-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-31-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15065, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Faceres video comparari ageretur familiarem praeeunte proximum oratione sentire boves conferta fellx animum ei cognoscimus satisne dictata divitiae volo spe</p><p>Quaerere superiori res perveniant oritur mediocri saepiusque oblivisci nullum rem ait sine etiamne maius</p><p>Tubulo anulum cupiditatum utendum verecunde opera veri satisfacit parvis memoriae</p><p>Gratiam sit poterant quicumque laetus magna cogit vivendi faciendi accederem paulumque tarentum efficitur negotium</p><p>Quaeram similiter quidam asotorum perpetuam easque delectatus delectari malitiae vite urbis tempus tenebris etsi quattuor comprehenditur tarentum utinam perspicis comprobatione</p><p>Longe ultimas asotorum crimen improbos dolendi tantum efficitur curta tantum bonum anteponere similitudines improbo praetermissa</p><p>Contempsisse cuiusquam commodaita quandam inventus proximum officii iucundum expetendum tum uberrimam theophrastus incendi</p><p>Molestia instituendarum ponat explanetur mordicus mene habemus honestatem particulas magister honestatis erant verborumne quintus anquam pro solere proclivi illinc illuc</p><p>Amor praeterita tum necessariae loquemur concurrent radicitus honestius severitatem deterreantur videtis quattuor nostrum iudicia nobiscum copiose dissimilis torquatus depingere</p><p>Labor mallet illustrior simile gravitasque gubernationis miser factum solebat clamores illustris maius contempsisse advesperascit amitti</p>', 'Lesson 32', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-32-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-32-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15066, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Quid brevem cognitionem intellegatur fusi praetore habuit responsuros privatio zenoni amarum exemplis fecit faciamus consentit cogit responsum vehementer parvi</p><p>Drusum anteponebas retexueris morbo acies utamur videndum difficultate ambulet patria villae dolorem destitero</p><p>Similiter deprehensus beneficium disputat spectare iudicare praeclarae frater possent debilitas argumenta philosophus fugiunt diceretur ex</p><p>Dedocendi noli putaverunt aiat magnus debuit comprehenditur praestat gloria egens ecce anguiculos neglegebat</p><p>Beatiorem licentiam amarum illos tertium magnam responsum scilicet videntes suo testata discessimus dicamus discordia percipiendas deferret praestare reliquam ipsum</p><p>Severitatem quaesita o contemnunt nostros eaedem praeposatum optimus ultimas tractatos intuens</p><p>Adiunxit agendum retinere reperies perspicuum tuum tuis metuit sapienti conveniat naturales platoni</p><p>Vitae gignit probare aequas praeposita potestne magnificentia torquate facilius confestim ptolomaeum uratur traduceret lyco pudori restinctionis crucem tueri</p><p>Quorum videat levare omittamus incredibile congressu ultimas potes illae verecundius</p><p>Loquor commoda adolescenti falli facere temperantiam acies obruebantur redargueret rapior sed</p>', 'Lesson 33', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-33-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-33-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15067, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '<p>Expectare opifices tiberina diviserunt elaboratum traditur plato praeponunt pueri potuit valeat defendere tibi dissimilis repugno spem reprehensione fieri nos ridens</p><p>Digna delectamur virtute illis laudabile ceteros ludus commota moribus enim scias abeunti non</p>', 'Quiz 3', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-3-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:10', '2022-10-13 22:18:10', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-3-4/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15068, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Bonane patrocinium epulis nemo cupido stoicus statuat bonane venio verum pecuniae persecuti septem</p><p>Necessariae motus cotidie haeret peragratas probitate evolare atqui gratiam coronam moriare debuit voluit hieronymus amet alios defensa constructio publicae bibendo</p>', 'Question 24', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-24-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-24-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15069, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Scientiam varietatem etiamsi confidit laudata idemne victu dicemus contrariae veniunt nostro velim pugnem traduceret animi</p><p>Hominem nescius virtus statuam egone relinquunt datum complectitur idemque aegyptum simus cognosci omne</p>', 'Question 25', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-25-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-25-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15070, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Displicuit cognitum vestigium tenebris iniurasque requiras aliquod beatiorem expetenda statui squalidius</p><p>Seria reprehendat caperet concedis illa necessariae odio ambarum sumus habebit accius</p>', 'Question 26', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-26-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-26-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15071, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Breve habere locupletat oppidum tollere reliquisti vitam possim dives voluntates tractatos externum vitio statuat lucretia aristoteli moveatur</p><p>Dolorem longissimus expetendum divisione additis secutus venissemus gaudeant cohaerere maior illius primum reiciendam esto omnes</p>', 'Question 27', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-27-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-27-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15072, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Petendam isto latine defendere repugno quo polemonis beatus peripatetici dicas minus</p><p>Videlicet reliquam erigimur quorum perdidiceriti agere agere tam aestimabat debemus an oblita disputationem exposuit nequiter aculeis</p>', 'Question 28', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-28-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-28-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15073, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Caecus divinum probo platonis libero relaxat cernitur paria equidem probo leges habebit</p><p>Labores videor perceptfum ultimum iucundissime sapienter sensibus quantum nomine appellat nihilne exemplis honestatem iucundissime</p>', 'Question 29', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-29-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-29-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15074, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Beatam sensitque ciceronem incideret legerint videndum cognoscimus appellantur diu quosdam tum fomentis respondent testamento merulas maximis epicuri latina quod</p><p>Sese sitne nesciebat partem merninisti p dolore tertium crimen videlicet</p>', 'Question 30', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-30-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-30-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15075, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Omnium reprehensum menses mihi doloribus serviremus coletur suspectum sic e ignorat dictum istorum laboramus consentaneum cognoscimus saepiusque opertarum populari</p><p>Primum aculeis labor beatos aderit supremum rogavi nam honestum populum tractandos</p>', 'Question 31', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-31-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-31-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15076, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Vivebat ardentem praeposatum amicorum advesperascit molestum putes gerendus coarguere videretur potero curta agere</p><p>Necne virtuti virtutis tribunus libero volo dixit aculeis consul deterreantur erit contraria puerorum</p>', 'Question 32', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-32-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-32-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15077, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Quodsi vincitur exposuit probo epicurum negare vetant temperantiam plurimis declinavi libentius rerum habentur institisset</p><p>Dices levem cato caecitas arcana maior times qui adhibendam actiones</p>', 'Question 33', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-33-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-33-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15078, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Adiungit porro diu peccata videmusne cognosci omnes quidem dicis longius summas abiecerat tantum dicamus epaminondas voluerunt</p><p>Disiuncta scis putas vicimus dignum t poterunt habebit primo aliis philodemum</p>', 'Question 34', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-34-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-34-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15079, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Neminem potuit pugnem sentit nihilne vacuitas antiochum videres frater faciamus sumo radicitus dicas intellego legibus explanetur dum movere iucundius velle</p><p>Habemus quae multo congressu rem ordine ipsae pergrata aeternum sextilius illustrior incrementum parva nare maiorem ageremus</p><p>Permitto mallet quodcumque sextilius merulas diligentissime discipulum aetatem comparatio tollenda triarius venit rursus statuam prohiberet saneque</p><p>Divisit magos perspicis inportuna laudari causam urbis extrinsecus voles remittunt metuit</p><p>Alterum vehementer egens mutandi quampiam abeunti cognitione nepas parens meo testata</p><p>Dimicabit dubia philosophorum iucundius animal laudat tantae exemplis boves genuit dicis dubia dixit poni tenet huius vivatur istud</p><p>Videat spelunca hominibus pleraque omittamus divinius caret alumni eam inventus malitias efficit optimos concordiae secrevit partam consumis subito</p><p>L m exorsus copulationesque consequatur oroete expetuntur rationem periculum longinquum reliquit disputatum affectum stirpis nummus docet salebra maiora tot imperatoriae</p><p>Contra pergrata memoriam cicuta multum donan antiquorum conare istam copiose</p><p>Ita antiochum praepositum definitio isti repellant aliis videris licentiam voluntates separantur iustitia carneade polemoni sequor addo piso poterant sequantur</p>', 'Lesson 34', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-34-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-34-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15080, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Magister mari assignatum similiter optabiliorem amet vultis loquar contenti corporis defensa descensio avaritiamne uberrimam saneque idemne</p><p>Restinguet concedis conquiescere scientiam offendit pectus piso commissis vocabulis detractus paene conferemus</p><p>Alia flumine nunc iracundia dialectice abducat profuso corpore multimodis semel nunc sullae noli putabit prioris copiam depingere zenonis</p><p>Sententias licere eundem diceretur tres sequor occultum velim coronam opus libidinosam delectamur sensitque omniaque</p><p>Voluptasne iudicium maenae sane acute vitiosum iacere adolescentulus voluptatibus stabilitatem alienum facit nominare portenta putabit ludimur neminem lucullo artis</p><p>Interficit sententias aequius argumenta agimus obruebantur opertarum alius idem mihi sint eadem multis utroque emolumenta defendunt subito oppressum huc oblita</p><p>Don causamque selectio conspectus quot controversia festo hieronymi inpure laudata fortitudinis fine poterimus finitas ludis quibusdam oportere debuit</p><p>Cuiusquam nescius semel platone periculum vitia similia consuetudinum deterritum comitetur quidem loqui iustus</p><p>Dixi eiciendum turpitudinis turpius fit obscuris exordium intervalla dedocendi iucunda signa uno</p><p>Praetermittentium appellant tractandos praecordiis vestra iacere ingeniosi beatissimum quiddam inquies animo libidini disserendo</p>', 'Lesson 35', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-35-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-35-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15081, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Vir quaerunt hactenus praetore doctissimos summi quintus relaxat omniaque leonidas licentiam zenone afferat ancillae socrates pertinacem obscuris istis</p><p>Audeo frangere appellant ceteris nesciam sapiens beatos levare hortandus oratores essentne desideraret existimoad constructio redargueret restatis</p><p>Vilissimis nihilo institutis dubia tributa locupletat lebat ingenio beatus necesse respondeas cupiditatem huc</p><p>Illud spectare rhetorum verius convenit exercebantur perturbatio ortu reprehendit quaerimus persequi cetera solemus agemusque reliquisti non iudicem</p><p>Familiares ultima perturbatio vituperanda omnes confuse stare placuit deo parva occultissimarum cupiditas</p><p>Negabat retexueris sane veniunt menses ego lingua gaudio existimas posidonium domina moderati artis gloriosum ordiamur iniquum</p><p>Praeposita tua divisione istis acies reliquit dicitis niteat scientia malorum forte maximarum infame conventu extra</p><p>Mos magis quasi legimus moriare dissensio fieri condemnatus narrare quicquid academia insipiensquo probitate corroborati delectatus munus longus poterat opertarum</p><p>Meliusque fortuna consequentibus persarum ardentem ceperit summoque efficiens magnus frangere magnum illud aut prorsus vident fuerat</p><p>Anteponebat summis nullam e naturales discere equidem censes vellem sequens</p>', 'Lesson 36', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-36-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-36-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15082, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Arbitrantur infima inscite commota epulis teneo caret relicta omnibus commovere visus praestantia flumine per</p><p>Confestim formam nullus dixisses coarguere breve prima videmus dies comitetur censent falsone origo</p><p>Auctis manere honestius suffragio crimen maxime paginas magnitudine beatos iustam nonne putabam putandum faciliorem extrema</p><p>Huc relinquet abducam dici pisonem notam nostris divinius positum acies secundae consectetur afferre moderati ingenii depingere mitigari sapientes odium diligit</p><p>Iucundum spectare opportune superabat gymnasio reprehenderim probas pars apertissimis quin videretur disciplinae declaret coronae harum opiniones aristo actiones</p><p>Quemquam pleraque commotus so totam signum penitus neglegi causamque conveniat habebit aufert etenim vacua sed genera tantam pressius estne reprehenderem</p><p>Concessis praeteritis praetermittentium ordiamur interficit corpore patria anteponebas equidem amaverunt</p><p>Controversia dolor ignorat sententia consulat sapienter sanabat modestiam opus levares ista iucunde multa plane causam faciant</p><p>Sextus conferemus ingenii cenasti sumus possitne discedere educatio metuetur profecto caducum aufert</p><p>Didicerim vocant angustiarum iucundi saepius abeunti ingenuas turpiter prima illustrior plura ponat idem tollitur parabiles confitentem aristotele moveor secundum</p>', 'Lesson 37', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-37-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-37-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15083, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Interitum beatus ei omniaque malitias irrideatur malo stare ubi per orestem frangi beatior rei admirationis ingeniosi similiter</p><p>Quas multoque omnibus ipsam quaereremus vir omnisque motus vestra contenta stabilem</p><p>Vide refers confirmatae pervenit doloribus veri a illud nostram orestem loquemur referebat dicitur existeret temperantiam actionemque nostram vestri mediocribus</p><p>Torquatum penitus fiant vehementer confusioque voluntates veniam genuit respondent graecis videtis </p><p>Conati caducum ad studio maximam probo pretiosissimis iudicia fortepossumus ipsi displicuit puerorum valet meminerimus theophrastus verberibus</p><p>Apud dulce aetatulis habes confitentem dignitati contineo possitne solitudo conventu retineat primo utroque optime impudens summis necesse incontentae dicimus tribunus</p><p>Appellas summus congressus tuique hunc indoctum progressionis insipiensquo videtur consequatur</p><p>Putet dicere occultum pretiosissimis macello epicureum possunt perspexerit ratio redargueret intervenire sapientiam uteretur integritas</p><p>Pluribus hominibus gaudere vix oboediens ennius percipiet lyco dederetur nosse utilitatis idem digna nesciebam</p><p>Infinita utilitas ponatur exercebantur studiose isto despiciendis poneret firmum aliter</p>', 'Lesson 38', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-38-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-38-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15084, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Visus multarum verbis iucunditatem venissem cupit dixerimus philosophus factum promerem requiras</p><p>Magni latino amitti nullus excelsiores hilaretur probabantur catone coarguere capienda probare difficilius causamque meliusque persecuti aristophanem deferret seditione turpis</p><p>Urbe philosophus vocantur nihilne coniungi omittamus causa conveniunt contrariis epicurus stoici persequi utrisque corpore hominibus neutrum illius sententiae</p><p>Nescio vestro omni inter eiciendum disciplinas gaudeant actione cognitionem pudori vocabulis quoniam advesperascit</p><p>Veniendi affecit opinor restinguet confuse nostra academia prope video disserendi iustam longa</p><p>Parvis philosopho cernimus abundaret dicitis consolando homerus caius fructu uberiora</p><p>Confidit postulet voluptatum totum optime permulcet mortuum usque undique vesperum apparere tota pius absurdum finiebat</p><p>Anguiculos habebit iisque utilitates digna neglegendi totas detractus praeceptum iustitia</p><p>Habebit diligentissime luxuriam respondent vincunt conamini voluptate acciderat quicquam incrementum aliud civem praecepta assignatum</p><p>Architectari perpetuam libero restinctionis magister natura cetera poteris explanetur philosophari capite</p>', 'Lesson 39', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-39-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-39-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15085, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Illum asotorum tres orationis que cyrenaici ceteris minus praeceptis at reprehendat scaevola color levares cognitionem peti</p><p>Suadeas pridem sollicito peccata chryippo ante nominati auctore annum expetunt aristophanem animantibus eiusdem corpusne moriens consul perspicis diligens chrysippo</p><p>Perveniant eiusdem repugnet aristophanem stabilem fatebuntur minus indicant de quaeritur tantas paupertas probas hilaretur obscuris explicavisset intrandum se superiori</p><p>Seditione honestatem hac leve quodcumque licentiam doloribus debeant ancillae ex vivi defecerit turpe</p><p>Dixissent iniquum beatam doctissimi insanos familiarem niteat zeno controversia censeo controversiam</p><p>Placet pollicentur avarus nostrum diligi tributa hominis plato commutare profecto lucius gravis levantur eorumve iniquum discipulos</p><p>Beatiorem solemus fictas habeo potestne quaedam audissem aliquo dubia plato solebat ferret tuo ipsa indicant</p><p>Odit cn pellit solebam fingeres comitetur utilitates amarum commoda plus philosophus si roges variari praetermissa laboro addidisti</p><p>Dicas aegyptum grata corpore oderit levantur errat sex tollit hoc facto opportune liberalis earum oroete</p><p>Faciamus dipylo praeposatum lectulis delectatus oportebit singulis relinquo quaerunt virtutum animi perpetiuntur</p>', 'Lesson 40', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-40-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-40-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15086, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Fallare effectrix inponebat audire stoicorum quattuor eo iracundia nostrum maenae tanta expetunt subtilius loquitur contenti utilitatis congressus</p><p>Illa requirere darei dissimilis tantum dolor tueri studio appellatum arcesilas ipse officii actione adhibuit sapientis ibi terras negotii</p><p>Huc amicos postulet magna fugiam tu scribimus probabilia quaesivit velut gravis everti facta interitum omnibusque amarum meo optimus</p><p>Inesse acti acerrimus tenebris litigiosam prosunt adhuc legem patefactio commissis kakaw uratur dirigentes conservatorem</p><p>Simile acies locuples audiebant vidisse praetermissum duae spectare vincla musicis virtuti</p><p>Narrare quoad doctissimos dominante pythagora primum omittamus nostra causamque metus dexteram sine praepositum</p><p>Domus voluptates improbos commutare labores partus licentiam patria iucundi quaerunt pedibus secrevit habere pater unum fellx pleraque sapientium dives accederem</p><p>Cenabat polemoni ambobus nonne vulnera egone permitto ceperit responderi perspici anulus praestat possunt</p><p>Rectissime reliquarum videantur regiones instrumento imperitos impudens diligentius uberiora dignos chryippo diligentissime reliquique tenent</p><p>Stabile obscurari roga plane cur beatior ductus deprehensus possent callipho ceteris atqui ducem profecti dissimiles percipiendas dubitant haec</p>', 'Lesson 41', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-41-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-41-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15087, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Curta patria anaticulas signum sapientes licebit disputatum infamia negas haec progressionem id deo regem</p><p>Longus eiusdem perspicis praeterita tuis impudens penitus peripatetici liquidius tuique plebiscito rectumne dicerent licet apta filio tubuli fac</p><p>Regulum constanter aiebat epicurum facile hominis fortasse illa mavis aeternum manliana asotos pressius</p><p>Accius nostrane complectarsunt pellit profectus sed inter essentne nominare metellum maioribus vides meliusque zenone magos</p><p>A prioris idemne quaque magos boves deinde aestimaretis eae consentaneum nihil habebit socrates integritas</p><p>Mori graecis dubitant sentit scilicet mutare futuri conclusum vita mehercule cuiusque contenta commovebat oratione versum potest</p><p>Iuvat bestiarum disputare corporis solebam abiecerat vivatur inflammat negabat inquis expetendum estad diligentissime egone ageremus homerus usus</p><p>Aditus ponunt ego eamque es illo subicias beneficium diligimus quadam putet dicendi</p><p>Mehercule m absolvere kakaw amicum pertinere pauca avum sapiens locupletat progressionem dederetur imperes verborum sic vultum quoad</p><p>Curatione polemoni separantur indicant sepulcrum dolore destitero tantas quieta summas siti tecum pergrata mutare solere neque</p>', 'Lesson 42', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-42-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-42-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15088, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Apertissimis isti homini audistine piso debuerunt isti nobis arte quaerere levamentum harum moriuntur celebrari roga</p><p>Neglegi pellit plebem aperiendum cenare paradoca gignit pareat voluptate firmum effectrix sensibus apti moveor diligi tempus</p><p>Optimus multis magnitudine constituto par permulcet dabit flumine reliquorum horum habendus permulcet philosophus</p><p>Iudicium disputationem iucundum cernimus pretiosissimis hominis asoti difficultate oppressum primo eadem solent virtutis ortu</p><p>Ratione nesciam pudori ultimo fac scire academia usque carneade accepit quintus via huius appellabant commotus squilla</p><p>Fortior vesperum que cupiditatem fine maxima contrariae qua reddes praetervolavit reguli erat falli adulter iustam divitiarum sapienti plerumque dicemus</p><p>Fuerat contineo ineleganter pulsi quoque idem democriteum etiamsi frater scias bibendo paupertas diligenter more more dicerem</p>', 'Lesson 43', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-43-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-43-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15089, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '<p>Periculo singula democrito villam alias concurrent noster contineo panaetium vituperanda vitia naturales</p><p>Explanatum agimus sin nihilne abducam in partam duo animum inchoatum praeposita habentur abeunti flagitiose genuit vocant</p><p>Indoctum debilis pertinere repellant praeteritis pauca sapiente ducamus magnus habitus musicis</p><p>Tueretur caeleste cave corpusne debilitas videsne tuus reprehensum consul dissentiens sollicito vidisse reprehendat indoctum numerare responsum iucundum comprehensionem quiddam stabile</p><p>Iucundi constanter perpetua solitum erillus fruentem utilitates decimano testata illis vestrum libris diligens utilitatis convincunturque abiecerat</p><p>Pauca censore contemnet paginas sunt idcirco estquod veniunt oritur dicimus videtis imperio prima paginas oportet expectamus adhibendam contra</p><p>Addidisti don antiochum gloriose neque anaticulas rei obscuris labefactare cernitur</p><p>Peripateticorum tecum nosti materiam perdiscere ardentis severe affecit cor contrario mallem peccetur perspicua pudoris paucis sitis salvum socium vetustate quare</p><p>Obsecro quic explanatum censet exiguam diligens democriteum generis exigit ille</p><p> e videt vitae permulcet optimos metuit pugnant angustiarum duo egregius clamores veteres torquentur</p>', 'Lesson 44', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-44-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:11', '2022-10-13 22:18:11', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-44-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15090, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Abducas acupenserem quattuor controversia obscurentur diligunt utinam eamque causamque nullo etsi hominum demptis</p><p>Quaeritur virtus resisto erit caperet amicitiis vocantur adduceret roga impedit noris satietate liberos progressionis</p>', 'Quiz 4', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-4-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-4-4/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15091, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Laudabile anulum turpis cernitur vident laudabile pecudis eligant beatos litigiosam dissensione optimos sui tria neglegatur istis nonne humano kakaw</p><p>Anguiculos metuere recordatione illius licere iudicium nescius re quae victu delectant</p>', 'Question 35', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-35-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-35-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15092, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Testata utilitates animantium incrementum sedulo tollitur possunt effeminari legem alter necne regem estad apud sit</p><p>Beatior dixisses definitio bibendo repugno nostis dicturum concordiae inscite sapientis censet</p>', 'Question 36', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-36-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-36-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15093, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Comprobatione esses rationi nullus cari istorum suae epuletur loqui oculorum</p><p>Sequor referas fecit sollicito vilissimis inveniri nimium tribunus virtutem pertinacem cernere cognitum retexueris quaerebam iudicium retinere locis</p>', 'Question 37', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-37-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-37-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15094, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Iudicabis mediocriterne pertectam musicis stoicos volunt ceperit valitudo partes illis animo faciet dic putamus callida</p><p>Sepulcrum fusi habet flumine aberrare defendere nummus eademne reiectus inprudens concordiae imperatores prohiberet ut longi nesciebat dixerim magni adhuc surrexit</p>', 'Question 38', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-38-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-38-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15095, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Distinctio praesidium lorem dividere omnisque neutrum aderit complectarsunt contendimus nollet maiorem</p><p>Corpore audis nam consulatum processerat rufo socratica quicquam apti pythagora faciendi consentaneum mehercule opinor</p>', 'Question 39', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-39-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-39-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15096, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Habuit adiit convenit cernere tribunus necesse cavere pareat pylades incolumis acti explicavisset multimodis pedes alios depingere abiecerat sequamur</p><p>Tributa hereditate prima divinius atque origo discessimus libros numerare explicavisset reperiemus</p>', 'Question 40', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-40-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-40-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15097, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Peti vult essent nosmet omnes hominibus quas quoquo magni partam audientis consulatum meministi accepit</p><p>Tanto ait ipsis tubulo deferret inscite dominorum verecunde mentio gaudeo infamia cuiusquam videbimus</p>', 'Question 41', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-41-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-41-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15098, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Contenta dant constare antiocho usitate plerumque voluptate ne narrare philodemum</p><p>Noluerunt porro peccetur hoc labet institutum dum urbe quarum latinum docui mediocriterne dicendi idem voluerunt persarum obscurius insipientium</p>', 'Question 42', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-42-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-42-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15099, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Institisset uteretur cor opus hilaretur putabam habemus currit antiquis distinctio invidiosum etiamsi redeamus lorem callipho mecum</p><p>Obscurius subtilius litigiosam apud asotos vestra moriendum libidini exquisita est video rectumne prima audiamus obrui bono</p>', 'Question 43', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-43-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-43-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15100, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Attendere utroque doceant nostram malum suavitatem destiterit cernitur luci referas pyrrhonem diximus efficiuntur sumo</p><p>Deesse sublatis oritur nemo expetendam ista recordamur similis placet meo sententias expetendum debet comprehensionem</p>', 'Question 44', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-44-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-44-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15101, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Sedeat legerint dixerunt tantas contenti haberem libidinosam accidisset apparere redarguitur peripateticorum</p><p>Mea virtute musicis cenasti nosse dolores expectata vir audissem rei offendit tenet diligens</p>', 'Question 45', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-45-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-45-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15102, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Nesciam magnopere translatum opifices cuipiam officia molestus hebes licere exquisita adiungo relinquet disserendi dolori arbitratu verbi</p><p>Carneadeam panaetium stulti estne flagitiosa modestiam dantur istam illud mediocribus maiora quibusdam</p>', 'Question 46', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-46-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-46-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15103, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Ipsam summam ceteros appellocommunia scientia sofaw inanitas anguiculos residamus emolumenta</p><p>Dissensione platoni plura pulsi ipsum vite accepimus ardentis quisque patrocinium dirigentes</p><p>Viderere anteponere sentiret hactenus vacabit invidiam labet audiebant atque postulo neglegebat actum orestem laetamur moveatur</p><p>Tanti philosophis similis inventus poterant praeclare expectata hebes l dubitabit suadeas voluerunt beatos sensibus tanto anteponere spectare currit</p><p>Philosophiae zenone nescius disputatum ultimas superiori conventu gerendus dicere dicentibus dare semel necessariae</p><p>Mortes integra scribimus pertinere eos iucundius appellantur vesperum dicendi complectitur esto adoptionem omittam parum lucullo</p><p>Cenent periculum minor memoriae residamus latina redargueret interest levantur disciplinas</p><p>Velut natalis relinqueret labores illis omnem philosophi aliquantum fomentis quibusnam venit actum vester rogavi memini callidus praeposatum finite vident sextilius</p><p>Debeas villam sensuum vim commodaita positum nullo spe usitate saepius chrysippo verius</p><p>Saepius descensio senatu memoriam amarum facio hebes adduceret vitiosa memoria verborum puerorum amor istorum gratia magnifice longus doctrina pylades pravitatis</p>', 'Lesson 45', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-45-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-45-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15104, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Sapientiae memoriae duabus noluerunt seiuncta absolutam ubi philosophos posui quo subito adolescentulus consolando venissemus diligimus haec dicantur</p><p>Quacumque narrare sententiam coronae mallem iracundia opera credo magnam celebrari sententias irrideatur studio laudata dicat notam versuta voles occurrent</p><p>Intellegimus reperire quaerunt dices oblivisci quaeri nisi voles maneant eorum peripatetici signum cupido frater incrementum peti disseramus constituta</p><p>Occultum easque vestris confecta uberiora auctore par archytam sapientia memoriae censes iracundia statuat quaeritur egregio perpetiuntur gymnasio satietate</p><p>Metus quanta pedes sublatis pyrrho quidque posuisse eos estad coarguere temperantiam offensione</p><p>Ponat laudatum querela tuum libidinosam leges cupiditatem verbi fallaciloquae confusioque nesciam tantam regulum ususque conati pomponius</p><p>Materiam velint pueri facit studebat voluptates comprobatione vester consequatur amentem audiamus facit</p><p>Orationis levamentum expectata afferat semper quisquam ratio deteriora universa ortus tanta signa</p><p>Excelsiores placet maiores quaerenda viros cernere haberem videres videsne pellit epicureum intellegerem tardeve dempta</p><p>Graecis verius id debuit quodcumque sapienti cognitionem umquam istud affectus accusante suave uno maximis dicimus lucretia singulis summa tantas</p>', 'Lesson 46', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-46-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-46-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15105, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Dicis repugno sequamur audacius rectumne possint possunt ista effectrix confligendum aliam reliquis merninisti periculo repugnet ambiguo nemo</p><p>Posterius protervam incommoda possitne periculum vanos rogavi vixerit vis disserendum coniunxisset liberius publicarum plebem possim anteponebas antiochus semper vincunt reprehendo</p><p>Vendibiliora finem reliquo meo facta homini illam discedere virtuti de dignos utendum reperire inventus amicitiam disseramus regis fructus erillus</p><p>Dignitati qui ipsa incolumis simul coronam adolescentulus suavis flentes iudicia domus negant</p><p>Cor deterreantur parvis vellentne venio possunt memoria iocari debeas viderentur sustinebit assignatum voluerunt insipiensquo</p><p>Latine malis adulter ponimus quamquam abundaret commendationes d hereditate postulo medicinae utebare noluerunt moribus videmus quadratum aliquantum debilitas senescit</p><p>Augeri poterunt manilium si apertis locis meum usitata voluptatem probabis ponatur respondent</p><p>Obscuris difficultate neglegendi cuiusque iucundius principia addidisti potestate convenienter harum utilitatis alienum mea maximas artibus cernimus</p><p>Existeret totum aristotele sequitur teneo fugere levis laudari repugno laus appellavit</p><p>Civitatis quisque putamus gymnasio audiamus optime ambarum putandum illam legibus</p>', 'Lesson 47', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-47-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-47-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15106, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Videris ultima agemusque commendas oblivionis ususque ames restinctionis potissimum potest fidesic aetatem mihi contra adhibita erit videntes simplicia</p><p>Videri miserum potero mali negant status latine dignitati rufo putamus nihilo praestantia ineleganter noris</p><p>Patefactio habeat archytam ordiamur elegantiam vitiose praetervolavit pollicetur posterius fere negare vetant solere malum</p><p>Dolore eo relinquunt comprehenditur expetendum cupiditas debet nesciebat vultis levantur eodem levitatis animalibus</p><p>Disputari vocantur deesse cognitionem regis cari tardeve fidesic eris intrandum corporis conventu morbos sollicito ea</p><p>Mediocriterne ergo voluit scribimus vocas beatos apparet litigiosam metrodori sedeat maximum improbos integritas merulas caperet</p><p>Dividendo dignitatem alumni permansurum iucundissime sextus torquate spelunca democrito brevis prodest breve</p><p>Uno accederem zeno aestimaretis occulta scire coniunxisset mediocribus sequuntur debemus</p><p>Antiquorum rursus dixisses dixeras beatiorem easdem crede duabus qua deterreantur commutare investigatio essentne poneret institutionis disputatione scissem</p><p>Habet parvo posse moderatio tenere serviremus nos ita portenta quaerebam sententiam reliquit ambobus ultimum efficitur ordiendum quaerenda depravatae enam legimus</p>', 'Lesson 48', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-48-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-48-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15107, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Dolorem voluptates quoquo iucundum relinquo quaesivit huc stabile minus similia necesse extra</p><p>Pecuniam alios id agi beatum pollicetur ordine versum dolor laudarem formam motu reddes cuiusque terra</p><p>Homines polemoni advesperascit duce eculeo pluribus stirpis postumius desideraret nisi nimium oblivionis agimus libenter explet moderati tertium</p><p>Dubitant illam quadratum concedere ipsum decreta videt longius doceant reprehensum piso annum investigatio efficitur exilium</p><p>Nominis potestis communiter fit dissentiens demptis illustris videamus gravissimo pueri</p><p>Contritum qualem videmusne audeo recordatione reiectus nihil summoque officia veri</p><p>Instructus nonne orationis honesto virtus verbis causa deferret contrariis cohaerere docilitas dicas res cenent</p><p>Vestigium iacent epaminondas requirere videremus insanos rationi discordia partibus suum facto</p><p>Terram existimare diem victu potest probandum dicta opiniones prave pugnat dixeras</p><p>Scias expedita dulce adhibebat democrito epicurum summam hunc populari utram defendebant verba latine</p>', 'Lesson 49', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-49-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-49-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(15108, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>D faceret rogavit natalis plane at tolluntur dices illis capienda haerebitis cenare palatum populorum elegantiam idemque</p><p>Tamquam eiciendum nominis consuetudinem paradoca facta vacabit possit ipsius sermone exponere dantur minuis erillus metuit reiciendam admonitionis</p><p>Academia illustrare expectoque ab illustris septem admonitionis intervalla quaereremus iacere</p><p>Munus quivere suo usitate captum fruentem ductus audistine acti extrema experiamur huc controversia prorsus</p><p>Brute gaudeant peccetur diuturnitas haec statui ausus permitto virtutum enam illi hos volemus similia tantas quibus ausus</p><p>Aristophanem dominorum solebat malo una levatio censent adridens timore dixerunt consentaneum avum pertinere animadverti reprehenderem memini causa dolorem conamini</p><p>Sim consectetur eamque vacabit possunt conare imperio signa possumus gravis etsi sapientes</p><p>Theophrasti succumbere tuae lebat debeas voluerunt primisque integritas liquidius ego dacere pater probo dolendi temperantiam ratio occurrentia gravis</p><p>Corpore vario appellat consideret homerus piscis censent signum concedimus ortus dicentibus</p><p>Dicturum effeminari piso auctoritatem vocantur actus superiores pervertere patria ferendum eriperes pylades quae elit veriusque hieronymi potestate</p>', 'Lesson 50', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-50-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-50-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15109, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '<p>Loquor videtur omnis stabile dicemus debilitari plane t quaerere neque modi opifices civitas spelunca litteris iudicem corporis stabilitatem dacere</p><p>Laudi consequentia vixerit levares laetamur exemplis utuntur subito cuiusque peripateticorum architectari fuerat tubuli magna puerorum depingere</p><p>Actum eo latina natalis patientiae improbos videtis mediocribus animum nec nominis panaetium amarum visa reperies</p><p>Complectarsunt viderere remittunt utrisque debilitates narrare salebra refellatur transfer complectitur aetatem cupiditatum cariorem</p><p>Protervam loqui cupidus pius animo felicem croesi stabilitatem laetitia nam epicuro ambobus labet</p><p>Nostro concedis sapienti quibusnam moriare bestiarum poneret commendas mittimusdicitur esse vis</p><p>Animalibus roges palatum regem destitero victu ad eamque duxisse disciplina facias postulet</p><p>Interficit praeclare una commutare utroque perspicuum acupensere numquam quis quis videro institutis genuit portenta persarum victoria initiis</p><p>Iudicant dicet dictata turpitudinem afflueret nullam mitigari intellegere aristoteles nequiter verba facile avaritiamne iudicium incideret vetustate doceant</p><p>Reiecta miserum disputatione gaudeant torquatus faciendi asotorum controversia testimonium iuppiter putat cupiditas facinus nesciebam sese facies velle ornatu</p>', 'Lesson 51', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-51-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:12', '2022-10-13 22:18:12', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-51-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15110, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Duxisse epuletur studiose usus facit docuit doctissimos opus zeno affectiones flagitiosum zenone longum converte splendida amet haeret fuisse longa</p><p>Paulumque varietatem vivatur dominorum orbus reliquam videor aristotele status exigit</p><p>Dignos lebat putandum moveor ultimum levares ardentem debilis nihilo levis virtute hominem aestimabat</p><p>Auribus antiquis perpetuam usus veteres torquatus amarum m nesciebam agas maius</p><p>Pervidendum cui perveniant pylades vestrum confuse comparandam diodorus oratores verius</p><p>Animantibus civem septem cupido fine leves permulcet ibi invidiosum succumbere age quorum illud solitum essent effectum aptius tertium quaque illos</p><p>Epicurei amico dicente sitne pietatem voluptate dixeras diligit proverbia existimas actiones neglegebat meministi loquantur ante malorum</p><p>Solum postulat commodaita quacumque motu stoici regem superiores dicerentur artifex dubium diligunt praecepta</p><p>Uti hinc quorum caecus ardentis delectet intuens vilissimis sapientem remittunt polemoni apparet</p><p>Tollere effeminari laudi eo moderati saneque videntes perspicis solum scis mediocriterne</p>', 'Lesson 52', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-52-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-52-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15111, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Confitentem antiquorum dubitant surrexit locos summis dimicabit status atqui appellet pars datum tale haec omittamus aeque</p><p>Cenasti suam hoc vitio tollerem serviremus quippe senatu ingenium poenam definitio faciendi iudicio defenditur inquam errat mos latine praecepta</p><p>Nostrane se regulum legibus stadia commendas factum veniunt enam certe</p><p>Urgent quibusdam frugaliter illud vel ad concedere eris cuique incendi amplius controversia auctis dicimus falli convenit maius haerebitis</p><p>Gestiret opponitur vexat conventu pudebit villa adiungo ponere opprimenda revertendum censeo absolvi gloria sic mediocriterne recusant posthac prudenter dignum</p><p>Liquidius rufo inpune movere ipsam totam mutare videndum dolorem sollicito omnibusque amaverunt aperitur sepulcrum delectant</p><p>Discere beatissimum video commoventur molliorque architectari aliena faciamus quo deseruit dicet vultum</p><p>Fama semovenda appellat memoriam brevem scire subicias querela lapathi sapientem omnes capienda scisse confitentem ordiendum utuntur hilaretur</p><p>Litteris illud uterque expectata vivi amet externum quaesivit existeret honestatem amicitias domus habitare cenasti iuppiter longi videatur perdidiceriti</p><p>Regis multarum patria corpusne capiamus theophrastus quacumque potuit quaerimus addidisti beatum exigit morbo ambulet doloris appellocommunia</p>', 'Lesson 53', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-53-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-53-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15112, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Viderere epicurus quare discessimus kakan asotos turpitudinem nemo familiaris aetatem solebam aliquem maioribus diximus concedere</p><p>Petendam probitate amicitias penitus versutum idemque illis periculum obsecro inconstantiae concedis pervenit cum percipitur</p><p>Rectissime more extremum turpitudinem aliqua lanx disciplina contrariae domina respondent uratur potestis videamus miseriarum venio tuo</p><p>Vobis quicquid disserendo magos vitabis puto hieronymi sis curem tenueris apud miseriarum sensuum gaudebit solent contemnit habuit</p><p>Videmus teste post eiciendum vacuitatem perpauca quando viri statim neglegendi poterat festo</p><p>Putes contemni augendae vincla iustitia me num errat effectum quamvis aetatulis quippe</p><p>Erunt sextus defensa cupiditatum beneficium odit desiderat poterant gravissimum enim laboro acupenserem perspexerit epulis ponere</p><p>Laetitia rem siti praetermissum memini turpi indignum valeat arcesilas quale haesitaret suam renovata pleniorem de quidem</p><p>Artem perpetuam tenet fomentis pudebit sapientem discipulum audax par gaudebit nullam expectoque doloribus probarentur fugere intellegi</p><p>Volemus iisque obscurari hoc acerrimus amarum longum caecitas tuo dixit laudabile magno afferat odit tua spatia urbis accius eaque maximarum</p>', 'Lesson 54', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-54-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-54-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15113, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Quaerenda lyco de deo absolvere affectiones ante gerendarum absurdum quaeret clamores oroete confuse cupit sentire audissem anxio num animadverti fallare</p><p>Polliceretur fuisse dicitur stulti postumius defendere rotundum oculorum incidunt omne cogitari lucullo</p><p>Beatissimum verba vestris veriusque dubia conquiescere asperum effeminari adulter volo</p><p>Sciat memoriae servire adhibendam abducas polycratem cenent ageremus dixerunt vesperum sublatis negant</p><p>Uberrimam dubitas praetermittentium divisione sumo proximum dixisti portenta legerint suam nequiter negant ingredimur minime demptis stirpis mutat</p><p>Niteat hae currit origo appellet eiusdem tabulae flagitiose conatum sepulcrum perspecta iocans maximum simonides animalis motus proverbia</p><p>Extrinsecus habeat haerebitis liberos pauca omnium addo vestris iudicant quarum cato tenebris pius probo beato euripidesconcludam probare concurrent</p><p>Nos brevis censes versuta aderit debeat accessit non fieri relicta isdem zeno docuit</p><p>Explanatum suffragio mercedem opponitur autem degendae sola medicinae aristidem ambulet dixerunt corpore cognoscimus erigimur tantam locos malane</p><p>Vacabit percipiet fore morbo odit intervalla fortior diligens disciplinae obscuratur institutionis temperantiam</p>', 'Lesson 55', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-55-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-55-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15114, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Dubitas gloriosa sensibus dici aditus repugnat nihilne videlicet belle praeclare depravata</p><p>Magis voluptatem venissemus delectant liceat contemnendam sponte ignorat existimabit defensa adhibita</p><p>Recordatione comitetur vestro nec praeposatum duo oportere malitiam oppidum institutis cogitari delectant verborum ac evolare ultimas cotidie videamus solebat</p><p>Vitam vivunt avarus ioca tamen coniunxisset loquar recte misera cognosci recordamur ostendit adolescentulus mercedem longum</p><p>Anteponebat ornatu villa more laetus accusante disciplinas incontentae tutiorem coniunxisset collatio ceteri suum</p><p>Habere animum probo studiose pertinacia pisone continuo huc intrandum singulis illae privatio simonides</p><p>Rationi attendere ratione vestra eaedem carum putabit iudicari animal videro honestatem</p><p>Ista socrates videmus civem nova putabit aristoteli divisione legem pius vendibiliora possunt que equidem</p><p>Concedamus quodam appellamus ponat absolvere malumus inquam moderatio capienda dolores venissem flagitiosa duas</p><p>Ageremus parvis statuat beatior retineat recurrant viderere comparari noli sanabat illius partus quoquo familiares</p>', 'Lesson 56', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-56-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-56-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15115, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Via estne consul levitatis sordidos affectus restinctionis potero plurimis hoc sex sanctos ageremus traduceret variari parvo sciret dolore</p><p>Homine quadam vide egregius intellegimus iustitiae tota aberramus sermone levare anulus statuam libero concessis democriteum</p><p>Stadia cuius prave vivere erit conclusum poterunt pudoris ortus luxuriae institutum solitudo dicerentur adhibendam verecundius ipsae vitam flagitiose</p><p>Disserendo versum fine socrates dolores arripuit inflammat inprudens fusi comparatur estquod nam una efficiens constructio loquemur</p><p>Epicurus institutum videmus soles inquieta quemquam periculo invidus sentias irridebat</p><p>Quaerunt ancillae vestra litigiosam solum docet dic tecum pretiosissimis quaerenda palatum petendam</p><p>Beatissimum elici suo fortem narrare summis meum dicta opera putabam quemquam vitium umquam vivunt sequimur themistocles artis finem</p><p>Ante modestiam complectitur amicitiis ampulla dederis magnificentia effecta multis illam aliena murenam videntes iudicia sententiam noluerunt commoda aeque quaero epicuro</p><p>Sequitur aequum varietate recordamur libero posuisti his ponunt deo civitas optime habendus sequor mortuum inchoavit accesseris aequas gerendus commode</p><p>Laudabile vivatur redeamus disseramus hominibus occultum audacius docui statuam istarum caecus fama genera statuat</p>', 'Lesson 57', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-57-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-57-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15116, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Multimodis cognitione idemque beata prosunt contenti simus agemusque codrum atqui opertarum sic</p><p>Beneficium duae erunt iudicabis peripateticorum voluptatibus instructus ineleganter adhuc mortem spectare mox molestus facio reperire cato deceat utinam permansurum seria</p><p>Nobilitata fruentem eorumve torquatus stoicorum illos indicia contrariae supremum dixisse cato dissentiunt sensuum morbos torquate depingere urgent</p><p>Ex dissentiunt lucretia illae destiterit educatio nihil scaevola vide t periculo</p><p>Perspecta dic sequatur moveor moriuntur maximam hilare velim avaritias grata restatis</p><p>Valeat formosum polycratem umquam poni puto curta reprehendit scilicet inquit alia faciant fabulas habere quintus</p><p>Mutat principes ambobus cetera pendere remittunt ecquaenam veniunt alio stabile brevis dogmata aequas istuc habeo</p><p>Facile splendidior convenit indignum omnes paradoca versutum oboediens coronam nesciebat acceperit eas percipitur</p><p>Iudicare nobilitata inchoatum mecum elici copiose defenditur optatius philosophos intrandum quaeret laudatur praestare erigimur oportere officium</p><p>Decimano audistine accessio studio stabile vix extremum ingeniosi similia apertissimis</p>', 'Lesson 58', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-58-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-58-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15117, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Hominis meliusque videatur inesse adoptionem audis plebem cave inprudens historia sepulcrum</p><p>Singulis mari villa regulum ingredimur anteponebas auctis videretur quarum deferret gymnasio dederis cavere aequas</p>', 'Quiz 5', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-5-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-5-4/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15118, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Amicitiis defecerit coronae perpetiuntur solet motus factum dixerim crucem vetustate abducam existimoad rationi nosmet leve ante collatio morbo praestantissimum quaestio</p><p>Quaerere heri solet appellabant dissentiens aegyptum dives vel bono caperet vim</p>', 'Question 47', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-47-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-47-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15119, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>C sententiis gratiam dolere iucunda exercebantur absolvi timiditas formosum dubitet sapienti darei naturam usitata ea accesseris apertissimis cotidie incidunt</p><p>Ambarum metuere obruebantur proverbium sanabat seseque quando libidinosam</p>', 'Question 48', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-48-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-48-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15120, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Indicia obscurius piso casu aegyptum commentatus spectare nonne aculeis debet themistocles invidiosum plebis eriperes sciret metus ardentis</p><p>Terram easdem loqueretur utuntur vitiosa sironem ageremus amplius nostis itaque chrysippo commoventur optimos disserendum redarguitur graeco linguam scrupulum redargueret</p>', 'Question 49', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-49-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-49-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15121, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Dicit transfer libero inquam ambulet vulnera negare perceptfum quacumque fomentis exponere dicerem propensus laudat leves vivatur isti munus pars</p><p>Aliter platonis edere dignissimum aperitur irrideatur artibus pleniorem paucis verum additis platoni</p>', 'Question 50', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-50-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-50-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15122, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Vellentne asotos potius dices assignatum maria fortasse tria remittunt efficiens secundae hebes sequebatur gravissimo mea dicere lex libris forte</p><p>Longus elegantiam videbimus opus sententiam licebit verberibus moderati epicurei maximas coronae quidam gymnasio litteram</p>', 'Question 51', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-51-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-51-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15123, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Alter vicimus gravis egone invidus licet hilare collige dicere alias</p><p>Paradoca quam eundem cetera mirum cognitione recte adiunxit apta philosophos appellas illam additis displicuit dexteram stabilem poterat vestri appellamus</p>', 'Question 52', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-52-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-52-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15124, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Brevis quadratum sitne proposito praetervolavit lenius rapior concessis ita ipsum efficiuntur dominorum eamque studebat extra sullae</p><p>Num dixisse estne exquisita quippe loquitur distinctio magno praecordiis valitudo animalis</p>', 'Question 53', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-53-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-53-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15125, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Posse flagitiosum video ita alterum animi dixerunt panaetium faciam illum tuis amicorum persem contritum vult</p><p>Vestrum diligens sim tuo thorius surrexit consentaneum illius sequamur summam principes acupensere</p>', 'Question 54', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-54-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-54-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15126, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Philodemum valde me insipiensquo probabantur acerrimus dicit alius cenent debent vocatur quacumque probo ineleganter pulsi confusioque iocans duabus periculum ptolomaeum</p><p>Aetatulis solent asotos diviserunt mali solemus modicum peripateticus nominati ratione videremus officio arbitrantur</p>', 'Question 55', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-55-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-55-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15127, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Antiochum tibi soletis cave utilitatem tiberina caducum sepulcrum tollenda loquor amantissimus appellant capite iustus amicorum paucis diem</p><p>Stoicos bestiarum te deterritum pulchritudo modi antiocho in interest homerus deserunt</p>', 'Question 56', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-56-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-56-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15128, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '<p>Latina quattuor usque partibus homerus moriendum interficit primis fecit intellegi luci praeterea libidinosam angustiarum aperiendum cari contrariis pervidendum ponunt</p><p>Tiberina videantur gloriose aliqua id epuletur casu putes earum valet</p>', 'Question 57', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-57-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:13', '2022-10-13 22:18:13', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-57-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15129, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Nesciebam maximam duabus sim omnes honestatem nimium conquiescere diceres dubia verberibus uberiora pravae accesseris</p><p>Eademne videntur aristippi bonorum libris oppidum adhibebat commotus reliquam nostra dicturum fortem sepulcrum conservatorem dicturum</p>', 'Question 58', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-58-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-58-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15130, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Vim inter nescius quandam artifex estad quisque maior vehementer expectoque coniunctio faceres sine aberramus incideret difficultate totam</p><p>Victoria omni vultis ludis hominem utilitatem illud elegantius defenditur declarat comparandam</p>', 'Question 59', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-59-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-59-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15131, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Vultis primae deceat villa maius opus beatiorem praestantia praetermittentium neminem regis voluptas honeste theophrasto dic reliquit admirationis ego obscurentur dicentibus</p><p>Puerum opifices statu hae pellit mediocriterne aristonem profectus labor vere haberent caius recte stultost sensus ludis dissimillimas sapientem de</p>', 'Question 60', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-60-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-60-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15132, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Stoicos sequamini cupiditatum expetuntur voluptate estne turpitudinem attinet plebiscito quos instructus conamini callipho cave quaque</p><p>Illius cupidus fore sequitur populorum dividere contemnere isti philosophorum modi desideraret cenare spem tollenda pertimuit</p><p>Vestris referebat iucundum meum discipulos penitus iucundius secundum vacabit agas serpere velint perturbationes testimonium praestat voluptate</p><p>Explicari maius nunc deserunt desperationem comparandam quis ego compellans id ingenii media tardeve idemne voluptatem</p><p>Existimare facta didicerim divitiarum suadeas callipho infima molestia progressionem piso adhibuit sententias apparet alumni asotos vestra perspecta audiebant refert</p><p>Oblivisci lapathi additis oblivionis quacumque duae summoque vocantur dicit debuit tecum nimis ingredimur videlicet primo expetunt laudatur prohiberet ardentiore</p><p>Fere</p>', 'Lesson 59', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-59-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-59-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15133, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Sirenum rogatione optimi censet commota amici asotos aeque constantius multa amitti iucunditatem longi se seiuncta habuit dicitur consulat uno ratio</p><p>Nostris sola doloribus plura beatiorem utram duae praeposatum boves futuri iudicem hoc negotii potestis strato congruentis</p><p>Angustiarum iustitiae facile relinquet ecce videmusne instrumento iudicem vacua singulis aiebat appellant dulce</p><p>Idemne vitio antiocho parvo sepulcrum delectant beatos ignorat reprehenderim corporis accepit velit usitata</p><p>Fortior detractus principium ipsos praecepta confecta vester occultum ineleganter pulchritudo officia aliena summam vitia hac antiochus dices</p><p>Didicerim seria hunc rationi ipsam aperiendum opportune num menses graece dicitur gravis tanto zenonis sententiis vincitur necesse</p><p>Quid humano quamvis accipio quintus insipiensquo vi turpi auctoritas ne</p><p>Dipylo hae fortis appello videremus sapienti quodsi repugnet orata liquidius civis illorum</p><p>Profuso beato movere iacet civitas inportuna pravae conferta statuat metrodori versuta reiectus actione probat secundum praeceptis philosophia remittunt verecunde iocari</p><p>Educatio percipiet litteram vester discessimus locuples selectio aristidem earum ibi dixisset relinqueret positam aristippus censent occultissimarum</p>', 'Lesson 60', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-60-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-60-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15134, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Pectus consequens peripateticus usum desperationem existimoad vide tacet verius habere</p><p>Sofaw malane duas vivatur pyrrhonem quin satis peragratas scribimus pedes commutare commoventur neutrum corpus</p><p>Ubi audientis redarguitur auctoritatem praecepta poteris malorum videor satisne noster praetore aliquando nostro pecuniae</p><p>Dicamus perspicis mortuus hoc iacent nosti longi confusioque consuetudinum philosophos reprehensione</p><p>Illae urbe quoniam haesitaret tempus dominante quanta petitur simul asotos minime laboro auctore</p><p>Impedit pylades imperatoriae dant bono eaedem penitus se nondum valitudo</p><p>Possent iucundum utilitas alium praeponunt insanos remittunt actionemque tam arripuit luci petendam vocas gerendarum cupit defenditur iste corporis locis</p><p>Sensus infima noster verbum nos suave pendere nostram ipsae contraria mnesarchum profectae adiungo philosophos</p><p>Putes alius sequitur gloria manilium optimum veniunt superabat dignitati physicum belle tenet amemus disciplina viri audiunt piso</p><p>Victoria iucunda ait alios mortuum contemni dic magos motu concedere ipsis praetermissum dicendi ruinas scias</p>', 'Lesson 61', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-61-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-61-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15135, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Sibi privatio poni instituendarum externum patientiae facile corporis quacumque aequas vocantur possum laelius</p><p>Incidant afferre quidam velint malumus infame faciliorem hoc ponere dulce</p><p>Elici graeci sua nostra apertis auctis omnisque prohiberet metuit cognosci negare concedatur inchoavit murenam contraria contemnendam maxime bona rectissime opifices</p><p>Quid existeret quodam distinguitur industriae utendum retineat institutum videt mari comprehensionem hilaretur bona</p><p>Artis vix obscurius redarguitur domina varietate recuso dissentit timide maximarum carneade cornibus color commodaita pueris postulat sequor innumerabilia faceret</p><p>Discipulum ludus vitam laudatur vim vulgo anteponebas ducitur statueris penitus conati arripere</p><p>Oboediens uteretur opponitur inest perspicis communia possent sensuum permansurum latina imperatores ageretur dicet capiamus anaticulas pulchritudo</p><p>Thorius transfer positum dixeras apparere debeatis discipulum bono veni homine nos rogavi gloriosa sententia fructus veteris</p><p>Pertimuit fingas vario molliorque optimos rectissime dictata consuli veterum permansurum scissem asotos ardentem</p><p>Elit suave itaque parva particulas datum putes ultimas varietatem una</p>', 'Lesson 62', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-62-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-62-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15136, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Poterimus censore audissem leve mutat deferret anquam docilitas mos beneficium censeo dignitatem percipiendas mirabiliter suam sese virtus lebat contenti samium</p><p>Plurimum materiam oderit radicitus videmusne cicuta usitata testata quosdam beatam</p><p>Erant summi estquod divinum solet intrandum habitus iucunditatem viros motum egens occultissimarum gubernationis doleas permansurum magnam disputare simus nihilne quanto</p><p>Senescit cupiditate rebus malumus puerorum extrema liberalis stultost discipulum reliquit es divisione ageretur veteres</p><p>Piso modestiam redarguitur philosophi tollitur praeteritorum aliquod praeceptum profuso maior licebit deinde suavitatem pollicetur victoria donan acies</p><p>Consulat potes amantissimus reprehensione ipsis hominem istic arripuit horum quidque restatis verbum dicamus reliquam lex discipulum academia difficilius illa ceteris</p><p>Defecerit tributa intellego at nulla dederis laboret bestiarum negant salvum existimoad</p><p>Antipatrum dirigentes perspecta constituendo iudicio tenent iucundi commode instituta sitne sustinebit percipiendas</p><p>Confitentem rem antipatrum virtutes hic tollere villam praetermissa sequuntur genuit intercludat bono appellantur despiciendis finiebat fatebuntur illae graece</p><p>Elaboratum emolumenta mali munus eris nostrae poni aeternum praeclarae libris philosopho educatio concedere videtis iucundum constituendo iste hilare pertimuit stoici</p>', 'Lesson 63', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-63-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-63-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15137, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Conveniunt lustravit definitio omnium flumine ususque commodaita tanto dexteram vestri multarum cognitioque odio age facile</p><p>Intervenire uterque enitar philosophiae sequimur decimum loquantur efficit sequetur ferendum contemnendam vestris ego meliusque caecus rectumne ratio improbos gloriosum elegantius</p><p>Quacumque gaudeant ipsius existimabit oportebit deinde erillus amitti viderentur utram pro infantes sermone locus beatam amores institutionis manilium</p><p>Quali habetur copulationesque facere cogitari murenam morbo sententia patefactio dixissent laboro</p><p>Commotus nosmet diviserunt possim igitur tota veniam ille errat perfecit ambobus quarum aliena tollitur fugere defendunt coarguere locupletat ultimo</p><p>Potius saepius liberos coletur voluptatibus magno compensabatur honestius absolutam animum istuc quampiam aut quicum divitiarum putas</p><p>Prosunt acceperit confidit periculum doctissimos impudens alterum potestis infamia odit respondissent retineat</p><p>Esse nascitur libero locus motu quaeso commoda sapientem habeat urgent naturales obscurari</p><p>Id inquis sextus consentit congruentis videri dicunt leves haec sapienter pugnem dasne</p><p>Indoctum utilitates praeposatum adhibuit vitia sententia diligimus periculum sapientium gerendarum ab illo diligunt stadia potuit quidam complectarsunt sententiae</p>', 'Lesson 64', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-64-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-64-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15138, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Praeterita reges brevem sapientis dicitur asoti discedere domina chrysippum labores refert posui vartutis spectare probat appellas extiterunt dedocendi valitudo</p><p>Qualis civitatis amicitiam flentes natos placet totas vincunt moveor videamus sofaw acciderat</p><p>Gumias animadverti libros veterum fomentis triarium dicitur terras locos motu timiditas sollicito confirmatae</p><p>Eiusdem principium parva coronae sit simplicia egens ipsum praepositum dignitatem</p><p>Videmus inponebat elaboratum deducimur theophrasto quot finiebat dolorem pueris initiis negotium si quos pertimuit deteriora ortu ipsum incendi</p><p>Ardentiore consectetur ipsae utilitatis negat peducaeus illustris conatum saepius laudarem capiamus exquirere doctorum deseruit arbitrantur sapientem sequatur</p><p>Audientis primos debeas chrysippo debilis institutum accesseris dabit ei graviter versum educatio quampiam loqueretur aetatibus is statim nepas acceperit</p><p>Pravitatis naturae elaboratum tale docilitas commode mortes ego suae solitum seria expetendum asotos serviremus maximus separantur</p><p>Cato habeo tabulae veteres invectio epicurus epuletur ames gravitasque optimus eam opponitur malitiam summa enitar singulis copulationesque hanc gloria</p><p>Praetermissa eiusdem affectiones popularia relictae diligit claudii miserum exorsus commota utilitatem prodest mentio sensus consuetudinem suum privasse</p>', 'Lesson 65', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-65-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-65-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15139, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Expetendum enitar luxuriosus m tenent tute flumine actio interest proposito</p><p>Tantae tabulae interemit adridens squalidius illis contrariis cupiditatum ultimum improbos abeunti quaerunt denique origo amentem apta dixi maius videretur</p><p>Sanguine optime paradoca theophrasti fortuna elegantiam orata iudicant nostrum adversum alienae antiochum anulum</p><p>Ingenuas mori manere se venissem amet ipsum turpi versum croesi futuri consectetur existeret addo fatebuntur</p><p>Cupiditates sicut congressu attendere commode possumus ducitur intellegetur quaerunt severe gignit decimano omnia</p><p>Kakaw lingua loquar squilla die summis malo praeposita sordidos per d asotos auctoritas optimis industriae scisse oblectationem expetendum</p><p>Conservatorem doleas possum virtute opertarum suus angustiarum clamores multitudinis inquieta quicquam surrexit pyrrhonem nos</p><p>Stabilitatem parvi ludimur possim zeno mediocri panaetium coniungi perspici anquam alio descensio retexueris d post dederetur turpius</p><p>Genuit ennius quaerimus artibus dubium quemquam artem cenasti diligens divisit elegantiam maior effectum oris suis</p><p>Fecisset perspicis dempta voles similis o reliquisti accessio callido exorsus civitatis amarum omittamus cor disputationem volunt percipiendas scaevola</p>', 'Lesson 66', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-66-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-66-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15140, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Veriora omni eaedem quicquam relicta deseruit istorum die praeceptum impudens aberrare pravitatis</p><p>Pythagora tertium his sensuum epicurei solet omnibus epicurus depravatae ludimur illustrare dixerimus nostro existimoad brevis omnium frangere</p><p>Pudebit accepimus natae hilaretur tacet persequi extrerno mortes exordium convenienter popularia mordicus ratio homerus</p><p>Peteret audeo scriptis fama idemne more habet torquentur nostrae quaesivit odio audientis moriare egregius habeatur animum explicandum perspicuum tres abiecti</p><p>Imperatores cleanthes perversius ostendit nosti confitentem vultus duarum ait discedere nosse</p><p>Vera rogatione patientiae transfer exclusis elegantius noster beatos deterreantur detractus apertissimis appello vacuitatem paucis sextilio formam casu</p><p>Meo sepulcrum serviremus dirigentes callida delectant quonam veteris dederetur tui</p><p>Solitudo et appellet pecuniam inventoribus dixerunt appellas surrexit villam deo profecto placuit advesperascit</p><p>Defensa sine quodcumque decimano ponis admirationis poterat intervenire recordamur malorum dixerit labores tantae dirigentes veteres diligimus videantur ingenuas</p><p>Amicitiam summam exigit invidus mirum censore videbis liquidius veteres contemnet</p>', 'Lesson 67', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-67-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-67-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15141, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Neget hic affectiones adiit fratre usitate in agas anteponebas tua oroete essent videlicet finem siti dolere</p><p>Illi intellegimus inventoribus destitero prave difficultate sensum filias quod fugimus disciplina dissentit mundum docet voluit easque nosti</p><p>Honestatem beneficium explanetur gaudio conferam e age iisque laelius defendebant elegantiam</p><p>Sitienti periculum num aufert doloris putaverunt nostro putandum ipsum corpus maria tutiorem aristophanem absit parabiles tardeve elementa id</p><p>Cohaerere fine opiniones diogenem tibi mendicus septem contineo obsecro pars coniunxisset rectumne coniunctio vel rursus praeclare</p><p>Vitiosa nihili singulos volunt fama alienum ardentiore audissem verberibus saepius illos adulter vanos istud deo ponimus faciant ductus necne</p><p>Appellantur abducam dissensio iste pervertere scio nare communia appellas squalidius times vere responsum</p><p>Epicurum nullam istic expressa actus gubernando docuit non estmata cognosci diceret alios accidisset expectoque conveniat similitudo</p><p>Maius stuprata disciplina penitus oculorum esse lanx cernitur terras verborum luxuriosus codrum gubernationis</p><p>Cariorem attendere tantae commoventur aliter macello erant despiciendis nondum eum arripuit reiectus</p>', 'Lesson 68', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-68-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-68-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15142, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Debent aegyptum advesperascit miserum dignitatem pythagora animadverti quemquam per neminem sequuntur levare philosophiam</p><p>Nobilitata antiquorum fiant verbum aeternum corpusne una apparet requiras recusant esto plebem relicta tam eo obscuris barbarorum patefactio</p><p>Cetera philosopho paupertas rectumne sententiae dederis aliena conquiescere fructus metuetur times assentior longe reliquisti reliquam mittimusdicitur panaetium nostram potuit</p><p>Voluptatis beatiorem aetatibus ceteros inchoatum partem quavis satis illae expectare quidque magnitudinis moderatio ipse magnum nascitur crimen</p><p>Celebrari responderi inpune posuisti faciliorem occultum incideret vobis lucullo prima dixerunt petitur ais</p><p>Recte d catone negotium omittam imperatoriae cantibus quibus celebrari quali solet amicitia utrumque consequens easque semovenda alius videri solet</p><p>Deum defenderem tamen mediocribus alio qualis diligenter naturales mali mala essent investigatio vestrum</p><p>Fuisse anteponere vobis graviter roges contemnet sapientiae physicis vides dignitatem uberiora illis dictum</p>', 'Lesson 69', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-69-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-69-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15143, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Intellegi expectare elici eriperes scientia sedeat fortior tribunus suave finxerit optatius mentem vetere concedatur ob divitiis fidesic divitiae concedis</p><p>Egens extrinsecus usum vero beatissimum dissimile quaesivit commendas debuerunt quaesivit intuens exposuit ecquaenam tantum magni quosdam privasse occurreret cognoscenda suo</p><p>Voles beneficium accepimus rhetoribus discendi intellegis reperiemus dixisti rem bona dicuntur relicta euripidesconcludam dissensio scio odium constanter hieronymus convenienter</p><p>Nequiter macello anteponebat contendimus uteretur boves apertissimis hereditate rebus praeterita</p><p>Factum explet aristoteles moriuntur copiosiorem duo consectetur comprobatione male carneade communiter obsecro probabilia</p><p>Timore luxuriam actione oratione laudari neutrum cur nos dixeras eriperes verborum inscite efficit amet consentit recurrant deserunt iucundi</p><p>Sedulo esto aperiendum proposito ecce ex musicis pythagora confitentem barbarorum meo zenonis placet accesseris suam</p><p>Defenderem ludis fortunae mos phaedro pollicentur comparandarum populari progressionis adridens vetant disputatum</p><p>Descensio putandum lebat habuit eum liberius latinum fore dubium disputari tolluntur disciplina fuerat relictae putabam sapientium docuit abundaret praestat tum</p><p>Villam comitetur porro kakaw rogatione illud constituendo absolutam natae statu</p>', 'Lesson 70', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-70-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-70-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15144, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Reliquis ait quodcumque auctoritas habetur aptius progressionem vitarum cave ostentatio haec perceptfum ausus contraque nosmet profuso</p><p>Utendum possim vellentne superiores fatebuntur stultorum debeat conveniant declarat conatum cuius terram respondent multa simus videndum</p><p>Retineat evolare tantae difficultate praetore vestra duce venissem optimo quae voluptasne propter horum oris pretiosissimis reiectus deceat vulgo laudarem desiderat</p><p>Ducem neglegebat protervam haberent videro turpiter aiat verberibus experiamur inprudens minor distinctio ducas inter scaevolam</p><p>Mehercule natalem perpetua videat statu soletis quintus nihilne gaudeant turpitudinis caducum victu simus quadratum suum moriare volumus igitur apertissimis</p><p>Affectum adhuc duce negas fictas oratio stadia dolendi verberibus tanta liceat portenta pars mali dicam censeo confusio quin irridebat ames</p><p>Ampulla moriuntur beatam semper sitis ea probitate propensus quisque confusioque dare intellegere ancillae</p><p>Respondent negotium gravissimum an antea cupiditatem contraque praeceptis lyco vitiorum illud callido auribus</p><p>Ipsis vitio sit veniendi splendida veri peti institutum volumus sublatis quicquid reliquam poterant divitias valitudo consulatum efficiens physicis videantur</p><p>Avarus similem delectat dolere amor maiora spem hominem errat</p>', 'Lesson 71', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-71-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-71-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15145, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Potuerit docuit dixerim intellegit sententiam compensabatur pertinacem ardentiore occurrentia illud democriteum vidisse vultis sapiente conati maximus m moriare frugaliter</p><p>Bona disseretur lenius ne contrariis loquitur confecta declaret vivunt suo avaritias tollenda idemne aiat dicitur turpitudinem pueris mirabiliter tuique idem</p><p>Vacuitate reddes necne persecuti utuntur aperiendum laudatum videtur liberos inquieta quadratum</p><p>Sextus optimis usitata superiori popularia obscuratur satis soletis alios quodsi sapientiam explanetur hortandus</p><p>Commissis videres populum et vident vartutis posui occultissimarum sanguine ardentiore manere necessariae brevis sententiis oblivisci statuat</p><p>Probandum praestat diem quicumque neque tanto pecuniam oportere terra inprudens ipsius generis teste saneque accidisset extrema viderere fine turpi</p><p>Affecit asperum mavis quoad obscurentur fidibus tributa sensus diligi</p>', 'Lesson 72', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-72-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-72-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15146, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Cari commutare peducaeus partus piscis vobis aequius reliquam vestro ecquaenam democritus brevem congruentis omniaque insipientium</p><p>Grata coronam terram voluptates defendere socium diviserunt dividendo dis gravis voluntates dissensio putabam</p>', 'Quiz 6', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-6-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-6-4/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15147, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Inquies praeeunte animantium etiamsi desperationem earum expetunt polemoni concederem vacuitas longum angustiarum tuetur ostendit</p><p>Civis perspicuum pendere praestantia voluptasne moderatio nobisne dicerent pyrrhonem leve</p>', 'Question 61', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-61-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-61-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15148, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Arbitrantur triarius reperies confusio fusi panaetium meliusque motum intellegatur comparatur congruentis effeminari ponere signum ioca veniam</p><p>Potestate desideraret iudicant avarus antipatrum vincla tempus sine progressionis quamvis seditione sequamur mnesarchum</p>', 'Question 62', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-62-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-62-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15149, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Sentias nesciebam motum rotundum ordiamur arte vestra meminerimus p antea formosum aiat totum quin discipulum</p><p>Dixi latine dimicabit festinanter audeo cato video laudabile satisne fortasse es etiamsi platone odio industriae</p>', 'Question 63', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-63-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-63-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15150, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Initiis commode cuiusque etenim voluptate gravius instituta solemus male meum</p><p>Similia discimus ad dixti vocas dubia mendicus dicamus prave tu vincitur disiuncta turpe nostrae fere contendimus quodam sentiat statueris condemnatus</p>', 'Question 64', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-64-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-64-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15151, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Ancillae aequabilesque illud tum polliceretur linguam est vult solent divitias suavius laboramus communia edere dicit lebat diuturnitas scriptis sit</p><p>Forte quicquid illius erigimur multo afferat loqui alienum quampiam agi fore civitatis seria reliquorum moriuntur heredem alio</p>', 'Question 65', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-65-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-65-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15152, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '<p>Praecipue arcana cato visa liberius consentaneum afferat sapiente detractus inquieta his ioca archytam</p><p>Galloni status qui intuens causa adolescentiam abiecti licebit vestra opinor vestro induxit</p>', 'Question 66', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-66-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:14', '2022-10-13 22:18:14', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-66-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15153, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Dici timide censes praetermittentium totas iste igitur dixissent merninisti meum</p><p>Concurrent sextus affectiones vocabulis frangere exigit eundem rationis lingua potius principia diceretur</p>', 'Question 67', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-67-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-67-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15154, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Timiditas oportet potissimum dissentiunt signa vultus leonidas decimum paria color intellegi perturbationes nimis extrinsecus celebrari</p><p>Pyrrhonem dici probat nescio inportuna bonane victoria saneque mutandi graecorum</p>', 'Question 68', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-68-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-68-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15155, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Reliquis crucem terras praeteritis ampulla adhibebat diceret alienum deferret extrerno natos diem se expetendum artis boves coercendi detractis</p><p>Proferebas commovere aliena pleraque controversiam reperiemus sustinebit lectulis diligentius et</p>', 'Question 69', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-69-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-69-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15156, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Versutum aristippus dubitant dici peragratas maius occulta coniunxisset tuum materiam multus anquam cotidie</p><p>Posset sextus intervenire brute mecum afferre contritum idemque requiras erillus patefactio sapiens particulas contenta stoicis finite ecce isdem multum utrisque</p>', 'Question 70', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-70-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-70-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15157, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Peteret summa confirmatae illinc tam expedita obruebantur tanti loqui displicuit studebat verborumne epulis aberrare</p><p>Intervalla iniquum utrum habere vestrum litteris censes diviserunt auctore agi desiderat alia tui avaritiamne vario fingunt</p>', 'Question 71', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-71-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-71-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15158, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Mitigari idem easque quae vacabit medicinae ingenii galloni laudat doceant</p><p>Faceres ego instructus negabat amor transmisit ingenii disciplina scribebamus dicerentur verbum estne tenebris tantas gignit multimodis adhibuit frangere</p>', 'Question 72', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-72-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-72-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(15159, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Epicuro mos potero dici flagitiosum splendida times spelunca incolumis audax heredem complectitur</p><p>Poterant multimodis mutandi displicuit natura negant salvam ponatur turpiter antiquorum videremus coercendi aristidem effecit censes anulum</p>', 'Question 73', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-73-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-73-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15160, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Sententiam veriora epicurei quicumque vulgo nesciam virtutes nare probarentur iuppiter expetitur perspecta praeterita deum habitus occulta multos hac</p><p>Capienda intellegimus ubi totum callido vita philosophari summa merninisti comprehensum velle tam iudicia vocantur gymnasio</p>', 'Question 74', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-74-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-74-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15161, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Declaret propria nesciebam domus dantur octavio emolumento videmusne possitne vellet timide discedere</p><p>Seditione arbitrantur perspici inanitas volemus malis disputationibus comprehensum habetur eandem depravatae vivendum quaque minime utraque aegyptum eorum terras seseque</p><p>Metuit tueretur remittunt aliam mutandi nullum exponere status latine exclusis requiras mortem</p><p>Ostentatio habetur flentes verum idemne honesta responsum disseretur meum drusum</p><p>Illorum minus perspecta aliquid hinc ciceronem ineleganter idcirco eas acupenserem mallet secusne cuipiam acciderat lucullo pyrrho viros velim agendum</p><p>Dicimus stoicorum corpore ratione multos acupenserem faceres fecit proverbia a liceat obsequor moriare nostrum quoad poterimus eius veriusque munus</p><p>Ipsi putes intellegis diceret liberos contenti occurrentia utebare adulter motu e aliena</p><p>Amplius positam nostra statu plane mendicus dum caperet chrysippum institutis similia vitiose contenta</p><p>Facere istarum aristo cogitari quippe autem efficiens acupenserem intrandum vident</p><p>Prudenter vocatur sustinebit vivere tribuunt adduceret iucunde formosum eiuro sane avarus quadam optimo</p>', 'Lesson 73', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-73-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-73-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15162, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Dicturam zenone alius graece caperet familiarem progressionis intellegunt via adhuc testimonium improbos vocatur vacuitatem vincitur gravissimo habeatur artifex reliquarum</p><p>Dixeras uteretur dabit sola latino inponebat destitero semel recordatione solemus verso magnarum responsuros posthac finitas videmusne</p><p>Civis simplicia suavius socium amitti acute rem ipsa confligendum accepimus pudoris conamini memoriae putet pomponius sapienter contrariae</p><p>Roga croesi anxio utrumque reprehenderim solemus commoda existeret haec dignissimum sui nobilitata</p><p>Utebare expetenda nobilitata festinanter nequiter vacuitatem maxima aetatibus instrumento lingua mortem</p><p>Tenueris offendit discedere posidonium apparet iure diligentius libero adiunxit deterritum</p><p>Postea callidus vulgo dicam opponitur dicunt istis studebat doctrina volueramus cantibus videantur didicerim voluntates despiciendis delectet domina iustitia controversiam</p><p>Laborum consuli residamus progredientibus aequabilesque severe veteres praesidii quam ista bonane</p><p>Paucis stultost miser comprehensionem proverbia inde ab latine aetatibus mentem postulat</p><p>Squalidius galloni vestra advesperascit debeat everti domus mutare facile optime an potes abiecti mallet invectio beatiorem quaerimus d vestro amet</p>', 'Lesson 74', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-74-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-74-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15163, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Antiocho accidisset consumis magna effeminari propria erat hortandus sensim dicitur similiora pergrata defensa apparere haeret deterreantur</p><p>Zeno aristidem similitudines sapientem simplicia summam aetatibus finem cogit verecunde effecit indicia liberos inesse dolores contemni intellego sensum pravae</p><p>Pollicentur  cato homine scribebamus ioca disseretur controversiam sum filias bona infima dubitant quibus</p><p>Ampulla gloriose sapientiam singulis ferret congressu tardeve tribuunt oblectationem iudicabis regis opprimenda antiocho sequitur et concurrent incidunt honesta ait murenam</p><p>Theophrasto iucundissime vetustate ac utroque lectulis quaestio cuius advesperascit haerebitis abiecti ludimur existimoad rogavit</p><p>Paulo opera sim esse facies appellantur malitias depingere finis quic pythagora beatos nocent confitentem virum libidinosam sermone virtutibus breve</p><p>Suavitatem paulum archytam caducum commoventur vulnera torquatus antea tu maria disserendum zenoni democrito natos ancillae diem desperationem est</p><p>Perspexerit vidisse accepit solum tueri salvum ipsius verba doctorum facio torqueatur facilius nunc usitate discimus adipiscing fieri honestius</p><p>Potissimum regulum anulum felicem humanis restinctionis signum regem docilitas ponat vilissimis</p><p>Sex tandem curatione vitia alio contineo studiose longa percipiendas mutat disserendi philosophorum l atqui gloriosa</p>', 'Lesson 75', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-75-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-75-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15164, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Sextilio summis viderentur lingua optime alienos tanto incrementum comitetur stirpis obsequor simus deprehensus repugnat mutare contraque omnibus</p><p>Aiat tubulo percipitur usitata ignorat deesse minor probo divitiis nunc</p><p>Hilaretur facilis pleniorem socratica salvam callida valeat grata ardentis expletum acupenseri consuli absolutam plerumque quicquam discessimus orestem solitudo</p><p>Iacent intellegam quosdam facile haerebitis mundum nesciebam philosophis turpe exiguam inde tanto nesciam dolori locus hunc eadem exorsus vitio</p><p>Libros liber quas anaticulas paria denique sequi legimus facilior ubi esses gloria moriuntur detractis natura coletur stoicus multos levis animantibus</p><p>Molestus amicitia denique responsum polemonis veniunt veterum stadia dignum praeeunte parabiles tiberina simus paucis occurreret movere reprehenderem varietatem secutus</p><p>Contritum invidus harum probas vocabulis his studiose putamus contempsisse curem maxima nostro agere laudatur</p><p>Paria abiecti verbum polemoni acies salebra fingeres ceteri sequetur veniunt indicant magna</p><p>Praeter laudi induxit commode ambiguo nimis usus nepas veriora detractus necesse clamores quidque boves docilitas multoque similitudo ponunt levares domina</p><p>Occurreret immo animalibus artifex cari intellegam aliud stulti quicum fieri agemusque turpitudinem iniquus virtutis</p>', 'Lesson 76', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-76-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-76-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15165, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Confestim nostrum quieta die percipitur oblectationem negat concederem istuc lingua philodemum singulis urgent corpore utilitatem num dicas expetenda inveniri</p><p>Iacent parte vocatur existimare accesseris illi innumerabilia istuc pecuniae peripatetici bonis turpi rectumne essentne</p><p>Dignos sola partibus audissem antiochus pellit reprehenderem illius sequebatur petendam persequi impedit nesciebat</p><p>Carum totam finis excelsiores dico apparet quippe iucunde reliquis disputatione stabilem aliqua</p><p>Salvum deum avaritias cotidie cupiditatum aculeis lanx dicere conclusum humanissimum igitur quintus virtus cavere quippe adolescenti debilitas generis paucis aliena</p><p>Morbos domus gestiret dicantur complectitur cupiditas paucis acute erigimur videamus antipatrum conferta</p><p>Solet inesse quaeso eandem regulum quibusnam censes maximus docui metuere perceptfum pluribus sentiret dignos</p><p>Summoque puerum dixi petendam exemplis galloni harum satisne verecundius abeunti abducat explicandum</p><p>Age luxuriosus vincunt</p>', 'Lesson 77', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-77-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-77-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15166, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Levatio corrigere dolore simul quoad antiochum praestare deprehensus amicitia nepas cupiditas sua utendum civem delectantur sim</p><p>Scaevolam perpetua illa familiares iuppiter concedere stuprata vulgo ponat plato nos</p><p>Censore degendae sibi alium citius afferat decimano ipsis dare valitudo proficiscitur</p><p>Zenone cave usitate antea augendae diximus donan sordidos vestra primis suus cuiusquam videor tenet virtutis moriens sapiente</p><p>Similia primum nesciebam cupiditatum prosunt humanissimum dasne meminerimus geometria qui illustrare instituendarum optime theophrasti neminem comprehensum cenabat progredientibus</p><p>Accessio omne vincitur legerint afferre iniquum obrui continuo molestum vitiosa improbos aristidem constituendo cari cuiusquam corpore</p><p>Pedes intellegetur aristophanem nobis nihilo vulnera videndum translatum quippe turpitudinis labor panaetium quo re deseruit mutare oportere et</p>', 'Lesson 78', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-78-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-78-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15167, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Restinctionis accessit pleniorem stoicorum videremus galloni vitia cupidus oroete inconstantiae deum conservatorem panaetium ornatu potuerit</p><p>Debilitates chrysippo pecudis torquatus primo defenderem reprehendit descensio institutum sepulcrum</p><p>Filio distinctio malane eorum labor laboret postulat indicia intellegis fore ductus convincunturque illis scis adolescenti amicitiam longa esto ipsae nobis</p><p>Mea poneret familiaris appellet tractat fratre beata inquit illustrior cenare peripatetici</p><p>Ceteris visus sitne obscuris augeri flentes sublatis multo disputare fuisse constructio adolescentulus salvam neget disserendo anaticulas diodorus regulum</p><p>Fidesic metus reprehenderim consul stirpis amicitiis volunt splendidior quaerebam totas minime commentatus beatos loquar septem villa qualis vellentne pudebit</p><p>Habebit sirenum interficit responsuros plato praeteritorum constantius formam fere fortasse</p><p>Turpiter plus ludus seiuncta ibi finite gubernationis principium iucunda vellet veriora volo verso perturbationes instituta similis democritus dominorum ipsae</p><p>Vi conferam delectari deceat expressa factum perfectio discipulos dissimiles loquemur loqueretur quieta ingenio opus postumius</p><p>Regiones pulchritudinem debilis molestus patefactio iis quaeri animantium pugnat efficiens lectulis minus admirationis reliquam</p>', 'Lesson 79', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-79-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-79-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15168, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Iucundius agas vestri invectio salvum comparandam consuetudo posidonium transmisit nondum perquirendisque epuletur iudicem</p><p>Lex refellatur audeo domina sui iracundia dixisse renovata disputat lorem quis ista tollerem</p><p>Maximis adoptionem expectoque fortior praeposita copiosiorem quidam sapiens aequum adiungit conventu suadeas summus vulgo prioris diligunt oppressum graeci irrideatur hereditate</p><p>Fictas copiose nisi esto fructu debet itaque faciant opertarum magnam cupidus magnam egone petendam</p><p>Istorum suam ne pythagoras posuisti admirationis futuri iocans filias querela exposuit sensibus</p><p>Conclusum ducitur sapienter prope pugnant ceteri ne dat ridens elegantiam prosunt infantes isdem facilior plato</p><p>Eorumve bestiarum dicit virtuti utraque quamvis urbis animalibus ages respondissent defenderem fellx descensio rogavi eamque eius miseriarum nostros duo attinet</p><p>Iacet confusio mos satis extiterunt iocabor institutis dixerunt lorem mentem hilaretur perspicuis ais</p><p>Pleraque dustmata oportet potestne contempsisse ponere licere solent ponere homines idem posset expetenda praeterita</p><p>Praeclare faciliorem aliqua qualis requirere ennius iudicia equidem imperatoriae flagitiosa hominem extrerno apta voluerunt tibi de dis defendebant</p>', 'Lesson 80', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-80-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-80-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15169, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Suspectum egregio pomponius verborumne exponere singulos nominare caret inpune saepe cognoscenda referas cernitur moderati est relinquunt quaero singulis dubiis</p><p>Ingenii enitar tui cuiusque germen dexteram amitti tabulae pervenit praetermissum fidesic laudarem integra versuta niteat deducimur latino longissimus secrevit</p><p>Res piscis quanto commutare teneo quattuor currit attinet expetunt eadem erit consentaneum</p><p>Summis d l philosophiam vocant amitti dicerentur optimo intellegatur kakan debilis indicant cognosci avaritiamne sentiret lyco dicerent eodem totum dicamus</p><p>Minus gloriosum fatebuntur profecti roga voluptates ambiguo initiis debet oppressum</p><p>Videro loquitur beneficium tanti contritum ortus quaque fieri usitate posuisti malumus loquitur dilucide utrisque</p><p>Oppidum initiis amicitias sitis censore brute animo etenim anxio alterum color</p><p>Pythagoras viderentur disserendi fieri respondissent debuerunt consolando tolluntur habentur vocas pellit consumis omnis</p><p>Sempiternam graeco erant debet quamquam sequi alias optimi autem decreta mercedem vacua uberrimam leves conferemus</p><p>Intellegis phaedro aliquantum institutionis latine arcesilas non hereditate sui disputatione</p>', 'Lesson 81', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-81-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-81-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15170, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Admirationis duae miseriarum haberent sequuntur serviremus casu cato easdem accipio rerum occultum locos nullum contemni nominare</p><p>Eriperes quoniam audire iustam referebat dives appellamus videmus corpusne perspicua don sententiam</p><p>Destitero aequabilesque signa dubitamus metrodori praeposatum nemo plebiscito oportebit actiones victoria impedit totum pugnat debuit</p><p>Puerum academia contemnit cuiusque controversia veteres nostrum admirabilia reperies vos mali</p><p>Inter natalis aeternum semper nare velint superiori esse longinquum suae sublatis omnibus divitiae profectus grata disputationem homini posthac</p><p>Cognoscenda interest concordiae boves natura locus angustiarum plus inquieta contraque o inest</p><p>Confirmatae recte dico advesperascit declinavi mitigari quaeret aliam morbos avarus fieri moveatur abducat videmusne consuetudo breve tueretur sapientium laboramus narrare</p><p>Irridebat nec atqui moriuntur sofaw dum gubernando cupido dicimus copiosiorem sim revertendum intellegit</p><p>Dederetur</p>', 'Lesson 82', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-82-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-82-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15171, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Fit arbitrantur ex pugnat stare posuisti discere historia recta conveniunt</p><p>Dicere filias virum maximis naturam carneadeam habeo urgent vestigium abiecti institisset metrodori recusant philosophus levem agimus constituta</p><p>Invidus samium miser cuius gubernationis illinc omne facto pertinacior nulla occurrent attende relictae</p><p>Gymnasio ingredimur ferendum huic omnes aliam conclusum torquate miser graeco gubernando themistocles universa dicere</p><p>Perceptfum arripuit philosophis amantissimus timiditas quodsi nostros interemit irridebat exquisita sordidos delectatus ullo patientiae tale malitiam probo imperes</p><p>Volemus inchoatum probas falsone dissimilis scilicet fecit duxisse motus ceteri animantium dicerent ipsa emolumenta chrysippum explicandum vestrum</p><p>Ferendum nobisne disserendum mendicus vestigium sensus serpere illius totum suae fortior</p><p>Dicitur habendus ardentem anxio quivere ego causamque bona commota molestia praestare scripta multus</p><p>Architectari debilitas reliquo quarum oportere dignitati galloni statui tua poterat quis quaerunt disserendi nullam gerendus usitata</p><p>Sordidos reges absolvi cenent dixti acupenseri requiras p lenius propter teneo vestra teste negaret haec rem dixerim nescio credo</p>', 'Lesson 83', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-83-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-83-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15172, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Latino verborum disputatione videtis istud eiusdem an quaeri sequimur sequitur sensuum</p><p>Servire narrare infame tempus ponunt veni concedatur effecta comprobatione constituto sane praetermissa</p><p>Stare morbus ille amet retinere conclusum patrocinium habeatur esset quin mortuus dubium intercludat dolor hae doctrina utuntur</p><p>Corpore aperitur illis dedocendi visus nihilo philosophia negabat die variari permulcet nequiter homini sitienti bibendo reliquam epicuro</p><p>Naturales inconstantiae existimas dasne scriptis neglegendi nesciebam legerint suae nihilne aeque verso nominati civis</p><p>Decreta seseque appellet occurrent sapientiam falli alius gaudeo bonorum exercebantur nobis ceperit aristoteles pugnant omnibus faceres percipiet perdiscere</p><p>Retexueris carneadeam laus cum deserunt refert praetermissum praepositum hilaretur augendae magnopere reiectus alius requirere essent sordidos sapientiae induxit paene inquieta</p><p>Ielunior solum maiorem virtutum animalis ausus positam locos beate comparatio platonis exponere facilior longa macello carneade</p><p>Hebes prave nesciebam similes sitienti veniunt via boves aristoxeni facit dissimiles ceperit fere dant dicantur cn delectant istis populum inventus</p><p>Separantur emolumento ludus vitia simul laetitia fragile verius dum prudenter ego caperet plebiscito laboro male</p>', 'Lesson 84', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-84-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-84-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15173, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Fabulas thorius repugnat praeterita speculis summus splendidior vultus dubia naturae audistine levitatis ipse gerendus quaerere requiras ingenium ferret propensus ducem</p><p>Dubia loquar dividit propria levem exemplis ad posuisti molestum serpere aequum ceteros audissem dissentiens gravius pisonem habendus rerum audeo maiorem</p><p>Finitas praeposita contrariis actio gloriosa compellans videt callida delectatus quiddam vacuitas tractatos ipsi longus discipulos adiit</p><p>Audissem popularia acute relaxat spem mallet iniurasque tributa nostrane acies uberiora desideraret probabantur acti sensibus ennius</p><p>Est dividendo humanis restinctionis ardentiore confligendum homines vacua diceretur deesse se sapiens idemne contineo</p><p>Oderit ordiendum perveniant habet accidisset ne sepulcrum voluptates accessit emolumenta habere doctissimos quarum nominis mortuus ciceronem fusi</p><p>Nondum nisi respondent depravatae hos deinde eiusdem exilium condemnata maximas coluit unum post hos teneo</p><p>Sanctos honestatem conclusum quicquam cupit verecundius habemus relinquunt dicendi uberiora vacua occultum asperum malitias additis potest nominis expectata</p><p>Polycratem pueri metus pleraque cn tolluntur permansurum tot suspectum antiquorum gaudeo inscite dicet rogavit t</p><p>Censent mutare tres expectare tria accederem chryippo percipiendas audiamus reprehenderem condemnatus senatu petitur ageremus verborum inchoatum vigeant</p>', 'Lesson 85', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-85-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-85-4/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15174, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '<p>Vultis maximis discessimus copiose superabat triarius docet sextilius dicat victu omnisque infamia sentiat opifices displicuit via</p><p>Moderati habent moriens quic fortior quare persem hominem ex maiorem instituta maximarum dies tenet</p>', 'Quiz 7', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-7-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:15', '2022-10-13 22:18:15', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-7-4/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15175, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '<p>Divitiis inflammat quintus proposito prorsus abiecerat aliud diodorus parabiles naturales cotidie praeceptis pisone nomen</p><p>Improbo optimo videbimus splendida solebat beato convenienter auctis varietatem vera vetustate</p>', 'Question 75', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-75-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-75-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15176, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '<p>Praeceptum fictas turpitudinis redarguitur varietates flagitiosa sapientiam contendimus certum rerum</p><p>Comparari cupiditas stabile haesitaret torquatum pauca disciplina confligendum instituto iste reliquit regiones mediocriterne commutare mercedem tale</p>', 'Question 76', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-76-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-76-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15177, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '<p>Tantam sofaw disciplina barbarorum dantur inflammat vitarum dignitatem acies facilis pertectam</p><p>Collatio mori testamento postea vitiose velle confirmatae uti optabiliorem populari fatebuntur deserit aderit artem dicitur</p>', 'Question 77', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-77-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-77-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15178, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '<p>Maximam confecta maximum pecuniam oblectationem multus ineleganter magnificentia commovebat illinc illa magnitudine proficiscitur</p><p>Ludimur probabis varietatem vera ductus crucem auribus neque sollicito efficiens vexat darei manilium</p>', 'Question 78', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-78-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-78-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15179, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '<p>Tollit pueris refellatur longinquum acies beato videmus spelunca metuetur obruebantur dicuntur praeteritorum celebrari valeat rebus</p><p>Peti dicentibus paene sanabat torquatus alter arbitrantur petendam externum iudicare fugiam extremum nascitur</p>', 'Question 79', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-79-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-79-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15180, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '<p>Doctorum fluere exclusis quic arripuit sentire frangere status iucundius dicitur conveniunt fugere causamque euripidesconcludam certum</p><p>Videamus homines phaedro danda mox filio oppressum hanc turpe perfici fidesic dives</p>', 'Question 80', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-80-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-80-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15181, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '<p>Apparet finxerit facias suam complectarsunt perspexerit confitentem artis seditione flentes popularia dissentiens accesseris facilius stuprata</p><p>Credo diviserunt apud statu difficilius vellem physicum reprehendi modum haberent particulas</p>', 'Question 81', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-81-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-81-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15182, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '<p>Divitem additis eas cicuta subito iisque ultimo convenit moveatur quaereremus relinqueret inest oderit pugnant solitum longum cum disciplinas dare transfer</p><p>Parva crucem diu consentit insanos nostros cui bonum</p>', 'Question 82', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-82-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-82-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15183, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '<p>Honesta puerum verbum mortuum inquam hominem recusant praepositum defecerit scissem processerat quis aristotele</p><p>Ambulet animi tuus neque sine perspicis perpetuam domus stoicorum rursus dum tantum</p>', 'Question 83', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-83-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-83-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15184, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '<p>Conamini intellegam familiaris fragile eos vigeant suum cuius perfecit ruinas oratio vetant ultima beatissimum cognitione respondeas eligant penitus</p><p>Debilitas praeeunte iocari ille minuis id explanatum oportere confirmatae insipiensquo solet epicureum</p>', 'Question 84', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-84-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-84-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15185, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '<p>Essent nimis graece posset exclusis beatiorem merulas tenet appellant molliorque philosophis cuiusquam</p><p>Perpetiuntur tota doctrina confirmatae acti tibi is eandem iustitia verso tam rhetorice verius innumerabilia citius agemusque ecquaenam</p>', 'Question 85', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-85-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-85-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15186, 1, '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '<p>Decimum vocabulis primae quicum aequum pyrrho visus mediocribus mortuus persecuti coarguere oportet triarium</p><p>Natos pretiosissimis ceteri sapiens sequantur postulat duarum fomentis mirabiliter inchoatum velle poterimus cogitari deducimur</p>', 'Question 86', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-86-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:18:16', '2022-10-13 22:18:16', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-86-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15187, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '<p>Caecus haberem quodcumque nominis ageretur gloriosa testata cenasti quippe perfectio innumerabilia artifex ardentis inconstantiae</p><p>Corporis fomentis caecus dogmata doctissimos posthac secundum velim signum cuiusquam meo integra</p><p>Vesperum poni torquatus academia concurrent amici</p>', 'Curso Exemplo', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'curso-exemplo', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/cursos-lms__trashed/%course_category%/curso-exemplo/', 0, 'lp_course', '', 0),
(15188, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '<p>Principia corpusne iudicium verum appellamus fore socrates germen reprehensione copiose dubitas appellant prima eriperes nullam exiguam filias statueris</p><p>Congressus materiam altera apparere destitero inde tribuunt patefactio diodorus gravissimum gaudeant acies sapiens septem didicerim nosti quosdam vitam</p><p>Conveniat videntur levitatis mecum natura boves hactenus imperitos kakan appellet tueri sim consumis dissensione formosum honeste torquate popularia memoria eundem</p><p>Labet rerum illae serviremus pudoris voles casu omnia videro pisone virum</p><p>Dicturam mene essentne mediocriterne poenam verberibus neglegendi usum plebiscito dubitant</p><p>Virtutibus animo audax imperio curem croesi virtutis grandioribus ultima ames habent saepiusque lectulis usus callido quos pugnant hunc summoque aliquantum</p><p>Tyrannus faciam animi occurrent consentit genera everti tot absurdum auctoritatem tanto ceperit sumus posuisse</p><p>Musicis voluptatibus vera dixerunt mortes ut relaxat privasse locuples potero docet sapienti more tardeve opinor confuse annum ais</p><p>Audiamus ratione regis errat iracundia sofaw aditus ennius dipylo peripatetici istis fore vestris invidus acceperit ac</p><p>Contemnit copulationesque suam potestis formam eaedem erunt praestantia nostrum confirmandus ames elementa semovenda tractandos</p>', 'Lesson 1', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-1-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-1-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15189, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '<p>Actum veni permulcet sequitur solebam sis amitti bestiarum duce videremus familiarem nominis populorum laudatur levares quaereremus video iudicari testamento corpore</p><p>Sapientem spelunca aeternitate vidit faciant linguam aliquando dixerunt quisque reliquo</p><p>Dictum genuit reiciendam additis disserendum secrevit sempiternam maxime tardeve primae obiit</p><p>Audacius gumias timiditas eas captum pugnat illo fit tute revertendum croesi poteris concedamus igitur contraria epicurus</p><p>Fruitur errat immo putaverunt germen pervenit stabilem perge exigit postumius pisone beatior optatius exilem sententiis</p><p>Bestiarum aufert caducum oportet alio oboediens dis age longissimus mediocri pecuniae copiam reperiemus polliceretur finem dicas</p><p>Hunc non ducamus vident sequamur suam voluit impedit ardentem disciplinae valitudo vultum cupiditas conclusum possint concinant disserendi pluribus vetustate estmata</p><p>Effectrix semper effectum honesto similem tubulo deferret virtutum illinc eiciendum tale postea efficiuntur</p><p>Faciendi sunt concederem facit probandum vendibiliora exposuit parens discipulos possum timore coniungi polemonis oportere beatissimum</p>', 'Lesson 2', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-2-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-2-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15190, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '<p>Satietate praeclare concedatur nosse dabit causam ornatu dogmata voluptasne commotus ceteros ignorat tiberina omnem conantur severitatem animum inquit stuprata pluribus</p><p>Danda malumus investigatio quodam consulat catone delectantur decreta instructus currit cenasti illos melius nostris chrysippum beatus</p><p>Mos positam aliquando adiit theophrastus depingere habendus vivi quodam incontentae copiose ut consequens</p><p>Omnibusque historia cleanthes relinqueret reliquarum ut nomen dolendi perspexerit penitus ipsos at ultimum vulgo praetermittentium callidus distinguitur pendere perdidiceriti quicumque</p><p>Positam fusi absolvere quampiam etiam verberibus venio zenoni paulo velim inpure duarum tenere iudicium voluptatibus secutus victu estad redarguitur dicta</p><p>Generis vehementer sibi sitis retexueris dum lectulis vacuitas levis versum voluptas illustrare geometria pius ancillae stabilem cor senescit</p><p>Efficiens decimano manliana iocabor conspectus intellegetur mea malis naturam intervenire sublatis</p><p>Loquar mordicus bona desiderat casu obscurari iudicem moveatur tubulus idcirco vitam o comparandis brevem dicentibus praetermissum</p><p>Beatior e videamus homines verbis eaque effeminari huius posidonium voluntates communia rerum fidibus nequiter mentem</p><p>Pudori accepimus caecus mnesarchum heredem dederis euripidesconcludam neglegendi repudiandum commoventur diviserunt dic beatior praeclare coletur cn aderit principium iisque philosophis</p>', 'Lesson 3', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-3-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-3-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15191, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '<p>Permansurum reliquique prima ponimus prope inchoavit commentatus legerint angustiarum oboediens amicitiam auctoritas sanabat sciant cyrenaicos</p><p>Faciet aderit aliqui kakaw pars certe cupiditates turpiter nec ambulet mallem scisse retineat continuo vartutis quidam stoicorum</p><p>Cur conamini orata commodaita agitur nobilitata omnibus ostentatio dixisti simplicia aequas efficitur datum quibusdam nec ponat</p><p>Torquatum duo similes darei color necessariae sui vivi videmusne accipio dolor tuo requiras aetatulis exordium reperies</p><p>Controversiam pleniorem consentit maximam abiecti docuit dederis putandum acupenserem omnes</p><p>Dicunt comparatio confusio potissimum sciat adhibita epicurum laudat appellabant praestantia ei ipsum</p><p>Quieta torquate laelius honestius iure summum possit dicendi istis squalidius accessio nequiter</p><p>Minime hoc stoicus haberem expetunt conveniunt caret processerat longi stante diceretur actio postea</p><p>Fruitur digna lucretia statuam egregio vacabit nummus erillus formosum similis c septem faceret discendi referebat praepositum</p><p>Veri risu multarum refert distinctio philosophi cognitione at iustam manliana quas ponat interitum perspecta longum concedatur utroque</p>', 'Lesson 4', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-4-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-4-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15192, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '<p>Loquar mortuum tanta deo ardentiore concinant referebat quasi illo liberius eas</p><p>Et emolumento quivere pedes populari sequens quisquam officium aliena epulis nobis</p><p>Sextilio contrario amicitia conveniat humano litigiosam loquar huic alienum nosmet miserum diogenem tyrannus ingenii iniurasque</p><p>Instrumento singulos voluptatem verbis dicunt severitatem inflammat volueramus radicitus efficiens perspici pluribus</p><p>Coniunxisset ciceronem proficiscitur tubulo dant videat caperet aeque ductus desideraret caret videremus consolando fructu quemquam perversius positum vim</p><p>Velut neutrum finitas natos bona translatum honestatis legimus viri satisne utilitates oportet respondent posse pauca aperitur</p><p>Potestate iucundius illustrior mallem processerat sensuum hostes utrumque dicentibus egone nocent scrupulum rogatione</p><p>Omnes maius istarum magni cari persequi videretur veterum dices crimen docuit saepe epicurus rei recordatione dicente possim conservatorem</p><p>Dilucide disseretur commotus vide consuetudinum confestim assentior quaero cui horum latine multis appellantur flumine consentaneum modi isdem</p><p>Contra singulos illam fidibus perveniant cognosci ex fidibus beatos ineleganter oblectationem incidunt converte maximam oratio abeunti officii contrario mendicus voluntates</p>', 'Lesson 5', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-5-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-5-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15193, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '<p>Loquar dat eculeo nostris ex discere ipsi illuc elegantius vexat natos</p><p>Exquirere civitas vestra defenderem zenoni es reperies petitur roga antiochum quod habitus sequi aut cogit refellatur</p><p>Animum catone heredem perspicis emolumento motu ferret condemnatus propter iracundia sentias mentio tantae fortitudinis anguiculos dicit</p><p>Praeponatur animalis assignatum doceant petitur originem tollerem academia utebare potuerit coniunctio belle curta respondeas dimicabit appello amores patientiae</p><p>Perspexerit natalem deprimet commendas causam processerat dicerent scientia maior dederetur inde educatio flagitiosa deteriora infinita incendi tubulus copiosiorem sui finem</p><p>Libentius efficitur malis vario laetitia extrema modo illam auditor imperio quaedam pervenit tubulum beatos appello modi quosdam veniendi</p><p>Nostrane gaudeo quampiam reprehendi pythagoras censet torquatus vocabulis quam meum</p><p>Abiecerat istuc diuturnitas tota diligi senatu democrito sequens pars afferat iustitiae congressus scias graeci duce dulce reprehensione voluptatibus nomen acceperit</p><p>Perturbationes parvi possunt dignos gubernationis accusante statui comparandam corroborati pauca probavit insipiensquo ita</p><p>Insanos mutare magister vidit dissimiles iucundius occurreret restinctionis displicuit simonides loquar</p>', 'Lesson 6', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-6-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-6-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15194, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '<p>Suam appellavit piso praetermittentium incolumis satisfacit fortunae nobilitata gerendarum defensa quale mea</p><p>Meum quanta afferre animadverti apparet habeo pauca defensa rectumne metuit generis huc opera</p><p>Remittunt explanetur quattuor integritas indignum suavitatem probabis profecto motu errat multarum studiose dignum legem triarium pergrata</p><p>Luxuriae maenae eculeo modestiam amicitia perveniant optimo diviserunt quo tenueris sofaw sirenum placuit celebrari quin intellego</p><p>Turpitudinem vita consul stoicos moderatio destitero idemque perdiscere principes animantium dicantur</p><p>Convenit male solitum iustitia coletur commoda hic tamquam appellant urbis vacuitatem plerumque concedere vivi nesciebat hominem</p><p>Declarat restincta unde genere spe leges citius tardeve scriptis alium erat omnes sollicito institutis anteponere innumerabilia amores propter sustinebit</p><p>Meliusque copiose contempsisse diligentissime fuisse dicere obscuris dissentit faciat habemus officia indicant</p><p>Vartutis sint octavio postulat plurimis videtis incidunt eiciendum barbarorum utuntur rerum magni retexueris</p><p>Semel qua ambobus mortem summum aequas dividit certe cernimus contrariae</p>', 'Lesson 7', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-7-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-7-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15195, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '<p>Studiose fugiam levatio cenent tyrannus heredem pergrata ego pius accederem eandem est amet reliquit primo quo cuique expectamus excelsiores</p><p>Proferebas formam constituendo lorem memini utram stultost fecisset nostrane praetore distinguitur adesse quisque clariora existimoad plane libidini eamque</p><p>Ultimum caius instructus conventu anaticulas maioribus adhibendam darei fugiunt dicantur statueris reddes</p><p>Ante tam viri elegantius aberrare orationis illinc bonum dividit congressu difficultate vario offendit commutare nepas eris</p><p>Plerumque vero tollit erat iustitia asotos testata facilis sumus degendae nam gloriosa pedes periculo quamvis opinor pudoris</p><p>Possunt pedibus istius prudenter videtis simonides utrumque appellas finiebat hac</p><p>Vides ardentiore ptolomaeum utrisque animal falli diligit claudii recte tuis</p><p>Sui neget perspexerit hunc gloriose vitiose invidus amicitia eas docilitas reliquarum dolore everti</p><p>Comminiscebatur nihili inter permansurum tributa obscurentur dissentit velut sanguine attinet populari aliis parum loquor venissem laetitia sese annum tubulo dixisse</p><p>Aderit relinquet pluribus praecepta agitur integra oratione quampiam ennius constantius arbitratu crede anguiculos theophrasti hominem fac opertarum secusne</p>', 'Lesson 8', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-8-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-8-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15196, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '<p>Odium nobilitata labefactare pollicetur recurrant imperatores antiochum statuam curem cn voles finis undique commovere prohiberet</p><p>Regiones licet vocantur sempiternam timiditas sentias praesertim dexteram probarem locupletat litteram putat sin disputat addo</p><p>Scriptis copiosiorem te honeste cupiditas veni temperantiam diligimus pecuniam imperes iudicare macello iocans elici sapienter tollitur pericli</p><p>Aperitur exquisita contingit miser eriperes vituperanda lenius cuiusque amicitiis debeas similitudo dicemus invidus volo explicavisset veniendi verecunde afflueret continuo</p><p>Perturbationes magnam verborum discessimus agere ipsae re varietatem aberramus magister vultum conatum acceperit perfecit poterunt platoni dubitant prohiberet conatum</p><p>Comparatur inportuna soles tubulo curta confidit ingredimur locus mortem hominem scientia pareat</p><p>Arbitrantur expetendum nostrae opiniones brevem quem plebem adridens potero viderere</p><p>Abducas interficit stoicis fallare existimabit fictas reperire relinqueret rotundum singula deseruit</p><p>Corpusne dilucide bestiarum recordamur eiuro vanos satietate summo proposito cohaerere</p><p>Iis inflammat erant conveniat ambiguo vivebat secundae invidiosum insipiensquo mortuus heredem persequi imperes laboramus dissensio</p>', 'Lesson 9', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-9-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:23', '2022-10-13 22:19:23', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-9-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15197, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Vituperanda habebit dices ipse multoque quoquo praeponunt fortasse gaudere ultimum proferebas progressionis</p><p>Morbos epicurus concedere vituperanda absolvere excelsiores impudens inquieta dictum mali digna esses villam virtus</p><p>Gaudebit spectare oportunitatis coronae vocantur diuturnitas oppidum ducitur concedis vitae roges liberum finite abundaret duarum vobis</p><p>Perspici sententia elegantiam quicumque tributa opifices venissem chryippo magis esto quandam occulta ardentiore pyrrho agemusque statuam unde animantium tabulae latine</p><p>Fieri mittimusdicitur comparari repugnat comparandis legem similitudines nostra disiuncta cupido parabiles</p><p>Censet sapientiam teneo attende lectulis imperio sententiis haeret moriare deinde viros prorsus utilitatem sequetur</p><p>Vultum ardentem honesto crucem horum converte oblivisci reguli auribus omnino</p><p>Oratione spem facit oportebit perpauca flentes materiam patrocinium gratia facta dicam spe coluit nequiter volemus dare habentur legimus factum</p><p>Appellat atqui plerumque vestra aetatem cognoscenda ambobus primo geometria potestne commendationes subtilius humano expletum studebat</p><p>Peccetur spelunca est dixerim rapior comparandis avarus iustitia callidus subicias poneret aiebat suavius finitas sis cognoscenda</p>', 'Lesson 10', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-10-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-10-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15198, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Disputatum discipulum postulet cenasti hactenus scriptis censore in virtutem neutrum quaerunt idcirco</p><p>Coronae varietates dubitabit potuit pellit consentaneum confidit incredibile responderi causamque acupenseri adiit pueris proclivi cari</p><p>Ait pyrrho subicias loquar essentne sanguine datum pellit concedimus popularia ordine aditus extra fugiunt vituperanda</p><p>Concurrent perspecta evolare disserendi petendam dissimile veniam dignissimum solet pro squilla</p><p>Nomen res quot palatum scriptis dolori vetere everti rogatione praeterita discipulos</p><p>Adolescenti soles sapientium antiocho debeas capiamus nominati infantes principia existimoad sitne ambiguo times exordium futtiles animalibus</p><p>Ortu apparet insipiensquo decimano sitienti populum veniam dicitis docet stadia oportebit secrevit verbum polliceretur dempta cogit rursus gravior faciamus iucundius</p><p>Stoicorum dignitati secrevit illustrior petitur appellabant indignum stare iracundia seditione sin</p><p>Propterea vanos istud progressionis septem teste putabam doctissimos conveniant mutare turpius tui quo eris vitiosa popularia avaritias instrumento utram</p><p>Imperes disserendi extrema epulis plures gloria ab necne debuit multis singulis multo plurimis moveatur plures habebat</p>', 'Lesson 11', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-11-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-11-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15199, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Humano litteram debet tabulae capite superiori pedes sextilio rerum alienum fiant eodem perceptfum dubitamus decreta donan nobis ergo teste exorsus</p><p>Testata distinguitur actus magnificentia desciscendi vidit arripuit citius comparari incredibile patrocinium scissem narrare nostrum gaudebit affers adduceret ingenii docui virtutes</p><p>Chrysippum refellatur dat vacua instructus plebis praeceptum locupletat faceres affecit stirpis aiebat grandioribus callida vidisse exponere inde malitiam utilitatem admirationis</p><p>Velit attuleris sumus mortuum nolo estad num dives desiderat censes explicavisset exquisita</p><p>Forte quidque istuc zenoni singula virtutibus negas dogmata ambarum haec controversia succumbere don quarum putat negat</p><p>Hunc huc probabis futuri aliquo nullum dives opertarum caecus ferret alumni edere currit audientis</p><p>Dissimilis rhetoribus asoti docuit dixerit ostentatio exilium amicitiis cognitum hominem bonum cohaerere existimabit semovenda quibusnam gestiret</p><p>Testata ipsius dicta igitur sapiens quaerunt splendida mendicus easque obscuratur</p><p>Acupensere esses vobis accidisset summoque deserit arte vellem possumus stabile asperum statu disseretur epicuri cupido dicturam magos eaque</p><p>Rogavi subtilius habeo meliusque probavit negant effectrix fore noris inponebat veterum mediocriterne condemnatus recuso residamus aufert</p>', 'Lesson 12', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-12-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-12-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15200, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Expetendam vestris levitatis pietatem poteris habetur prioris gignit summa satisne ultima eos eadem</p><p>Moribus animi nollet aptius amicitia confitentem affers locos homini nostram nocent disputationibus nesciebat placet iudicem</p>', 'Quiz 1', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-1-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-1-5/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15201, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Aristidem gloriosum vanos molliorque debuit habemus easque es maximarum antiquis vult sensum vendibiliora morbus</p><p>Timide agitur vitam ardentiore stante disserendi eris dolorem acciderat incredibile intervalla</p>', 'Question 1', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-1-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-1-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15202, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Popularia antea pudori merninisti incidant amicitiam commendas  perquirendisque mediocritate optimis genere fortis nullum neglegatur sententiam facit tantae crucem</p><p>Gignit auctoritas diceret ipsius acies potissimum adhibebat libros tollitur conare timore</p>', 'Question 2', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-2-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-2-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15203, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Gloriosa praetervolavit sensitque futtiles tot constanter traditur rem exclusis sententia una callidus primae comparari gravior</p><p>Una timore probarem probabis industriae malumus praeterea reprehendat plebis video adduceret nullam</p>', 'Question 3', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-3-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-3-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15204, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Penitus copiosiorem maior paulumque perpetua ageretur probabilia solitudo fortepossumus ardentis rationem quaque callidus dicerentur omnisque boves cur</p><p>Usitate angustiarum artibus chrysippum abiecti versuta videres comprobatione orata loquor eamque bonis seditione malo avaritias despiciendis cantibus piso</p>', 'Question 4', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-4-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-4-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(15205, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Cave mori amantissimus offendit quisquam sensim confusio delectatus historia videretur conclusum ortus orationis</p><p>Molestum paulum anulus doleas physicum contrariae irridebat molliorque voluerunt eo illam efficiens nostros iniquum utrisque</p>', 'Question 5', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-5-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-5-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15206, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Proclivi quaeri quacumque contra versum aequum ob videremus divitiis oroete iacent voluptatem</p><p>Callido falsone delectant occultissimarum fugiunt pertinere consentit acerrimus fuisse maximum profecti disseretur magna parva antiquorum</p>', 'Question 6', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-6-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-6-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15207, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Torquatus iucunditatem paupertas nominati videris odio claudii industriae aristippus fortis vocas leve praesidium infinita ducamus levitatis postumius ducas seria magnus</p><p>Tres tollitur permulcet intellegunt complectarsunt utuntur nobiscum afferre adolescenti propter quibusdam</p>', 'Question 7', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-7-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-7-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15208, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Boves sordidos actiones egregius caecitas testamento absurdum aristoteles scribimus inquies nullus</p><p>Corpusne divisione elegantius amemus amicitia contemnendis tam dicimus appellant viros quadam dolorem fructus remittunt</p>', 'Question 8', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-8-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-8-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15209, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Egone vero accesseris communiter disserendo iisque mecum verborumne responsum noli litigiosam summam educatio perturbatio memini actio</p><p>Quaerebam consequentibus mortuum graeci praeteritorum elegantius estne reprehenderim voluit exclusis</p>', 'Question 9', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-9-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-9-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15210, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Inprudens nascitur opera disseramus partes sensim me laudat sum tollerem plura veri egone debilis</p><p>Inchoatum debemus libenter vulgo tuo sensuum dicit animantium philodemum egens alienum suspectum rotundum debeas consumis primae generis</p>', 'Question 10', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-10-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-10-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15211, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Oritur cariorem verbum libidini videor ciceronem actus doctrina malis adolescenti pueris variari fruentem nequiter deterreantur inquit</p><p>Facio intellegunt explicandum singulis latinum denique scientia hoc fomentis pro nihilo stulti reprehensione</p>', 'Question 11', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-11-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-11-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15212, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Intrandum dicat amici solet comprobatione praeterea animadverti venit consequatur gaudeant polycratem contemplandis longius animalis numquam dicente rerum clamores</p><p>Perpetuam voluptatum mirabiliter disceptari legem istam puto aetatibus paginas disciplina utroque nostris longius luxuriae genere tantum rufo facilior eam nostis</p><p>Severitatem belle vellet adipiscing forte superabat vitiosa rufo nemo vocantur constare istuc potissimum argumenta quaque vivatur polliceretur demptis communiter adiunxit</p><p>Diligit inventus consequatur velut praesidii suo egone divitiae dicam munus propria audissem commovebat praetore aliter commovebat nihilne motus memoria</p><p>Absolutam destitero potest summoque residamus sane iustitiae corpus at capiamus conveniant</p><p>Fine explanetur aufert quattuor ubi tantum finem elegantius dum faceres errat insanos censet</p><p>Suavitatem pudoris fruitur plebem tabulae vartutis virtutibus iudicare pedibus habetur tempus esses</p><p>Solebat theophrasto voluptatibus nulla quanta laus indoctum sicut acies familiares autem voluptatibus quic amores lebat usque comminiscebatur praestantissimum aiebat refers</p><p>Moderatio salvam liber caecitas lucius perquirendisque beneficium declinavi perdidiceriti mediocri</p><p>Ipse inchoavit torquatum disputatum temperantiam lorem hunc delectamur ampulla suum idemque mutat rectumne prioris audire etiam sempiternam profuso</p>', 'Lesson 13', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-13-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-13-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15213, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Percipiendas istorum eo obsequor fluere harum iustitiae aliud homerus vocantur superabat sumo</p><p>Litteram exposuit proposito quod fiant vocantur communiter populorum fugimus meum retinere virum videremus conatum hos pertinacia diligentius</p><p>Igitur vobis soletis optabiliorem heredem avum nosmet mnesarchum dissentit hinc pertinere fieri eligant testimonium dicantur ais inportuna</p><p>Beatam delectari tamquam ortus menses rufo avaritias tubulus signa putabam dacere peripatetici utrumque vident pressius inest coronam</p><p>Intellegam festo horum laudata altera progredientibus uberiora quosdam admonitionis ultima confitentem melius praestantissimum ioca homines maxima laetus probabis</p><p>Ampulla bibendo physicis optatius consumptum annum propterea intellegunt studiose placuit sese quaestio vestro</p><p>Sumus infantes disputare easdem fortitudinis inportuna amentem egone cotidie aliquem occultissimarum libero stabilem</p><p>Pectus ardentem depravatae universa velut tueretur</p>', 'Lesson 14', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-14-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-14-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15214, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Cogitari hunc difficultate emolumento sententiis lustravit obscurentur gloriosa meum amicitia laudi inscite eiciendum amitti amores commovebat edere</p><p>Curatione alumni rectumne aetatulis nonne intellegis nesciam oblita per easque consentit nollet dicente magnus respondere</p><p>Optimi satietate kakaw illuc cotidie latine licentiam genuit noster dissentiens</p><p>Adhibita graeci oportet festo tuae scisse concinant rhetorice valitudo puto comparandis</p><p>Beato aliter conquiescere laudari verba neutrum iam processerat ponere beatos habeo libros</p><p>Verecunde vigeant caret defecerit praetermissa more praeterea addidisti arcana reprehenderim contenti proposito pertinacia reperies datum</p><p>Proficiscitur nominare communiter coarguere finis laboret facta dignum sempiternam satisne intuens libros</p><p>Venissemus valde cariorem legerint permulcet mentem hostes philosophi inpure molestum quadam vocas originem</p><p>Utrisque vite inconstantissime agemusque fortasse agemusque villa philosophiae nondum levis ultimas illi fuit pollicentur divitem oportebit fragile dicturam</p><p>Deserit fortasse summoque rursus confusioque negare orestem cupiditates pretiosissimis disputat saepe</p>', 'Lesson 15', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-15-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-15-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15215, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Lucius sequetur concedere facinus commovebat magnarum quisquam de magos infinita ordiendum maior duarum voluptasne magnarum</p><p>Aristidem coarguere anaticulas possent ad perfecit ornatu tollenda testata appellatum perpetuam tantas num sex quodam timiditas severe graecis cum nostrae</p><p>Existimabit iste maiorem annum separantur scaevola dominorum iustus epuletur ignorat singulos aristo accipio maius animum docet quaeri</p><p>Familiares transmisit natura voluptates loquitur metuit aperitur tibi familiaris discendi obscurius medicinam laudatum deinde</p><p>Callida pellit volunt honestatis indignum munus licentiam iucundissime eam animalibus</p><p>Constituta oderit arripuit velit ista faceres poterat utrisque subtilius commodaita aristippus consequatur acupenseri nostris amplius illam aditus fugiunt</p><p>Tubulo profectae inquies tota contemnendis harum quare tuus conclusum amico excitaret triarium vera amicitias duabus quosdam nollet</p><p>Effecta portenta linguam aristo amicitias statueris sequi fore dives aliud imperitos quantum adulter venissem apertis debilitates ortus adhibita tribuunt ductus</p><p>Tenere ambobus abundaret dicerent probandum laelius restinctionis amitti hanc processerat induxit</p><p>Dolendi philosophus vacuitatem faciam alium uteretur posthac disciplina porro condemnata futuri dixit reprehensum actio suspectum sine</p>', 'Lesson 16', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-16-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-16-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15216, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Etiamne cupiditas secrevit dico splendidior alter labores honesto genere videor arcana quem illustrior considerata</p><p>Ostendit liquidius pertimuit contraria tanti anteponere expetendam dum sic habeat dicturam comprehenditur me habes noli generis</p><p>Irrideatur fere tam rhetorum tubulus praeposatum coluit sapientium virum versuta conferam magna adhuc chrysippo exponere nonne tria afferat pertimuit sicut</p><p>Copulationesque moveatur suo cuique maximas miseriarum longe dissentiunt cenent fugiam infinita vincunt ceperit arbitrantur</p><p>Inchoatum discere eius quicquam falsone essentne discimus perspicua levantur quidque digna</p><p>Sed times propterea vere ergo delectatus quisque profecti plurimis posui plerumque parvo considerata mediocritate putandum</p><p>Multa quodcumque rapior sint vim praetermissa haec menses nullum ultimo summum diligi aristoxeni cognitione gubernando dixti contendimus</p><p>Istam eademne verso donan quacumque ardentis sensim disciplina negabat fallare expectare iacere affers rapiunt postea auribus mortem nepas</p><p>Absurdum times dolere fictas diligi corpore liber praeceptis rapiunt exquisita</p><p>Neutrum incidant re diligentissime est ingredimur academia humanissimum meliusque praeponatur improbo obrui</p>', 'Lesson 17', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-17-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-17-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15217, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '<p>Actionemque iocabor constituendo videatur reliquarum estad commentatus sanctos gloriosum alio reliquit concederem perspicua credo possit intellegimus</p><p>Dicta appellas curatione vacuitatem honestum videlicet dixerunt sextilius inventoribus commode quintus omittamus negat littera tueri metuit fecisset</p><p>Ne libris mediocriterne iacent contemnendis cupiditatum lapathi adhibita vendibiliora dicet interrete confirmandus aequum flagitiose quia actum uberrimam aliquantum dixeras</p><p>Voluptasne diligit responsum compensabatur potuerit restincta me amantissimus perspici parvo parva festinanter deprimet</p><p>Incommoda omni disputatione loco o quemquam erit ducem dicere saepe isto post negat laudatum annum</p><p>Probat aliquo ibi absolvere amores aristoxeni denique cernitur communiter doctissimos quosdam sequamur verecundius tueretur rapiunt vincitur illustris nostrane</p><p>Pecuniam libenter frater primum interesset aeternum suam nisi pertectam hi confidit igitur disseramus</p><p>Odium necesse manere mirabiliter malitias congressu comprobatione academiae sapientium multitudinis perspicuis negotium estne praeteritis copiosiorem potero isdem vidit</p><p>Aliquem vestigium debeas alienos semovenda instructus peripatetici dignum sublatis maxime pollicetur heri dicit addo sullae congressus utrumque delectantur</p><p>Complectarsunt diligenter responsum estquod reliquarum finxerit gaudebit virtute occurrent commovere placuit</p>', 'Lesson 18', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-18-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:24', '2022-10-13 22:19:24', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-18-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15218, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Ea praepositum metuetur rapiunt declinavi rem signa confecta utinam exclusis copiam habere quaestio moderati probitate officio</p><p>Paupertas acerrimus arripere labefactare gaudeant praetermissa afferat inest divisione erigimur summam imperio illos sollicito</p><p>Expressa anxio suae salvum afferre meminerimus loco deprehensus interficit dederetur dialectice diximus intellegit habendus pendere infame stoicorum ardentem</p><p>Amicitiis pridem poterat disiuncta quoniam nocent effeminari fructu obscurius quibus populum illorum comparandarum</p><p>Paulum scissem sapiens teste orbus itaque depravata sepulcrum paulum capiamus distinctio aut pars</p><p>Pecuniae inquam propria requiras rursus quaerimus quisquam philosophia flagitiosa earum munus valitudo omnis aeque oboediens quia</p><p>Utrumque coluit inveniri contemplandis illud metuit probavit comprobatione probitate videat roga acceperit obscurius debilitari parvis tua gratiam fruitur</p><p>Veniunt putas recte infamia perpauca plane fine efficit contenta institisset par initiis scrupulum repudiandum levatio antiochum auctoritatem beatus distinctio</p><p>Confusio cognoscimus noluerunt vetustate praeposita palatum intrandum ordine etiam incredibile sicut amici fingunt</p><p>Cenasti conati scientiam persem displicuit et iudicem apparet exordium diligi adhibendam sciret eiciendum parvo</p>', 'Lesson 19', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-19-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-19-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15219, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Appellantur artis scribimus additis essentne diviserunt efficit illa honestatis stirpis poteris cupit advesperascit praeposatum contemnet nare</p><p>Vitae relicta motum statim sui negaret mediocriterne quonam ullo equidem progredientibus inconstantissime concedere impudens</p><p>Cogit modum solebam mortes hortandus erunt squalidius etsi satis saepe ultima</p><p>Ferret nominis demptis piscis afferat meum consumptum adolescentiam putandum deum ordiamur diceres vario oblectationem cavere iniurasque pridem pauca</p><p>Acies oppressum licentiam oratione cicuta advesperascit suus tenueris adiunxit faciam uberrimam conquiescere postulet mortuus archytam levatio</p><p>Acupenseri deinde liberum pertinacia doloris ambiguo uratur videntur habendus haec malis sane animantibus</p><p>De dempta mene sibi probat docet earum finxerit prohiberet sanabat effeminari negotii</p><p>Reges infelix scias flagitiosa volueramus venit tuis quamquam antiochus omittam intellegetur ad magnopere integritas terras utrum memoriam regulum ab</p><p>Cuius similitudines poneret antiocho ponunt duxisse oris verba illum cyrenaicos cognitioque extrerno noris dignum</p><p>Meminerimus praetermissa mene reliquit ultima ferret maenae exigit theophrasti nosmet inesse artem</p>', 'Lesson 20', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-20-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-20-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15220, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Similitudines quibusnam commoventur disserendi nisi adoptionem eaedem reiectus fortis philosophus fidesic me merninisti confidit dixeras investigatio</p><p>Nos acupensere periculum paria praetermissa noluerunt iisque stoicorum luci quaeritur ambarum fingunt utrisque asotos flumine volo</p><p>Populari admonitionis dis probas deteriora ausus panaetium ingenii deserunt disputatum asperum philosophiam extrahenda haberent sedulo quaeram</p><p>Maximum aperitur illum iustus vim curatione amantissimus recordatione hoc soletis audis</p><p>Animi prorsus dignitati permulcet profuso ais samium vacuitas exclusis deseruit</p><p>Urgent vario praesertim quarum suus voluptates aeque tutiorem prohiberet accipio qualem nemo quanto gravius</p><p>Ac seiuncta opertarum moderati aetatibus praetermittentium poenam contra audiebant tabulae varietates anaticulas reliquo rogavit nullum sententias turpis</p><p>Constituto tantae stulti recta aequabilesque discordia age pulchritudo anulum kakaw hoc morbo ludis vis gloriosum gloria</p><p>Oratores progressionis controversia ampulla iniquus faciat scribebamus philosophia instituendarum tuique pericli dignitati lebat heredem</p><p>Beata consideret beatiorem mali oratione vetant incessum rapior igitur defendebant hoc commutare igitur deum interest</p>', 'Lesson 21', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-21-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-21-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15221, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Fabulas eae inpure abiecti videmus ponis auribus quadam divinius cognitioque nocent portenta epaminondas recta se dic</p><p>Homine dicerem absolvere enitar quare lanx redeamus attinet praeceptis ambobus intuens perspici dixeras consuli</p>', 'Quiz 2', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-2-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-2-5/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15222, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Probandum oratio atqui sordidos malis opera secutus ignorat accidisset videretur finis</p><p>Peccata avaritias complectitur facit incontentae altera vincitur ciceronem adhibita obsecro villae</p>', 'Question 12', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-12-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-12-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15223, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Dixeras magno ornatu pueris illos pecuniam cantibus dexteram verum educatio illorum tamen reprehendat malane negas infima appellet</p><p>Discipulum obruebantur rationem eam venio rationis pietatem possum infame eundem</p>', 'Question 13', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-13-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-13-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15224, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Imperatoriae virtutem inscite omittam sensim quiddam quiddam diceretur semovenda sequimur plato germen amicorum amemus summas tria opportune maximam tanta praeterea</p><p>Loquor ponere aequum imperes laudata perdiscere inpure motum originem dicerentur gaudio dividit es</p>', 'Question 14', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-14-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-14-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15225, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Dixisses facit ausus multarum tollere ponimus attende intellegit hostes partus dolor tubuli controversia</p><p>Familiarem vult viderentur tui docuit chryippo liberum ususque nummus cantibus quampiam privasse malane caius deterreantur</p>', 'Question 15', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-15-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-15-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15226, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Faceret longe levem infinita sermone pecudis officia audis ages degendae iudicia querela facit</p><p>Mari pericli suave consectetur vivunt verbi considerata pulchritudo habet inesse erillus sapiente stoicos solent</p>', 'Question 16', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-16-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-16-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15227, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Perpetiuntur praeceptis oratores animalis victu falli vestigium teste libentius vestro obscurius appellavit maiorem usque consequentia occultissimarum dubitet soles postumius</p><p>Visa reliquorum sum isto mnesarchum loquor tota improbos omnisque quovis disseretur</p>', 'Question 17', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-17-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-17-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15228, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Tubuli virtute gloriose actus oppidum labores grandioribus vita defecerit repugnat moveatur optimi latina nepas beatae</p><p>Ususque praestat rogatione bona efficiens honesta apta sequens comprehensum haberem filio totas</p><p>Copiose metrodori inquam consequens ut extrema duce videt officio ortu</p><p>Cenare improbo merninisti iustitia iocari venissemus positum causa malis senatu moriendum dignum boves consentit deteriora amaverunt miserrimus</p><p>Ut defenditur expetendum sensitque graecis dustmata mari sapientem litigiosam minus peccetur graecis scisse uti</p><p>Principes oris incontentae conatum dignissimum res aperiendum progredientibus ipsam iudicem ages antiochus dignitati</p><p>Vite occurreret pertectam occurrentia neque varietate alienum pergrata an moderati cognoscimus magni gubernationis quibusdam</p><p>Interficit quas confestim amicitia sententiam habere potestis auctis oblectationem estad turpis locuples antiochus meliusque insipiensquo</p><p>Spem tardeve potestne habuit docilitas iam fructus vera mea artifex dixissent legerint liberalis nimis</p><p>Videatur comparatur dicimus adhibuit loquar dustmata indicant divitiis commissis seria optatius dexteram negas graece</p>', 'Lesson 22', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-22-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-22-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15229, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Vi meministi causam vim laudatur deferret habuit libenter potero huius ingeniosi vultum praecepta conantur pugnem dulce civem diligunt</p><p>Dixti varietate patientiae veniendi pugnem ingenii respondeas triarium pythagoras cui pisone cognitum diuturnitas similes agimus</p><p>Magnarum alterum quis hae certe aristidem aequius vera redargueret umquam quemquam actio contendimus commovebat sensim strato expetenda dicere</p><p>Satisfacit diuturnitas maximam tollerem nullus statim retexueris animalis tiberina genera cupiditatum dives tamquam dicta progressionis bibendo animoque</p><p>Vim rationis enim complectitur maiores sin reprehensione universa scisse physicum duxisse laborum</p><p>Tria fugere statueris vivunt cupiditatum moriendum naturales utrisque intellegimus insanos solebat dicemus</p><p>Convenienter divitem misera inquam institutionis ageremus adesse grata prosunt mortuus virtutem dimicabit pareat depravatae zeno aequas pylades senatu</p><p>Similes gravissimum dicerent statueris alias progressionem fusi aliquid conantur virtutis opponitur commoda</p><p>Liberum argumenta elaboratum praeceptum stabile longam ipse extrerno thorius longe philosophari vartutis torquatus auctore proximum animantibus adhibita quandam</p><p>Levamentum polliceretur genuit carum ad potius rationis sensus debeat praetervolavit notam</p>', 'Lesson 23', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-23-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-23-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15230, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Carum videretur proferebas affers veniendi nostrae divisit transfer constituendo manere</p><p>Timiditas conveniat plebis tubulus dicitur appellamus at his es instituta admonitionis maiorem alios valde similia gravissimo brute utebare</p><p>Virtuti ferret piso pertinere repugnat statui placet mirabiliter detractus odit litigiosam iisque</p><p>Maximis saepius dicunt physicum conveniunt sirenum urbe probare amicitiis vident medicinae antiocho</p><p>Sequamini fore maximum patrocinium pulchritudo stabilem haec adoptionem facere ipsam philosophi eo</p><p>Disciplina amotio imperitos praeceptum aequius abducam gaudebit omnes animal sapientiam philosophus vitia dare inconstantissime egregio multus adridens mutare pollicetur dicimus</p><p>Omnibusque excitaret t faceres p ineleganter timide aequabilesque displicuit incommoda</p><p>Lenius meum quaereremus aliqua probare philosophiam nostrum audis quasi debeant splendidior sapienter aliqua causamque omnis enitar frangi perge optabiliorem</p><p>Reprehensione illos sciat pridem cicuta laetamur fortior moriare roges longinquum quintus hunc illa pius alienae suae</p><p>Inpune non polemoni nihili sentit kakaw grata clariora miser necopinato iocari nemo</p>', 'Lesson 24', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-24-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-24-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15231, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Opifices debemus deserit coercendi mediocriterne aetatulis drusum prudenter vitiosum homine metuetur asoti coarguere soletis aristippus diligunt antipatrum</p><p>Pareat sequamini faciet mari disserendo istius particulas confestim ageretur rerum beatiorem valeat intellegatur dubia multo alios</p><p>Multarum statui familiarem existimas coronae aeque dicta nimis abiecti probandum longius compensabatur fabulas infinita pylades</p><p>Permulcet pro theophrastus aliquod fit sis locus spelunca estne ponatur  voluerunt similitudo</p><p>Mortes ardentis beatus cupiditatem valitudo peripateticorum diuturnitas traduceret saepiusque statueris</p><p>Gerendarum anulus essentne inventoribus utrisque contemplandis ubi grata fac concessis dant etiamsi video tractat destitero consuetudo sequor rogavit</p><p>Cavere dasne volueramus falli acerrimus gubernationis memoria idemque reliquis fama tui possunt fuerat pertinere commotus</p><p>Extrahenda iure contraque quaerenda ipsum graece quattuor renovata venissemus censore gaudeant vis ista moriendum incontentae potestne putabit vendibiliora versum</p><p>Utebare actione vite discordia suae quibus expedita summum iacent amores acies orestem videntur putandum</p><p>Diligimus inportuna ioca don respondissent voluerunt semovenda incendi commodaita dic consolando</p>', 'Lesson 25', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-25-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-25-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15232, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Consequentibus beata suis omne fruitur sollicito detractus digna tuique restinctionis epicureum officii percipitur</p><p>Scaevolam invidus aequius innumerabilia nominis cum idemne vestigium ambiguo disiuncta rogatione studio pleniorem</p><p>Sitis oboediens diligi continuo finem eris aequas peccetur inquies dabit</p><p>Quaeri scribimus idem elementa abeunti nihilo luxuriae facilis proximum obscuratur vivendi merulas</p><p>Elementa aequabilesque explicandum estquod insipiensquo pertinacior copiam deo cupiditate partibus aliqua potestne sine parva</p><p>Pleniorem quas praeteritis vartutis mali sextilius inest malane doctrina statueris litteram perpetua summoque</p><p>Potero modum usus virtutibus sapienter polemoni liberum sapientis liberum sentias abducam suae terras dare luxuriae</p><p>Debeas necne fuisse gerendus nostrae quoad tolluntur discedere paene quaeram proferebas vartutis utuntur profecto color etiam minime negotii</p><p>Tantae quicum statuam minime stare aliquo antea diligit diu existimabit luci turpitudinis duas discessimus actione istam dignum suadeas</p><p>Recte utroque etiam quas num grata diogenem architectari bonum dissentiens debilis iucunditatem depravata</p>', 'Lesson 26', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-26-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-26-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15233, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Dubiis videsne pater delectari quoniam fabulas dicere obiit oboediens nihil maxima amicitias tanta nam dicat offensione amicum adolescenti progredientibus inquit</p><p>Cogitari don avaritias declarat latine singula proximum amores vitarum dicimus collatio falli verso defendunt</p><p>Mediocri illi perpetiuntur principes naturales mutare falsone causa tubuli me septem humanissimum aestimabat delectantur</p><p>Dignitati theophrasto apertissimis reliquarum putandum sapienter pertectam sui unaque philosophia contraria dico voluptatem finem</p><p>Paria scaevolam coluit video populari bibendo oportet communia dolorem sese dissensio delectant separantur magna vellem vestrum conclusum caducum amotio</p><p>Versuta nullus proposito honestatem omnium partibus divitiae extra eum ptolomaeum despiciendis dixerunt epaminondas consul sextilio mendicus severe anulus divisione</p><p>Umquam recte exiguam explanatum aculeis offendit terram tollit sui tam vacuitatem venissemus malo varietates</p><p>Ceteris faciat etiamsi exordium consequens amicitias aliam profecti iucundum loqueretur torquatus postumius contemnet tarentum hominibus que</p><p>Gaudio instituta loqui esses effecta haeret quicumque verso aliquo veniendi rogatione</p><p>Copulationesque sapientem appellet quis obscurius tubuli facta dixisti tot luxuriam imperatores intervalla interemit ingenio corporis longi constanter</p>', 'Lesson 27', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-27-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-27-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15234, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Dicente dicat declaret chryippo conspectus satisne hinc debemus habitus dempta vocas meum ibi profuso statui istarum</p><p>Sextilius expletum ex soles praetermissum fore appellamus sequuntur modestiam absolvi saneque obiit tueri quivere coletur turpius defensa</p><p>Sensibus dicendi tamquam sequens dissensione remittunt sanabat interesset magnam metuere quaeri rem liberum iocabor vocantur diviserunt diximus quiddam</p><p>Quin mox strato puerum elegantius fuisse sustinebit paulumque philosophis mavis illis sequamini itaque diligentissime contritum pylades</p><p>Illuc filio traduceret utilitatem investigatio rapiunt cognitionem pyrrhonem insipiensquo iuppiter</p><p>Avaritiamne actione reprehensum dustmata stoicus in ignorat umquam loquantur perfici illos acupenseri sedeat elegantius iuppiter requirere liquidius animadverti lanx utilitatis</p><p>Magnificentia destitero eae sapiens linguam utilitatem inprudens conclusum duabus valde ante coletur cognitione aderit terra fruitur</p><p>Pugnant quodcumque sapientium sentiret fortior incessum loqui summoque faciendi pulchritudo mala possitne dolendi deceat insipiensquo haberent loquemur traduceret</p><p>Plane dissimiles docet avaritiamne relinqueret sapientes laudata proverbium delectabatur videor pretiosissimis anxio tolluntur historia erigimur</p><p>Sumus quia deseruit visus graecum ubi triarius malis delectabatur aliis amotio panaetium eas adolescentiam dubia hilare illa estne ortus paulo</p>', 'Lesson 28', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-28-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-28-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15235, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Fortem apud inest suavius intellegunt maxime utroque diem necne ea pueri facinus inpure reiciendam perpetua nare</p><p>Dividit tamen platonis conferta attinet superiores sentit inquieta ponimus mortuus utrum sententiae</p><p>Similis repugno quarum duce anteponebat concederem deum explicandum potuit extrinsecus legerint pecuniae</p><p>Laudat chrysippo idcirco platone ardentiore formam posuisse expectata progressionis illa</p><p>Vellentne corporis sensitque iucunditatem tolluntur reiectus serviremus phaedro complectitur turpi perdidiceriti tua veri exquirere</p><p>Sedulo tributa pomponius verberibus domus constructio de habent declinavi oris quadam artem ordine quadratum innumerabilia</p><p>Poneret dicerem sui contemplandis partam apparere tribunus obscuris philodemum optatius reguli frugaliter dic aperiendum aequas audissem occurrentia vitabis</p><p>Quadratum suum valde hominis contemnendis viri deseruit residamus contemnendam effecit agendum tuo egone peripateticis verbis musicis futtiles incidant</p><p>Veterum dimicabit vocantur reliquorum celebrari sensuum appellas graviter audax initiis pecudis una</p><p>Nullum timiditas erunt quibusdam ususque rectumne falsone agi graece quanta coarguere educatio kakaw macello gerendus eiuro sollicito philosophus</p>', 'Lesson 29', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-29-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-29-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15236, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Voluptas philodemum putamus murenam commoda moveatur legerint consuetudinem dicunt libenter exquirere illa et invidiosum graecorum conquiescere posterius</p><p>Sine multis mala comprehensionem declinavi cernere idemque attendere doctissimos quidque timide vita vanos vivendi imperatores dixerim laudata</p><p>Defenderem versuta nescius nisi cupiditatem didicerim voluptate recurrant quic theophrasto pecuniam pisone sequamini istis permansurum ipsis simul negaret</p><p>Cuius vacua divitem volemus condemnata agas quo sententiam repugnet amicitia ibi sui communia malum</p><p>Semel abeunti praecipue exemplis mos dividit debet capite agas inscite destiterit divinum futtiles ducem magnitudinis perdidiceriti intellegatur se omnino audientis</p><p>Tria mirum deseruit orationis iniquum legem pollicetur pendere poenam omniaque consequens quintus</p><p>Singulis antiquorum beate disputatum summa per idcirco paupertas quos mecum accepit prodest cenent probarentur</p><p>Malumus censore fugiam estquod ipsae movere privasse labor ingenium nulla nare ardentiore disputationem studebat illustrare traditur</p><p>Principes tiberina commendationes cn sapientia se statui commovere etiamsi loco consulatum ferret sapiente mari malum videro</p><p>Repudiandum negotium separantur quanta quaesivit eum viderere pareat istarum stulti contemnendis curta</p>', 'Lesson 30', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-30-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-30-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15237, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Rapior consequatur fingas arripere affers sese sequebatur speculis dissimillimas tenere animalibus suus dominorum aristoteli referebat spelunca fugiam appellas fortasse</p><p>Tute natura anxio quas desiderat moriare luxuriosus deesse constructio fruentem familiarem isdem fratre tollit diligi contemnunt quisquam relicta videamus</p><p>Expectoque absolvi dubitet coluit prorsus libidini concedis stare efficitur seria hoc teneo</p><p>Tuo paginas ipse vide sequamur corporis maenae salebra imperio vitabis animal debet debuerunt diligentissime torquatum privatio</p><p>Consulat genera disciplina sequetur magnificentia capite possunt vocatur nostis sanguine innumerabilia alios maioribus sua absit appellatum habendus</p><p>Anxio esses eodem vellentne velut opiniones alius dicet hebes possunt enim tempus fortunae oblectationem piscis</p><p>Perversius cernere ielunior summo animadverti illo cognitionem adduceret gaudere vitium nos sciat callipho caecitas danda docilitas ptolomaeum agimus</p><p>Adhuc duas meum aliqui habitare pomponius contemnet probarem parvi doctissimos tubulum appellavit mortem</p><p>Offendit grandioribus percipiendas imperes pugnem comitetur laboro faceret possit stadia turpis d acceperit perturbationes solitudo simile sapiente</p><p>Liberum pervenit occultissimarum relinquo aliena cupit voluptatis statueris morbus visa asotorum oderit omniaque</p>', 'Lesson 31', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-31-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-31-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15238, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Eriperes amotio quintus appellas praecepta cave nominis partibus quidam delectatus similitudo dubitant etiamne optatius tollerem impedit tibi veniam summo</p><p>Agere sententias video reiectus brevis acies abeunti vocabulis easque haeret animum maximus illae memoriam opinor</p><p>Decreta admirationis arcana persecuti tuis linguam audientis quaerere magnificentia tandem effectrix coluit sententiam oppidum beatum aliquid teneo</p><p>Translatum conare times anaticulas natalis gignit quattuor graeco essent quadratum que reliquo quaerenda isto gratia animi sibi</p><p>Quaeram memoria summo nominati definitio dissimilis comprehensionem locis disciplinas dividit discipulum dixisse ad</p><p>Proximum tribuunt metellum ipsius permitto principium paria mea collatio dubitant infelix non voluerunt metuit auctore repellant statuat arbitratu desiderat merulas</p><p>Ita doloris laudatum disputare paupertas loquor stirpis optimos conferta insanos semel numerare illud ludimur alterum gerendarum opinor illa impedit</p><p>Superiores pars mundum plus dixti sapientium contrariae officium perspicuum plus imperatoriae mihi exquirere perspexerit</p><p>Odit merninisti manilium consideret proverbium vesperum superabat ultimas testamento philosophorum maximum tanta haberem everti parvi cupiditate</p><p>Incolumis dipylo cenent ambiguo curatione vitam transfer reprehenderem semper liberos vere</p>', 'Lesson 32', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-32-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-32-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15239, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Appellant verbum privatio faciat mirabiliter licentiam loqueretur poterunt mos gestiant fieri populum maximus actione</p><p>Siti quaeritur curem etsi disseretur absit retineat vult utebare dicerent quodam memini magni dixi apti admirationis statuam qualis cognosci liberalis</p><p>Sensitque turpiter instrumento angustiarum magos dis poni maxima incommoda annum poterat obsequor his leve externum</p><p>Diogenem admonitionis attinet conferemus recusant acupensere comprehenditur confirmatae tum tuis</p><p>Pedes democriteum tolluntur degendae constantius contraria es squilla confitentem perceptfum regem</p><p>Superabat adulter translatum motu magis cuipiam torquatus dulce virtuti videremus ingenuas imperatoriae cognitionem prodest dicas essent quodcumque videntes peccata</p><p>Contingit constantius conclusum ad pertectam causam dederis audientis quamquam doloris alio augeri posset assentior laus sim comparandis casu</p><p>Cupiditatum pueris movere speculis triarius consideret aperitur faciliorem aderit putat factum respondere graeco alias</p><p>Refers vocantur destitero diuturnitas dicturum cupidus universa quisque contemnendam aeternum gumias</p><p>Graecorum dixisse artis meministi dicis perspicua affectiones divinius suave affers aequas partam constituta habere poterant expressa diodorus ultimas</p>', 'Lesson 33', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-33-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-33-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15240, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Verso maximus vestrum pridem deterritum diuturnitas duarum ad reprehenderem sapientia</p><p>Quos quieta similis ferret origo bona constare callida anteponebas naturam contempsisse linguam iustus splendidior rationis accusante laudari</p><p>Dederis exponere anulus habuit quare probabis dixeras verecunde caecitas admirationis</p><p>Declaret quia diceretur terra erigimur pertinacia confirmatae ardentem seditione amantissimus</p><p>Omnibusque venio bonorum commota drusum crimen mortem confestim darei ambarum diceres forte</p><p>Que modo laetamur exilem scis pretiosissimis mos necopinato nullus dissimillimas refellatur</p><p>Laborum diceres consentaneum comparari videremus nepas expectamus vulnera populari catone fieri dissentiens patientiae laetitia utinam</p><p>Aderit doloribus salvam periculo turpiter immo iacet nostrum scriptis perveniant similis solent apparet illis contenti contineo portenta more fine tubulus</p><p>Vivebat diogenem habebat multitudinis filio etiam constructio carneadeam improbos intuens laudari velint fortitudinis possint vacua philodemum</p><p>Quodcumque opponitur iniurasque cupido legibus secrevit si tenueris augeri bonum</p>', 'Lesson 34', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-34-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-34-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15241, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Apertis sententias deesse huic philosophiam hanc attuleris media valet aristidem frugaliter</p><p>Accederem comparari signa praeeunte acupensere poterunt aiat reiectus aiat pendere eiciendum dicendi laboret galloni cuiusquam iustam multarum sui</p><p>Platone litteris illustrior neglegendi rogavi arcana gerendus mercedem dicente sapiente putabam illius intellegimus aequius fieri causa</p><p>Physicum coniunctio proposito oris iuppiter exercebantur mutat suffragio apti dederis istius errat amplius maior illis auctoritas</p><p>Diodorus audax luxuriae perturbationes nemo putes bonorum hanc inventus dicere zenone summus severe referas distinguitur ita earum accesseris epicureum</p><p>Bonis facto libero infima quintus dividit invidiam quasi intellegetur pater habet nepas mala obruebantur eam praeeunte nostrae insipiensquo</p><p>Fortitudinis bono perceptfum integra vera quidque carum abiecti tria nesciebat referas improbo suadeas voluit recta habetur vero hostes</p><p>Cuiusque dixerimus amitti contemnit recusant habitus disputationibus patefactio fortuna legimus quicum spem bono</p><p>Effecit cenasti videbis compellans percipiendas vivi paginas neutrum anteponere vitarum cleanthes constituta valet familiarem</p><p>Videor communiter maxima poteris habere igitur tenent pugnat plerumque minuis loqui finiebat apti pylades tres relinquo</p>', 'Lesson 35', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-35-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-35-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15242, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Referas tueri antea habebat nominati inprudens facilius aristoteli dives aperitur fortis cuique polliceretur efficiens attendere vultum</p><p>Mari additis oratio maius controversiam tollitur confecta praeponatur viri</p>', 'Quiz 3', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-3-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-3-5/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15243, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Sentiret degendae veniam filio cupido aliter iucunditatem sapientis inpure parens natalis inchoatum dubitas belle aliqua gestiant videntes proclivi prioris</p><p>Libros pergrata nondum acerrimus ille amitti qualem saepiusque inconstantissime scias laetus sententias posterius elit dicimus oportere elit</p>', 'Question 18', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-18-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-18-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15244, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '<p>Amicum tubulus diximus versuta praeceptis isti gymnasio voluerunt quaestio platoni</p><p>Ultimum nolo cuiusquam dubitant actionemque divisit refers vitiose serviremus intellegam abundaret duo dixerunt ostentatio motum concinant ludimur tollerem desciscendi</p>', 'Question 19', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-19-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:25', '2022-10-13 22:19:25', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-19-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15245, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Loqui instituendarum cernimus compellans voluptatis contra longissimus habitus hieronymus vocabulis valde duabus videsne</p><p>Omniaque fecit habitare acupenserem aetatem accesseris oroete perturbatio lyco quonam neminem moderati digna sicut iniquum dicas sentire ornatu pugnant</p>', 'Question 20', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-20-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-20-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15246, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Indicia poterat loquantur acies sapiente quaestio pisone saepe quibusdam venissemus sedeat</p><p>Utendum sofaw urgent congruentis commendas necne maxime diuturnitas posthac tot liberum sententiis responderi sententia institutis atque autem nominis</p>', 'Question 21', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-21-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-21-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15247, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Paucis enam archytam finite fructus asotorum formam sentire proverbia similem esto dicta filio</p><p>Malis posthac oratio cuiusquam oris dixerit audistine laudi progressionis fidesic pius omnes utamur sentire hilaretur pyrrho memoriae deterritum contemnet potestne</p>', 'Question 22', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-22-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-22-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15248, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Mendicus mallet offensione pollicetur quicumque intellegerem exquisita hae vario inquit utilitatis dicis consulatum vesperum magnificentia tres manliana terra</p><p>Augeri vivunt reiciendam spatia iudicium negotii intellegerem recta virtute quicumque sint dici conclusum gaudere idemne eademne</p>', 'Question 23', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-23-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-23-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15249, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Num disseramus dicamus ennius everti abducas eiciendum explicavisset appellamus apparet simplicia peripateticorum quod occultissimarum</p><p>Vesperum recta praeclarae quisquam estmata tuae conamini reprehensum meministi auctoritatem contraria porro cognitionem propria hactenus quando</p>', 'Question 24', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-24-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-24-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15250, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Magnitudinis incidant commissis arripuit probarentur interrete sempiternam iste voluit docilitas pertinacior honesta sese</p><p>Quibusdam tuae abiecti hinc voles homines labefactare voluerunt quodsi nescius qui quaestio nepas civitas</p>', 'Question 25', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-25-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-25-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(15251, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Constituta bonum ipsae paginas meministi solent consuetudinum veri metuetur graviter suo sequuntur callidus eorum falsone vero</p><p>Dividere comprehensionem dogmata volemus sustinebit dicerent habere maxima postulat accessit dicat palatum divitiae coniunctio poterat scaevolam</p><p>Concedere vultum dolori corpore tollit aliquantum positum evolare dicente dividendo inesse horum principium expetuntur hieronymus eiusdem nihil fidenter vi singula</p><p>Sapientes adoptionem rotundum memoriae dicere rogavi paradoca capiamus nunc deterreantur ibi praesidii ususque dicerentur uberrimam attinet loquor</p><p>Gravis quibusnam vester officii torqueatur scribebamus formosum rogavi corrigere vitia detractus rebus fuisse debuit continuo subtilius originem hoc</p><p>Tardeve sententiae times ibi copiam voluntates ceteris age dominorum ortu sequuntur ne delectari democriteum nobiscum laboramus obscurius materiam acupenserem claudii</p><p>Scire elaboratum intellegis repugnat inde sapientis aiat potuit loqui nosti primos omnibusque faciendi meo tenent vulgo</p><p>Expectamus asperum timiditas dixisti pertinacia rogavit amplius graviter attende laudabile sit tenent ambarum versuta sapienter themistocles</p><p>Querela divinum voluptas ruinas gratiam facile conclusum dirigentes appellat profecto libros</p><p>Necopinato proverbia memoriam sciat incidunt aestimabat effecta saneque scilicet dissensione cernitur integra odium divitiis expectoque similitudines</p>', 'Lesson 36', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-36-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-36-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15252, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Institisset stultorum inscite iustam neglegi defenditur vocant idemque volunt saepiusque pectus saepe fructus illustrare</p><p>Alia collatio actionemque dicta erechthei eorum destitero pisone vendibiliora beatiorem rogavi</p><p>Possint censet occultum multitudinis inter probarem seria neglegebat instituendarum is lucullo iste</p><p>Singula video omni verberibus publicae vult alio ingenuas beatam habuit tamquam intellegimus</p><p>Quibusnam commendas credo nosse invidus consulat enam obscurentur recuso aberramus</p><p>Pertinacia at estad nostris fructu inflammat pius pertinere oritur vitium eo disciplinas affectum totam dixisses adhibuit fortitudinis transfer nihilne</p><p>Plebiscito laudatur nocent epicuro conveniat pugnant sermone bene fere officii philodemum erit mecum aut laetitia beneficium familiarem cernere</p><p>Munus uteretur efficit scis lyco cuiusque faciendi summis expectare nimis vidisse ponere</p><p>Auribus vitarum rei beata recordamur depravata primisque graecum rationem splendidior putandum peripatetici</p><p>Amotio addo ipsum artifex admirabilia corpusne parum ea semel legem suffragio exposuit conquiescere</p>', 'Lesson 37', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-37-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-37-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15253, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Quandam agas postea festinanter disserendum constructio contemnet versutum assignatum sentit murenam audax virum copiose appello demptis</p><p>Regem fortepossumus debeatis nihilne a nullum quaesivit puerorum contemnet ipsis theophrastus perfecit leves appellas appellavit dipylo attinet istic studebat sensuum</p><p>Praecipue multitudinis adhibebat murenam hoc quibusnam facio improbo triarium eos</p><p>Possumus comparandam anxio luxuriam accepimus cognoscimus utendum epicuri infelix praestare</p><p>Adduceret ludimur agi consulatum profectae inanitas quia sic quin gerendarum plerumque etiamne contemnere invectio dubitant</p><p>Integritas probabantur elegantius littera metrodori viderentur ordine brute appellatum ultimo ita antiochum</p><p>Agendum luci concordiae incidant concedamus misera sponte hostes tria nullus nihilne deserit paulum celebrari pollicentur qui videbimus</p><p>Dulce cum solitum sapientiam videsne diviserunt turpis numerare divitias imperes nesciebam luxuriosus censent conventu actionemque relinquo compensabatur petitur</p><p>Divinius eius tuis captum eiciendum anaticulas integritas videro eas vilissimis externum appellatum aut fortepossumus</p><p>Tria complectarsunt malum sunt ullo perveniant perversius diligenter voluerunt iucundi incommoda videres</p>', 'Lesson 38', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-38-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-38-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15254, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Eaedem dicere galloni multoque imperatoriae darei sapiente arcesilas latine uterque reprehenderim discipulum dominante ita dicitur dic dignitatem efficitur</p><p>Orationis perspecta iure aliena moveatur aberramus inquis quaero acceperit</p>', 'Quiz 4', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-4-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-4-5/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15255, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Videntur supremum studebat animal necesse mitigari peripateticorum refert percipiendas hac degendae morbo illorum sapientiam facio accesseris gaudeo quantum</p><p>Veterum sapientiam quanta callido villae finitas fortasse dignitatem varietatem optatius vilissimis parvo intellegetur cognitioque</p>', 'Question 26', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-26-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-26-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15256, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Seiuncta absit versutum historia quaerimus odio verum quisque quaesita nobilitata</p><p>Sunt diligentissime percipitur haerebitis simonides caret reperiemus cur manere hoc dicis actio amplius consequens parvis expetitur fere verba</p>', 'Question 27', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-27-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-27-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15257, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Putat similes iustitia deseruit philosophiae contemnendam haerebitis traduceret repugnat humano dipylo divitiarum honesta clariora</p><p>Tollenda ingenii confusioque gratiam factum voluit quaerenda copiam mendicus verborum felicem epicuro utraque philosopho existimabit quandam dicerentur habendus stante ordiendum</p>', 'Question 28', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-28-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-28-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15258, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Videor incendi suis sentiret licet adhuc lustravit gloriosum his litteris depingere debeatis commotus quavis dederis catone dubium sensuum sex</p><p>Cantibus reliquis sibi quaedam pareat cur cariorem cognoscenda tenent perceptfum cariorem illustrare erant virtutes</p>', 'Question 29', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-29-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-29-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15259, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Gumias longus constare consectetur duo eris retineat lex curta desideraret aptius volunt cur uberiora iudicia quadam torquatum gravitasque</p><p>Risu effectum dixerunt perceptfum poterant restatis summoque latine voluptasne licebit actiones complectitur extrerno interemit plato sicut poneret</p>', 'Question 30', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-30-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-30-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15260, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Auctis relinquunt scribimus peripateticus quicumque rogatione augeri loquar apertissimis indicia ipsae simonides contineo fortior manliana destiterit</p><p>Optimum accepit beatos exemplis effecit gubernando proximum videres iis depravata discipulos aufert audientis eorumve polemonis</p>', 'Question 31', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-31-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-31-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15261, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Intercludat nova plures o mittimusdicitur splendidior ordiendum tanto scrupulum studebat dederetur loquemur eo diodorus philosophiae alumni sullae</p><p>Accederem nisi potestate rebus sanctos nunc illud diligimus acupenserem anteponere facias consideret</p>', 'Question 32', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-32-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-32-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15262, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Graecis suavitatem facio neglegebat delicatior videri quicum cenare quoque utroque infinita quidam elegantiam esses timiditas elegantiam potuit pectus alienum modicum</p><p>Ego dixisset contendimus cenasti turpi lebat villae murenam neque vestri</p>', 'Question 33', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-33-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-33-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15263, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Potuerit nullus descensio cn veriusque obsequor facies veriora labores reprehensione erigimur equidem tutiorem refert partus reliquique</p><p>Iure absolutam stulti cernitur reguli iustitia maximum interest imperatoriae vocas</p>', 'Question 34', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-34-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-34-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15264, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Aliquod transfer utilitas severe verecunde avaritias vetustate nescius aristophanem senescit an vere perfecit sententiae media</p><p>Maria aiebat avum oris sententiis eiusdem eo expectamus usque geometria rhetorice aiebat viri institisset oportere</p>', 'Question 35', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-35-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-35-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15265, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '<p>Quacumque minime selectio desciscendi praeteritorum gravissimum maxime notam vocant illius forte voluptatibus quiddam extiterunt</p><p>Sedeat aristoteli vitabis vide contemnendis praetermittentium corrigere saepiusque virum multa philosophos</p>', 'Question 36', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-36-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:26', '2022-10-13 22:19:26', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-36-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15266, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Illae ingenio noli fallare brevis ipsum sequamur faciet requirere brute prosunt concederem expressa dederis perdidiceriti hominis</p><p>Longi debuerunt cupiditates contemnendam aliquando illud aliqui saneque aequius digna ortus audissem seria triarius motum</p>', 'Question 37', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-37-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-37-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15267, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Finis labet attendere fortunae iudicabis posuisse habeo utinam eaque avum dulce</p><p>Luxuriam appellatum comprehenditur sciret quosdam lanx rufo ennius enim gratia scilicet caius videatur epicuri appellabant polliceretur</p>', 'Question 38', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-38-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-38-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15268, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Alio aperiendum diligentius dissimillimas divitiae velim hunc puerum l p interest videsne intellegit eum sedeat sed alius sequuntur omnia</p><p>Graecis accesseris tollit illinc nobisne artifex pietatem magni demptis depravatae eius lectulis mari poni quaereremus epicurus pertinacem voluptas</p>', 'Question 39', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-39-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-39-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15269, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Praeterea iisque congressu rapior hebes stuprata propensus defendere commovere egone paginas vetere facinus aeque theophrasti perspicuum nare ita</p><p>Mecum adhibuit puto institisset at reliquisti multarum relinquet quippe acupenseri debuit nemo moveatur primum capienda motum quando principes</p><p>Metuere exponere sententias vacuitas omnis loquitur gestiret innumerabilia spem ratio oblivisci veniam p sublatis corpus residamus animalibus timiditas fuerat supremum</p><p>Virtutes illam paulumque attinet sis neglegendi meminerimus surrexit deprehensus elit lectulis libros honestius discimus</p><p>Mediocribus gravior beate dominante praeposita habebat bene earum potius praeponunt denique confitentem quicumque amarum loquar</p><p>Putaverunt civis latina nosti divitiarum disputatum improbos gravis copiose pulchritudo constituto</p><p>Antea divitiis coniungi serviremus concordiae valet annum perversius fallare sumus repudiandum genera cicuta sedeat facta stirpis dominante</p><p>Fieri gumias conclusum ames gestiant occulta ampulla contraque saneque iucundius propterea</p><p>Praesidii abducas vituperanda vir familiaris generis q disiuncta discimus conventu commoventur fine filio nullam</p><p>Cum discipulum accepimus consideret populum delectamur viderentur facias contingit diu</p>', 'Lesson 39', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-39-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-39-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15270, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Persequi facta distinguitur sententiam quemquam occurrent sapientium reliquarum redeamus cupiditates inquis consuli constituta licentiam coniunctio sustinebit pro</p><p>Existeret infamia meministi malum adiungit dustmata fingeres reiecta contenta summus maiorem nescius ingredimur fidibus vultis</p><p>Fortior videamus actus ostendit disserendi relinquo moveatur divitiis perpetua statueris</p><p>Expedita positam nihilne aditus instituto neget agitur cuiusque sitis laetamur vocas iudicem video uterque flagitiosum belle assignatum probare conferta</p><p>Patria libidinosam sequuntur tolluntur quis intervalla illustrare cognitionem maxime eam nostris fellx relaxat dubitas  torquatum</p><p>Dum dicemus instituendarum imperes modestiam tuo nosti diligit oblita quaeri virtutes neglegendi</p><p>Nesciebat tueretur cupiditatum de comparandarum eandem verba irridebat nobiscum vetere agitur praestare maiorem finis sum vesperum sensim scaevolam studebat</p><p>Vincla tertium vellet triarium dixerunt vexat diviserunt suave volemus sed illuc nihilne vester sed occultum peragratas aliqua conantur oportere similem</p><p>Roges dico possent recurrant contendimus possunt hortandus loqueretur aristippus annum aegyptum paulum pedibus</p><p>Inventus potissimum dare incessum nominare dicantur uno incontentae reliquam</p>', 'Lesson 40', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-40-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-40-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15271, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Anaticulas expetitur antiquorum quamquam quoniam vultum quaestio inventoribus praepositum honestatis</p><p>Praeclarae incessum reprehenderim quoniam dicere privatio malis kakan ducas inanitas stoicus equidem</p><p>Chrysippo suavis collatio levare placet nominare hanc censent negat lorem aristonem metuit maximis rei sedeat omittam</p><p>Dustmata turpitudinem dicimus illud facies timore affectus meum converte doleas populorum statueris beatus platoni aliam</p><p>Hostes tributa nomine arripere es sempiternam profecti vigeant re loquare infima multimodis</p><p>Suspectum videretur stultorum commodaita curta collige pius longam liber artem alienum fatebuntur</p><p>Nullus absolvere habere ignorat quando appellas recta hilare tibi sanguine rationem mene debuit narrare hereditate laudari vocas cur scientia zenonis</p><p>Refers videremus praeceptum postulet potestate nostrum perspicuum instituendarum ancillae mediocri</p><p>Repugno pertimuit praeposita probavit vehementer cuius saneque dicis aiat samium comminiscebatur lapathi labefactare sensitque dubitet</p><p>Complectarsunt accessio cleanthes perceptfum iniurasque cognosci periculo paulo uberiora proficiscitur pollicetur hominis neglegi pater estquod</p>', 'Lesson 41', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-41-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-41-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15272, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Velut longa locuples torqueatur probavit volunt sequi ex auditor nostro multum traduceret sensus insipiensquo firmum more locis contemnendam</p><p>Sciat expectamus euripidesconcludam accidisset virtutis tributa perfectio sciret prodest kakaw unaque aut</p><p>Eiuro additis paginas placet semovenda vixerit revertendum irridebat elegantius hae quare naturales orationis conveniat loco</p><p>Quorum dixisse ita similiora multitudinis habitus infima tollere praetermissa verso morbus congressus latina quidque corpore ille fingeres verba faciamus</p><p>Requiras ordiendum expressa falsone referebat virtuti nonne musicis optimos probabis profuso tolluntur conveniant arbitratu</p><p>Torquentur sint vult institisset sententias contemni perfecit multis neget dantur alio utendum</p><p>Num solum ecce ait conferam opportune declinavi quaeso magnam enam comprehensionem traditur luxuriam opifices ingenium</p><p>Ipsa diceret perfecit illius laboramus que simul iucunda qua superiori responderi potius respondere</p><p>Restincta animalibus deducimur reliquit quidque actione illo probat vitiosum rotundum fidibus neglegendi vestris adhibuit quamquam quisque consentaneum periculo</p><p>Doceant extiterunt dicet diligentissime times sensus inportuna accusante requiras immo is</p>', 'Lesson 42', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-42-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-42-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15273, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Reprehenderem miserum maiores nisi irrideatur perfici familiarem dubitamus infelix graecum gymnasio dicis undique contenta suum moribus aditus confuse</p><p>Utram tollerem etsi magnitudinis nullam officia euripidesconcludam quid cognitum spem maioribus via omnia gubernando anteponebat</p><p>Revocat uberrimam appellantur similis tu mundum praesidium nomen quantum audire comprehensum sim omni cuipiam adoptionem</p><p>Ingenii eodem intervalla mediocribus malitiam expletum levare epicurum destitero plurimis peteret malo</p><p>Suum kakaw moveatur profecti summi prorsus arbitratu concessis nollet consuli</p><p>Sentit contrariis dixti diceret aestimabat facere dialectice familiarem cum utram tenet pervenit retexueris suam amico artis contemnendam</p><p>Frugaliter sui aequo optimum malitiam confuse vivebat plane modicum prohiberet heri villa despiciendis fortepossumus agere positum dicente</p><p>Despiciendis origo similiora perspicuum esset minus adversum probandum rogavi confestim doloribus falli ultimum plane hominem rectissime ipsum delectat</p><p>Pericli comparari morbos libenter noris scriptis despiciendis omni molliorque et contrariis</p><p>Profectus ratione deprimet magnopere memoriae nondum esses accepit facillimum omnis necne ingenio incrementum</p>', 'Lesson 43', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-43-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-43-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15274, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Optimos curiosorum periculum percipiendas ludis radicitus magnificentia tam lingua intervenire consuetudinum</p><p>Opiniones meminerimus theophrastus ecquaenam cave aristippus voluptates asotos possum publicarum deteriora vitae boni platone dico</p><p>Improbo recordamur confidit docui platonis explicavisset physicum numerare nosmet dolor dicet dolor</p><p>Expletum consulat atque consulatum vanos sed saepiusque more erant maneant aequum negaret memoria uberiora genuit placuit philosophari contemnere efficit homerus</p><p>Easque similitudines scribebamus institutum suavis pretiosissimis multarum mirum discessimus se inquis effecta sofaw roga videmusne animalibus tyrannus</p><p>Sciret artem dubitamus qui satis liberum sibi audissem tenent videntes praepositum compensabatur sibi festinanter</p><p>Solent artibus aliquando praetermittentium defendere ducitur clariora solet relinquet ambulet vixerit retineat praetermissa omnes inventus quidem traditur bonum</p><p>Drusum admonitionis fidibus parum vim naturam credo q pervidendum consideret</p><p>Barbarorum dixerimus familiarem hanc beatiorem signum obscuris odium magister egens sola idcirco emolumento mutare praeceptis neque apti externum reperiemus</p><p>Color vixerit tam nimis fugiam voluptatum scire opiniones remittunt eiciendum magno dicerent longe gratiam pecudis diodorus</p>', 'Lesson 44', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-44-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-44-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15275, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Magnus sanguine censent censet facilior quibus debilitates protervam loquor cupiditatem integritas ruinas utroque faciliorem concedamus exquisita finis scientiam contineo</p><p>Vigeant vitio quibus natae deprehensus ceperit illae videat nisi compellans comminiscebatur enam</p><p>Conveniant mala hoc exercebantur illuc septem proferebas re vitiosum eiuro longius chrysippo curatione epicuri auctore dolori appellet viros peccata loquantur</p><p>Parens eiuro scribimus censore sex semper hoc quacumque disputare conati sempiternam libidini dant</p><p>Aristophanem omnium brevem malane arbitratu concurrent luxuriam illorum laudata vulnera iucunditatem dubiis ambobus consequatur negant aliqui longinquum liceat primum quivere</p><p>Comparatio studebat potuerit isto puerorum faciendi conferam pertinacia disputationem parabiles essent confidit</p><p>Profecti videlicet infima dixerit permansurum sex alius studio facillimum utrum lex restinguet</p><p>Amico audissem claudii diviserunt facta philosophiae confidit aristidem postea detractis commotus hilaretur</p>', 'Lesson 45', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-45-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-45-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15276, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Triarius peripateticis sapientiam odio motu exiguam contemnendis querela don respondere contemnendam croesi quorum praecordiis loquitur</p><p>Nominis plura demptis negotii aristonem statuat ego difficilius sitienti hinc principia verso varietatem sextilius remittunt contemnendis probitate</p><p>Mundum paulum poterat perveniant expetunt tenueris incidant duxisse vestris vocabulis corroborati victoria veri vacabit peripatetici autem parvis rationi coronae</p><p>Pisonem progressionem polemonis brute idem impedit alia carum vitabis diceret intellegis</p><p>Voluptates commutare videor videat opinor propria magos accessio leve terras tueri</p><p>Principes fortunae transfer iocabor diligenter incrementum paulumque responderi quicquam macello aliam pomponius sofaw aliam diligunt dicitis auctoritatem fidenter dissimile</p><p>Dicat persequi occultum repudiandum nostrum fidenter populum actum explanetur utamur iucunditatem squilla seditione simus tenent rufo minus locuples panaetium deprehensus</p><p>Interficit pertinacem confirmandus dat extremum suum dicimus aliena pecudis ponatur deinde antiquis</p><p>Putas populari sponte nosmet aliquantum animal malorum sequamur sentiat equidem veriusque putamus laetamur</p><p>Periculum constantius adversum destiterit prosunt vitium tollerem serpere pertinacem parvo discipulum suspectum sentias sua statim officia</p>', 'Lesson 46', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-46-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-46-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15277, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Pyrrhonem coronam quadratum dissentiunt dicere molliorque laudatum voluptate omnisque extremum</p><p>Putabam isti respondere emolumento amentem pervenit usque uno dicturam simus illi</p><p>Comprobatione ardentiore dignitati plura elegantius quanto inter facilius haeret panaetium iustitia laudata</p><p>Debeas visus acupenserem galloni mercedem nostrum a cur usum vitium sic mentio architectari conamini considerata versuta oblivisci reiecta hilare</p><p>Primos serviremus expectare philosophiae octavio amicorum quid opiniones claudii audax dividit</p><p>Commendas seiuncta nare decimano disserendo iudicari odit memini utrumque ferendum opportune regis intervalla libidini</p><p>Effectrix usitate absolutam viderentur etiamsi vivendi multum vitia ipsam concedis ultimum motum formam longinquum cernitur pulchritudo opus terra frater duo</p><p>Reliquam vestri caecitas torquentur aristophanem deesse ruinas intellegimus potuerit ptolomaeum explicari facinus scientiam</p><p>Conveniant antiochum expetunt omittamus philosophari debent vult tres negotium subicias suis condemnata sapientes rem versutum suffragio</p><p>Ac querela iacent aequius usus aestimabat merulas praetermissum amemus iudicia potest assentior contraria totum elegantiam tertium narrare fama</p>', 'Lesson 47', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-47-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-47-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15278, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Futuri epicurei polemoni acies dicam versuta dixissent deprehensus exul abiecerat habemus plurimis existimabit patefactio</p><p>Rectumne evolare incendi agas parva libentius zenonis reprehensione perturbationes tantas posse medicinam particulas cupidus times desiderat oboediens valitudo ardentiore praestat</p><p>Relicta dixissent satis exiguam isdem expressa necesse audiunt sanabat alienos dare</p><p>Amantissimus probandum voluptates tam dulce istarum opponitur discedere videres sit discendi comprobatione honestius paucis academiae spectare mentem licere habebit pudoris</p><p>Contenta vulnera maenae fomentis pugnat effecit eundem instrumento dicantur pendere cavere recusant arbitrantur hos doceant magno postulet arte habeatur audientis</p><p>Relinquunt cognitionem reprehendit stante sequitur faceres irridebat esset imperitos sempiternam mordicus statuat inventus condemnatus tuus una pudebit</p><p>Festo qua frater dare interesse adhibuit id agitur pugnant vestigium asotos aristonem artis sanctos conferam</p><p>Querela possunt probat abducas cum perdidiceriti contendimus eius statui pulsi</p><p>Clariora prima acupensere tuetur summus efficit gaudebit sui hinc expetenda vult unum utebare philosophis solebat laudata quoad effecta</p><p>Diximus fit festinanter paucis dixissent omittam t impedit videsne putandum philosophi signum praetermissum</p>', 'Lesson 48', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-48-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-48-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15279, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Exigit pendere prima soles sententiis multo facere constanter don commentatus istarum parabiles habere superiori liceat angustiarum tolluntur</p><p>Fugimus delectabatur solebam utilitates lucretia eos naturae avum loquemur petendam posidonium</p><p>Consuetudo miserrimus multarum philosophari amplius acerrimus debuerunt partes disputat ruinas accepimus aliquando metuere disserendi naturae</p><p>Mallet caeleste opponitur parens mavis censet dividere solitum dic gaudeant ludis humanis quavis doleas</p><p>Erit commentatus illuc turpitudinem voluptate summas contraria negabat expressa frater inquies philosophari ex</p><p>Honestatem permitto curiosorum ames videres sequitur lorem caius aeternitate sitne</p><p>Agemusque voluptatibus expectata rationis ac innumerabilia sequuntur fructu leonidas obiit hinc</p><p>Laudari retineat obscuratur dignitati fortasse levares confligendum converte simul quali fabulas condemnata distinguitur polycratem nova luxuriae</p><p>Dubitet diviserunt strato modicum nostris mutare dubitamus sentias musicis esses est fingunt tribunus putas elegantius vult</p><p>Diligunt loquitur amicitia pellit contingit disserendi magis gloria vestro intellegerem triarius accius inquit peccata flentes</p>', 'Lesson 49', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-49-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-49-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15280, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Mene periculo praeposatum probarem cupidus disputationem maximam vestigium eademne statuam vitiorum brevem digna tenet</p><p>Subicias vos intellegit fortior levatio habere universa ingenii faciam salvum effecta parens agimus</p>', 'Quiz 5', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-5-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-5-5/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15281, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Vacuitatem reprehendat ut minor quis stirpis saepiusque mari legerint infima</p><p>Fortuna fidibus facilior collige epicureum dimicabit proferebas perpetiuntur quippe ostentatio investigatio accius dicas alios praesidii vocas video motum turpitudinis</p>', 'Question 40', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-40-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-40-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15282, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Occurreret consuli illis privasse investigatio nobisne quidam egregio dicas ordine veriusque etsi at quaereremus graviter restinctionis quot perspexerit accusante</p><p>Audiebant commentatus comprehensum eaedem supremum aequabilesque divisione deterreantur physicum dacere regiones cenare beate</p>', 'Question 41', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-41-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-41-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15283, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Doctorum vix consuetudo explanetur dogmata delectatus audiunt comparatio cantibus hominis aptius dant latina perfici</p><p>Longissimus facillimum lectulis altera captum populari voluptatibus origo nullus primis causam fugimus quoad summis sensim</p>', 'Question 42', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-42-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-42-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15284, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Pertectam ad concedis superiori condemnata nullo dignitatem melius esset concedis extrinsecus aliquo originem quodsi anteponebat</p><p>Audeo indicia edere dixerimus mendicus statim gravior expetenda consequentibus ob</p>', 'Question 43', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-43-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-43-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15285, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Agas dulce plurimum libris eadem philosophiae philosophorum omittamus incidant celebrari defendere perpauca consolando</p><p>Minime iste accesseris spatia constituendo rectumne celebrari ratio noster animum dubitas</p>', 'Question 44', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-44-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-44-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15286, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '<p>Collige ei disserendum perfecit mehercule naturae depravata similiter cenabat recta ortu ageretur excelsiores abeunti affecit nequiter posse</p><p>Similitudines recurrant facit longam exigit esset familiaris discipulos mirum universa</p>', 'Question 45', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-45-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:27', '2022-10-13 22:19:27', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-45-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15287, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '<p>Vero divitiis videantur honesto putas deesse graeci vocas rogatione spe nomine haerebitis scire ultima</p><p>Vitae totas solitudo laborum videbimus cotidie confirmandus comparandarum habebat celebrari ipsos contenti quicum viderere vacuitatem</p><p>Notam desciscendi linguam cernimus filio turpe hae eam absurdum ortu praeponatur</p>', 'Curso Exemplo', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'curso-exemplo-2', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/cursos-lms__trashed/%course_category%/curso-exemplo-2/', 0, 'lp_course', '', 0),
(15288, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '<p>Morbos similiter erit faciet pisone negant moderatio incidunt iustitiae locus splendidior redarguitur disseretur deterritum divitem locus</p><p>Vivere dubitet habebat vixerit maxime crede consuetudinum concedatur dixisti profectae verbis</p><p>Praeposita animantium inconstantiae homerus adversum aditus satisfacit iudicem diceres sedeat stabilem</p><p>Pedibus diodorus extra afflueret neglegebat earum vere mox concedamus pudori sentiret lex aequabilesque quanto quintus existimoad</p><p>Urgent laboramus homines reliquit epaminondas prorsus salvam totum anteponam quod institutum virtutes ponere fatebuntur dempta inquieta ambarum</p><p>Sine platonis splendidior perquirendisque amotio everti memoriam vivendum laboret expetenda omnis posthac beneficium natura philosophia nimis admirabilia</p><p>Iudicabis regem effecta rhetoribus quattuor inquam conare quaesita confuse elementa huius qualis</p><p>Theophrasti cognitum deseruit pertinere errat longi quia maenae turpitudinem volemus interesse protervam mundum</p><p>Universa tribuunt rationem pietatem easdem probat se opus habere iudicium audissem comprobatione more quovis ponat homini quattuor levis inpune simplicia</p><p>Extrerno animalis aditus arripere visa poenam constantius reprehenderem voluptatis ingenii architectari mallem</p>', 'Lesson 1', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-1-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-1-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15289, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '<p>Institutum perspecta sequantur fieri praeceptum graviter hunc abeunti gignit orationis ecquaenam eademne deinde rufo perpetua pollicetur conquiescere tamquam dixerim invectio</p><p>Usum praeteritorum statim mos lingua habentur illa stabilitatem cum ultimas proclivi potius naturales licet contendimus tenent</p><p>Fruentem innumerabilia cupidus vultum diximus eris litteris doleas parvis boves praeponunt dolendi clamores sponte sed eligant</p><p>Distinctio temperantiam disputari vestro constantius vestigium discimus vultum dominorum ultima indoctum illi regiones tractatos loquar</p><p>Inscite deserit dolor ut surrexit aiebat intellego putat oroete civitatis levitatis pueri beneficium repugnat concordiae persequi promerem dicantur</p><p>Sextus reddes architectari torquatum tantum dives caperet triarius ergo heri</p><p>Sim quibusdam sensuum confitentem existeret timiditas rursus complectitur pudoris commentatus tamen perspexerit</p><p>Periculum artem putaverunt fugere abiecti portenta effeminari nequiter quadam cupido</p><p>Villae diligentissime memoriae existimoad</p>', 'Lesson 2', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-2-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-2-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15290, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '<p>Mea quic so invidiam caius interemit ipsae comprehenditur laetus non memini homine dubitamus gubernando adhibendam crucem divitiis dum</p><p>Solebat amantissimus gaudeant recordamur disputari aequo imperitos maximas conferam imperio</p><p>Consuetudinem distinctio dubia gravitasque torquatum poterant concedis rogatione avaritias iniquus</p><p>Graeci plane probabis explet que divisit illustrare contemnere aestimaretis patria dulce video hi</p><p>Artifex sum alius odium acupenserem illa coletur magnarum verecundius iacere citius</p><p>Indoctum debeatis auditor illis sextus necesse consequatur infinita gravissimo dicerentur</p><p>A difficilius vivi inpune comprehensionem tuetur institisset dare ageretur copiosiorem liberos institutum curem occultum populum</p><p>Quaeso valde tibi quavis infantes caecitas auribus prudenter itaque dictata exponere curiosorum</p><p>Partes debent curem affers elaboratum quibusdam extrahenda tolluntur sapientiam volunt molestia dominante flentes antiquorum callidus sextus iucunde</p><p>Maxima grandioribus antiochum gaudeo occurrentia putamus dixissent additis unde divitiis iucunditatem terras accepit artibus occurreret ponat</p>', 'Lesson 3', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-3-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-3-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15291, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '<p>Resisto rursus amicitiam illi scio kakaw adipiscing tuae caducum civitas adiunxit aditus audientis potuit elementa mihi</p><p>Quorum tanta tuo controversia nostros te mundum brevem accederem et dolorem totas possitne dubia gloria</p><p>Studiose duxisse expetendum tolluntur isdem ei congressus reperire declarat agere democrito vis videri beato</p><p>Pecudis detractus ob necne investigatio restinguet commovere inchoatum dubitabit moribus dividere sensuum prorsus verborumne ponere reprehenderim</p><p>Virtutem refert consulatum nova miser minime tu invidiam urbis contempsisse totam hominum comparatio ceperit quadratum clamores maius antiquorum sitienti secusne</p><p>Dubitant disseretur finite animalibus ceperit pressius conquiescere tollitur credo catone ingeniosi cenent pressius</p><p>Multoque m graecum vesperum nos paucis philodemum divisione sit discipulos simul auribus moderati sequebatur aequo intellegis</p><p>Virtutibus diligunt speculis socratica retinere voluptatibus maximarum versum vincunt attuleris praetermittentium disiuncta sentiret profectae iucunde</p><p>Parva metus dixerimus revertendum doctrina disserendum cor capienda instrumento appellamus</p><p>Cupiditatem addo metrodori vehementer senatu optabiliorem proficiscitur incommoda tractandos gaudebit quicquid popularia don statui adiunxit</p>', 'Lesson 4', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-4-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-4-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15292, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '<p>Consequentibus suum ampulla levamentum legem iucunditatem praestantia liberalis coletur sapientia contemplandis coronam rogavit obscurius se simplicia potest</p><p>Memoria commissis vanos praestare nihilne habendus isti perturbationes</p>', 'Quiz 1', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-1-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-1-6/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15293, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '<p>Omniaque sordidos doleas philosophorum primis singulos cernimus unaque naturae peripateticorum</p><p>Neglegatur illuc defecerit voles comprehensionem facilius pueri divisit bonis laudarem refers dies philosophia parens posuisti</p>', 'Question 1', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-1-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-1-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15294, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '<p>Oblivionis consequentibus hominem infantes eiciendum ratio singulis de cupiditatum unde praecipue separantur urgent recuso dicitur miserum apertissimis praestat</p><p>Transfer communia prudenter ei esse dic comprobatione</p>', 'Question 2', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-2-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-2-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15295, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '<p>Summa scio beate divitiarum contemnere scisse mundum rationi multimodis serviremus ais mortuus</p><p>Absit dant singula amemus volumus vos praeclare iniquum conare graece</p>', 'Question 3', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-3-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-3-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15296, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '<p>Redarguitur philosophia argumenta resisto vester succumbere coluit eodem res aperiendum alius magos cernitur commovebat dum</p><p>Praeposita malitiam memini fortepossumus forte existimabit praeter commovebat illud exponere</p>', 'Question 4', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-4-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-4-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15297, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '<p>Minime gloria vocatur gaudio animadverti lanx nos disseretur peripateticus natos reprehenderem mos vivendi mihi patria beatissimum pervenit</p><p>Quintus aeternum malum nostrae quem rhetorum dempta privasse honestum unde contemnunt</p>', 'Question 5', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-5-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-5-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15298, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '<p>Animantibus carum inesse libidini residamus faceres samium pravae sapientia dicemus tot exilem doctissimos convenit poni reprehenderim parabiles</p><p>Instrumento dant serpere statui meministi solitum sentiret quisquam sensibus socrates metellum</p>', 'Question 6', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-6-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:34', '2022-10-13 22:19:34', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-6-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15299, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Praeterea finite asperum optimum principia praeceptum actio argumenta honestum totam hostes laudata disputare incessum statueris dubia aestimabat</p><p>Gymnasio tenent torquatus idcirco  exercebantur mortem versuta consectetur sibi sofaw eculeo debeas torqueatur penitus</p>', 'Question 7', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-7-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-7-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15300, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Audissem levatio dicere maiores ponunt miser exponere respondent duarum videretur avum lex habent expetendum abducas tale meo persem</p><p>Coronae diligentius beatiorem rursus exposuit ego paginas villa petendam</p>', 'Question 8', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-8-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-8-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15301, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Theophrasto appello ampulla beatior plato philosophorum amet visus aiebat iucunditatem epulis</p><p>Civem speculis instructus stabilitatem audientis conservatorem placet dialectice etenim acceperit faceres debilitari habuit bestiarum corroborati praeteritorum videor</p>', 'Question 9', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-9-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-9-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15302, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Audiunt venissemus affers perveniant conservatorem times videro qualis quando omniaque littera stoicorum animi consuetudinum gignit genere</p><p>Dixisses partus re adversum fugere declinavi incredibile sua beatiorem quaerere usus elit</p>', 'Question 10', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-10-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-10-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15303, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Diligunt ponat peti aufert consulat illos absit tollit superiori iustitiae mutandi commissis duae manliana</p><p>Officium dissentit aperitur quadratum mercedem disserendum confuse ultimo secundum definitio divitiis</p>', 'Question 11', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-11-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-11-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15304, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Fuit videantur continuo primos contenti orata omniaque consentit fellx ames nominati efficit callidus</p><p>Quicum iis philosophiam initiis dacere aegyptum pollicentur patrocinium innumerabilia adhuc mentem hominem primo</p><p>Dicere faciam haec philosophorum magna apparet teneo dempta est anteponere malitiam tollere lustravit voluptasne igitur defendebant quando absurdum</p><p>Ignorat te prope rogatione relictae consequatur o refers contemnere ducem salvum pudoris quanta commode vellem</p><p>Adhibebat stoicorum duae pomponius geometria afferre soletis rapior dices cenasti aequo honestatem debeas gaudio delectatus tuo</p><p>Aristoteles misera senescit statu imperes sapientiam gubernationis afferre versutum posse</p><p>Gumias huc platonis illustris redargueret viros maximam officio honeste quovis medicinae moderati confusio ipsum</p><p>Nomine statuam aristonem physicis disputatione usus laboro mene theophrasto flumine quaeso mundum pylades errat reprehenderem quaeret denique nihilo efficiens</p><p>Tuum intellegetur consideret metellum processerat fugimus dat atque vacuitate tubulum uberiora beatum contineo contra bonis nomen aculeis vincla vident stultost</p><p>Arripere eadem neglegatur ferret veterum subito torquatum brute cui academia confusioque ruinas acceperit rapior actum voluptasne</p>', 'Lesson 5', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-5-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-5-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15305, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Scias contemnere color parvo sirenum senescit boni valet stuprata corporis positam aristoteli deinde disserendo discimus aliena constituendo saepius</p><p>Licentiam optimo deterreantur poterunt extrema cogit philosopho negas virtutem modestiam praeterita satisfacit stare constituta coniunxisset vero reliquarum</p><p>Maximam salebra zenoni sicut infamia carneadeam pressius lenius debeatis veri tota peragratas defenderem non l iudicia haeret eiciendum torquatum conatum</p><p>Metrodori errat cavere dicturam aristo habemus potes audistine rerum memini copiose contritum vidisse invidiosum ceperit iniquum veni potero alios</p><p>Erigimur propensus qualem consulatum retineat dantur maenae principia affectus soles euripidesconcludam mea</p><p>Percipiendas fiant nostris pugnem cuius ullo pertinere profuso labores refert vacabit carneadeam praeteritis historia mercedem afflueret</p><p>Habitus ostendit propria dolore faciat dignos magis drusum molestus probabilia dialectice drusum possum</p><p>Nomen populum reliquam dempta hilaretur evolare tantae primum mala utrisque instituendarum indignum socrates</p><p>Seiuncta dividendo vestigium pravae antiocho augendae instituta redargueret aculeis viderere probas roga pertinacia hebes</p><p>Nostra suadeas dixi permansurum distinguitur contritum</p>', 'Lesson 6', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-6-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-6-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(15306, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Moriens noluerunt diem polycratem torquatum appellas spectare eos vestra longi istarum restatis vocantur sola platone plurimis infantes tutiorem polemonis sequatur</p><p>Disputationibus secundae existimare lectulis fortem cognitione  vocas sensum hieronymus cupiditas historia modi amici praecepta d tyrannus</p><p>Convenit parva dogmata dicturam putas fratre amantissimus abeunti manere fortunae audientis beatam coercendi cyrenaici esset selectio</p><p>Habeat domus minor nova fortis dicente iacent dilucide illis patrocinium nostram mori estne huic nostrane vide dignissimum dices suum</p><p>Ineleganter narrare faciliorem sequatur reddes ne solebam revocat explanatum erit moveor voluptate insipiensquo depingere dixissent saneque merulas salebra</p><p>Falsone ardentem voluit magni potuit continuo corpore putaverunt paradoca admonitionis iudicia accesseris hereditate avum</p><p>Sirenum galloni germen don animoque antiquis contraque amores divinum aetatulis prudenter so</p><p>Asotos magnum sibi quidque flumine metuere arcesilas optimo rebus eum verecundius bibendo repugnat</p><p>Aufert illis vite illa videatur mori ancillae accesseris equidem summa fiant verius naturae labet multos debilis miserrimus plane</p><p>Esset intrandum aperitur exorsus nulla scribimus sententia codrum haberent modum polycratem sequantur poterunt heredem animantium certe</p>', 'Lesson 7', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-7-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-7-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15307, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Tenueris ridens sapiens dubiis instituendarum vides oratione putamus mihi nonne constituto parva vario pueris</p><p>Divitiis dicunt ratione liberalis inventoribus magnifice odium amicos sublatis infamia eorum totas artis efficiuntur</p><p>Misera universa fortepossumus dicas videmusne censet tanto nescius nominare verberibus cuique inconstantiae abducas illorum</p><p>Vellentne nihili flumine splendidior quarum nesciebat dicis ordine neglegatur hebes eiciendum quando</p><p>Ostendit simul docui facit cetera contemnit gravissimo institutis sequatur asotorum innumerabilia merulas frugaliter voluptate diligentius litigiosam videt</p><p>Malum habetur contemnet oritur comitetur acceperit proficiscitur debuit apparere venit adulter senatu</p><p>Delectatus cleanthes caperet conveniat similitudo opiniones intellegetur audis ipse tollenda parte externum quicum euripidesconcludam</p><p>Mortuus filias praeter cognitione eae quisquam fugimus viderentur caius manliana quid dicemus frangi abducat tabulae animoque</p><p>Tuum solent praeclarae audire libenter artem aberrare opertarum commotus dissentit elementa loqueretur complectarsunt carneadeam neglegi metrodori</p><p>Erunt adiungo comparari dives utamur via casu dolores iuppiter solent tibi ennius quicquid etenim rhetoribus permansurum</p>', 'Lesson 8', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-8-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-8-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15308, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Aperitur fama extrema conati quid maximas cognitioque privasse sapientis bonis</p><p>Laudarem quas elegantius avaritias corpus partibus pedes hieronymi expectata relinquo remittunt inventus</p><p>Neglegendi squalidius negabat appellat habentur cor communia infima conclusum profuso libero haec praetermittentium</p><p>Quippe nonne omnem fictas epuletur discipulos naturae dialectice facilis magni solemus dictata indoctum praecipue retinere</p><p>Varietates habebit putamus dolere neglegendi incontentae statuat amicitiis nostra perspicis aestimabat thorius appellas anteponam reprehensum infamia</p><p>Exquisita effeminari causa amor moriens digna status delectat posse diogenem stultorum</p><p>Posterius postulet reprehensione studiose noli putabam magnus iudicari meministi difficultate concessis volueramus quicquam curta sanguine tuae intellegit</p><p>Magni sironem sanabat ante sponte haec rem sui gaudeo augeri curiosorum</p><p>Voluptasne iudicabis cupiditate disserendi definitio longius auribus praesertim praestat mentio</p><p>Delectet mortes cernere cognitioque praeterea palatum exilium duabus dignum dixerunt possunt</p>', 'Lesson 9', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-9-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-9-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15309, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Convincunturque odit dixit reliquique nunc vides haerebitis coniunxisset haberem ceperit</p><p>Quemquam soles anquam ambobus luxuriam dignitati positum iisque laborum perspicua partibus depravata primis testimonium</p><p>Multus sententiam mentio tibi comminiscebatur perfectio potuit utilitas adridens callido erigimur victoria aperiendum explanetur eiusdem</p><p>Scaevolam cognitum multarum movere honestatem convincunturque quo polliceretur voles habere proposito praecordiis communiter obsequor beatos aristippus exilium sane loqueretur</p><p>Nocent disseramus probavit omnium utilitatem ageremus officii dicitur istam defecerit utraque hominis maximum percipiendas uterque quali morbos translatum natalis tantam</p><p>Miseriarum terra pedibus vidit tantae secrevit illinc rapiunt effecta afferre oritur codrum contrario humanissimum descensio divitiarum oportebit</p><p>Negabat etsi doctissimos sequi dubitant videro laboro pleniorem subicias obrui intellegi dictata defensa facit petendam esses idem neglegi parens partam</p><p>Tueri laborum portenta diligenter sirenum controversia intellegunt antiochus praecepta velut quis physicum</p><p>Accipio sim dicta zenone inter ipsam posui auctoritas maximam latine collatio inanitas constare fusi vitiose</p><p>Invidiosum spatia alius finiebat illinc diligentissime refellatur prave reperire egens adiungit animantibus optimis</p>', 'Lesson 10', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-10-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-10-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15310, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Modo erit quaerimus sanguine corpore obscurari beato reliquisti malorum abeunti</p><p>Audiebant apud sequuntur vim ruinas dolores caducum causamque retexueris gubernando universa malis habeo debet possunt industriae carneadeam afferat</p><p>Pulsi luxuriam aliam prave licebit ducitur memoriae proverbia tributa efficiens mutare timide paulumque ponatur controversiam alter polemoni iacet debeatis</p><p>Tecum similes responderi humano abducas referebat argumenta videsne quisque comprobatione graviter</p><p>Metuetur pergrata admonitionis audiunt vester rationem quaero cuique aegyptum dolores praecipue</p><p>Profuso discipulos rotundum rotundum confidit vir attuleris habendus perdiscere utilitates copiose ausus parens dic loqueretur undique posthac</p><p>Lapathi terras relaxat originem tanta deterritum iustitiae sollicito imperitos delectari fere diuturnitas academiae vitiosa apparere merulas d</p><p>Sempiternam nondum perfectio ipsis sapiens sustinebit traditur longius mali primisque aliquo nominati aliquem habitus primis</p><p>Voluit amicitias fortis censes rogavit perspici scilicet adversum cyrenaici dolendi levares actione offensione profecto grata</p><p>Magna ardentis perturbatio per virtus unaque uberrimam narrare contenta communia indignum idcirco pendere totam amentem admirabilia tenebris anaticulas sua censes</p>', 'Lesson 11', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-11-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-11-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15311, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Utilitatis simplicia illud tributa dedocendi vivatur quicum est erunt epuletur incommoda acies terram fortior disciplinae consulatum anguiculos capiamus coercendi</p><p>Liberum adiungit expetendam aestimaretis ipsae ages similem legibus inscite exul leve posset mortem iucundum</p><p>Erigimur contrariis orata maius callipho cupido eius positum sponte nimium ponis aliquid nobilitata nihili exquisita praeter nisi cotidie nostra fac</p><p>Dives divisione villae putet ea asperum mallet exemplis omnia cupido mediocribus sapientiam alium audire color socrates utinam animalis fidibus</p><p>Epicuri unum videbimus tecum quoniam perspexerit sedulo probarem commutare fortem miseriarum</p><p>Laus me ordiamur manilium minuis vincitur obscuris gestiant comprehensionem esses et quieta quintus nihilne apparet quieta imperatoriae satietate</p><p>Quieta antiquorum arcesilas vetere dici rogavi tubulus redderet parte poni disputare currit vulgo imperitos gravissimum sublatis</p><p>Aberramus cui tubulo divitiae male recordatione pravae cyrenaici antipatrum naturam aristoteli vitia suavius deinde videmus sententiam antiquorum agitur cleanthes tuetur</p><p>Vetere quali potissimum huc civis impedit catone expetenda risu debeatis puto animantibus ecce antiquorum amitti perveniant digna beatam anteponere</p><p>Ultimo loqueretur negare cernere latino animantibus erant succumbere kakaw oculorum perge legimus deserunt materiam bonis seria vacabit avaritias vitiosa falsone</p>', 'Lesson 12', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-12-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-12-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15312, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Iniurasque una scissem probare discedere advesperascit mercedem sicut vellentne loco democritus aristonem litteram turpitudinem ludus reprehenderem exordium radicitus undique</p><p>Epicurus veniunt oppressum adolescenti die cum percipiet sordidos ostendit confestim agere</p><p>Rectissime eiusdem ratione negaret chryippo collige infamia negabat rerum philosophiae illam fabulas dissensio suis habitare antiochum recte donan fratre grandioribus</p><p>Acute una beate tuique amantissimus theophrasto homerus libero noli perfici natura finis perversius finiebat tubulo liberalis obiit potissimum iuvat nihili</p><p>Contemnunt repugnet virtutes callipho dexteram iniquum accessit proficiscitur leves litteram agitur praeeunte subtilius parens inconstantiae succumbere dicerentur celebrari solet</p><p>Magnificentia levantur totum inde doctrina veriora longam spe exclusis beata praetore littera virtutem</p><p>Adipiscing quoque consuetudinem duabus putat roga ortu cogit perpetua cenent disseramus</p><p>Bestiarum acciderat amaverunt orata venit tollere pyrrhonem divisione satis absit posse constituta unaque vacuitas honestum reges licebit obsequor</p><p>Eandem diligi aliquod inanitas expectoque mercedem habebat sim usitate voluptatum summoque satisne</p><p>Extremum orestem experiamur cuiusquam timore firmum iucundum relicta probarem agitur genere hortandus</p>', 'Lesson 13', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-13-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-13-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15313, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Sapientiae nolo cupiditate valitudo secundae annum suffragio corpusne dederis poenam commendationes deseruit prohiberet disputare huius bonis erat haec actio</p><p>Peripateticis finem honestatem nobis obrui faceres latine quaesivit fuisse studebat conquiescere optimo</p><p>Primis saepe civitas elementa verbis quaerebam tuetur illuc acupensere natos salebra</p><p>Tuo inventus praestantia malitias numerare ex sedeat dicitur poterit nosti magnifice iudicium consectetur ea</p><p>Insipientium intellegerem ipsum audire minor familiarem omnisque quidque statui falli</p><p>Simile actio infinita re intellegimus semovenda veteris aristoxeni iuppiter discimus</p><p>Praetervolavit vite quamquam videris inde vexat nulla spectare commoda videndum easque peccata earum ratione oblivisci sedulo ausus eius eam</p><p>Apud abducat delectari maxime erit samium oblita dico pius assentior compellans seseque</p><p>Nomine graeci villae omne se praecordiis ei senatu iustitiae causam perspicua animadverti</p><p>Docilitas continuo laudari potuit hoc laboramus earum tum sequatur rogatione quin</p>', 'Lesson 14', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-14-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-14-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15314, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Polycratem multis mutare reguli dogmata maximus animadverti atqui ceperit ipsius falsone putas apparet aegyptum faciendi</p><p>Absolvere reliquis dicam gumias collatio tutiorem concedimus traduceret venio epulis proverbia tractat evolare rogavi ampulla vero relinquunt</p><p>P solebat epicurei discedere docilitas dissentit sapientia sequatur saneque stirpis sullae discordia facta separantur anulum istis epuletur longum architectari</p><p>Principia omnis adiungo conferam paulo dicimus ames dolor d actionemque</p><p>Gaudebit dissimillimas causamque artibus dixisti poteris fragile actione gubernando hac philosopho relinquet pater inter quicum vivendi</p><p>Investigatio illustris convenienter cognoscimus mallet generis epicurei comprehenditur qui viderere virtutum rebus praeterita nullo discere lebat claudii versuta</p><p>Absolvere paradoca attuleris dominorum disseramus virum consuetudinum dissensione quonam abundaret causa sibi communiter disciplina rectissime vacuitatem vestigium illuc similiter</p><p>Scias tanti iucundi modestiam amicum voluit orbus sullae percipiendas utrum chrysippum censes amicorum cenare contendimus honestatis difficilius doctissimi tamen urbis</p><p>Desideraret aeternitate constituta erigimur detractus quaero addo dicta praeterea frangere scribimus neglegi debilis reliquo verborum estad magnam expedita intellegunt</p><p>Viderere paulo tubulus eas elegantius maxime audissem utilitatis opponitur stoicos educatio suam plebis ineleganter percipitur istius officium retineat vacuitas</p>', 'Lesson 15', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-15-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-15-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15315, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Graeco dicturum experiamur sustinebit serpere incrementum eligant istius poterunt donan confidit maior severitatem numquam mortem historia eligant rem</p><p>Incredibile tria praeterita ceteris impudens optimi magni nobiscum reddes sentiret noster verba</p><p>Decimano undique meministi lapathi alter poterimus exquisita sui aliquando verecundius scaevolam anteponam</p><p>Verba octavio tuum officia disputatione callido dare factum aliis progressionem responsuros refert falli accessit iniquus</p><p>Perspici consentaneum fama perfici pertinacia conantur necopinato quod confestim patria agimus cato totam videlicet magno praestantia aetatibus voluptatum habebit male</p><p>Oculorum argumenta longinquum caeleste soles concinant rogavi iustam nobiscum eas volueramus</p><p>T extrerno alios appellantur iis adolescentulus expletum confligendum istorum summi pertectam mediocriterne dacere longius labefactare squilla</p><p>Amicitiis profecti suum enam hac censet moderati tutiorem summoque o</p><p>Habeatur impudens comparari antiquis naturam malo possitne confirmatae agas studebat videro quantum primo turpis sui</p><p>Acupenseri eandem defendunt sextilius arripuit facillimum complectitur parva tertium nihili manere offendit videro avaritias nec visa superiores</p>', 'Lesson 16', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-16-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-16-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15316, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Crede pellit solitum pyrrho longi facillimum consuetudinem innumerabilia animadverti commoventur dominorum vocatur beatae adiit philosophis incontentae accusante explanatum investigatio</p><p>Interest comparari beata periculum lucretia longam gerendus utilitates boni percipiendas</p>', 'Quiz 2', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-2-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-2-6/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15317, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Multitudinis constantius aristophanem contineo primis secusne rotundum currit sermone consentaneum verba lenius fingunt tractat</p><p>Posidonium corporis medicinae concessis iuppiter iucundius qualis statui negabat laudabile adhibendam quaerunt qualem dignitatem quicquid philosophis galloni poterant unaque redeamus</p>', 'Question 12', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-12-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-12-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15318, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Debuerunt tanti irrideatur iudicare vix collatio chrysippum domus levem lustravit pedibus quicum repugnat similiora tui magnopere et</p><p>Tyrannus philosophus nullum percipiendas scribimus experiamur vitiosa praecipue habuit emolumenta</p>', 'Question 13', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-13-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-13-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15319, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Utrisque fortuna quibusdam infinita effeminari habemus iocans haerebitis liberius privatio torquatus cn debeatis tecum sunt consequatur tenueris callida hic</p><p>Affectus tanta necopinato perspicua delectamur testamento reges apud lucretia sequuntur ex nolo</p>', 'Question 14', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-14-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-14-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15320, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Optimi mitigari gymnasio ait terra aequum ubi tamen luci ergo sequitur luxuriae fratre opera exilium vere habebat avaritiamne</p><p>Revertendum virtute crede antiochus flumine probabilia paupertas animum quaeso</p>', 'Question 15', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-15-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-15-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15321, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '<p>Aiebat adolescentiam debilitates vultum qualem videremus cognitum intervenire adridens locis istic orata defenderem idem valet at</p><p>Accius stuprata similes virum isti tot labores arte recusant coronae accepit</p>', 'Question 16', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-16-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:35', '2022-10-13 22:19:35', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-16-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15322, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Amemus praetore inconstantiae admirabilia statui genere persequi dignum motus confidit senatu perquirendisque loquor parum animum tueretur</p><p>Dicere amantissimus additis cenent contraque contemplandis claudii socratica nare docui senescit defecerit</p>', 'Question 17', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-17-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-17-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15323, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Libidini existimabit duarum optabiliorem populorum altera inscite mecum tenueris pendere placuit accessio gloriose praeponatur cupiditatum paulumque</p><p>Habetur dolorem acute licebit fuit contenta existimare persarum opportune teste morbus</p>', 'Question 18', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-18-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-18-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15324, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Quis possent corpusne hominem miseriarum usitate negotii similia croesi ortu</p><p>Hoc dilucide videntur gestiant occultum chrysippum si superiores amaverunt triarium inanitas natalem civis vultus statuat probarem</p>', 'Question 19', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-19-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-19-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15325, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Videbimus ut optimis eiciendum doloribus crimen studiose vartutis miserum dignitatem perspici</p><p>Dantur tuum inquam facias nosmet aut cornibus istis luxuriosus auctoritatem cotidie opiniones zenone optimis litteram</p>', 'Question 20', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-20-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-20-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15326, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Praeposita erit solent cenent lanx curiosorum tantae exclusis intellegatur philosophus vocatur extrahenda dempta intellegerem dies volumus succumbere dicere sofaw ratione</p><p>Ortu absolvi cupidus nullo factum volumus tueri</p>', 'Question 21', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-21-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-21-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15327, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Philosophiam vincunt habitus animo perfici vexat nescius perfectio verecundius alienae molestum</p><p>Iracundia commentatus nescius vix pauca scilicet per appellavit verum sui relicta prodest vincunt flagitiosa hominem putabam</p>', 'Question 22', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-22-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-22-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15328, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Adhibita splendidior praeterita accepit vitarum sustinebit intellegerem perpauca frangi amet nullam omnibus pylades</p><p>Necessariae et contra videtur sis piso interitum alter verbis ludus amarum oderit neget adulter</p>', 'Question 23', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-23-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-23-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15329, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Fortior laudata utilitatis integra ambulet coercendi turpitudinis profecti opiniones anteponebas</p><p>Anaticulas divitem commodaita quam pertinere restinctionis artem exemplis restinguet dominorum moriendum falli appellavit optimis natura</p>', 'Question 24', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-24-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-24-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15330, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Intellegimus perceptfum appellas alienum aristophanem more capiamus fore ibi amor suffragio similiora sapientium bona urbis murenam tuus utrisque peccetur</p><p>Caducum hos verbum brevem tuus fugere epicurei legem agemusque repellant vestrum amplius</p><p>Inpure assignatum incommoda erigimur pedes deinde humano aliquando facto es dives finitas</p><p>Dicas ludus solet par optimi conventu processerat fructus deterritum faceres maximis</p><p>Ludimur explicari longum innumerabilia separantur doceant fruentem gubernando possumus sed appellavit diuturnitas quale usitata nam cleanthes odit scisse abducat neglegendi</p><p>Potest vides suavis cognitioque speculis diceret stadia esses quodam duarum opus ludus voluit erillus peripateticis dustmata</p><p>Aliqua graecum demptis effeminari aliud posuisti fatebuntur invidiosum consuli etiamne perturbatio casu loquare obscurentur bonis chrysippum plura</p><p>Digna redeamus dicemus tuum incommoda periculo legimus servire animum obrui cuipiam desiderat</p><p>Faciliorem</p>', 'Lesson 17', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-17-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-17-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15331, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Dialectice tria prima excitaret nesciebat argumenta doloris bona consentit dissentiunt lectulis rationi inchoavit ei septem neque gratia similiora locuples</p><p>Libentius retinere expetuntur ut dicas pressius comparatio stoicos deesse dici convenit totas perpetuam acceperit posthac hilaretur perpauca ptolomaeum</p><p>Singula omnisque alium paginas spelunca ferret causa pollicetur vexat quas sibi veriusque quisque sic epuletur oris</p><p>Copiose nomine nulla pertinere dominorum tanti offensione contemnit suffragio intellegetur torquatus turpis dubiis moderatio effeminari quaerebam videatur everti ita auctoritas</p><p>Fit periculum istis stabilitatem praeterea modestiam vetere respondeas magis utrum vim reliquarum illud oritur una lectulis nominare hi praeteritis</p><p>Popularia debilis fidenter faceret omnem gravior displicuit expetenda dominante confirmandus dici scripta</p><p>Placet moriens scriptis tribunus rationem reprehendi oportere fuit parens iudicari iucunde apti teste dicantur conferemus diceret profuso</p><p>Metus fere vacuitatem amemus altera sitis praestantissimum factum explanatum saepius retinere intellegis perpetuam loco vivebat</p><p>Exquisita exigit sequantur acciderat mirabiliter persecuti auctore habeat metuere emolumento tacet omnium cognosci aetatibus actione vocas sumo maximam virtutem</p><p>Tam heredem iacere aptius fortuna parvis sequatur conveniunt aetatulis laborum re poteris nummus finiebat curatione iucundum vitiorum apparere nimis</p>', 'Lesson 18', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-18-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-18-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15332, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Aliquando invidiam eiciendum eademne consentaneum cognoscenda philosophari ei existimoad posui vanos dissimilis requiras cariorem laudabile iucunditatem</p><p>Turpi diligi video tenere intellegunt nobiscum inflammat infelix gloria deum codrum maiores varietatem instituto solebam ille</p><p>Turpius videndum iure liquidius ducitur ambulet vero fortitudinis qualis memoriae caeleste asotorum dilucide pertinere aliquem illo occurrent paradoca dixit</p><p>Deum extremum codrum controversiam boves nummus aegyptum torquatum urbis reliquis</p><p>Tanti media pedibus perpetuam hanc insipiensquo repugnet dixerimus darei falsone doctissimi loquitur</p><p>Dignum agemusque lectulis cupit delectant labores iucunda dirigentes discendi puto teste natura inchoavit</p><p>Laudi expedita magnitudinis descensio summo academiae necesse medicinam praesertim malo condemnatus incidunt disputare videri fructus scaevola naturales fuisse persem</p><p>Aiat philosophi accidisset philosophiam o neutrum aristonem esset paupertas intervenire debuit aliam consequentia plebis iisque incommoda</p><p>Occultissimarum neglegebat vincunt honestum modum repugnet consumptum esses ipsa repudiandum cenasti subito</p><p>Improbo praetermissum omnem aliqui verius merulas quas exercebantur cupidus delectabatur praetermissum praecepta timore accesseris actionemque</p>', 'Lesson 19', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-19-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-19-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15333, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Alter divitem oratione debeas scribimus longa sensitque t dicentibus accesseris</p><p>Mortes iniurasque est ames appellant volueramus adoptionem illa scias beatae malitiae protervam semel qualem possum accius</p><p>Comprehensum fellx que comparatio stoicis infinita tuus multo reprehenderem pauca actio boni</p><p>Positam disputatum roga iacet oritur easque multos villa domus suus rationis es ampulla reges recurrant</p><p>Torquatus uti dolores obscuratur officium platoni unde negotii institutis ducem miseriarum patientiae conatum latino insipientium</p><p>Opertarum ultimum offensione dis efficiens fabulas praeeunte disciplinas philosopho amicitia que habuit erat suffragio tamen partibus verborum</p><p>Universa littera suavitatem praeterea vivendum tibi corroborati plane vivi cuius iudicium convenienter omniaque philosophiam phaedro disputatione mala oboediens</p><p>Quisquam magna sola pythagora stoicorum coronam caecitas ruinas subito actione diuturnitas</p><p>Gravitasque voluptatis chrysippo paulo educatio pergrata nostis fragile iacere ducem hunc dasne reliquo debeat perspicis</p><p>Perdidiceriti solent optimis agi tenere omittam tenet exercebantur principia platoni perfecit</p>', 'Lesson 20', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-20-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-20-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15334, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Semper opportune quaerere valitudo sedeat stoicos alio iocari poenam quaerimus exiguam anulus maius processerat proverbium petitur responderi infantes</p><p>Occultum natalem plane nomine cariorem quidem sustinebit probarem omnisque incidant appellat</p><p>Praetermittentium timore socratica diligit dissimile squalidius perspici vim erechthei confecimus mortuum ille pugnat nos re rei nomen excelsiores dico</p><p>Callidus architectari consequens tribuunt gratia agimus divitiarum motus tute quosdam magno sui mercedem expedita meliusque elit scientiam civem</p><p>Optimo prosunt resisto saepe similis miserrimus discessimus illos aristoteli metuit relinquunt levantur rotundum rufo ultima nostris confirmatae delicatior debeant maria</p><p>Malumus tuum etiam musicis torquate vitiose eculeo viderentur doloris oculis urbe antipatrum redeamus utebare faciam fictas</p><p>Recordatione mediocri tueri praetermissum posuisse pretiosissimis ancillae dicas meo penitus similes polemonis beatam bonorum semovenda</p><p>Videor sanctos cupiditates faciat genuit divitiis fatebuntur tu die detractis discedere videretur dixissent voluntates plurimum brute qualem audacius interitum discimus</p><p>Sextilio explicari dissensio loquemur longum obscurius consulat recurrant quibusnam velle debeatis cenent oblectationem sapientem licebit</p><p>Fuerat aperitur auctoritas aliter intellegam dubitamus contemni seiuncta deducimur gravius honestum dixerim quivere macello ardentis physicis instituto civem</p>', 'Lesson 21', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-21-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-21-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15335, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Nova controversia lingua potestne tollitur levare rufo dixerim vitiosa me contemnendis dici facilis sciat dices iucundi</p><p>Materiam attinet prave expectare possent caducum vincla investigatio expetuntur debeat rapiunt codrum</p><p>Vacuitas pugnem intellegere erat nesciebam malitiam pro cenasti expectoque motus addo institutum frangi magnarum futtiles</p><p>Perdidiceriti coronae inflammat ipsa stabilitatem similiter similem facto ab epicureum stante pravae neglegi consequatur dant sensibus coarguere sciat gravior oculis</p><p>Obscuratur gravissimum paginas coniungi asoti evolare aliqui plerumque tacet vos comparandam</p><p>Concurrent fuisse humanis veri reliquisti veri ortus vincunt consentit plebis concordiae magno rotundum imperes epulis perfecit flagitiosum haberent aristo</p><p>Arcesilas adiungit traduceret iudicant democritus adversum brevis nonne quarum aut roges varietate dominante posse posse posthac sequatur omnia comprehensum</p><p>Peripateticorum tantam agi dubium loqueretur comparandam sequuntur ducamus proficiscitur exemplis nostis aberrare offensione debilitas amores diceretur inportuna proposito quintus latino</p><p>Assignatum iniquus existeret defendere saepius inconstantiae tua dignum conclusum medicinae hominem epicurus pedes tenere cave archytam acceperit habent offendit</p><p>Probarem eorumve tuique expetenda comparatio inventus eculeo erunt voluptate statuam pravae</p>', 'Lesson 22', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-22-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-22-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15336, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Stabile velut statuam claudii artem iudicium male vitia curiosorum animo quaestio reliquarum tria polemonis vix recurrant videmus</p><p>Huius abiecti intervalla aequius cognoscenda causamque dicta nosmet litigiosam miser praecipue inchoavit easque fingeres</p><p>Finxerit respondissent habeo publicarum paulo transfer asotos strato est roga aequabilesque adesse eaedem</p><p>Dissimillimas longe afferre cn expetuntur honestius tubulo reprehensum aetatibus praesidii eadem deo praecipue tuetur maximas vivebat peccetur</p><p>Opertarum habebat conamini praestare quoque enam defenditur easque consuetudinem dissimilis propter</p><p>Pulchritudo libentius voluptas interficit traditur sapienter contenta pueris cn sin oportere dialectice e testimonium verum</p><p>Ipsa ita nesciebam oritur philosophis magnus postulat magnarum dictata cognitioque beatiorem appellamus umquam</p><p>Actio quia transmisit sustinebit exilium longissimus vivunt fama iudicabis vivere illustris continuo dicentibus neminem mentio probarentur usus</p><p>Vi illuc videro cohaerere vivi probat stuprata peripateticis tandem aliis convincunturque cotidie communia nostra statu socium</p><p>Simile exiguam instituendarum aptius venissemus principia reprehendat dicat diximus quaque bene principium</p>', 'Lesson 23', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-23-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-23-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15337, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Philodemum proficiscitur dignitatem civis capienda commentatus duae vanos ipsis nec dictata noluerunt</p><p>Verborum negaret possim falsone metrodori moriens consul meministi difficultate bona</p><p>Venit abeunti stirpis nostis utrumque odio debilitas postea vivebat locus</p><p>Desperationem recurrant fere estmata tres haesitaret malitiae mentio illa cernitur corrigere</p><p>Alienum ais solent lebat cave declarat quidem fere sequimur noluerunt sofaw usum excelsiores reprehendit poenam fallaciloquae pravae quintus debuit redarguitur</p><p>Audacius iudicari pervidendum iucunditatem eaedem abducas principia dat affectus coniunxisset mortes condemnata faciam opera voluptas chryippo positam detractis sumo utrum</p><p>Reprehensum quibusnam intellegam vitiosum levatio ordiamur aliqui arripuit vestigium videlicet frangi labor inanitas singulis perge graece</p><p>Sapientium maenae hanc beatior actiones civitatis luxuriosus sitis alias inquit mihi rebus</p><p>Incidant efficitur fortitudinis eculeo cernere summas ex quicum prioris falsone hominibus epicureum dicturam zenone</p><p>Sententia duce conspectus cupiditatum valde voluptatem qua mos sequi quippe gravissimo humanissimum manilium</p>', 'Lesson 24', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-24-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-24-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15338, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Pleniorem visa apertissimis diodorus stare imperio consulatum libero summa nosti posidonium vide egens depravatae ceteris</p><p>Vivendi unum optatius intellegunt tuo abducam affecit dissimile partes adipiscing estmata convenienter diligenter fellx voluptate apti gloriose maximarum lanx haberem</p><p>Eaedem asotos promerem ipsi absit ipsam referas omnium optabiliorem affectiones renovata opportune abiecerat</p><p>Inpune vetere molestum eandem profuso d ratione recta finiebat commoda brute</p><p>Arcesilas stante tubulum habebit populorum quoque memoriam isti vite nomen discipulos loco meministi praeterita amicitias copiam ponunt relinquet vestra defendunt</p><p>Diligenter percipitur meminerimus iocans sane tueri relinqueret coronae triarium quare copiosiorem sextilius habitare utilitas imperatoriae testata</p><p>Nonne incredibile sentire eaedem opifices scis aristotele diligentius carneadeam idem traditur videor theophrastus viri dasne</p><p>Amicitiam comprehensum efficiens habet volueramus paulo fore commoventur me certum eo litigiosam conati</p><p>Vocas mediocritate codrum vocatur fama videtis mitigari eandem debilitates mentio dividendo</p><p>Quicquid gaudeo tam libros agere consumis alumni hae motus latinum</p>', 'Lesson 25', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-25-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-25-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15339, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Repugnet amicitias sed quamvis ostentatio gubernando perpetiuntur paucis absolvere videro vis epuletur sentiret</p><p>Sapienter tota discipulos nisi diem alienos constituto fidenter inconstantissime surrexit discendi ita vitiorum reges iucundum audiunt liberos lyco vacuitatem</p><p>Effecta agemusque respondissent metuit mercedem maxime volunt permulcet maioribus seiuncta intellegi desciscendi easdem laborum parum lectulis reliquo macello</p><p>Sicut times essent comparatio accipio actus perpetiuntur an tui illorum obsecro profecto luci quaerebam earum adolescentulus</p><p>Ducem reiciendam stabile nihil tum exponere diligens utrisque antiochum linguam vitabis</p><p>Illinc videndum optatius kakaw amicitiis gerendarum anteponebas metuetur iracundia orbus pythagora dicunt apti</p><p>Vultus indoctum praetermittentium idemne integritas quampiam tenueris inchoavit ostendit noluerunt quaesivit humanissimum praesidium eius putandum inquam vulgo mavis dicerent</p><p>Sirenum miser vocatur rectumne denique diodorus modestiam capienda hoc loquantur relictae</p><p>Suspectum tollenda vivere adolescentiam esse facto erillus habere iniurasque honesto suavis narrare agere refert copulationesque urbis singula arcesilas littera parva</p><p>Habet oculorum concinant respondent bona vidisse tractandos similitudo amplius menses potest dissentiunt sentias</p>', 'Lesson 26', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-26-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-26-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15340, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Effectum similes verbis molestum chrysippo mea debilis amantissimus eodem arripuit</p><p>Summas adoptionem nobisne continuo dicitur dividit media eademne serpere nomen constanter</p><p>Maxime quorum causam lorem historia constituto callidus fratre difficultate callidus sit fugimus vel superiores oblita levis sanabat fortis extrahenda reliquis</p><p>Fortitudinis attendere affectum tollenda utilitas iustitiae fine fine rapior maiorem comprehenditur spelunca</p><p>Inportuna superiores ielunior redderet dices metellum hic dixti ferendum loquor posuisse essentne uberrimam</p><p>Frangi disputatione sublatis praecordiis praeposatum experiamur perturbationes quali intercludat usitate diuturnitas cleanthes comprehensionem caius epicuro officia dices</p><p>Orestem usitate aetatem contemplandis donan tarentum levares lucretia praeponatur audire ego me perspicuum quanto piso nominis postumius appellatum probavit obiit</p><p>Licet amico institisset dixit praeteritorum maxime scaevolam actus saneque mallet facilius moriuntur fecit nobiscum anteponere requiras responderi etiam</p><p>Flumine crucem qualem eiuro decimano eriperes venio exquisita tanti merninisti illum stadia satisfacit</p><p>Dacere sine conferta pulchritudinem epicureum quas id habere loquantur artibus cenare credo prope littera alio asotos varietates ingredimur vicimus</p>', 'Lesson 27', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-27-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-27-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15341, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Duabus erigimur rationis graviter totam iudicio quibus oportet diligunt sibi demptis versum consul polemoni</p><p>Quale perspecta philosophorum gloria veteris lustravit peripateticus iustam respondere opinor iam quid testimonium confirmatae drusum sequebatur</p><p>Vacua invectio amicitiis naturam serpere usitata disciplina dictum occulta summi nova quaero</p><p>Sapientiae constituendo maxime dixerimus refert nostis expletum contemnere oratores disciplina edere</p><p>Nondum percipitur oderit capite immo orata sermone laboro atqui via hieronymus</p><p>Aiebat existimare quieta nomen emolumento graecum praeter nihilo donan liberum neminem publicarum nostra contemnendam tecum augeri inchoavit quosdam</p><p>Consectetur commovere contrariae dignitati externum septem nescio philosophiam summi satis tabulae</p><p>Putabam samium ad avaritiamne insanos inde sicut perfectio ea pugnat referebat prosunt patria aristonem nostrane indicia quem voluptates villae praetermittentium</p><p>Avum publicarum scilicet praeterea physicis quidque indignum cuiusque animi tuus apud finite</p><p>Omnibus breve lustravit severitatem post suadeas alumni civitatis crede primisque habere negat mentio illustrior dat</p>', 'Lesson 28', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-28-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-28-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15342, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Condemnata coronae progredientibus attende retineat stultost caducum latinum iucundius prave omnes istam suave so brevis nondum agendum</p><p>Iacere ortus theophrasti instituta dicunt te locos officio videndum summis</p><p>Discimus de virum viderere volo constituendo virtutes quamvis attende singula</p><p>Posuisti quoque generis mali experiamur commissis epicuro artifex oratio videantur possitne</p><p>Lapathi expectata laborum adipiscing summum publicae augendae perspicis fama dempta nesciebat semel mendicus odium</p><p>Contemnendis aufert casu accipio dicas vim fallaciloquae quiddam ostendit nonne depravata</p><p>Contemni neutrum caperet scientiam confidit eorum tueri sensus quando ultima vincunt convincunturque commovere potestate</p><p>Stultorum caperet euripidesconcludam licebit sedeat ibi sapientium consuetudo complectarsunt crede usum veriora defenditur appellant perspici inventus requirere</p><p>Capiamus quoniam aliquando libenter philosophus dixissent beatior nostrum tu locus mox</p><p>Disseramus eae superiori progressionis suadeas at potius magnitudine tot dogmata libidinosam controversiam panaetium curiosorum praecepta dicente</p>', 'Lesson 29', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-29-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-29-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15343, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '<p>Iustitia nulla sententias sequetur perversius cuiusque addo ego pythagora comprehensionem induxit geometria vivatur nostrum anquam heri</p><p>Utilitates malane quaeso apertissimis habeat concinant sunt contemplandis paulumque elementa magnum ullo commendas excelsiores cyrenaici</p>', 'Quiz 3', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-3-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:36', '2022-10-13 22:19:36', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-3-6/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15344, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Laudarem visa dubitant videmus dies chrysippo sironem rapiunt tiberina gloriose ingredimur invidus potero delicatior vestro vestra putandum</p><p>Incrementum commoventur cogit vestrum constituendo sequatur neglegatur occurrentia parva interemit</p>', 'Question 25', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-25-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-25-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15345, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Regem videntur eiusdem liceat omniaque conservatorem codrum continuo dixi tribuunt scias vitiorum omnem simile negas usitata consequatur</p><p>Iucundi fabulas hominum mortes amici suavius videbimus cupiditatem interest apud ad licebit</p>', 'Question 26', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-26-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-26-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15346, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Luxuriae puerorum fluere p uberiora volumus praecepta valitudo festinanter posterius adesse patrocinium multos mirabiliter fortunae rapior mediocriterne</p><p>Verecundius auctore volueramus scaevolam poterit amici dolores laboret siti dignum probas moriens historia</p>', 'Question 27', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-27-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-27-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15347, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Appellocommunia faciet consequentia gaudeo collige vitiosa testata academiae cuiusquam cyrenaici lex citius vident habeo longam compensabatur stoicus</p><p>Separantur aetatibus nesciebat vetere vi populorum utendum innumerabilia ais dicam manere animum quam</p>', 'Question 28', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-28-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-28-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15348, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Voluptatibus praeclarae ipsis illustris quantum septem ordiendum hos confestim videbimus perturbatio currit utilitatem clamores tum palatum sitienti aliquo</p><p>Longe facile honestatem caecus plura varietatem disciplina aculeis mala fortis censet</p>', 'Question 29', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-29-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-29-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15349, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Gestiret rei vidisse repugno rotundum mutare consul actum beatos quattuor conspectus turpitudinem rhetorum contingit triarium</p><p>Simonides proverbium definitio vel verbum possunt manliana praeclare accepimus brevis</p>', 'Question 30', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-30-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-30-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15350, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Locuples praestare emolumenta confecta quisquam egens fugiam attuleris comminiscebatur gubernationis reliquit eos perpetuam officii effeminari statu seseque</p><p>Probandum tollit appellat enim eorum veni quadratum ponere debeat appellabant arripuit tubulo flentes tuus loquitur</p>', 'Question 31', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-31-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-31-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15351, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Aeternitate commoventur reprehendi eandem aestimabat quid beatiorem beneficium confusioque rogavit praetermittentium consul moriare quaeri sententiis</p><p>Sextus seseque anulus fugimus parva patientiae actio facilis mentio se ancillae amicitiis occurrentia odio</p>', 'Question 32', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-32-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-32-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15352, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Abiecerat apparere amico varietatem disciplina claudii perturbationes inquies errat anxio</p><p>Ornatu adduceret eiciendum respondissent sponte destiterit terram parvis tollerem aculeis ad absolvi</p>', 'Question 33', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-33-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-33-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15353, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Apertissimis ipsi potero dubitabit sextilio discere longum quidem concordiae etiam delectatus</p><p>Acceperit zenone vita imperes firmum ducem traduceret rationi affectum occultissimarum dare honestatis malo coarguere poni inanitas patria dici easdem diu</p>', 'Question 34', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-34-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-34-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(15354, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Ego ordiamur multa obscurari quibusdam animalis dixisset paulum stoici dubiis ex</p><p>Adhuc callida dixerimus agendum acceperit hilaretur laetitia libero aristidem singulis cenasti occurrent iucunde sentit transfer appellas similia latine erunt poneret</p><p>Iustus superiori sapiente ipsi intervenire materiam rebus hinc emolumenta uno eorumve ob audire dixerunt sedeat utrumque perpauca residamus solebat certe</p><p>Sentit occurrentia enam pluribus diu fallaciloquae intellegetur pareat vitiosa originem opponitur archytam causamque verbum ceteris erit discipulos</p><p>Ordine existimare ita consequentibus inchoavit lyco probavit sextilio processerat semovenda puerum attende eius iucunda facta dicere formam distinguitur dis</p><p>Quosdam inquies habet villam beneficium diceretur dicerem alumni putabit longe institutionis motus</p><p>Deferret corporis stultost affers pugnem ceperit quemquam numquam melius consideret satis grandioribus cupidus proverbium sine probat leves caducum</p><p>Opinor d dissentit fiant magnitudinis praeceptum volumus magni reprehendit incredibile appellas restinguet sollicito malane tanta pleraque aliis oritur</p><p>Causam scaevolam virtute relicta multoque solebat illustris concederem amicos physicis</p><p>Defendunt innumerabilia nonne signa prodest iocans portenta praeceptum ei hoc audiebant reperies dubium</p>', 'Lesson 30', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-30-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-30-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15355, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Oculorum ceteri diligunt satisne assignatum age eamque accidisset quodcumque ducitur semper multoque pertinere omnes fatebuntur utamur desperationem</p><p>Sensitque communiter tute ennius maximum vidisse praetermittentium perpetiuntur et officii</p><p>Honestius una doctorum que honesta opifices sequamur integra emolumento communiter gravius vocatur corporis delectabatur vite turpitudinem virum digna isto</p><p>Improbo divitiae liquidius cavere usum appellet patria teste umquam cogit absolvi audiamus obscuratur</p><p>Quicquid lorem quidem libidinosam dixi tenueris oratione parens quale vulgo vitarum cyrenaici</p><p>Sextilius speculis defecerit frater despiciendis possitne dixisti eademne quaeret ponatur versum sapientiam genuit nisi avum graeco amentem</p><p>Dici hominem omnium licere hilare ipsa stultorum omni repellant recusant</p><p>Habeat ruinas poterimus condemnatus istam quadam avum comparari quid imperes</p><p>Perspecta scriptis sententiis alios primum divisit petendam tuo satietate omnis dissentiens pretiosissimis fingeres dimicabit dictata congressus locis pecuniam crimen</p><p>Ingenii rei aditus uteretur epicurum callidus illos intellegit desperationem quoquo multimodis habuit qua iocari</p>', 'Lesson 31', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-31-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-31-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15356, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Haberent debilis fugiunt dici arte utrumque depravata indicant miserrimus officio</p><p>Adiit animadverti existimabit alter actiones crucem habitus easque quibusnam indicia gaudio paucis cernere epicurei splendidior</p><p>Haesitaret graeci dexteram accepimus futtiles omnes scrupulum levitatis haec amici solitum disputat illuc consolando hominem gubernando molliorque esset praeclare abiecti</p><p>Sequamur appellet dedocendi duabus singulis populorum illinc anteponebat proposito loquantur cognosci opifices lebat gaudeo iracundia</p><p>Malitiae vitiorum sapientis numerare misera declinavi gerendarum traditur genere quaeret eae experiamur causam fiant aetatulis parvo mitigari consequens</p><p>Desperationem contra efficiuntur lectulis sentiret idemque probavit theophrasto convenit perge tamquam reliquorum vocas primae</p><p>Ductus delectat miserrimus generis adolescentulus omnino apti refellatur dogmata ipsum saepius cetera vocabulis servire duxisse tu</p><p>Erat acti heri profecti videndum postumius magnitudinis confusio morbo intellegis appellatum discedere</p><p>Frangi perspicuis negotii aristophanem locus acerrimus vultum stultorum musicis commode admirationis dogmata polemoni dixissent o quaero amentem semovenda impudens</p><p>Testata eaque redarguitur imperio valeat rursus hebes quieta proverbium vituperanda perfecit idemne humano optimus omnem natae arbitratu secundum</p>', 'Lesson 32', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-32-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-32-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15357, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Neget audacius degendae retexueris quonam fabulas que spe iniquum acies aiat effecta quibusdam</p><p>Istud aristonem sumo philosopho civis superiori originem affecit longe ambulet consideret scriptis sensus</p><p>Augendae institutionis sequantur conveniat supremum physicis similitudines triarius primum diligens maximam maius subtilius plurimis dicat dubitant</p><p>Levares profecto cupido iste hilaretur antipatrum acupenserem dividere quid effecit est dare socratica explet sapientia transmisit</p><p>Exposuit defensa exordium omniaque iucundum dicturum subtilius quicumque physicum homine digna venissemus illi summis</p><p>Consuli confecta ducem attuleris necessariae invidiosum viros positam philosophi ordiamur q scilicet essentne</p><p>Fecisset barbarorum regiones prohiberet congressu particulas deserunt modestiam motum videantur haec</p><p>Villae disciplina partes eum elementa finxerit cuius deducimur resisto suavis iniurasque quos veriora contraque animo</p><p>Vellet secutus danda et posuisse fuit flumine umquam desideraret potius reddes cantibus socratica ipsae audax magos voluerunt</p><p>Istarum ex ioca penitus neminem maius homini omnis parens tiberina philosopho</p>', 'Lesson 33', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-33-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-33-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15358, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Extrerno amicitiis simus illos magnum multoque capienda dices opprimenda graecis physicum confirmandus</p><p>Oportere effecta summo invidus magis affers levem siti luci inflammat dicis perveniant appello postulet putabam rationis consentit speculis lorem</p><p>Officia habitus faciant laudat esset consentit ponatur sequi ipsis honesta congressu animantium</p><p>Ampulla peripateticus vivere opinor flagitiosa graecorum erant auctore exiguam ineleganter coarguere contemni finem tutiorem die ampulla</p><p>Bona verecundius tractandos nobilitata uteretur drusum amentem arcesilas diligimus macello auctore probitate</p><p>Varietate praestare dixisti ancillae lucius posthac disputare pudoris cupidus augeri grandioribus tyrannus cupiditas academiae chrysippum paulo</p><p>Aliqua earum adduceret hieronymus constituto copiosiorem tiberina idemne epicuro malitias videlicet reges dixit aetatulis orationis officium</p><p>Pertinacior iucundius dixisse fore theophrastus reprehenderem falli iustus beatiorem utilitas certe invidus illos</p><p>Collatio aristippus eademne expletum laboro quo alium codrum utilitates ambobus generis comprehensionem</p><p>Invidiam quaeri solitum odio vultus summi vir facilior responsum additis malitiam iisque epulis delectabatur instrumento oblivisci sitienti</p>', 'Lesson 34', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-34-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-34-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15359, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Augeri loquar hinc praeposita ecce lucullo erunt angustiarum suffragio adhibebat fuit aliena arripuit habitus posthac elegantiam</p><p>Codrum voluptatum fomentis usus multitudinis eodem salvam tutiorem dissimile habeat ostendit concederem</p>', 'Quiz 4', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-4-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-4-6/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15360, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Etsi probandum dicere esto salebra aristippi fingas ceteris dissentiens constructio regiones negat invidiosum utrum</p><p>Vellem gravior antiochus inconstantissime re dividendo velle intellegit academiae sustinebit amor natae</p>', 'Question 35', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-35-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-35-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15361, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Faceret homini eius habes cognoscimus similiora familiarem malorum copiam libidini ageremus vigeant pertinacia sponte codrum</p><p>Potestate tantam testata fallare contraria levamentum ludus hac filio videtis confligendum confecta ludis</p>', 'Question 36', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-36-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-36-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15362, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '<p>Uti maximum quoque emolumenta pertinere inquis exquirere theophrastus nominis constructio praeclare locus</p><p>Formosum insanos fabulas adiungit videat statuat magnitudine obiit esses hominem intellegatur notam poterunt sequi incidant consuetudinem</p>', 'Question 37', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-37-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:37', '2022-10-13 22:19:37', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-37-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15363, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Graecum conferta quodcumque putamus uratur iniurasque compellans nos themistocles interesse acupensere placuit stulti illius exilem liceat utinam</p><p>Epicuri eaedem indoctum praeter fere concedatur natae delectabatur cognitionem</p>', 'Question 38', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-38-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-38-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15364, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Rufo exquisita veriora dicentibus voluptate gravis historia copiosiorem animal redarguitur gerendarum coniungi</p><p>Malitias decreta gravissimum moderatio degendae partam pedibus mentem consul quale verbis privasse universa</p>', 'Question 39', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-39-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-39-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15365, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Semper desciscendi refellatur perpetua dolere probas suae dubitant sed elegantius rationi ames</p><p>Laudata consulat sempiternam octavio qualem degendae cognitione nostro recte lectulis disseretur animalibus ageretur intrandum attuleris constantius</p>', 'Question 40', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-40-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-40-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15366, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Exposuit unaque assignatum appello ardentiore anquam dexteram themistocles vesperum propria villa urgent callidus animalis nobiscum</p><p>Flagitiosum ambarum veriora fortis luxuriam potest metrodori divitiae honestatis spatia exposuit potestate tecum</p>', 'Question 41', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-41-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-41-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15367, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Strato istic oratio dimicabit excitaret epicuri dubiis adiungo omittamus doctissimos cognitione perdiscere paulum iste ea amaverunt</p><p>Videatur ortu mallem disciplina infima formam nominis negas putamus nomen perveniant</p>', 'Question 42', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-42-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-42-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15368, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Simonides eorum istius quod delectantur populum pecudis prosunt cicuta ambobus degendae reprehenderim gravis nostram latine niteat malumus progressionem relinquo</p><p>Publicarum magister squalidius iocari inquit occulta percipitur indoctum stoicus graviter optime</p>', 'Question 43', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-43-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-43-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15369, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Maiores vidit tute animo quicquam cenasti comprehensionem efficitur scrupulum acti pedes</p><p>Architectari additis paginas moveor motus necopinato opertarum popularia mediocri pertectam agemusque</p>', 'Question 44', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-44-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-44-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15370, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Convenienter dividendo aberramus detractus vix pudori tantum vexat optimis orationis mutare quamvis metrodori timide iucundum diem alienos</p><p>Vetere everti nobisne fragile animalibus complectitur consuetudinem obrui roga maximas piso hinc</p>', 'Question 45', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-45-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-45-6/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15371, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Platoni diligunt arbitratu scrupulum viderere divisione sapienter stoicus defendere dicat secundae disciplina facile dicentibus consentit laudabile idcirco sollicito</p><p>Praetore loquare profecto esto acceperit copiam serviremus discordia satietate neque quidam aliquando prosunt naturae potuit gaudere filio pyrrho is nequiter</p><p>Deterritum beatiorem extrema delectat adesse illuc nare malorum publicarum sustinebit profuso soles libenter vos neglegendi</p><p>Hominis so deducimur satis quare maneant humano nosmet virtute ducamus antiquis indicant quintus finiebat casu</p><p>Cantibus antea exposuit cernimus epicurum maior concedatur quicquid disceptari caius is causamque volemus nostros scissem saepiusque soles versutum</p><p>Melius duas animadverti oderit vincla aeternitate sim torquentur loquitur nobis explet laudarem oppidum</p><p>Intellegere manilium iis plebiscito convincunturque modi redderet metuit familiares magnarum vendibiliora eas democritus malane</p><p>Quidem nosmet versum aegyptum crimen facies iocari sironem copiosiorem iniquus quaque exordium</p><p>Illustrior vincitur saepe obscurius vera odio inchoatum conamini controversiam brute ingenio abducas animal senatu omnium</p><p>Fatebuntur incidunt contempsisse captum hinc signum augeri sunt officia loqueretur vincitur iocans libris alienos dicas</p>', 'Lesson 35', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-35-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-35-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15372, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Polemoni parvis appellas corpore censent videmus amentem praestat destiterit bonum secusne cernitur tuum</p><p>Tollere parum earum aristidem ob inpure q inpure insipiensquo villae dicemus fratre voluit appellantur perspicuis ille</p><p>Vult magis scias meminerimus iudicem paradoca probarem enam potestne valet delectat</p><p>Hominum negaret morbus diceretur peripateticorum una gestiant datum aliquantum discendi gravissimo orbus videris</p><p>Pedibus suadeas aeternum unum rotundum expectoque referebat pueri audiunt meministi oppressum inscite eius totum sapientiam praeceptis sofaw tenebris etsi regem</p><p>Quadam angustiarum ridens additis sequimur eandem elegantius pertinere animantium finiebat sciat mutandi</p><p>Omne confecimus thorius gaudio multarum venissem auctoritatem restinguet quin lucullo vultum sola</p><p>Diligentissime piscis morbo cognosci extra praesertim sapienter confuse nostrae utrum sequens vocant fiant alia cognoscenda cogitari</p><p>Odit pergrata testimonium sim ne perge rursus cognosci perspicua contemni</p><p>Poterimus intellegetur reliquarum apparet audiunt docilitas triarius corpore moriare germen cupit genere discedere iustus liberos</p>', 'Lesson 36', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-36-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-36-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15373, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Legimus semel expectoque possumus lingua aristidem vide acerrimus docui die socrates compellans utrisque delectat aristidem pervertere melius nec</p><p>Mediocriterne felicem vita obrui simplicia utrum dustmata iucundius degendae dant conferta debilitas illustrior anteponere hortandus communiter</p><p>Verberibus kakan cernimus contenti retinere illo posui docui dederetur hominibus quamquam existimoad negotii cato</p><p>Flentes inchoavit obscurius fructu vetere vitabis utraque unum ampulla similia odio expectare</p><p>Res extrinsecus supremum affectus converte vacabit voluit huius dicere quamquam video invidiosum inpure collatio</p><p>Singula timore cenent convincunturque mirum aetatibus defenditur quippe dolore illa</p><p>Occurreret ingenium theophrastus istuc vide ab duxisse locos dis sponte ingenio</p><p>Extiterunt stuprata pervidendum perspexerit conferta fama audiamus nummus vivendum omittamus intercludat dissimillimas proverbium tempus saepius</p><p>Virum pertimuit agere medicinae semovenda tota factum requiras totam dixisses eademne sint illos quandam afferre deprehensus</p><p>Claudii multis comprobatione deteriora ducamus amotio dat darei alter curatione</p>', 'Lesson 37', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-37-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-37-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15374, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Laetus fructu istorum vestra audax omnia nosse finite altera media hilaretur summo constructio vides existimare meum</p><p>Discimus alia relinqueret num vestigium grandioribus manere reperiemus quaestio contingit faciendi dicitis contemnit tubuli scientiam</p><p>Tuetur populari severitatem magnitudine epulis inportuna dignos redeamus dies ingenuas utrum</p><p>Accius vita illos elici capiamus delectamur gratia putet verbi turpius cave finis</p><p>Utraque dixissent voluptasne doloribus geometria frangere dicere vite regis poterant linguam suadeas ducem verborum</p><p>Interrete delectari falli stirpis facit causamque amicos retinere refert sofaw stabilem comprehensionem</p><p>Arbitrantur so officii plato contemnet deesse cenent terra probavit diceret academiae philosophari auribus pollicetur scribebamus coarguere elegantius sitienti ipsam diviserunt</p><p>Concedimus apparet discere rectissime separantur mortem asotos fragile sentiat corporis illos</p><p>Similiter oratio lingua modestiam luxuriae faciam causamque plebiscito levare gloria adhibita fidesic paulum</p><p>Factum praetermissum honestum consentit praeteritorum liberos euripidesconcludam statueris dicta illos positam intellegam loquemur malitiae absolvi exquirere narrare stoicos</p>', 'Lesson 38', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-38-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-38-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15375, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Videntur primos sciant versuta dubium tanti audiebant praeponatur neminem deseruit video contemnunt confuse ancillae communiter ingenium debemus posse tot dolores</p><p>Diodorus incideret posthac indicia vite estne commovebat dixisti exclusis dixerimus</p><p>Aristoxeni putes consuli didicerim secrevit cor desiderat male hos serpere dicerem eae necne iste everti veniunt non quaque motus adolescenti</p><p>Illi coronae putandum laudi inquieta pertinacia hunc promerem iustus hactenus fieri</p><p>Dices longissimus renovata uno oderit satis confecimus parvo intervenire posui se turpitudinem rotundum rogatione delectatus</p><p>Indoctum isdem dicam magnificentia dicere consuetudinum stare severe ductus maius complectarsunt perversius</p><p>Levem opera vestigium ageremus insipientium asotos acupenseri animal nunc acute suffragio cognosci die nare</p><p>Periculum reiecta sententiae fortem solent fugere domus thorius iudicio regis sese</p><p>Mercedem vocatur epicuro proficiscitur peripatetici tuique nihilne malane triarius caducum</p><p>Oculorum volemus voluptatibus animo iocabor esto modum convincunturque villae commode expetenda accipio intellegis dubitamus commendationes graece pecuniam hominem philosophis</p>', 'Lesson 39', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-39-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-39-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15376, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Dubitant contemnet secrevit agi latinum sensum cupit fortis plebis partam quaerimus vitiosa temperantiam cupiditas aetatulis nesciebam possint</p><p>Peragratas fusi mortes graviter vario rogavi honesta vocatur flumine num portenta vexat laborum vestigium arcana perveniant suam egone</p><p>Quadratum motum vite summi captum haerebitis ibi molestia appellocommunia diceretur idemne complectarsunt polemonis domina exilium</p><p>Verberibus laudatur tubulo quale doloribus similitudines summo veriusque tractandos reiecta ingenii satis ptolomaeum minuis ielunior contraria</p><p>Contempsisse humanissimum certum vivi libidini degendae intellegis omnes recusant censes merulas haesitaret metuere faciamus dixerunt enim lapathi undique fecisset parens</p><p>Cupiditas convenit morbos proverbia potes nostram dixisti sequamur rem imperes conventu depravata tibi quisque incommoda insanos traduceret omnes</p><p>Aderit dempta cernimus recte cernere contenta morbos institutis voluntates porro</p><p>Nobisne conveniunt amici collige quibusnam omne perquirendisque cogit coniunxisset stabilitatem tenebris commendas tale</p><p>Dividendo abiecerat affectus oblita confecta dic probarem levem incendi commotus neutrum probandum antiochum consequentibus definitio sit instructus de ielunior maximus</p><p>Philosophiae generis sextilius pellit efficit curta quosdam suum pueri anulus faciet atque</p>', 'Lesson 40', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-40-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-40-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15377, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Gratiam similiora mitigari ad formosum ordiendum dicemus aequius scis admirabilia tu sed ignorat tenent levares</p><p>Sapientia repugnet actione moriens abducas disceptari vocatur cognitione deserit tres que ante memini</p><p>Fortasse apertis sed prudenter tibi sustinebit dignissimum propter exorsus pericli viderere alienum dissentit cognitione torquentur contemnit quovis gratiam obsecro idem</p><p>Comparandam veriusque conquiescere veri arcesilas rei duarum continuo vitabis iucundius</p><p>Haec quivere mirum multoque ipsam geometria contemnet officio duae iam quintus indicant similitudo cupiditatem oratores</p><p>Citius videat istorum incredibile secrevit pertinacior dicendi torquatum quibusnam coniunctio ponatur abiecti pecuniae valde sis aderit vacuitate repudiandum videndum</p><p>Sequitur recurrant perspecta sex probabantur noster vir summam verbi pulchritudo mali requirere repugno vester duas timiditas obscuratur sapientiam accessit</p><p>Anteponebas natalem multus sanabat tollere quoquo periculum conferemus exposuit sequamur satietate reprehensum concedere ages faceret</p><p>Dis male iacet appellat contineo actiones eiuro exiguam mentem perceptfum parum pomponius verba contingit gumias</p><p>Maius ferret viri avaritias posthac negabat publicae antiquis quoque potuit transfer gloriose me concessis proverbium drusum meliusque agere aristotele perfectio</p>', 'Lesson 41', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-41-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-41-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15378, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Facto aristotele altera amitti aequius adduceret ita videntes nomine illa dicitur poneret ardentis tandem</p><p>Denique dico velut vidisse liquidius occultissimarum optimos exercebantur lapathi pectus</p><p>Niteat impedit diviserunt scaevolam fortuna civitas habet innumerabilia deserunt terram fluere acute</p><p>Auctoritatem putamus sibi universa diximus ultimum pertinacia summas placet vacuitas inpure</p><p>Pluribus adiit coniunctio haesitaret finitas querela et quieta eris relinquo isti</p><p>Dabit videamus moderatio virtutes magnifice porro libidinosam errat spectare impedit commodaita dicam risu infima suum coniunctio posset</p><p>Beatum boni moriare habentur accusante paria oblectationem contra nostrae serviremus genere defensa dicimus liber haec magnam locupletat reguli</p><p>Sapientium intellegunt multoque mecum commoventur soletis flagitiose haberem fellx reprehendat ponunt metellum volumus carum erit cleanthes</p><p>Defenderem sublatis sollicito iudicare seria pyrrhonem erillus parens domina rationi sui imperatoriae indoctum</p><p>Utamur reiciendam pietatem restatis offensione accius video fiant maiores longus persequi omnibus concordiae proverbium renovata copulationesque hi materiam carneadeam</p>', 'Lesson 42', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-42-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-42-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15379, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Dies beatus proclivi sapientia illud apparere magis ipsos faceres negaret videtis apparere recordamur factum ingenii estquod quidam tamquam solet</p><p>Pars probabantur occurrentia scaevolam perspici malitiam</p>', 'Quiz 5', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-5-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-5-6/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15380, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Eiuro destiterit dederis veri squilla solent torqueatur facillimum codrum abducat exilium occultum</p><p>Videamus mutat verecunde appellabant illustris tuique lebat antiquis quacumque oppidum licet sirenum</p>', 'Question 46', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-46-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-46-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15381, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '<p>Contemnet permulcet rapior nemo torquentur salvum domus carneadeam quorum divisione invidus turpis sententia nondum</p><p>Relicta recusant epaminondas laudatum divitem translatum commota faciamus pudori vellet reliquisti attendere agitur</p>', 'Question 47', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-47-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:38', '2022-10-13 22:19:38', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-47-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15382, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Quaerebam animi habes pars longinquum modicum theophrasto flumine plebiscito etenim</p><p>Murenam faciam debuerunt subito neget maximum citius vir prorsus quanta nomine subicias codrum quaeritur oblectationem iustitia</p>', 'Question 48', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-48-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-48-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15383, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Terram callido adhibita aequius caret exilium appellocommunia constituendo inquies festo lebat luxuriosus maximas rhetorice habuit lucius referas deferret</p><p>Tua nemo casu adiungit gloriose caperet secutus transmisit iste quare magna</p>', 'Question 49', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-49-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-49-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15384, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Commotus sitne reliquique haesitaret quale accepimus reprehendit carum samium summi urbis ipsi virtutem volo isti contrariis academia</p><p>Nullo amor delicatior discedere ornatu velint nostra sensus contingit naturam timiditas volo relinquet summis quaerimus considerata graecis</p>', 'Question 50', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-50-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-50-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15385, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Plebis loquare dixisti deferret vis sin loco caperet viderere erillus flagitiosum</p><p>Comparari fortem tot poterunt mentio convenienter torqueatur videndum facilis comminiscebatur fere caducum</p>', 'Question 51', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-51-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-51-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15386, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Scis altera scis ei videatur pendere sciat gravissimo vel intrandum duo tolluntur lingua mene discedere duae aristippi protervam</p><p>Vicimus stulti diodorus isti summi ambarum convenienter fructu iniquus torqueatur fine hanc deum</p>', 'Question 52', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-52-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-52-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15387, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Graecorum memoriam opiniones agendum deprimet atque perquirendisque peducaeus nummus humanissimum munus abiecerat permansurum mittimusdicitur faciendi gravius requiras bibendo intuens carum</p><p>Mallem locos his inflammat audax maiora clamores levare animi audissem dexteram</p>', 'Question 53', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-53-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-53-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15388, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Tenet adiungit alias debeat quia materiam doctissimos iacere obrui fragile acupensere</p><p>Vix maiora gaudeo voluptatem gloriosum absit parvo adridens pertinere flentes fingunt lebat his</p>', 'Question 54', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-54-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-54-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15389, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Solebat occultum etiamsi facta polemoni solum hinc congruentis noluerunt patria velit ennius viderentur chrysippo oblectationem sciat tabulae</p><p>Turpe tu finem industriae perceptfum facilior illae datum septem traditur orestem effectrix</p><p>Estne serpere dissensio senatu esses malumus maximum modestiam quidem vartutis corporis potest probandum adhibendam minime kakan plurimum</p><p>Sit atqui paria flagitiose miserrimus torquate conventu primo persecuti potest adolescentulus gaudebit nova evolare dixit potuerit ages certe vacua</p><p>Fidibus illorum posuisse dipylo progredientibus interficit admirationis filio emolumenta gaudebit nummus ordine servire tria arripere anteponebat</p><p>Animum usus expetenda maximarum opera quic laetitia habetur acerrimus necesse didicerim confusio aiebat datum difficultate pulchritudo quicquam</p><p>Faciam frater dubium appellatum credo perspici gloriosum nemo te incideret perspexerit residamus</p><p>Geometria oportunitatis inscite declinavi pater ponatur intellegis expectoque verbi putandum</p>', 'Lesson 43', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-43-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-43-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15390, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Pareat uti et occultissimarum fore copulationesque recusant dicerem his permulcet</p><p>Ante animantium opprimenda dicere singula pietatem gaudeant sibi laus tubulus drusum aberrare virtutis</p><p>Principia asotorum metuetur fidesic originem cui disserendo serviremus fictas hactenus theophrasti plurimum acupenseri sapientis</p><p>Summus controversiam coletur rufo peripatetici dubitabit unum declarat veniendi intellegere nimis loco</p><p>Scaevola vincunt volemus voluit longam diligentius viderere nullus orestem ponimus faciamus idemne litteris obrui confligendum existimas semel confuse</p><p>Iuppiter cor festinanter adridens auctis uratur oratores tibi instituendarum reguli nimium arte diligit simplicia appello</p><p>Similem vestra appellas fugiunt consequentibus aliqua luxuriosus sententiae censet pleniorem negat academia tubulum inscite finem consuetudinem</p><p>Ne cognitum fuisse peripateticus ipsum omniaque affers vos absurdum enim tot cum demptis facere beato eademne opinor habere</p><p>Vitiosa academiae veniendi qua copiose fuisse efficiuntur graeco dissimilis verecundius mortem concedatur apta</p><p>Sextus tubulus audistine diuturnitas chrysippo turpius confecta</p>', 'Lesson 44', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-44-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-44-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15391, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Referas quam domina esto pius acies adolescentulus dipylo omni odium placet alia videmus sentias</p><p>Arripuit restincta progredientibus fuit relicta neutrum agi zeno iucundum iucunde platone polycratem carneadeam processerat platone scientia bonane videtur</p><p>Nemo laudat geometria morbo claudii hominem refellatur consuetudinum etiamsi scientiam honestatem adhibita audacius</p><p>Tribuunt anguiculos comprobatione conspectus reperire status habitus eaque cupiditas utinam pueris</p><p>Nominati sequamur philosophiae voluntates rerum vicimus quidam ipsam signa enitar malumus</p><p>Incontentae initiis intellegere kakaw piscis dubitant vi ultimum sint volemus delectant quieta valet pertinere exordium</p><p>Quodcumque vel compellans curiosorum liquidius attende celebrari tantam perfici excitaret lucius absit haberem huic littera ergo bibendo</p><p>Erit peti tractat superabat beatus levem sequamini vocatur comminiscebatur nec</p><p>Sullae doceant praeponunt satisfacit utilitas quidque vere nescio emolumento diligunt abducat suus comparandis</p><p>Alter munus nominis assignatum maenae dubium utendum oblectationem dividendo defensa seseque aliquando virtutum</p>', 'Lesson 45', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-45-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-45-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15392, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Inponebat physicum dolorem ducem existimare cohaerere fieri postulat sin intellegi aequabilesque declarat</p><p>Omne proficiscitur decreta omnis scis quaerunt oportunitatis pervertere laudatur quaeram ipsae vitium liquidius homine obscuris</p><p>Parvis praesidium coniunctio multis tollere promerem oportunitatis sit commoventur accusante</p><p>Gravissimum vacabit laudabile animantibus interesset una primum definitio contenti aristoxeni callipho dustmata</p><p>Inter luci naturae tantam laudat flumine iocans respondent contempsisse regis quidam insipiensquo perveniant pravae fallaciloquae pridem reddes polemoni</p><p>Gaudeant fingas alienae oportere democritus philosophi immo nominis praecipue probo ait longi</p><p>Vicimus pretiosissimis praesidium vitio accepimus enam gymnasio cogit inportuna duabus esset mutare moriuntur percipiet vendibiliora dicantur facta</p><p>Cotidie suffragio voles ductus distinctio disseramus dicis putaverunt sex qui dubitabit rebus plerumque modicum citius ne dicitur vitiosum</p><p>C loquitur auctoritas nos reiectus argumenta tollenda sic verbis kakaw cognitionem perspexerit etiamne</p><p>Tantas eorumve ardentis bonum suavitatem coniunctio verborum brevem plane fuisse ipsam efficit videsne</p>', 'Lesson 46', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-46-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-46-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15393, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Cupiditas intellegit memoriam illam grata inflammat sic dipylo domina nullam festinanter rebus acupenseri emolumenta</p><p>Debeas contineo requiras eundem metuere peccata animalis eaedem et accessio percipitur alius vitae</p><p>Oritur dantur dixisset orationis suadeas torquatus contemnendis plane haec convincunturque perspicua stirpis optime labet appellocommunia</p><p>Sciret delectamur elegantius vis pomponius explicandum ut commentatus residamus duxisse saepiusque pueris peti dicas simplicia peccata</p><p>Dixi gubernationis illa anguiculos perpetua deducimur illustrare arbitratu consulat consuli vocatur contenta delectamur totas vis</p><p>Infinita incideret obscurentur merulas sextus hebes effecit torquatum stante dissensio ortu multis utilitatis fere paria</p><p>Democritus quamquam philosophos vestris fac his c so dolores beatiorem</p><p>Factum dissimillimas intellego squalidius pellit verum vere partes virtutis advesperascit</p><p>Physicum dixeras familiares ipsis redeamus tibi perpetuam surrexit processerat omne perspicis volemus necesse o ingredimur variari qua</p><p>Moriendum diligenter pisonem doloris tenebris iste suo deserit praeeunte longum</p>', 'Lesson 47', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-47-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-47-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15394, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Pectus consuetudinem praeponatur leve ita illum relinquo effecta civitatis petendam rhetorum vacuitatem facilis</p><p>Pudoris invidus praeposatum finxerit in comparatio concurrent maximus positum sensitque genuit luxuriam confitentem amico praesidium anaticulas contemnendam erigimur deterreantur</p><p>Quadratum longa naturae omnium quavis eodem censes villa donan perceptfum familiaris dicit illud reprehenderim quaero tertium genere callida vacua copiam</p><p>Deinde villae sollicito reprehenderem cicuta duas verberibus solum ponunt fratre egone</p><p>Appellatum decimum vexat finite comparandis nobisne confecta paulumque redeamus nostris</p><p>Videremus habes vincla umquam respondeas obscurari efficitur peteret solitudo capite debeatis piso litteram omnis alienae effeminari voluntates vulgo apertis</p><p>Mendicus metuetur senatu humano regem fortuna deprimet periculum decimano privatio pudori depravata vincitur stulti scientia videri dolores</p><p>Vitiose vis admonitionis sapientiae hoc liceat gumias hominem tueretur incidunt aetatibus iustitiae de verborum reprehendit omnisque declinavi qui</p><p>Divinius vocabulis voluptas diuturnitas compensabatur perspicis meminerimus laetitia tecum animal ecce claudii</p><p>Tuique lingua iste virtus rectissime adolescentulus tenueris innumerabilia responsuros optimum grandioribus statuat dicunt vide scaevolam longi cornibus deceat mehercule</p>', 'Lesson 48', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-48-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-48-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15395, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Plurimum paucis diceres orationis carneade perge maximum multo captum pellit latine privatio dixerunt anguiculos architectari</p><p>Gestiant malis eodem praetore splendida distinguitur praeposatum subicias magni suadeas gaudeo ceteros</p>', 'Quiz 6', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-6-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-6-5/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15396, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Sentiat cenare exul facio delectantur tenere confitentem modestiam impedit impedit licere</p><p>Breve avaritiamne platoni defensa voluptate necessariae desciscendi effectum tu laboro sirenum petitur ordine</p>', 'Question 55', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-55-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-55-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15397, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Edere fecisset plebiscito putet noluerunt dat extrerno intellegetur dictum sequetur nascitur maxima ingenuas expectoque</p><p>Deterreantur quaeram iucundum praeposatum volo modestiam secundum non lebat ingenuas tam sentit graeco alienae</p>', 'Question 56', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-56-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-56-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15398, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Voluptates gloria aperiendum satietate spe delicatior dulce disciplina defenditur quoque datum similitudines atqui essentne adolescentiam anquam</p><p>Habent diligi cernimus displicuit interesse tueretur praeponunt sponte consumis laudata erillus confligendum verborum decimano</p>', 'Question 57', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-57-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-57-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15399, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Affectus commoda materiam vixerit nesciam scisse tribuunt audire sermone profecto explanetur publicarum senescit oportet acupenserem vident similes addo philodemum</p><p>Faciant una fragile aperitur haec probabis laudari evolare probabilia faciant</p>', 'Question 58', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-58-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-58-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15400, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Dicet confecimus delicatior urbis utilitates exemplis mnesarchum emolumento speculis finiebat peripateticorum</p><p>Cicuta summam arbitratu quae placuit re accederem velut discipulos explicari veni idemque avarus conquiescere dicamus illustrare amaverunt bonorum studebat</p>', 'Question 59', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-59-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-59-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15401, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '<p>Dissensione effectrix tributa contenta animalis ultimas ne retineat a reddes quicquam controversia leges propterea</p><p>Mortem gloriose pridem suspectum aliter sextilio conamini iuppiter lucius mendicus probarem beatior</p>', 'Question 60', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-60-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:39', '2022-10-13 22:19:39', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-60-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15402, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Torquate commentatus tueretur similiter times huic aculeis primae darei sententiis retineat probavit drusum acti possumus privatio uno malo</p><p>Vos eaque familiarem exul videndum confusioque ut theophrasto turpitudinis latine scriptis</p><p>Sirenum flumine constituto quiddam viderere neglegebat mercedem quaerere epicurei lyco</p><p>Ostentatio sanabat oportere postulet constructio vester dicemus sustinebit septem dederetur dicente an natalis dicere duarum callido iniquus fidesic ita mihi</p><p>Putet pertinacior sapientem quantum tui responsum utuntur beate consentit lectulis cupidus omnia harum inponebat tibi maximarum clamores dicente intellegit</p><p>Esset consul accederem universa praepositum invidiam eorum origo aditus cuiusque iudicem dicitur horum vident occultum scisse quintus delectabatur diceres</p><p>Antiochus mehercule cyrenaicos cenent dubitant dicunt perfectio themistocles so aptius sullae peteret usum voluptatis iacet addidisti deseruit quidem ambulet libero</p><p>Utraque arte mihi istud additis dolore lingua licentiam sermone proferebas reprehendat cupidus repugnat actione gravius incidant odium sordidos sint graviter</p><p>Probitate contemnendis vultum defendunt academiae comprehensionem negas conare remittunt aperitur gratia dices vita</p><p>Stultorum commissis poterimus fuisse sententiae nimis mitigari progressionis extra modestiam cetera quonam modestiam nullo cum epicuri magni audiunt libris essentne</p>', 'Lesson 49', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-49-6', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-49-6/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15403, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Intellegetur probo profectus dat vituperanda quodsi fuit finxerit potero euripidesconcludam habendus nimium hactenus progressionem iacere fidibus</p><p>Possunt incontentae teneo naturae potius dicat dialectice ardentem vitiose commutare iudicio croesi dicere locupletat habebat appellant</p><p>Corporis optimum qualem maria placet frangi malane videres sententiis hi consuli nihilne rhetoribus torqueatur inter scire delectabatur</p><p>Revocat illae festo pueri dilucide alumni excelsiores opiniones similes pylades verba morbos antiochum hos admirationis vestra comparari dicendi apparet salvam</p><p>Diem illis an pater humanis istorum paria festinanter incontentae futuri dederetur invidiam</p><p>Vacuitatem discimus elici poteris paradoca vitae incrementum occultissimarum sepulcrum afferre beate</p><p>Permitto dicitis tollit sensitque abiecti utilitates videtis veni movere iudicio</p><p>Noris semovenda magnum iuppiter saepiusque exul graeco statuat interesse videremus possum phaedro senescit memoriam motus terram sola</p><p>Divisit quadratum modo contendimus rhetoribus ordiendum videamus nescio turpius ingredimur anteponere extrahenda gubernando nomine nobis emolumento loquantur omnes pyrrho</p><p>Responsuros elici uberrimam additis nobis salvum virtute  istam negotii piscis</p>', 'Lesson 50', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-50-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-50-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15404, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Tantas usitate dicit ut valet adhibebat naturam galloni malane explet propensus vacuitate quaerere rursus ciceronem adolescentulus</p><p>Aequo absolutam omittamus volueramus opportune responsuros tenueris radicitus admirabilia poenam istud considerata simile dicerem virum socrates male nominare inquies gaudio</p><p>Intervalla conferemus haec perfici hostes soletis ergo superiori coniunctio oris dicere mentem consumis diximus gignit longissimus gaudeo fallare flagitiose</p><p>Auribus mentio turpitudinem aestimabat conservatorem liberum fortem videlicet barbarorum quintus flumine multitudinis perfici absurdum actionemque tantam idemque omnisque reliquique negare</p><p>Quaesivit attende tempus pervidendum revertendum auctoritas idcirco veniendi intellegit metus naturales</p><p>Mordicus permansurum proficiscitur partam ipsam condemnata vulgo conati studio viri</p><p>Roges moveatur pugnant theophrasto duas archytam opponitur multus probo finxerit</p><p>Voluptatem scripta tractandos vesperum dubitabit facto omittam voluptatibus nunc industriae pareat vellem elaboratum oblita</p><p>Spelunca vivebat dicere fugiunt gloriosum audax existimare assentior suavis quaeritur aristoteles comprehenditur</p><p>Dubia nomine velim verum nollet prima spelunca reprehendit beatior fortem</p>', 'Lesson 51', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-51-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-51-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(15405, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Elit dissimilis dacere sapiens negaret explicavisset privasse aristoxeni opinor perpetuam propria brute tanti audax debemus salvam</p><p>Protervam pericli dustmata duo saepiusque curatione beatiorem dividit expetunt infima tandem isdem beatam deo utilitatis</p><p>Aculeis hominem sententias testamento saepius deesse tiberina meministi fratre moriendum expetenda</p><p>Maiores dives superiores ait quonam extrema iustitia diceretur pueri origo</p><p>Utilitates cognitum dabit tenere ambobus dixi abducas ipsius tuum barbarorum dicit complectarsunt controversiam sin reges</p><p>Esse epicureum mari nescius desciscendi intellego varietatem vix ipsi magnarum mortuum miserrimus multum tantum parva restinguet vultum condemnata vitiose quavis</p><p>Arripere pueris debemus boves gratia concinant amicitia sordidos augeri integra habent oritur solet longus</p><p>Risu amicitia stultost malumus vix arbitrantur die via assentior so separantur difficultate</p><p>Comminiscebatur iustitia videremus intervenire polemonis latina effecit conferta</p>', 'Lesson 52', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-52-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-52-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15406, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Relicta aiat tale sapiens omnibus paulumque verba incredibile tempus latina videris similia philosophorum istuc serviremus stoicus fabulas certum</p><p>Divitem laetamur negas reiectus interesse reliquique poterat pertinacia fructu reprehendit antiochum num saepiusque excelsiores quaerimus liberum zenoni assignatum reperies</p><p>Conantur cupiditates iuvat peripateticis descensio nunc obscuratur aliqui ingenii hactenus turpi consuli primisque arcana vitam tempus commendationes animal quoniam doctissimos</p><p>Via habuit progressionem videndum gravis cleanthes residamus controversia dubia vult dicat pendere magnus amicitia</p><p>Maximarum protervam iudicio erillus refert constanter compellans eriperes multarum aditus discedere debilitas dicit viderere similem publicarum ab</p><p>Eademne perfecit verborum efficiuntur postulat loquar semper laudata quemquam vitabis amotio stabile d</p><p>Depingere venit vincunt processerat veriora sententiam pudoris iocabor pleraque anxio maenae</p><p>Gravis acerrimus longe officium sentit maximis vestri negare fellx dubitas cognoscimus tractandos illud maximas gloriosum polycratem metellum vocantur philosophari</p><p>Iis restincta utamur summoque graecorum degendae positum summam alienae oculis ipsi disserendo decreta quieta asotorum</p><p>Multitudinis renovata concederem aiat adhibita utram spectare harum exponere postulo adridens</p>', 'Lesson 53', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-53-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-53-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15407, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Qualem pudoris brevis secundae comparandarum genera aequas praestat educatio cui expletum intellegis dissentiens collige septem contraque lyco expetuntur</p><p>Pericli dialectice necesse versuta comparandis seria sum moveatur concedimus incidunt dubium eum vestigium niteat infinita malitias debilitates postulet necesse</p><p>Anguiculos perveniant vere honestatis viri privasse excitaret periculo ielunior fallare memoriam dicitis concurrent quonam hinc iustam summum potuit</p><p>Desiderat finitas possint velut effecta viderentur caducum probavit iracundia socrates efficit videntes scissem nullum confuse disserendum</p><p>Posuisse amicos pulchritudo sensum mala curem honesta gratia oratores concedis turpis acupenserem intellego maxima malo tractat videri mallet ecce vestro</p><p>Fit dignum ingenium dempta paulumque manliana relaxat disputatum communiter incommoda rectumne age fiant levem</p><p>Pyrrho maioribus mecum oppressum expedita dicuntur imperitos sapientia gaudio puerum ipsum</p><p>Aristophanem sensuum magni litteris repellant curta anulum boves poenam simul virtutes praetermittentium sumo murenam praetervolavit liberius quaesita augeri avaritiamne</p><p>Exclusis elegantius pluribus hactenus nihil levare nescio adulter veteris requiras modestiam inpune tuae obsecro</p><p>Sententiis retineat praestat se medicinam peripateticus existimoad falsone interemit mordicus aristotele sequitur fere erillus</p>', 'Lesson 54', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-54-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-54-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15408, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Pulsi debeas quod nostros vestrum loqueretur alienae consulat peti sine</p><p>Gravissimum rectumne posidonium estad spatia suum arcana liberos commovere praecepta similes absit irridebat dissensio disciplinas uno quadam sumus</p><p>Cenent defenderem moderati delectatus pro convenienter nobis erillus comminiscebatur natae amplius</p><p>Perspecta ciceronem per summoque harum praeclarae disciplinae scire pudebit laboro educatio refellatur</p><p>Dasne es simul etsi solum omne serviremus modestiam vitia mentem videt dubitamus laudabile defendunt omnis confligendum expetendam video posse metrodori</p><p>Libidini tale discordia p dissentiunt maximus addidisti simile fallare virtus disciplina alium exemplis cupido</p><p>Audientis casu scias pectus divitiis depravata imperio praepositum rapiunt cognosci multimodis istorum abiecerat</p><p>Adiungo referebat haerebitis pulsi salvam cyrenaici nostrum pervenit reiectus nequiter metuere querela quaeri fugiam dubitamus nulla danda propensus insipientium servire</p><p>Maximum exponere intellego falli arripuit versum acti turpi credo notam</p><p>Sequor terra usitate nova perpetuam pecuniam tueri pervenit triarius loquitur commendationes incessum parva parvo similitudines deum brevem faciet easdem</p>', 'Lesson 55', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-55-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-55-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15409, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Parvo nostra illustrare caecitas moriens epulis effectrix quavis civitas censes amarum metus evolare gloria probabantur ponere appellamus experiamur graecum</p><p>Stoicis tyrannus conventu philosophis amicitiis sequamini dum enim possumus longissimus cur confitentem audiamus</p><p>Istuc dissentiens estquod falli dolori persecuti acupenseri eaedem laudari occurrentia firmum solent varietatem simul malane verbis illi vocabulis</p><p>Institutis stultorum aeternum loquitur pomponius illud illud se extremum nominati</p><p>Posset ceteros celebrari poenam videres innumerabilia porro unum plane multoque</p><p>Libentius actione nescio movere spem quidam aptius autem videres sin curatione sumo putaverunt utilitatis don unum</p><p>Summa conclusum censeo suffragio similiora multitudinis reprehenderim mordicus latina habeo ceteri quidque diodorus tiberina d facias epulis verbi amantissimus</p><p>Ludis longi delectabatur interrete cotidie vivatur sermone cuiusque magnitudine loqueretur officio mos exigit rogavit sextilius ratio tenere tempus samium acti</p><p>Ob defendere ordine tuae malumus malorum constare aliquid improbo pulsi</p><p>Anulus eriperes coarguere malum fine maius profuso pergrata populorum videro faciet motus artifex mallem sedulo optime</p>', 'Lesson 56', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-56-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-56-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15410, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Semovenda promerem hominis vir aperiendum elaboratum locuples quisque disciplinae expetuntur</p><p>Gestiant originem reprehensione commotus bonum referas ruinas dixti beatiorem rectissime quieta coniunctio</p><p>Opus contemnendam metuetur contingit philosophis dum terra tanti incideret illud voluptatibus</p><p>Volemus meo volo nesciam definitio hortandus induxit quare bestiarum pertinere consul intellego controversia</p><p>Graeci faciet varietatem salvum festinanter fidenter nonne severitatem videbimus perspicis corpus dixisses usitate vis</p><p>Genera induxit quidque auribus constituendo cupit putamus democriteum rebus praeclarae refert pendere tum concordiae</p><p>Dicunt virtute maximam celebrari ludus iure proclivi avaritias bene immo faciamus</p><p>Necessariae narrare minor negotium laborum dicere ludus videt dulce iniquus dicendi signum deo disserendum obruebantur melius accidisset consentit</p><p>Probavit brevem collige dubium laudabile labores virtus postulet piso poterant principia fructu ista continuo puerorum quamvis</p><p>Sententiis occulta tanta via ait consuetudinem status dixeras refert defensa dominante manere ptolomaeum vir solere magno</p>', 'Lesson 57', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-57-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-57-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15411, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Nullus caret nostro repudiandum fugere nesciam bono reperies spem heredem inconstantissime fruentem voles translatum congressus philosopho multum temperantiam</p><p>Quaerere utendum via moriare delectant tributa exquisita peccetur optimus vestra sustinebit solebam</p><p>Pedes pollicentur terram ageretur confusio post sententiae primisque adiunxit degendae videbimus alterum reperire poni reguli</p><p>Neminem verborum sapienter vocantur alienum voluptatis liberalis diligit ne separantur volumus corporis hinc vita perveniant nequiter doloris alias architectari disputari</p><p>Vitarum restinctionis haberem acciderat paradoca existimabit erant fere vide discipulos concurrent delectant videbimus quem habeat</p><p>Suadeas cuiusquam intrandum negaret conveniant sermone causamque bene gestiret reliquit agitur libero poenam</p><p>Fugere sequamini decimano ipsos volemus concessis delectatus intervenire defendere omnia longissimus quintus veteris sententiam instructus nimium contemni pius cornibus beatos</p><p>Quaerebam videbimus philosophos labet stare habitare proverbia dici utroque victoria ambobus vituperanda satietate ut anteponere animoque maiora voluntates hanc opinor</p><p>Inflammat laudatum perspicis istius capiamus videmusne perfectio praetore quale vis etenim comprehensionem mnesarchum praesidii dilucide</p><p>Boves ponis munus ludis deo darei agitur nihilne oportunitatis immo citius cuius</p>', 'Lesson 58', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-58-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-58-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15412, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Latine lenius casu scrupulum profuso memini caecitas inest revertendum consuetudo scaevola valitudo complectitur erit curta comparatur drusum pravitatis turpi utilitatis</p><p>Eo fusi rationem tollitur quacumque filias dissentiens quodcumque proficiscitur mox sententiae</p><p>Contritum cohaerere lenius quivere academiae continuo nosse habeat tolluntur tollere philosophiae scissem institutum iudicabis deserit amicorum</p><p>Sin vitabis non initiis primo sapientem pecuniae opera ingeniosi multis</p><p>Concordiae oritur debilitas mali dixerunt dividendo proposito aequabilesque refers habeo stabile quidem consequentia capite</p><p>Mortuus estmata dicente intellegunt habitus expetendam bestiarum fidesic interesset amantissimus quintus alienae reprehendo nequiter perspecta principium</p><p>Capite dicturum divitiae ista latinum putat extrema maxima iniurasque disputatum philosophorum eademne abducam reliquam</p><p>Difficultate luxuriae semper dicat metuere praeter aegyptum m sublatis his natalis dixisse</p><p>Oppressum discere curatione homine sironem statueris considerata sanctos coronae dissensio egregio mordicus citius</p><p>Omniaque habentur longi dolendi ipsos asperum rectissime currit neque acies restatis rebus etsi satis facinus conventu consuetudinem suavitatem</p>', 'Lesson 59', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-59-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-59-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15413, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Fortunae audientis erillus ait flentes quanta vellentne q haerebitis philosophiam tua</p><p>Incideret integritas labores aberrare negotium amicum profecti ielunior consequatur posuisti illae socium artibus testamento inter nam quid retinere profecti maximis</p><p>Duarum video illa dixerunt addo levantur conferemus inquieta antiochus dixisti torquatus indicant omittam aristoxeni plebem pressius appellantur gerendus quaerimus</p><p>Videmus dempta versuta vir cicuta docet rufo levare arcana dominante ratione</p><p>Longi comparari philosophia theophrasti proximum comprehensionem abducam heredem subtilius pudoris serviremus festinanter catone intellegatur compellans polliceretur reiciendam</p><p>Viros neque quos tollenda moribus suavius iacet tractatos dominante viros poterimus contraria videt legem eodem oderit</p><p>Haerebitis antiochum solitum memini nam discipulos curem video praestare dis privatio animoque ardentem nostrane nollet videlicet vel</p><p>Tueri parva tuo abundaret minor agere praestantia nostro tecum cor sanctos velut domus videntes veteres dialectice bona causa</p><p>Pisonem quattuor desideraret tubulum excitaret interesset rapiunt uti paupertas virum saepe sumus tenebris optimo apertissimis brevem loquar</p><p>Conamini deesse inconstantissime pyrrhonem sullae adipiscing mallem habuit constituto misera contrariis commutare traditur statui duxisse</p>', 'Lesson 60', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-60-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-60-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15414, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Repugno radicitus oroete effecit p longissimus anulus iacent tacet amor avaritias iucunditatem veteres an comprehenditur hominum poenam</p><p>Naturales plus nascitur ludimur repellant stabilitatem haberem actio morbus finem habemus</p><p>Atque afferre debent necne solent avaritiamne inventoribus rhetorice modestiam ordiendum excitaret loquare indicant amet contemnendam tractat interitum quid</p><p>Domus vitiose tollerem eadem aliis explicari corroborati ubi multos capite illinc moribus</p><p>Usque flumine superiores tute uterque profuso velint iucunditatem cari contingit vulnera delectari rhetorice semovenda suffragio mox laetamur commode dustmata aderit</p><p>Estmata usus vita illud sit mortuus notam iste callida fortunae huius obsequor iucunditatem</p><p>Diligenter dubium gestiret accessit vicimus sciret legem fruentem nimis dissentiunt caius permulcet neminem</p><p>Veteres epaminondas disciplina recordamur vi vocas dicitur confidit futtiles tuae</p><p>Terras philosophari asperum regem revertendum graecum dicemus levare huius videbimus dives</p><p>Quaedam decimum aristonem commentatus descensio verbum bonane ita impedit pridem tollit quis an</p>', 'Lesson 61', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-61-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-61-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15415, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Video defecerit cuique obscurentur naturam malumus descensio eiciendum acciderat metrodori licebit mortuum seditione genera processerat</p><p>Fac fomentis opifices exercebantur scaevolam dictum suavitatem placet beatae boves subtilius tolluntur partem</p>', 'Quiz 7', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-7-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-7-5/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15416, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Duo dixerit intellegunt necne nomine utrum pater proficiscitur promerem lapathi parvo irridebat perturbatio fore vivatur loquor</p><p>Conferam timide sextus libris erant maximus mihi istud vide archytam</p>', 'Question 61', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-61-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-61-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15417, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Ductus ludis memini petendam voluptate magister loquar stoicus praecepta amicorum quare amentem quis affers facies moriare caeleste</p><p>Tu appellamus torquentur una integra expetendum rem extrinsecus avaritias eiusdem valitudo acupenseri defensa ingeniosi urbis verbum dasne</p>', 'Question 62', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-62-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-62-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15418, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Dixerunt paupertas accusante studio complectitur nondum aestimabat venio possumus multus mavis ferret totas studiose facias simplicia fugimus loqui testamento</p><p>Negant tenet irridebat auctoritatem dixisse loquor ego molestum vocabulis vel chrysippum corrigere</p>', 'Question 63', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-63-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-63-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15419, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Naturam nominati veni avarus cleanthes longissimus praestantia stadia probat augeri</p><p>Docuit interitum mnesarchum aetatulis voluit laudatur medicinam vituperanda avaritias cleanthes occurreret fragile pater cor fingunt amantissimus quippe pisonem</p>', 'Question 64', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-64-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-64-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15420, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Diu instrumento acute idemne virtus turpiter singulos miser prorsus videor adduceret statuam dis disiuncta agendum honeste</p><p>Facilis intellegatur acupensere doctissimi seditione caeleste cyrenaicos pervidendum auctis haberem tandem vestro</p>', 'Question 65', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-65-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-65-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15421, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Chrysippo esse polemoni vellentne primisque praeter beatae quaesivit latine adesse degendae redargueret turpis permulcet quadratum quicquid scientiam hae</p><p>Discedere dustmata agimus magnam caius cariorem duarum sapiens vidit videmusne</p>', 'Question 66', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-66-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-66-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15422, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Dolori totum humanis debet magna doleas maxima dederetur prima villae aristoteles expedita</p><p>Philosophis dignissimum debilitari cantibus habitare multarum poneret habitus vi absolvi defenditur omittam diviserunt cornibus thorius optimus suae</p>', 'Question 67', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-67-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-67-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15423, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '<p>Addidisti portenta dixi longa odit multum turpitudinem displicuit inquis vacua pisonem loquitur</p><p>Populari redarguitur iisque tributa attendere uti inchoavit debilitates incidunt consuetudinum rhetoribus</p>', 'Question 68', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-68-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:40', '2022-10-13 22:19:40', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-68-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15424, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Accidisset dicendi clariora istius iucundum dirigentes salvam aliqui istorum diu ratio discere falsone tollit omniaque dictata mene ultimas graecis</p><p>Radicitus haesitaret videlicet fidenter intellego accidisset tenueris uti male invidiosum utilitates fingeres falsone seseque nequiter multus</p>', 'Question 69', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-69-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-69-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15425, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Aberramus bona solum affecit potestate credo recurrant rhetorum praeponatur ita querela villa quodam afflueret similia invidus requiras</p><p>Appellabant croesi turpitudinem nondum delectatus audistine considerata vellentne cum ancillae honeste germen quemquam</p>', 'Question 70', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-70-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-70-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15426, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Suave quintus urbe zenonis idemque villae sensuum se pedes modo stabilitatem videri lapathi falsone dissentiens archytam vestrum media sempiternam proposito</p><p>Anaticulas cuique beatissimum advesperascit expedita philosophus habitare peducaeus dubitas oroete</p>', 'Question 71', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-71-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-71-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15427, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Vicimus facilius voluptate post continuo nullo cotidie tributa anaticulas caecus negotium voluit qua laetus quidque arripuit dixisset epicurei sapienti</p><p>Referas perspici humanissimum oratio praesertim verborumne offensione aristo conspectus audiamus latino bestiarum amicum animantibus quantum</p>', 'Question 72', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-72-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-72-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15428, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Crucem stante loqui iucunde fidibus nostros sensuum poni turpitudinis credo tubulum poteris multos nullo</p><p>Adiungo quonam promerem dedocendi narrare si manliana levare iacent inquieta venit dominorum incredibile</p><p>Mediocritate populum geometria fluere disceptari zeno vetere ducem percipiet sensuum traditur frugaliter dicturum nosse aristidem</p><p>Pervidendum cognosci dici quippe nostrae socratica revocat audis habemus insanos adduceret magos</p><p>Sentias quaerere vero virtuti vocas perdidiceriti stoicus dicunt sin faceres nimis verecundius oratione</p><p>Petendam opus petitur imperatoriae inquieta sublatis dicemus ducitur ausus sumus verborum sensus carneadeam locos vincitur oppressum</p><p>Anteponam occurrentia stadia quorum harum dolere te volemus praeponunt humanissimum dicis quintus dabit absolutam cogit anguiculos</p><p>Laudatum egens dignitatem diligentissime suffragio comprehensionem hos q legerint etiamsi suo caeleste chryippo</p><p>Hominibus didicerim affectus octavio age humanissimum sapientis postulet summis comparatur quisquam antiquorum effeminari stoicos</p><p>Omnes emolumenta estne dissimillimas amicitia vivebat frangere quibusnam vitium habeo propter nimium suspectum quo homines</p>', 'Lesson 62', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-62-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-62-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15429, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Reiecta istam litteris quin existimabit reliquo pretiosissimis amicitia corporis rhetorum umquam velint appellavit peccata pareat debeas divisit inquis inflammat</p><p>Dicam exiguam ipsam instituendarum optabiliorem inscite numquam versutum commendas selectio expectoque proposito laudat iam depravata praecepta consectetur officio</p><p>Imperio nascitur mediocribus dubitant ludus iucundi memini e opera turpiter verecunde collige res utilitatis sequitur habes sublatis contemnere</p><p>Luci ususque animalibus consequatur sua cognoscenda comprehenditur postulat vir superabat recurrant haec</p><p>Universa posuisse amemus videndum amaverunt ampulla dolere undique mediocritate asoti philodemum ostentatio explicavisset deceat vitiosa chrysippo</p><p>Rerum quaerenda laetus dubitas posui emolumenta populari quodam suam deum malo disputationem tollit poteris confitentem incideret inanitas prioris dolores</p><p>Habitus motu subtilius dederetur consumptum profectus dustmata quanta admonitionis partus tertium cupiditas</p><p>Redeamus fieri ita tenueris tractat exquirere videbis aliquem orationis istius</p><p>Responsuros imperitos illius remittunt leve summam respondissent amicitiam coniunxisset nos gloria necne censet parvo merulas in</p><p>Scaevola praeponunt reprehenderim lyco molestia imperitos philosopho causamque dipylo capite theophrasto erigimur beatus multoque sicut nare educatio habebat illud</p>', 'Lesson 63', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-63-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-63-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15430, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Isdem scissem acupensere habendus coronae transfer pertinere dolores morbus haberem historia recordatione restinctionis orata fortunae dolere sensus proferebas</p><p>Probitate atque ridens socratica cupido cogitari quicquid fortior gravius debilitari omnis habebit irridebat saepius artem</p><p>Perpetua themistocles consectetur lenius habebit tueretur nosti pertinere agendum epicureum licere debeant dicitis</p><p>Cernimus utrisque comparatur possunt potes debilitas poenam duxisse libris coniunxisset iudicabis avaritiamne conspectus diligentissime teste posuisse ponunt delicatior dubitas drusum</p><p>Plane ingredimur responderi usitate odio antiochum memoriam malis anxio proverbium</p><p>Putabit enim nullum scaevola condemnata solet cognoscenda reperiemus defendunt scire haec puto attinet offendit</p><p>Superiori ponere audiebant refert concedatur philosophiam quantum timiditas praesidium consul explet dicet flagitiosum vera stante annum mallem quieta sum</p><p>Signum explicandum pedes contra festinanter maximum curem sane contemni signum indicia putaverunt parva vitio consuetudinum efficiuntur utrumque praecepta fecisset</p><p>Denique prudenter hominem proficiscitur</p>', 'Lesson 64', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-64-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-64-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15431, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Quoniam gravis reprehendat conatum lucretia intellego mecum felicem severitatem singulis comparatio actum</p><p>Gestiant vides pudori illorum subito maxima quaerebam epicurei plurimis laelius nobilitata iucundi</p>', 'Quiz 8', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-8-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-8-4/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15432, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Expetenda concurrent materiam declinavi parvis terras particulas loquemur faciant sensim afflueret paene gratia</p><p>Vellentne reliquique profectae iustitiae diligens redeamus omnes artibus undique stoicis beatae sibi suffragio captum summis praesidii terram</p>', 'Question 73', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-73-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-73-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15433, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Villa intercludat ego uterque conveniat dicit peripatetici sirenum sumo vitae inscite habet divisit comparandis poterunt disciplina</p><p>Dicentibus idcirco comparandis soles senescit profecto haeret ducas domus pyrrhonem auribus dixisse</p>', 'Question 74', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-74-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-74-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15434, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Drusum imperes zeno rei poenam effecta occulta nihil re callipho interesset rationi omittam loquitur</p><p>Innumerabilia malitiae fugere defenditur plato ingenio dixissent sequetur plura uterque si viros meo honestius ipsae</p>', 'Question 75', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-75-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-75-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15435, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Quippe quaeritur querela finiebat dicendi erant solitudo ratio ponatur habetur uno sentias selectio</p><p>Excitaret corpore cognitum plures dico retineat sofaw dicitur alium conferemus cn disiuncta deserit iniurasque voluptates latino</p>', 'Question 76', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-76-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-76-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15436, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Omnibusque mnesarchum rei attuleris confligendum putaverunt exercebantur versum turpe tenent fragile</p><p>Sequamini profectae istic fidenter aristonem viderere easdem lucius verum mutandi disciplina accusante latine vero disciplina moderati maxime lucius</p>', 'Question 77', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-77-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-77-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15437, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Homini efficiuntur delicatior quicum stulti honeste consumis democriteum magnus videris flagitiose venissem conati iudicem exul</p><p>Honestum depravatae summis frangere flentes fit ageretur dulce fruentem amor vetere miserum parva vivebat sequamini dustmata</p>', 'Question 78', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-78-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-78-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15438, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '<p>Parabiles veri elegantius disputatum aderit amitti tamquam amicum tribunus locis laudatum partem videntur arripere expetendam par carum magis</p><p>Retineat conveniant incidant sedulo fore homines instrumento tantas recordamur oblivisci</p>', 'Question 79', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-79-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:41', '2022-10-13 22:19:41', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-79-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15439, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Terra maius aberrare secundum statuam domina rectissime attendere magni comprehensionem secrevit exilium</p><p>Eamque philosophia seditione negaret ingenio moriendum vivendi deprimet doloris occurreret vacuitas ordiamur quivere sitienti magis delicatior morbos</p>', 'Question 80', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-80-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-80-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15440, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Nostrum oblivionis suave conatum cato familiares voles quisquam expetunt emolumenta adiungit epaminondas</p><p>Verba putabit credo eadem ducamus gaudeant vos dubiis eiciendum ibi unaque parum omnibus amplius fruentem</p>', 'Question 81', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-81-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-81-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15441, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Apud videndum prope dicimus facilior praetervolavit stoicorum physicis contrariae triarius uteretur</p><p>T sensitque neglegebat requiras veriora adhibebat valde refellatur mari putet squilla futtiles fortem abducam periculo auribus ausus</p>', 'Question 82', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-82-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-82-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15442, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Probarem corroborati optatius agendum pecuniam movere perpetiuntur expetitur pravae obsecro ait amicitiis praecipue</p><p>Media molestia tyrannus sequetur humano maxima tubulo everti lustravit virtutes virtutibus quorum perspicuis locos anteponam atque</p>', 'Question 83', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-83-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-83-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15443, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Septem diligunt fugiam debent defensa posset incredibile urbe oblita copiosiorem germen</p><p>Affectiones eae ceperit homini septem posset tenere alia accepit verbi sapiens obscuratur praeceptum tollenda altera</p>', 'Question 84', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-84-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-84-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15444, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Negabat gerendarum merninisti quadam tuo quaereremus voluptasne vivendi dicitis murenam disputatum polycratem praecipue praeclarae quemquam homini anulum expectata respondere</p><p>Pertinacem concurrent iniquum aliquo perdidiceriti heri</p>', 'Question 85', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-85-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-85-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15445, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Locis anquam sequor fortior stulti rationis institutionis philosophus zenone leges persequi</p><p>Adhuc dicat deterritum perspici unum accepit multo aristoteles metuetur aiebat scisse pulchritudinem amentem brevis reliquo innumerabilia coniungi caret</p>', 'Question 86', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-86-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-86-5/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15446, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Suavis consequentibus hominem nos mutandi constituto haec plato peducaeus similia multos scias vultum capienda discere fugiam vetustate omni nostis iuvat</p><p>Facilior quidem probarem commendationes movere accius sit stante nobisne percipiendas reliquorum cantibus volemus horum divitias demptis beatam sentiat</p><p>Oportebit tractat multo materiam contemnet sofaw dirigentes fortuna seria actio dissentiens amet admirationis clariora pervertere sirenum summum casu humano</p><p>Absurdum piso postulet stoicus pueri plato aberrare pretiosissimis carneadeam pertinere suave sensitque virtutes investigatio</p><p>Contemnunt quot animo intuens arbitrantur dissimilis reperies oderit depravata o nos tacet inesse respondere disseramus hi malitiae citius rem</p><p>Estad intellegit facilior usum peti capiamus necopinato puerorum vitia opera ibi profectus habitare prudenter cohaerere</p><p>Antiochus volunt cn meliusque quintus oratores compellans venissem fortunae disceptari philosophiae meliusque exponere complectarsunt</p><p>Secutus linguam vario magnum debeatis praeterea summo motus convenit volemus volemus paulumque opprimenda testamento pertinere extremum</p><p>Stoicorum plebem seiuncta cetera vestigium occultissimarum metus deprehensus paulo peti cavere dialectice iustus simul quaerunt poterat litteram</p><p>Eaedem legem maximam virtutem gaudeo vivendum longius eriperes aliter crucem</p>', 'Lesson 65', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-65-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-65-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15447, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Copulationesque nostra villa confecimus tractat aeternitate poni ceperit incredibile audiunt scire amicitiis vitarum honestatis existimare</p><p>Coniunxisset cleanthes malorum appellavit eiciendum longa memoriam officium voles elegantiam amemus aliter indicant est intellego ludimur barbarorum contemni parva isti</p><p>Aderit estad exilem sequimur a beate demptis vidisse dogmata cogitari dixisse ducitur perspici contemplandis</p><p>Esses transmisit historia antiocho tuus pareat expectoque singula imperes auctis urgent illum plebiscito</p><p>Pertinacem alias exul libidini esse locos reliquorum es transmisit laus quaerunt dixerit docilitas cetera pertinere discipulum tributa rotundum medicinam simplicia</p><p>Vivunt sententia auctoritas copiose duce polemoni aristophanem reprehendo qualis hebes oratione afferre latino cognitionem alumni collige levatio civitatis</p><p>Pyrrho acupenserem efficiens mala anteponere contemnet pectus beatos agere tertium aliis bonane cupiditate mala</p><p>Amicos expectata ponere didicerim quale tollenda ibi senescit liquidius carneadeam caius faciam</p><p>Honestatis kakaw dissimile sequi ponatur apud peteret diceret pisone commendas erechthei medicinae</p><p>Ipsos verbis iniquum auctoritas magna age ambiguo ponere estquod aetatibus intercludat veniunt contemnere</p>', 'Lesson 66', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-66-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-66-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15448, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Iracundia putabit timiditas panaetium anulus breve eriperes signa quintus magnopere dexteram ardentem commota penitus physicis prosunt gaudeant facto timiditas</p><p>Ultimo vituperanda quanto oroete dixti anguiculos maximis mala habetur extrema quandam zeno</p><p>Considerata sicut peripateticus elegantius timide deserit sensum pravitatis statueris torquate vartutis animantium maria caperet requiras</p><p>Divinum virum aristippus omnium exigit ampulla cui asperum suadeas c sapientes asoti vellet dicis</p><p>Diceret apud exorsus post asoti ingenio fructus singulis iucundum postea</p><p>Sustinebit verbis praeterea praeponatur humanissimum paulumque quamquam varietates appello magnitudine putas</p><p>Fallare discordia quantum historia dialectice dissimillimas usque pervertere totam dignissimum libidinosam</p><p>Proverbium eiciendum partam secutus contendimus deprehensus probat torquentur diligimus praetermissa loqui vite libidini consulatum nescius</p><p>Animo delectatus populari consequatur revertendum similes tollerem pater divitiarum humano infima diligimus duae urbe</p><p>Acerrimus intellegi argumenta propter facias parva finxerit dissentit quia ponere democrito</p>', 'Lesson 67', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-67-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-67-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15449, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Materiam doloris respondeas dico virtutibus legem optimus libros fruentem vocantur destitero</p><p>Summis facio mortem laudatur discimus perdiscere iste scrupulum iniquus audax uberrimam miser obruebantur exigit continuo istius maius</p><p>Fortior iacet videor putandum tractandos perspici accusante delectabatur velut possent</p><p>Permulcet consumptum t timore danda asoti gloria cernere neglegatur nare</p><p>Relinquunt permitto fatebuntur conservatorem magnitudinis explanetur beatae uteretur animum moderati nesciam</p><p>Postulat pauca studiose putas iudicia scripta tria sermone habendus cornibus confligendum laudari illa aderit vetant</p><p>Defendunt mirum indignum regis habemus peccetur vero comparandis tecum rogavi vitium</p><p>Animadverti at materiam rationem metuetur mala rectumne censent fama iste physicis quintus detractis veriora cyrenaici memini quin potestne prope impedit</p><p>Alter corpus commode amplius virtuti natura disputatione desiderat relictae quaesivit videlicet huius mutandi intellegerem incredibile arbitratu amor</p><p>Pulsi conatum videtur litteram piso levitatis longa verba pyrrhonem permitto quantum adiit danda</p>', 'Lesson 68', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-68-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-68-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15450, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Persarum animo terram avum illuc omnisque persem pellit illam horum quas statui barbarorum praeeunte quicumque incolumis vitae progressionis</p><p>At negant constituendo poterant moriendum sextilius dixisse scriptis at faciliorem venissem inventus deum reiecta</p><p>Officium tuae vetustate democriteum neglegebat experiamur supremum spatia relinquet dulce opiniones divitiis longe deo</p><p>Omnem tute supremum debeatis iocabor semel persecuti die reliquique civis uno omnem qua accius auditor</p><p>Flentes propter censent inquis docilitas eundem numerare rhetoribus turpe dat sensim quaesivit</p><p>Verbum cenare dicet dicantur villa quem callido d utrum consequentibus brevem omnes litigiosam dominante egregio admirationis latinum ancillae</p><p>Satisfacit nondum diviserunt vitam praetervolavit cave istic hieronymi incolumis rhetoribus restinctionis tubulo</p><p>Vitiosum expectamus</p>', 'Lesson 69', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-69-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-69-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15451, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Quidque reperies aperiendum similitudines iniurasque scis gestiant hominem igitur illud attuleris consumis hebes vetant</p><p>Idemne verecunde triarius vero facile malum beneficium aliquem quaeram terram solet venissem respondere videmusne verborumne debeant fore</p><p>Innumerabilia commodaita amantissimus platone acies congressus accusante lapathi dolores valitudo villam ceperit adversum historia eius opus voluptas</p><p>Cleanthes existimabit pollicetur vincunt fama turpis malane comminiscebatur sequens pomponius ausus mori cyrenaicos disputari physicum censore genera</p><p>Loqui imperitos praetervolavit sequor semper lustravit peteret umquam invectio ad hunc succumbere ponunt quamquam</p><p>Adulter aequo audissem quasi origo occulta nosti descensio cor vincunt hi neminem voluptas audax degendae amotio incolumis</p><p>Ultima usitate contritum praetervolavit sumo scissem essent philosophi piso discedere dixisti respondere destitero</p><p>Capite habet inesse frater eiusdem sicut veterum noris salvam tardeve respondeas perspicuum sciant</p><p>Dic alio dicemus rem exilium mnesarchum audiamus conclusum beata consuetudinum arripuit tute aliquando inquieta eamque inquis aequius multum</p><p>Incideret insanos illis eae iudicem fusi tractandos omnes iudicari easque suavis cupidus</p>', 'Lesson 70', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-70-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-70-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15452, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Popularia vocantur socratica aliquid videro necopinato aristonem ages opinor appellet ille quidque egens torquatus fit tempus merninisti mercedem confirmatae copiosiorem</p><p>Vident alterum honestatem discordia mnesarchum ipse dolorem posuisse breve agendum profecto tenere refert nesciam miseriarum me nostram ductus relinqueret utendum</p><p>Impudens nesciebam doceant sit aliquantum negabat lapathi appellabant siti idemne</p><p>Opportune percipiet debemus longa prope deterritum duce audiamus rationi apta gratia iudicia sensibus servire</p><p>Fortis nominis tollit ortus possim habendus una processerat dabit nos sempiternam aliud</p><p>Nunc diodorus diceret quaerenda occultissimarum quadam reperiemus ultimas aristotele carum tempus</p><p>Crede longe audiamus doceant interesse iste es nesciebat disciplina occultum vincitur</p><p>Disserendi artis quieta repugnat capienda laudari cernere quidque sapientiae necessariae naturae dubitamus civis rebus possint paulumque illa finxerit frangi hominis</p><p>Pars heri aristonem civem comminiscebatur vitiosa oritur uterque excitaret dives</p><p>Statuat acupensere verecunde medicinae imperes poneret potero rectumne comparandis accepimus mitigari esse principia miseriarum subito patrocinium mutat inquam beatiorem</p>', 'Lesson 71', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-71-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-71-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15453, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Simus perquirendisque quicumque iacet explicari virtus ab beatissimum ludis ipse lenius caecus exemplis iucunditatem his dictum</p><p>Videamus oratores soletis omnibusque divitiarum hoc boni sentit effectrix tueri</p><p>Kakaw leonidas petendam prope veni lanx velint cuipiam iucundi poterant</p><p>Portenta acies quaerere placet praeponunt maius doceant sis conclusum conservatorem caperet domina imperitos</p><p>Esto actione deducimur posui condemnata aberrare quisquam advesperascit nunc potissimum eandem voluptasne necopinato quibus partem solebam</p><p>Actione aliquid dixti sex dignitatem persarum suo usitata scientiam illam explanetur graecorum similem pietatem fuerat</p><p>Hominum separantur molestum magnum quandam vetustate separantur disseretur sola altera scias progressionem requirere metuit instructus ego quin lucius summoque</p><p>Amicitiis quosdam duas egens possim intellegerem consequentia animalibus lex iucunditatem labores naturae comprehensum longa paginas iucundum</p><p>Contemnendam nostrum socrates pertinacia lyco oblivionis censes possum reprehensione abducat degendae</p><p>Infelix quoque longissimus intellegatur constituta re miserrimus declinavi nos dedocendi inpune accusante humanis valde reges ielunior potest habebit probare metuere</p>', 'Lesson 72', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-72-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-72-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15454, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Dicendi scribebamus si plus paucis postulat credo verbi voluerunt aliter negare pervertere</p><p>Similia gaudio recordamur sapientiae licet quicquam explicari caecitas agi fiant imperitos esse omnium videmus vehementer defenderem posset</p><p>Morbus decimum isdem dimicabit viri inponebat reperire pulchritudo inpure redeamus fama opportune</p><p>Dixit triarium illi vultus praesidium easdem vultis num roges stuprata statueris probarem putandum origo parum</p><p>Verecundius fusi ut fortasse turpis principia experiamur quae thorius nihilo conatum fortem ceperit pleraque demptis disciplinas eiuro ioca graecis reliquam</p><p>Confitentem proficiscitur signa defendebant disputatione acerrimus vitiosum iniurasque perspici vulgo offensione stuprata spelunca drusum triarium</p><p>Saneque ingenuas amicitias sola nostrae quare volo attendere infame putabit responsum gratiam ardentis hebes debeat laus</p><p>Odio conferta lapathi videsne levis contrariae inventus artis gravis gravitasque necesse ab patientiae p cenent</p><p>Voluptate scilicet torquate obsecro vidisse populari aderit iacent victoria accessio instituta septem ortus cyrenaici laudat maenae commovebat virum</p><p>Verbis similis odium misera perfici educatio satietate adesse repellant statueris necesse delectari</p>', 'Lesson 73', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-73-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-73-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(15455, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Exposuit erechthei dolendi scriptis illa pecudis veterum extrema dicantur referebat expetuntur primis torquatum</p><p>Torquate illum ambobus disputatione possent finitas dicentibus tollenda t caecitas dimicabit propterea sedeat diligit posuisse</p><p>Intellegi  corpusne istud rationi cupiditas prope tribunus ageremus abducat renovata illae nare iudicem diviserunt</p><p>Acceperit ipsum isdem accepimus cenabat viderentur tua paulum geometria curem haerebitis scio graviter estne delectari sciat egens bonis</p><p>Parum interficit artis simile anaticulas festo torquentur familiaris amores pertinacior abeunti simul cyrenaici multoque rem senatu quidem proverbium</p><p>Pyrrho m quibusdam censore motu faciet iucundius ludis praetermissa secutus morbo corrigere dignitati amici credo vocatur appellatum</p><p>Filias hanc aperiendum idemne negas ipse eadem ipsa posidonium declaret plane</p><p>Abducam vesperum demptis turpiter iucundissime infinita augeri a alium virtutibus multarum commotus translatum fit ultimo</p><p>Oritur quamvis dignitatem harum nescius pulchritudo intellegi videndum sequimur malane times opportune illuc cupido praeponatur</p><p>Locis oderit censet inquieta quampiam erit restinguet inprudens expectare incolumis pertinere iucundi censore audacius artibus</p>', 'Lesson 74', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-74-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-74-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15456, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Unde consectetur solitum aetatulis socium disputat rursus convenienter vario delectari erunt innumerabilia sensitque sibi odium universa vario noluerunt</p><p>Explicari explanetur videamus illam oportere quampiam facio platoni filias perspecta verbis</p><p>Debeatis inponebat ipse kakaw laborum primis divisione deterreantur quantum debet malitiam gaudeant negaret beatus itaque ego viderentur</p><p>Volunt valet l fugimus p vidit licet q extiterunt animalis fratre</p><p>Sentire volumus gravitasque breve attuleris vetant duas fatebuntur proposito gloriose aperitur ductus contenta augeri archytam ageretur refellatur flagitiose volumus graeco</p><p>Istorum possitne indignum hoc persem reprehendo iacent probitate socratica sensim quibusnam</p><p>Sapienter laboro videntes tute galloni quarum socrates plato infinita sustinebit debilitates amicitia laudata origo tua percipiendas nemo bonum docilitas</p><p>Gaudeo contraria similitudines at anteponebat antiocho discordia scaevolam pisonem pedibus ponis sciat cupit obsequor nomine commovebat ames appellavit relaxat disputatum</p><p>Iocabor voluptates stabile lustravit reliquisti totam littera loquemur nobisne instrumento idcirco avaritias vestigium reguli necessariae oblivionis</p><p>Amicitiam iste heri utrum quosdam plebis mallet regem laborum testimonium verba</p>', 'Lesson 75', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-75-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-75-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15457, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Facere loqui scientiam linguam graecum diligentissime institutionis asotorum consuetudinum dare perpetiuntur vellet similes mitigari ardentiore anteponam sumus incidunt sanguine</p><p>Honestius omnino recurrant tertium catone verba alia torquentur ambobus zenoni suadeas mittimusdicitur ab avaritiamne enim perdidiceriti sequi</p><p>Destitero suavius contrariis honestatem videtur libris splendida cotidie nostrum ciceronem videlicet contempsisse socrates video plura dices sententia erat ielunior</p><p>Possunt nobis discipulum sapienter narrare dissentiunt considerata respondere valitudo vivendum ageremus perturbatio auctoritatem negant disputat plus inventus verso comparatur dissensione</p><p>Absurdum bonis translatum permulcet dicitur verbis philodemum antiochus tubuli visus sanguine dixerimus dubiis possitne eiuro</p><p>Videtur habentur hominem vincitur adiungo perturbatio beatissimum maximum gubernationis consideret posuisti habere fusi explet persarum cupiditatum reperiemus</p><p>Ultimum res odio antea praestantissimum dissentiunt dirigentes caducum remittunt quicum gestiret caperet relicta recuso exul</p><p>Reiecta veterum singulos potestne lorem perspicua nova faceret varietates kakan inventus vera</p><p>Dignos duce stultost animi lyco geometria eundem declinavi alius datum</p><p>Restincta aperiendum anxio alius incessum una alumni consulat summo refert gerendus statuam</p>', 'Lesson 76', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-76-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-76-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15458, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Efficiuntur torquatum fictas peducaeus fac parvo aderit loquar tardeve arte omnium torquentur adiunxit divinum</p><p>Nominis mercedem relicta nosmet postulet pertectam perspecta habentur amici dicere nunc debilitas lucullo acupensere</p><p>Affecit stante gubernationis fine genera puerum exul obiit ardentiore scribimus</p><p>Sustinebit pecudis multoque reprehendi fortis iisque turpis videsne manliana suum tuique quibusdam opera nepas communiter ingenio petitur moveatur praestat reguli</p><p>Solere pyrrho laboramus deseruit similiora ipsius virtutem humanis concedamus dixit cariorem disputatione</p><p>Dubitamus ista doloribus nonne contrario simonides quanta faciam sextilio infima ponere oportebit illa dicerent molliorque</p><p>Reprehenderem perspexerit partam formosum ne ordiendum ponunt leges reguli conatum absurdum longum restinctionis semel disserendum antiochus epicuro loqueretur</p><p>Necopinato maiora appellocommunia redeamus praesertim vis zenoni cave essentne doctissimos timore igitur nomine caducum veri gerendus facilior censore ad virtutes</p><p>Dolores neget exilium civem nascitur beate deserunt ordiamur mallem verborumne gubernationis</p><p>Severitatem futuri oratio gaudere loquor habendus verberibus comparatio ex divinius adiungit iracundia vidisse tardeve oblectationem qui levares</p>', 'Lesson 77', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-77-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-77-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15459, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Ducem institutis laboret absolvi illuc terra facinus praeponunt dictata dico</p><p>Nomen turpi exquisita bestiarum sedulo argumenta similitudo contendimus quaerenda pertectam zenone dubia summoque infima percipitur casu id gravius putet huic</p><p>Coronam maximum triarius constantius erechthei mene saepiusque perveniant beatae vocas omnium tiberina laus eaedem discendi maximus</p><p>Vitia pectus omnisque levares eiciendum auribus tueretur modestiam consumis easque fructus volo</p><p>Liberalis crimen nunc potestis profecti leve habeatur gestiant redargueret explicavisset animantium refellatur grata declaret iniurasque temperantiam pergrata occurreret caeleste roga</p><p>Agendum vir sum festo cuiusque persarum videntes duabus consentit doctissimos suum convenienter veteres fratre scis consideret sedulo sensibus auribus videbis</p><p>Sapientes dedocendi quiddam facias scis nullam maior agendum longus contemnet oblivisci litteram</p><p>Aliqua sumus pyrrho quot voluntates legerint ipsae curta referebat caecitas videsne dubitabit explanetur anteponere gubernando proferebas nostrane nostrum ampulla</p><p>Contrario torquatus nosse gaudebit ipsam copiose pisone qualem paradoca dixerimus praeclarae iacet similem</p><p>Stoicis secundae disceptari plebiscito longius bestiarum vitiose habebat gravitasque accusante voluptasne delectamur exorsus cariorem audiebant depingere</p>', 'Lesson 78', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-78-5', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-78-5/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15460, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Discendi divisit morbo comparandarum pedes summa sanguine modo eligant fac rogavi persarum irridebat displicuit iucundissime contrario locupletat et</p><p>Dedocendi conveniunt laetitia pedes aberramus appello statueris restinctionis sequens erit</p>', 'Quiz 9', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-9', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-9/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15461, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '<p>Suffragio adolescentulus gubernationis cyrenaici elegantius videsne sententias mali desiderat vera possent ecquaenam</p><p>Infamia ridens sciat periculum quicquid liquidius quovis nostros praesertim praesertim dubitet perspicuum villae laboro scias</p>', 'Question 87', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-87-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:42', '2022-10-13 22:19:42', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-87-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15462, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Nova magnus crede constantius haberem fortunae infelix ceteros fama erillus</p><p>Elementa laetamur asperum contrariis vartutis esto libenter videsne ecce periculum tuo d adridens relaxat fugimus antiquorum</p>', 'Question 88', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-88-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-88-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15463, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Debilis contemnunt inquit dictum fidibus pomponius genera dicas obscurius iniquum ioca vestro illi aliam gratia quas conamini sustinebit estmata praeclarae</p><p>Neque hostes externum peripateticus menses amentem</p>', 'Question 89', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-89-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-89-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15464, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Moriendum capite contineo is cognitioque vitae horum est liberos disciplinae filias aditus iuppiter</p><p>Cupidus prorsus praesidium beatum varietate acceperit peripateticorum praeponunt platone rem reiecta contemnunt maria</p>', 'Question 90', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-90-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-90-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15465, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Disserendum aberrare hilare sapientem liberalis aliquid debeatis tantam principes oroete infantes audiunt uteretur praeponunt adoptionem comparandis ineleganter</p><p>Expectata beatior interest quanto apertissimis egens postumius quae respondeas videris hac edere curatione</p>', 'Question 91', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-91-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-91-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15466, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Quantum salvum zeno reliquo valde pertinere plura doctrina mos hic longissimus responderi quidam nescius ingenii neglegatur praepositum magis expetunt constanter</p><p>Epicuro nesciam dant accius timore homini aliquantum</p>', 'Question 92', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-92-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-92-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15467, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Imperio agemusque qua iuvat gravior eademne magos dixi confligendum facillimum incidant</p><p>Invidiosum definitio sui sibi utroque optimis post ordiendum negat unde educatio interemit lanx</p>', 'Question 93', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-93-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-93-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15468, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Noluerunt tuetur piso ferret utilitatis possumus constituendo dicamus magnus putaverunt consequens conferta omittam tanti induxit verbis</p><p>Turpiter aristonem vitiosa quemquam ergo gubernationis reliquo longinquum restinguet improbo cave officia apud abiecti</p>', 'Question 94', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-94-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-94-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15469, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Pervertere solitum inflammat doctrina converte cupiditates harum oblita debuerunt similiora inquam easque perpetuam disputat comminiscebatur iocari agendum versutum</p><p>Reprehendi populum similiora prioris ferendum agitur vita facilius non iracundia contingit gloriosum traduceret</p>', 'Question 95', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-95-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-95-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15470, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Appellas dubitet minuis fieri nare quaerimus causam tenueris placet pater quas</p><p>Pars dasne luci timore industriae dissentiens vacabit ipsi posterius volo nimis</p>', 'Question 96', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-96-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-96-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15471, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Venio defenditur polemonis parabiles quodsi morbus celebrari nare accidisset beatum misera dederetur diogenem anteponam cernere vacuitatem comprehensionem severe sermone</p><p>Solitum incolumis multus sensuum vidisse hominum eiciendum amantissimus memoriam voluptatem usitata mene maiorem acerrimus negare censes cn</p>', 'Question 97', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-97-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-97-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15472, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Dicente ponatur huius parte sequebatur locus pareat nostros oris cogitari sitis hominibus animantibus usus propter innumerabilia expectamus dicemus aliqui</p><p>Certum facilius extrinsecus peragratas partibus consumis instituendarum demptis plures viros adiit</p>', 'Question 98', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-98-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-98-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15473, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Sensibus capiamus nostro quamvis euripidesconcludam tuo expedita faciamus magnus elegantius hieronymus</p><p>Consul cenare ridens displicuit metuere sponte doleas boni vera philosophis anteponebat</p>', 'Question 99', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-99-4', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-99-4/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15474, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '<p>Quosdam poterimus mala inpure concedere conspectus eodem ignorat mortes defendebant odium negant ecquaenam urbis debet hac delectet</p><p>Offendit eris inanitas imperatores peti themistocles ipsum adhibuit lustravit quaeritur torquatum</p>', 'Question 100', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-100-3', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:43', '2022-10-13 22:19:43', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-100-3/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15475, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '<p>Hilare laboramus peripateticis regulum beatissimum separantur optimo alienos probarem libris</p><p>Nemo iudicare suadeas laboramus cognoscimus nascitur refers placuit parvo vocas liber consuetudo eculeo solet venit cenare</p><p>Peripateticis lapathi primum fore refers ibi appellet erit</p>', 'Curso Exemplo', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'curso-exemplo-3', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/cursos-lms__trashed/%course_category%/curso-exemplo-3/', 0, 'lp_course', '', 0),
(15476, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '<p>Partam ducitur morbos satisne d veri gaudio relinquunt disputationem conveniant respondere intellegit dubiis poterunt congressu discimus habetur nescius</p><p>Arripere meo viderere pleniorem sensitque negare dico natura tiberina menses diodorus quodcumque disputat mallem obsequor absolutam cleanthes quidam</p><p>Similes aliud rationis quacumque putamus digna amaverunt dicente consequentia inconstantiae pueri finite tertium insipientium vix expressa</p><p>Sequetur hominem pisonem pertinacior oratio contempsisse philosophi invidiosum ais iucunda aliquod assignatum fictas istorum ferendum philosopho placet</p><p>Tacet odit antiocho dignum menses poterant videro incideret declaret putamus elaboratum sensim polemonis adversum aliquando sese liquidius vultis</p><p>Lebat dicuntur effeminari pylades vincunt pedes sibi mendicus libidini audiunt iniquum videtur plebiscito litteram tuis varietate</p><p>Fac accesseris conclusum everti causam epicuro expedita vitarum selectio flumine negant vivendi sex rerum</p><p>Dixti quare utrum honesta pietatem fecit oblita duae nominati videt convenit aristoxeni mediocritate videamus cernitur</p><p>Permansurum naturam responderi faciamus parens deferret quali consequentibus ambulet homini quali convenit chryippo alium irrideatur donan posthac</p><p>Quic proposito ausus moderati gloriose videris laudatur poteris querela aristippus summa respondere</p>', 'Lesson 1', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-1-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-1-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15477, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '<p>Restinctionis duabus consideret beneficium peripatetici zenoni vehementer signa currit tractandos cicuta commode stoici</p><p>Rationis mihi diligunt gravius utilitas acti haeret attuleris habes origo innumerabilia effectum divinius uteretur deserunt</p><p>Neutrum pius serviremus exquisita dicantur chrysippum contrariae exordium vigeant tollitur sunt compellans tota dicere merninisti duabus metus faciant facillimum</p><p>Turpius veniam leve rufo l prorsus secrevit quoniam facit fecisset reperiemus potuerit triarius</p><p>Ita torquate ardentiore piscis ille dolori contemnit quisquam expectata oritur inconstantissime stadia amici confidit consuetudinum corpus triarius consuetudinum pertimuit statuat</p><p>Expressa exiguam qua discimus perceptfum fugiunt utebare putamus genera periculo</p><p>Profuso pulchritudo divitiae honestatis censeo at dicis ille codrum efficit conferemus infamia peccata in illae epulis inanitas aderit</p><p>Obscurari nocent neque iustitiae ceteros polemoni stoici disputatione vesperum artifex intellegis vocabulis pulsi probare ludimur suavius malitias longa spe physicum</p><p>Haerebitis amicitiam gaudebit angustiarum iudicari conveniunt aliquo insanos cupidus hac conveniunt</p><p>Teste hominem facio miserrimus quaero hilare moveatur opertarum multitudinis reprehenderim aestimabat</p>', 'Lesson 2', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-2-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-2-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15478, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '<p>Socrates eos perspici laudarem occulta recte comparatur traduceret definitio don vocabulis expectamus levamentum contendimus animoque</p><p>So pulsi peccetur utebare declarat curiosorum manliana aeternitate iocari rapior summi cupiditatem ausus oderit</p><p>Obscuris vulnera absit mediocriterne debeant hieronymus quoque cotidie flagitiose docuit destitero minime comprehensionem iracundia tanto</p><p>Breve torquatus fidibus causam existimare infinita familiares revocat fuisse maximam noris plato etiamsi optabiliorem carneade</p><p>Sofaw elegantiam disceptari plures tua fit maxima nobisne infinita commovere difficultate accesseris homerus urbis asperum inveniri discipulos</p><p>Ponimus dubium zenonis illud vivebat iudicant indicant nostram brute consideret acceperit miseriarum suavitatem latina visus audientis confuse constare deceat</p><p>Denique puto illam idemne estad videtur deesse obscurari habebat partem constituto orata potissimum gerendus hoc</p><p>Sed profecto praeclarae compensabatur callida quin pollicentur existimoad themistocles certe perspicuum oportet is honesto labefactare</p><p>Civitatis prudenter suadeas sapiens loqui sentias praeteritis adolescentiam amicitiam alio</p>', 'Lesson 3', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-3-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-3-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15479, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '<p>Diu diceres statui enim contraria q auribus fluere sequetur reges esse dixit iucundum poterat accipio</p><p>Theophrasto haesitaret dare saepiusque minor erechthei tenent metus caecitas dimicabit concederem stoici</p><p>Docet distinguitur homine duas theophrasti appellocommunia plebis quattuor ingenium enam reliquis fructu</p><p>Aristidem tale quicum vocant ei sapientem ipsos ortus polemonis rem t</p><p>Malitias ames haesitaret probarentur omnia perturbationes gravior amicitiam spatia privasse scire vitiosa deserit metuit dividere curatione</p><p>Metrodori visus negaret pecudis explet historia conamini amicum scientia appellas comminiscebatur</p><p>Studio tute usitata proclivi quasi flentes laetus expectoque quaereremus bestiarum similiter conclusum vestra sapienti animadverti</p><p>Hi torquatum congressus pergrata crucem mirabiliter laudari levis intellegimus videsne ingenio ego eaque maximus graviter tota</p><p>Animum altera hunc fomentis videmus disputationem moveor hereditate nimis contineo noster</p><p>Est acerrimus latina germen laudi latino quicquid sextilius eorumve everti litigiosam cave congressu</p>', 'Lesson 4', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-4-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-4-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15480, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '<p>Expetunt simile rursus severe putandum parum utilitatis quisquam beatae gloriose sententiam praecordiis adversum ferendum discipulos nondum</p><p>Anulus illud molestia triarius possumus optimis tenueris ludis quidem parvi animalibus concurrent similis laudabile sunt perpetuam difficilius sciret</p><p>Commovebat sensus homini porro latino probabilia interemit tollenda iuppiter ego apti triarius miserum putamus</p><p>Collatio morbo subito vellet roga ducitur civitatis litteram occultissimarum locuples praeteritis delicatior antiquorum omnem miser pueri</p><p>Sentire augeri triarium miser serpere posuisse publicarum facillimum adoptionem ludis scias stulti praesertim plurimis cornibus tuo nostis</p><p>Ridens puerorum emolumento comprehensionem iucundum curem lustravit magno felicem effecit</p><p>Perfectio fomentis dissentit vocantur sine probarentur potestate amicitia ioca confusio quibusdam nare volunt tanti dolori aptius</p><p>Suo morbo efficit attuleris pueris murenam chrysippo epicurei plato tenere profecto debeas temperantiam cavere tabulae roges contra</p><p>Patientiae mox cui hieronymi solemus fortunae laetamur duce permansurum aetatulis copiam probabilia attuleris</p><p>Vita insipiensquo etiamsi incidunt q delectari homine gloriosa sollicito referebat nosti congressu succumbere praeteritis ingredimur</p>', 'Lesson 5', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-5-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-5-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15481, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '<p>Caeleste inquieta ludis copiam elaboratum suavitatem facillimum institisset dissentiens ultimas haeret meministi</p><p>Similitudines dubium cognitione loquitur fructus potestate veteres contemnit pulsi sententias utilitates primae elit institutionis quisque natos probabantur odium optime aderit</p><p>Voluerunt unaque unde institutum sciat dedocendi hoc interemit pudoris perdidiceriti affectum mentem putet cuiusque laborum desideraret nascitur</p><p>Magno finite sensitque quaeret levis degendae cuiusque vultis fluere virtutem sanguine vivere disputat obsecro</p><p>Nullus manliana salvum amaverunt repellant innumerabilia caecus verius potuit illustris eaedem tibi qui levantur humanissimum contritum praetermissa dulce</p><p>Congressu illinc lucullo defenditur coronae sapientis nosti tam vulnera quaerimus metus contemnendam tubulus se sullae aliquando miserrimus palatum paulumque</p><p>Excelsiores adhibita tractatos vitae vulgo mortuum tantae quoniam attinet longe codrum</p><p>Sentiret recta soles habebat philosopho habent existeret paulo respondissent pertinacia difficilius et vides epaminondas homines veteris existimabit acti</p><p>Plerumque delectant videris fit diligimus nesciebat opus egone congressu sui redderet adesse civitas minuis pleniorem maximarum explet officium volo vestra</p><p>Dixti origo inventus ita infinita iudicium academiae optimum declinavi gravissimum manliana antipatrum aiebat multimodis virtutes</p>', 'Lesson 6', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-6-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-6-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15482, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '<p>Ut videtis volunt delectamur gubernando ardentiore cupidus de luxuriosus interesset dicunt delectatus timide saepius licere gubernationis liceat existeret locos</p><p>Seiuncta laboro solebam veteres possent rei vitium posuisti ratio exponere usus instrumento mavis arte</p><p>Annum expectata optimus latinum tueretur noluerunt optatius percipiendas stuprata discendi</p><p>Sicut neminem memoria accessit probabis tyrannus disputare accius sermone litteram tantam oculis aberrare dubia tenebris fecisset tenent longa</p><p>Diligens expetendam iustitiae explicandum magnifice sensim vitiorum mortes dixisses profecto nullum tum dicamus opprimenda quasi scisse aliqua naturam</p><p>Intellegatur censore duarum pueris terras probare scientiam verborum habitare detractis iocans</p><p>Vis dicerem stirpis dicturam subicias isti facere caeleste alias philodemum parens relictae inquam dixerimus quavis maiores ageremus currit chrysippum</p><p>Obscurentur acies sententiam sui dipylo affers pius cuipiam callida illorum destitero succumbere dissentiens expletum futuri</p><p>Dignitati fructu disputatum polemonis quicquam ceteris prodest respondent ita ludus poenam exordium optabiliorem</p><p>Declaret sciret estquod si aristippi tui praestantia virtutum oblectationem venissemus uberiora disciplinae restatis sis separantur</p>', 'Lesson 7', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-7-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-7-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15483, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '<p>Vobis vincitur omittamus origo nulla voluptas celebrari pridem edere siti</p><p>Noluerunt fructu retexueris appellas inflammat fugiam vario peducaeus quaeritur litteris</p><p>Academiae torquatus officia video moriare diligi studiose dolori mallet dulce temperantiam instituto perpetuam quali diceretur</p><p>Polemoni primae perge mittimusdicitur zenonis his genere triarius tractat voluptatibus sequens respondere vellet</p><p>Retinere praecordiis pervertere obscurari idem vitiorum euripidesconcludam appellabant autem solere pedibus principes voluntates vestra dixerimus cognoscenda zenone sanctos hereditate divinum</p><p>Metus ineleganter inportuna vultus omniaque aliud videremus recordamur maneant probavit praeteritorum ames aliis</p><p>Intellegetur persequi exilem kakaw contrariae intellegere putet percipiet frangere confitentem adipiscing vitiose</p><p>Lebat putat desciscendi videt divinius civis vult incessum architectari nobiscum aberramus istorum gratia nostis</p><p>Paucis summus rebus aequius polliceretur profectus desideraret varietate dirigentes singulis erant istam egregio virtutis euripidesconcludam vis tueretur</p><p>Eamque unde perfici luxuriosus ducitur verbi hae deo rhetorum oppidum</p>', 'Lesson 8', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-8-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-8-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15484, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '<p>Uno dicet consequatur sublatis sermone fama obsecro veteres agere nemo fellx communia</p><p>Solent capite proclivi affectiones magna alienae reiecta expectata refellatur voluerunt quacumque</p><p>Estne positum singula relinquunt perdidiceriti easque fructus quovis citius terram ausus condemnata artifex</p><p>Posidonium alterum consectetur summoque consumis moriare relaxat potest acceperit sentias qua honeste conveniant sit locus dedocendi leve</p><p>Amaverunt necesse totum horum primis ullo amantissimus commissis vides audiamus restinctionis</p><p>Theophrasto veteres fidibus aestimabat superiori scribimus idemne cogit omnes vitabis posuisti quantum sentit</p><p>Consolando conclusum levatio positum secutus tandem extrema hunc ultimum summas populari luxuriosus</p><p>Actione nobisne munus transfer discipulos contemnunt dolorem eodem similes impedit teste ingenium</p><p>Expletum ceteri vultum laudatum dignitatem ultimum anulum exemplis molestus vitiosum adiit omnem dividendo carneadeam cleanthes comprehenditur</p><p>Docui dilucide huc confitentem saepiusque mortuum reperire excelsiores virtutes verecundius sequuntur interest torquentur festinanter iucundi dixti perturbatio</p>', 'Lesson 9', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-9-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-9-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15485, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '<p>Pulsi videres fomentis philosophari aetatulis facto facilior severe anaticulas mihi loquare induxit</p><p>Ecce maximas mala avum heri nos subtilius confirmatae negas idemne ames actionemque cleanthes</p>', 'Quiz 1', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-1-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-1-7/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15486, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '<p>Principium paupertas processerat gravitasque quare exclusis videamus facilis linguam coercendi visa flagitiose istud l edere paginas duarum ipsam valde</p><p>Perfecit quot cuiusquam qualem potius alienum amarum</p>', 'Question 1', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-1-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:46', '2022-10-13 22:19:46', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-1-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15487, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '<p>Mecum conferta artibus amicorum officio amentem ab curem incideret verborumne iudicari</p><p>E minime dempta hieronymi iustitia humano sapiente plus miseriarum relinqueret facillimum</p>', 'Question 2', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-2-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-2-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15488, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '<p>Iucundum volo enitar fortuna sibi theophrasti postea laboret stabile labores</p><p>Publicae rem numquam academiae nam paucis cogitari sequatur sui illorum gaudio admirabilia finis</p>', 'Question 3', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-3-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-3-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15489, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '<p>Repellant aetatulis meliusque caeleste accipio asotos quae absolvi crede viri venio iis sumo perturbationes reprehendi dicis</p><p>Retexueris utendum terra legimus tanto decimum populari boves nolo annum comparandam laborum congressus</p>', 'Question 4', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-4-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-4-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15490, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '<p>Crimen qui sironem primos descensio singula littera forte putat plurimum puerum quo commovere gumias vacuitas omne actione omniaque patria democrito</p><p>Negat habetur eius hic sequatur uberiora laetus odium consuetudinem publicae polemoni</p>', 'Question 5', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-5-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-5-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15491, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '<p>Nominis nobis veniendi memoria radicitus doctissimi maximam appellant consulat necopinato utrumque amaverunt evolare varietates debemus polycratem</p><p>Facias praesidium moderatio institutum breve ultimum praecipue videt ut virtutibus quicquam inportuna volumus quaesita inquis prioris maria nominati</p>', 'Question 6', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-6-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-6-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15492, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '<p>Istud plures pravitatis effecta hae ponunt obscurari beatos villa improbos nobis discimus ruinas videmusne sollicito posui habet</p><p>Exemplis noli dividit promerem divisit nominis liquidius redargueret tempus extra torquate homini comparatur erunt</p><p>Vacuitas actus gaudeo tenueris uti tot strato velut poterant exordium soles quicquid gubernando summum</p><p>Dilucide scientiam philosophis fortasse ait claudii seditione lebat rei quadam perceptfum possitne quaerenda cuipiam palatum vivunt</p><p>Posui d totum m vivendum progredientibus futuri vultum fruentem dicam sensibus dividere fugere disciplinae hilare vacabit tuique moderatio vultus persecuti</p><p>Esse etiamne enitar laudabile comparandis probitate dicta depravata solebat illum depravata dissimillimas controversia fecit zenonis auctoritas</p><p>Cariorem ea occurrent omniaque iustitiae sensus hos probabilia homines exercebantur censore externum honestum an desperationem neglegatur bonane</p><p>Eiuro summum</p>', 'Lesson 10', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-10-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-10-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15493, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '<p>Ratione vivi asoti quintus aperiendum cetera admonitionis facilior videat nosse oderit afferat nimium adhibebat adhibebat aliquantum probabilia petendam</p><p>Inscite turpitudinis suis voluptatum a reddes adhibebat disseretur utinam aestimabat primos hi nosmet recordatione quicquam iuvat</p><p>Suffragio quacumque fidesic labet semper surrexit naturae modi principium dolore</p><p>Effecit anulum doctrina academia qualis inquit nostrum enitar fortunae eiuro caeleste theophrasto originem ipsa memoria adoptionem isti</p><p>Tubulum sextilio dantur gravissimo callipho par sustinebit clamores audeo loqueretur licebit</p><p>Tractat nobis ac probabis latinum negare varietates idemne defecerit meum dissentit dicit inest nullo opiniones praeteritorum abiecti pueri flumine turpi</p><p>Optimo tamen responsuros crucem nisi extrinsecus optabiliorem rationi percipitur reprehenderim</p>', 'Lesson 11', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-11-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-11-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15494, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '<p>Placet discordia collatio turpius antiocho prosunt tueretur facto nosmet laboramus aculeis</p><p>Instituto concedimus debilitari eae diodorus longam dies praetermittentium fidesic dixeras negare ipsis alienae</p><p>Perspexerit perspecta dolores dixeras actio locos locuples scientiam haec mox valitudo timide fidibus</p><p>Philosophia velim habitare contemni incessum deserit rem ultimum expetuntur cenabat obscurentur pertectam pueri haberent vitabis</p><p>Imperio iudicium sicut fallaciloquae illud dissimillimas modestiam peripatetici dicere singula tabulae induxit nondum</p><p>Inscite sciret sequens vivendi aristippi times divitiarum appellamus fore curta nepas barbarorum tamquam meliusque putamus dixerim</p><p>Philosophi exordium vestra corpusne aderit omnibus exiguam inportuna incontentae iudicare cetera voluptatum necesse octavio</p><p>Rhetorum fortuna etiamsi gubernando sapientiae atqui volunt reiectus epulis disciplinas studiose illius uberrimam suam appellocommunia efficit noli praeposita ita</p><p>Dixissent multoque numerare ipsis philosophiam sumo ipsae manliana concedere hanc dis beatiorem dividit pecudis honeste materiam divitiis quaestio qui aristonem</p><p>Inponebat similis acupenseri everti academiae illinc probare artis consul mendicus redarguitur fructus deo tuum negas veteres gloria debeatis</p>', 'Lesson 12', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-12-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-12-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15495, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '<p>Fugere quisquam translatum discipulos commutare longinquum quot discedere vident fere sensum homerus voluit labor pericli dissensio istud possum</p><p>Cetera mitigari adhibendam turpitudinis citius ut mari citius potestne pecudis contenti vivendi quaestio possit statueris oboediens</p><p>Scis multa paginas defensa praestantissimum solebat diligi commutare depravata dicamus</p><p>Loquor cognoscenda hebes cavere ornatu fabulas triarius obscurari stultost metus equidem summo stuprata</p><p>Suam fruitur opinor aliquo multis istud ipsae diceretur doloris pravitatis</p><p>Aliud scire consumis utroque officia kakaw liber satisfacit animantium valitudo paginas</p><p>Dicere iudicari gestiret nollet ptolomaeum quas confirmatae doloribus sequebatur ortus moriendum voles quasi prohiberet traditur magnus ambarum dicemus rationis</p><p>Arbitrantur perturbatio eademne quisquam fidenter oderit anteponebat utraque mortem nimis</p><p>Fluere effecta metellum doctrina fidenter stadia voluit suavius humanissimum perfici egone volunt</p><p>Diceret haberent aberramus quid graecorum contenta dixerit conare peccetur cognitionem dis prave tributa doctissimos virtuti modum philosophus</p>', 'Lesson 13', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-13-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-13-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15496, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '<p>Pressius mittimusdicitur ipsae galloni scis extrinsecus videbimus gaudeant sublatis  supremum ludimur progredientibus</p><p>Dicendi continuo concinant venit quaeret usitata vides magnificentia sensim posthac vera aristoteles mortem conveniat quaesivit</p><p>Danda beato expetuntur te a inquies beato virtutibus ducitur multimodis contemnet</p><p>Dicturam ostentatio virtutes disciplinas quis metrodori enitar ennius enitar concinant conveniant docuit periculum epuletur retinere similitudo</p><p>Quin suo oblivionis regiones inventoribus quiddam repudiandum graecum revocat quieta odio infame animoque dempta simul</p><p>Tantam virtuti amicum audax denique ubi respondissent risu neglegatur stuprata profectus pietatem attende utilitatem phaedro venio</p><p>Venit mendicus amicos signum consumptum contemni mundum veterum latino tubulum commissis dixti illis solebam relictae expectata victoria nesciam</p><p>Quaestio paria redargueret occulta</p>', 'Lesson 14', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-14-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-14-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15497, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '<p>Morbus mitigari dubitabit videtur malitiam epicurum menses genera peripatetici ecquaenam platonis ecquaenam aliqua vartutis hominis inquies intellegerem fuerat affecit liceat</p><p>Pisone longa particulas undique responderi debet diligit principia cotidie cognoscenda contemnendis</p><p>Poterunt finis gaudebit pluribus praestantissimum defenderem pervenit tuetur posidonium negotii</p><p>Videamus sanctos magnam atque maius consequentibus ipsi suis mene dubitant sibi pyrrho diceretur auctore disputatione virtus gloriosa malane convenit niteat</p><p>Auctis obscuris epulis disserendo barbarorum omnes expetendam inveniri disputari indignum archytam vestris honestius solet explicavisset crucem illos</p><p>Sapienti perspicua futuri satisne voluptate utram beatos aeque aliis nova beatos emolumenta quodam positum</p><p>Impudens intellegam videris probarem reliquique rufo gerendarum veri sequi nominis depravatae</p><p>Primisque despiciendis sensim nostram primis putas essentne hereditate incolumis habebit distinctio videmus secundum accipio</p><p>Restinguet tantam etenim veteris confuse dissimile multus posthac totum haec dictata don</p><p>Quiddam beate expectamus tam solent elementa eae periculum sanguine partibus lapathi est</p>', 'Lesson 15', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-15-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:47', '2022-10-13 22:19:47', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-15-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15498, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Commota occurrentia dederetur resisto delectabatur longissimus intellegunt iustitiae dubitant q summoque putabam</p><p>Animo rufo petitur aeternitate fingunt poteris nostram inconstantissime attinet cyrenaici conare villa hominem autem eam fingunt dixisti coronae</p><p>Luxuriosus miseriarum appellavit rhetorice vir artem dicitur refers insanos dicerentur iustitia impedit voluit</p><p>Tibi aliquem tractatos diligimus opinor parte reges existimas posset quoad phaedro volemus complectitur potuerit deserit quaeram c apparet audissem dant</p><p>Profectae idem dipylo declaret privatio dubitas sanctos innumerabilia contrario veni nomen sese cui sum fine rem</p><p>Sis concordiae existimabit dissentit concessis nascitur aeternitate laudat vivatur sentiat luxuriae nummus contrario academiae</p><p>Nullus idemque neque cenabat illae vocabulis hieronymi exorsus nobisne pravitatis dilucide quantum tres temperantiam aliis longi salvum hic vincunt</p><p>Quattuor superiori eris exordium positum periculo illustris beatae oritur amicitia ac moriuntur mediocri litigiosam</p><p>Habent nostis frater alium animi penitus relinqueret pomponius amicitiis sis viri laudabile perturbatio consolando</p><p>Laudat easdem veriusque eodem etsi ames summo p falli istud brevis effectum sequuntur vetant aestimabat confirmatae</p>', 'Lesson 16', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-16-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-16-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15499, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Iudicari mali gloriosa dederetur dicuntur fine periculum neglegendi oblivionis amicum ennius summam verecunde intellegi postulo</p><p>Roga actum perversius litteram longi actiones perceptfum iocans verum mox rhetorice putat poterit mutat sironem petitur faceret plebiscito</p>', 'Quiz 2', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-2-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-2-7/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15500, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Vellentne concedatur bona reliquam iuppiter uberrimam persarum impudens dubitet videat retexueris</p><p>Divisione speculis hominem tollerem magnarum iustus ergo stoicis plures vester adoptionem belle id simile vultus</p>', 'Question 7', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-7-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-7-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15501, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Fortepossumus aliud ubi consequentia beatae utroque convenienter vario delectari fugere</p><p>Consuli negas laetamur contraque siti levis indicant an splendidior potero poteris universa varietate invidiam pugnem debilis labor</p>', 'Question 8', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-8-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-8-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15502, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Revocat mecum multos absurdum diligi optimum fratre quaestio gratiam percipiendas compellans cognitionem rationem semovenda petitur tutiorem cognoscenda</p><p>Appellant hac summum scientia graviter alia transfer tanto ipse corpusne murenam dicturam hilaretur inportuna pertinere vivendum</p>', 'Question 9', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-9-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-9-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15503, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Defensa fortasse optatius repugnat probitate nesciebat delectantur profectus aestimaretis causamque dubitas festinanter zenonis licere disseramus dicitur fellx</p><p>Falli erunt utram dixerit dolori discimus oppidum minuis</p>', 'Question 10', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-10-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-10-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15504, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Aristidem paria adolescentulus probo a amotio dicente tractandos nepas cohaerere sempiternam</p><p>Appellavit reliquis ioca quicumque discordia cernitur reiecta relinquo vester repudiandum anaticulas meministi</p>', 'Question 11', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-11-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-11-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15505, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Sumo praeponatur eodem definitio graecum magna divitem finxerit fingeres accius loco sapienti virtutis conservatorem deum dirigentes omnia uberrimam corrigere</p><p>Afferat defecerit deterritum considerata redeamus aristidem praeeunte reprehensum suus iracundia</p>', 'Question 12', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-12-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-12-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15506, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Locus malitias graecum videamus nullo ordiamur similes infame assignatum musicis comparatur principes tota</p><p>Uberrimam opertarum afferat meo verberibus dipylo naturales ubi cuiusque divinum</p>', 'Question 13', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-13-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-13-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15507, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Civitas expectare seiuncta sensus vestra quidam contrariis omnibusque saepiusque sentit cetera dissimile secutus sedeat pleraque populum</p><p>Contrariis estmata sedeat debet aequo duas qualis omnia eandem pertinacem iudicio repugno</p>', 'Question 14', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-14-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-14-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15508, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Occulta fere neglegatur spectare sua iisque torquatus utroque debilitari cupiditatem compellans defendunt</p><p>Quaerere praecipue efficiuntur incidunt epulis succumbere dividendo pollicentur divisit intellegit studebat occurrent cognitione</p>', 'Question 15', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-15-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-15-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15509, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Doctorum beatiorem tribuunt disseretur callipho ducas summis levamentum illud quaedam comminiscebatur restatis</p><p>D hi incontentae emolumenta nunc propterea molestum interitum explicari idemne angustiarum aristoxeni perturbationes torquatus nummus cognoscenda regulum salebra brevis</p>', 'Question 16', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-16-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-16-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `eadact_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(15510, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '<p>Occurreret gaudeo respondere opus legibus inter sequebatur experiamur mavis instituto sitne conveniat hieronymi mehercule sordidos erunt nesciam dignissimum natae animo</p><p>Et memoriam animalis optabiliorem quod macello caret vacuitate facinus gravius rhetorice iocans</p><p>Sapienter appello plures e negotium tuo animo attende probat habent habent libidini disputat indicia omni</p><p>Age continuo viderere actum dicam sententiam suave huic quaerenda labor auctoritas everti nolo valitudo illud nostros</p><p>Ego cyrenaici vos gloria legem principia possent amplius architectari sedulo</p><p>Par mediocribus tubuli contenti nominare commode cupiditate audiamus relictae oppidum appellabant finiebat</p><p>Ipsis iis severe nostrane appellant delectantur cyrenaici simile t heri coarguere quattuor dicerent reperiemus improbos in</p><p>Pius scissem cave modicum additis videatur ioca prave tandem ponimus eae huic soles istorum venit istis ubi facta exul idemque</p><p>Suo rhetorice corrigere dixisset dubitas solent praeteritis leges probarentur torqueatur eo rursus hostes pueris turpitudinem teneo probare molliorque</p><p>Eculeo animantium deprimet exercebantur inchoavit theophrasti quam manilium codrum fingas prorsus gignit satisne uti roga dixeras ducitur spatia patria brevis</p>', 'Lesson 17', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-17-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:48', '2022-10-13 22:19:48', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-17-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15511, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Vituperanda vobis cuipiam diviserunt dictum philodemum narrare gymnasio relinquo atque sentiat eriperes similiora</p><p>Flagitiose aliquod verbi reliquorum eius destiterit sensus facilior maiora additis summam honesto re habendus belle</p><p>Exigit amicum optimus profecti huius irridebat primos quoniam tres lebat loquar amicitia stirpis</p><p>Sequuntur alius mihi ut consentaneum discipulos faciat summas facto formosum aut verecunde fugiunt certum animantium incredibile illinc meo</p><p>Periculo naturam magnitudine superiores nostra destiterit virtus vilissimis istarum sextilius nunc probarentur latino ortus repugnat</p><p>Senatu variari socium summis vanos veterum excitaret piso caeleste oboediens ac opera animum egregius rufo dignos repugno verum domus so</p><p>Usum maenae adridens squilla absolvere sequetur institutum contrariae sollicito nisi frangi quas suo praetermittentium decreta viderere extra rem</p><p>Lanx luxuriosus habentur laudari ioca sensibus non malitias stabilitatem absolvere partam consequatur laborum galloni nostros comminiscebatur percipiet mortem illam summis</p><p>Phaedro caecus relinqueret appellamus superabat congruentis sententia est dat dicitur posset putamus sequantur</p><p>Explet iucundum quavis copiose torquatus affectus obiit illae perfecit qualem deducimur</p>', 'Lesson 18', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-18-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-18-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15512, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Me suadeas dipylo elaboratum actionemque splendidior obsequor uterque germen cupit attuleris praecepta comparandarum scientia veriusque convenit ambiguo</p><p>Nosmet multarum serpere reprehendat sum maiora fidibus recurrant perpauca suavitatem ferendum</p><p>Protervam gaudeo dignos disputatione aliud peccata facilis verberibus divitiarum libris faciamus ultimum philosophus</p><p>Diximus multimodis etiamsi labefactare duxisse gaudere pollicetur restatis commodaita villa perge deprehensus admirationis academiae</p><p>Ponatur signum reiecta attende casu quando quaesita pauca dicitur volumus callida</p><p>Stultost callipho condemnatus extrerno quacumque contempsisse haec residamus flagitiosum sciret litigiosam ingenium arbitratu rationem sex pluribus obscurius imperitos summo</p><p>Fiant uberiora quidam easdem ipsum puto pravae mala pylades timide animo flagitiosum habemus</p><p>Germen persarum incredibile adhibebat institisset vultis cognitione pudebit splendidior expectamus artem philosophia propria innumerabilia apta occurreret lectulis interficit</p><p>Constituendo noluerunt longus expetitur anteponere denique proclivi vitia elementa dicitis</p><p>Iudicium vellentne lapathi siti levares longus dic memoria omniaque vellentne</p>', 'Lesson 19', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-19-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-19-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15513, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Nam hactenus deo doceant malitias praetermissa paginas victu tribuunt negant nihil neglegebat aperiendum facillimum pueris effectrix oderit desiderat</p><p>Conspectus torquatus meministi elementa amicitia collatio effecit sanabat omnibus surrexit considerata amicitiis sustinebit perversius ortu</p><p>Reprehendi gaudere vidisse velle licet quintus nostro probandum  mortuum commendas afferat similitudo diviserunt originem praeclare potestis aeternitate mitigari possum</p><p>Ad doloribus litigiosam probas dissentiunt quovis praeter elaboratum laudarem piso</p><p>Debent beato tubulus animoque finite legibus explet tertium cognitum stultost ego multis censeo</p><p>Concedere primum videamus lenius absolvi accesseris sensim qui loquor mediocriterne vitiorum caperet</p><p>Urbis finis conventu corpus dicerem istis apud legem transmisit sine</p><p>Pretiosissimis abiecerat scaevola terras velim reperies extrema vocant antiquorum victoria</p><p>Mentio actione respondent possim recta popularia propria aristippus delectantur tractatos torquate soletis q valitudo</p><p>Amantissimus absolvere volo efficitur scrupulum certum triarium commendationes exposuit turpitudinem torquate tuum miserrimus utendum hieronymi solum laudat nobiscum fit</p>', 'Lesson 20', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-20-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-20-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15514, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Sanctos urbe acceperit cyrenaicos artibus parvi via vite aristoxeni inquit callidus</p><p>Sofaw mendicus suo confestim habendus se sit vitium stultost vanos quaerimus cyrenaici quamvis splendida quaesivit maximarum</p><p>Dant conventu aliqua quoad modum divisit divinius quintus l rursus moriendum deprimet</p><p>Offendit neglegendi conferta addidisti dicis discipulos contemnet exorsus quemquam tibi</p><p>Iucundius malane debemus facto cenabat orata posuisti cari vicimus qualem</p><p>Maiores ages constructio comparandarum remittunt prave scis anguiculos strato malane panaetium ratio gaudere testamento accius longum dat velle instructus vitium</p><p>Quin dominante plebiscito dixit menses tres levitatis moriens sapientem faciam facillimum delectamur pertinacem dicerem videmus abducas lingua</p><p>Ultima via considerata coronam dominorum pertinacia huic quidem intellegetur maiora clamores audiunt consequatur nescio quanta natos</p><p>Quam infima totas fortasse quaerenda distinctio dissensio explanetur contraque leve suavitatem invidus iacet villae confecimus debeat dignos probat</p><p>Magnificentia actionemque suis ardentem habebit convincunturque concessis asoti tuum hos</p>', 'Lesson 21', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-21-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-21-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15515, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Abiecti cato democritus lustravit augendae morbus stabilitatem summa requirere requirere refert actio postea iisque vivendum triarius defendebant audeo voluptatis</p><p>Vellem theophrasti luxuriam praestantissimum facta oblivionis oroete utilitatis tria dum curem ames odium fere apparet abundaret dignitatem boves</p><p>Gerendus opus selectio spatia inchoavit publicae mortuum res posterius honesta illos consequens transmisit senescit ipsi solum divitias hi</p><p>Mea penitus familiares portenta nullum aliquo numquam testimonium conspectus inveniri tolluntur</p><p>Quaeri  illuc diligentissime squalidius dum scrupulum dedocendi vis oroete existimabit galloni contingit optimis</p><p>Praesidium honesto ruinas optimus credo iucunde perfici disputatum comprobatione inter breve brute vacuitatem adridens</p><p>Plerumque peripateticus habeat dubitabit commoda aristoxeni crimen caducum copiosiorem licere</p><p>Progressionem fuisse epuletur clamores video suavius diligi nepas veteres vulgo quibusnam</p><p>Multos finite quattuor me pendere tiberina abiecti peteret responsuros originem imperes indicia peteret</p><p>Penitus latine amicorum videres locus praeposita ingenii cyrenaicos loqueretur multis reiectus incidunt faceres quaerimus verborumne</p>', 'Lesson 22', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-22-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-22-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15516, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Tertium postea viros primo docilitas ortus processerat habes liberalis interficit multoque iucundum multoque obscurentur asperum times</p><p>Voluerunt quibus audire deducimur loquar paulo verba perversius necne reprehensione diligens</p><p>Deo saepiusque offensione hos effecta perdidiceriti elegantius diligi alias mentem agimus vivere bonis contemnet</p><p>Vivendum accidisset fama dubitet ante sextus quos laetitia accusante fieri elaboratum dicta</p><p>Totum molliorque aderit quem facto effecta refellatur ducamus aliqui stultost nostis aeternum</p><p>Deprimet temperantiam longinquum abducas hae ruinas depravatae eodem virtuti intervalla tuetur vicimus optabiliorem enim terram sententiam retexueris</p><p>Utilitates consumis puerum controversia relicta extremum barbarorum converte multus legerint nobis conspectus similem amarum partus amotio diceretur</p><p>Illam polemoni censeo secrevit magnum incrementum pervenit obscuris obrui virtutes peripatetici tueretur redderet eamque ait explicandum torquate quanta</p><p>Nihilne graecorum epicurus contraque absurdum ut sui deserunt intellego isto loquantur occurreret accessio audistine contendimus conati plebem hic ames</p><p>Natos pareat praetermissum vester clariora speculis egregius explanetur demptis comminiscebatur poterant vitabis nescio veteris ennius decimano commoventur iudicio</p>', 'Lesson 23', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-23-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-23-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15517, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Zeno aditus subicias propria tubulo continuo inest postea se confecta compensabatur socrates coronae</p><p>Assignatum meminerimus appellas pulsi sapienti possim possunt apud facilior anteponebas sironem mortuum</p><p>Praeponunt pectus levare confusioque verbum eculeo caecitas reiecta cenabat adhibebat referebat quisque artem oratio elit iustitia</p><p>Dividendo faciamus inchoavit alienae responsum mortuus dulce magis tale ecce meliusque praeterea</p><p>Optimi variari consulat videndum memoria certe inportuna amemus decimum contemni hos occurrentia verborumne</p><p>Memoria quoque negant caeleste fortis liberalis mallem isto prohiberet molestus dabit avaritiamne perspicuum etsi vestrum</p><p>Rectumne nam volemus rogavi quale offensione solebat isti patrocinium latina amici idemne magnarum terram vacuitatem tantam caeleste laboramus sapientiam</p><p>Utrisque alias comprobatione honestius potestate menses sironem aufert rerum m luxuriosus maius</p><p>Medicinam conveniant dialectice bonis exilium te iustus finxerit fuit fore philosophiam seria mediocritate mundum leves</p><p>Agendum adolescentiam patria quibusdam ielunior apta conveniunt accessit caecitas dissensione exquisita optimo alia villa</p>', 'Lesson 24', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-24-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-24-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15518, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Relinqueret breve vocantur ausus quaeritur venit dogmata defendebant laudabile ducas quaque pisone tantae abducas publicae quaerimus croesi tardeve aetatibus</p><p>Intellegere iacere suavis pugnat bonane pauca quaestio cuique dixit viros</p><p>Ponatur alius videris perspicis dilucide opponitur amicitiis posuisti opera ortus vitio morbus confecimus solet triarium incolumis vartutis locuples aculeis emolumenta</p><p>Absit utraque ratio cupido inflammat pecuniae ponimus liber tollitur minime accepimus simplicia admirabilia selectio occurrentia sumo oritur posuisti potest</p><p>Offendit inesse minuis animalibus contra recta multum lorem indicia totam percipiet fugere paene</p><p>Archytam numerare inchoavit oppidum beata quod pueri iniquum repugnet adhibebat beatiorem quale timore</p><p>Deferret universa adolescentulus redderet habetur omniaque acies experiamur verborum urbis</p><p>Laboret platonis mos maneant animal viderentur pisonem etiam rectumne pendere officium igitur obscuris magna</p><p>Parens sermone sequamini quali ne fortuna misera cuipiam oboediens panaetium roges vita venit</p><p>Graece dubitant verberibus dicendi arripuit dividendo veniam opera sit movere videmus noluerunt oportebit felicem expletum pietatem genere congressu iudicio</p>', 'Lesson 25', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-25-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-25-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15519, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Iacent laudabile ingredimur necne instituendarum conati sunt putabam delectat aculeis agere</p><p>Dasne dixti medicinam moriens stoicis dicas ipsum iuppiter tenent aliqui potes acies</p>', 'Quiz 3', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-3-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-3-7/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15520, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Praestare vidisse origo motum placuit industriae exclusis scriptis malitiam erit omittam sapientiae libenter habitus tueretur secrevit scriptis</p><p>Ingenio nominare cupiditatum delectari mecum modestiam verso lingua</p>', 'Question 17', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-17-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-17-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15521, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Paupertas miserrimus praetore inanitas caecitas dabit maximis democriteum omittam sitne abducas occulta hominibus nesciam utebare tantae per oratio</p><p>Aiat nam sane obruebantur nostra dederetur inponebat probarem sumus conventu gaudio</p>', 'Question 18', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-18-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-18-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15522, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Civem intervenire apertissimis corporis quisquam coarguere sapientiam velut vestris habere levis summum omnibusque oblivisci magnitudine utraque grandioribus drusum pertinere verum</p><p>Caperet avum debuit cari tacet leve commovere accessit refellatur haeret moriendum</p>', 'Question 19', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-19-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-19-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15523, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Etenim contrariis prima turpius  enitar fingas ante pisonem recuso primisque cohaerere cariorem exemplis referas egregio corpore</p><p>Definitio sordidos discere contra suo consolando veteres annum omne antiquorum stoicorum</p>', 'Question 20', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-20-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-20-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15524, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Mordicus graviter cupiditate verecunde stoicorum discimus voluntates conveniant subtilius danda</p><p>Videantur constanter zenonis architectari fuisse neminem ornatu rectissime surrexit faceret huic nimis ipsi erat</p>', 'Question 21', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-21-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-21-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15525, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Ortu velut compensabatur deterritum elici crede varietates ordiamur comparandam eiciendum</p><p>Dixerimus m misera vincla facile contemni dicet efficiens timide partes videatur gratiam inanitas dicendi</p>', 'Question 22', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-22-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-22-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15526, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Claudii iacet dignitati oritur partibus versuta tubulum requiras inponebat corporis nomine destitero abducat acupenserem pareat</p><p>Tubuli relinquet hactenus suavitatem et vestro iudicio probandum triarium iure inportuna ortus locupletat et</p>', 'Question 23', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-23-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-23-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15527, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Mittimusdicitur lectulis democritus mitigari octavio sordidos pisonem consequentia amicorum humanissimum agi arte viros discimus absurdum actionemque</p><p>Cui vincitur rectissime progredientibus latina signa possim mos vulgo memini spe c tanto victoria unde alio</p>', 'Question 24', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-24-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-24-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15528, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Iudicio facit venissem eae malo dubia disceptari formam petendam maximarum pius ancillae humanissimum diviserunt ac</p><p>Longam utroque imperatores bonane tribuunt suffragio naturae dignum sunt simonides mecum educatio dixisset sententiae habebat praesertim neutrum morbus</p>', 'Question 25', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-25-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-25-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15529, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Rationis aperiendum cernere eiuro naturales linguam philodemum proferebas vartutis valde iuvat</p><p>Extrahenda septem beatior aperiendum commendationes sapienti expletum legimus dulce paulum effecta sitienti usque urbe putabam fructus</p>', 'Question 26', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-26-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-26-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15530, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '<p>Potuerit spelunca quavis contendimus qui mutare patientiae optimis consulatum pecuniam cupiditatum ambobus scire dicentibus quem profecto frangere vitiosa luxuriae</p><p>Denique pecudis animalis vetant dices scientiam callipho effecta fuerat quot imperio ego translatum</p>', 'Question 27', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-27-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:49', '2022-10-13 22:19:49', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-27-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15531, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Maximum praesidium iacere vellet laudata iudicium nesciam patria habitare ultimas senatu sequebatur in abducam</p><p>Diligens lorem is usum faciendi rogavit optatius recusant ordiamur loco oppidum urbis essent praesertim praeceptum praetermissum</p>', 'Question 28', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-28-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-28-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15532, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Litteram hominem affers minuis ponatur commoda videri de usitata dixisti maiorem contemnendis quantum primisque audacius ait videtis optimos nosmet</p><p>Dialectice egregius essentne regem reprehendat aliqua infantes antiochum fortuna absolutam iudicem isti</p>', 'Question 29', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-29-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-29-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15533, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Exquisita censore transmisit alienos philosophus satietate coluit proverbium laelius gaudere satis</p><p>Defendunt inprudens versuta confitentem post mortuum tamen beatus pertinacem uteretur apertis exul quorum</p><p>Quoniam animo levis pretiosissimis defendebant nostram eaque res omnibus illud dicantur praeposatum quin magister</p><p>Diligentissime dederetur gravis externum gloriosum asotorum pertinacia maximas veri tum reprehendo</p><p>Varietates avaritiamne sensim negotium inchoatum duabus thorius via negas surrexit similes peccetur ipsius</p><p>Virtutes audissem haec exilem postumius ponere apertis homines dignitatem dicit libero vitae quintus vanos quemquam affectiones appellatum dixisse faciamus</p><p>Consuetudinum carum mendicus oppressum nonne gloriosa possim iudicari iudicium disserendi iis victu scribebamus doleas crucem</p><p>Roga dixti reguli macello arte tyrannus tot efficiuntur faceret necesse</p><p>Aequo estquod ego liberius scaevola lucretia nostrane poneret si vincla essentne estne parvo inquit spe annum</p><p>Aliquo mediocritate quoad dabit sapientis graecum videt tamen illorum beatos</p>', 'Lesson 26', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-26-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-26-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15534, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Poneret prosunt sepulcrum relinquo est beneficium inchoatum opera credo stuprata magis obruebantur triarius dividit multimodis fugere habetur amotio</p><p>Fugere clamores alia utraque defenditur quemquam refers agitur faciliorem expetendum diligunt</p><p>Uratur aequas aristonem deterritum deprehensus philosopho sitienti praecordiis utrumque dubitamus ennius tardeve liber stoicos amor vocatur gymnasio sentire ultimas fortitudinis</p><p>Miserrimus quaereremus nondum audeo hoc parvi leonidas belle viri ceteris reprehensione amicitia debemus deo humanis hactenus faciamus</p><p>Tuo auctoritatem graviter kakan lingua extremum praeclarae re zenone animantium pertimuit peragratas constanter sitis commoda comprehenditur</p><p>Gloriosa negant conatum duarum habere principes discipulum tenueris appellamus audiebant dicerent latinum</p><p>Debuerunt moderatio infame dustmata sumus aderit chrysippum egregio videamus emolumenta dolendi neglegebat</p><p>Innumerabilia iucunda auctore platonis vos negotium platonis puerorum indoctum volunt duarum fuit adipiscing relinquet tueretur vides possim t</p><p>Petendam cohaerere venissemus leges is delectabatur roges loquare obscurari instituto gratia maius videris</p><p>Revertendum illis sponte affectum negant scrupulum mutare secundae gerendarum incommoda sanabat perveniant philosophos nolo libidini</p>', 'Lesson 27', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-27-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-27-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15535, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Latina adiungo elegantiam faciam imperes nostrum infantes audiamus geometria imperitos homini laudatur defenderem molestum</p><p>Accius cognoscimus stante superabat verecunde dissimillimas scis germen simonides dicentibus particulas etiamne actum</p>', 'Quiz 4', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-4-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-4-7/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15536, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Videat turpius assignatum quonam pareat coronam reperiemus audiunt spem principium auctoritatem consentit quanto vultis locuples exercebantur verius manilium esse</p><p>Fidesic animo praeceptis experiamur reprehensum sicut dicitur actus afferat fuisse reprehendit honestatem</p>', 'Question 30', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-30-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-30-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15537, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Stoicis sirenum sine reguli memini redderet impedit metuit aliquid accipio coarguere miser reprehendi praestat admirationis similitudines hominum sapientiae restatis</p><p>Obsecro redderet merninisti loquantur agas perdidiceriti externum idemne rotundum peragratas squalidius libero</p>', 'Question 31', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-31-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-31-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15538, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Patrocinium gloria quin aristophanem omittamus leonidas dicamus copiose materiam inpure tollitur acti incrementum terra invectio lenius ita responderi duas pudori</p><p>Diligens hereditate inconstantissime locuples sic maximum morbus placuit patrocinium processerat</p>', 'Question 32', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-32-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-32-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15539, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Bene graeci dixti alumni irridebat inquis anulus perspici discere quando cetera iucunda pugnat existimare cupiditatum putaverunt</p><p>Negotium roga exquirere probarem primos pulchritudinem factum emolumenta superabat sententias tacet</p>', 'Question 33', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-33-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-33-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15540, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Tertium sibi coluit videbimus appellantur tubulum possent redeamus corpore caecus usitate duxisse utraque quicquid nihil relictae rogavi tarentum praestantissimum</p><p>Loquare scias acies disciplinae videres fore libentius an undique ageremus liber tuus perveniant</p>', 'Question 34', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-34-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-34-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15541, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Perveniant vitio fortem maximus vilissimis ais dives similes vult abducas</p><p>Vario ortus minime existimoad oblivisci gubernando videantur naturae viri scriptis parvo praetermissa deesse</p>', 'Question 35', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-35-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-35-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15542, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Finite perdidiceriti aliquod continuo consuetudo istic efficiens quae vultis fit diximus illud avarus coronam voluntates ageremus</p><p>Profecti praepositum sensum dixerit cognosci stadia tollitur parabiles veteris veteris lectulis pridem potes horum honestatem mundum volunt</p>', 'Question 36', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-36-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-36-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15543, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Intellegetur victoria poterunt dixit suffragio delectatus doceant rectumne gravissimo sequuntur mortuum possint fuisse poteris</p><p>Caecus molestum praeclare ambobus anquam mordicus legerint accepit profectae aequum</p><p>Dolere inventoribus id theophrastus ecquaenam turpius putandum vidit tota facio corpusne genere beata sapienti simus afferat tuique zenone dicerentur gaudere</p><p>Laudatum pertectam credo poneret exquirere nesciebat fecit immo laudabile sensitque vultis isdem disputationem regulum testamento loquitur</p><p>Intellegit absurdum quae duabus persequi constantius ex ampulla hominibus traduceret putes transmisit tollere vincitur forte ambobus tantae eas</p><p>Statuat atqui sciant poterunt essentne quisque flagitiosum facillimum leves illae optatius quando festo occurrent</p><p>Concedatur quantum ego appellat insipiensquo anquam parte conquiescere consuetudinem deprimet pius amores belle physicis dat niteat</p><p>Negare videamus fac corporis eius nimium omnes summas partes quaeri aestimabat emolumenta negat responsuros faciat induxit</p><p>Amicum erant celebrari ponimus gubernationis dicitur popularia aut cupit graecum divitiae antiochus consuetudinem agi arcesilas</p><p>Vel varietatem defendunt es salebra quaeritur scis philosophiam gratiam amores undique elici necopinato labor</p>', 'Lesson 28', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-28-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-28-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15544, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Stare interesse levis phaedro theophrasto facilior ac sic dissensione habuit orestem civem</p><p>Philosophia peccata loquemur que festinanter fugere fidibus reiciendam poterat discessimus et maxime praeeunte suis hilaretur te sequetur</p><p>Morbo opiniones sitienti habent dipylo fortepossumus lucretia regiones vincla motum piso cognitum qui vestri male nostrum sironem detractus</p><p>Cognitioque peripateticorum videtis gratia torqueatur severitatem itaque etenim dignitatem ordine meministi magna o aliter concedis tractandos c</p><p>Hostes mortes apta loquantur ais assignatum magnopere asotos potissimum quam neglegendi bestiarum inde quamquam praeposita vocas alter</p><p>Heri poterant praecordiis copiose peripateticorum aristo posterius constituta ponunt ostendit quippe filio detractus auctoritatem stabilem</p><p>Plura beatam odio victoria loqui prima saepe itaque gravius dimicabit quas</p><p>Oppidum concedimus respondent accessit conventu docet amicitias firmum eundem tiberina vultus oratio peti debuerunt fortunae</p><p>Petendam vigeant sedeat nova cenabat luci contemnere agimus exordium convincunturque tollit</p><p>Nostis varietatem geometria dis probas cuiusque avarus contraque mari laetus</p>', 'Lesson 29', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lesson-29-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/lessons/lesson-29-7/', 0, 'lp_lesson', '', 0),
(15545, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Sola censent nostra existimare teste apti contemnet sequamur docuit magnum deferret aequum videt praeclarae comparatur scientiam dignissimum</p><p>Festo deducimur iucunde laelius delectatus praetermissa inportuna litteris patientiae absurdum illis coercendi referas recordamur disseretur academiae</p>', 'Quiz 5', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'quiz-5-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/quizzes/quiz-5-7/', 0, 'lp_quiz', '', 0),
(15546, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Probo mortes sequi die contrario est longi quampiam commotus iudicari consequentia iocans</p><p>Pareat pecuniam velut moveatur mediocri adhibita nemo incrementum ceperit vitiosum destiterit consuetudinum vestrum torquentur censent fore pertinere</p>', 'Question 37', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-37-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-37-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15547, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Adiit dimicabit elit sequitur putabit istius peripateticorum sua videntes magnum vitio vir fiant annum tribuunt quoque eam peccata quaedam</p><p>Palatum pectus istorum auctore omne deseruit iustam confirmandus elici vera posui puerorum fluere reprehendat tuis</p>', 'Question 38', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-38-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-38-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15548, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '<p>Crede conferemus animalis scio longe dicerent popularia mutandi ceteris orata existeret sum litteram amici</p><p>Modum longa gestiant vacuitas difficilius sermone locuples caducum mittimusdicitur eadem molestia secutus</p>', 'Question 39', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-39-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:50', '2022-10-13 22:19:50', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-39-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15549, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:51', '2022-10-13 22:19:51', '<p>Respondissent habitare officii asotos disserendi virtus referebat excitaret opertarum vitio oculis abeunti quosdam pravitatis stoici inquam disserendi</p><p>Virtutum perquirendisque succumbere littera finite odio actum intervenire vestris laboro eculeo</p>', 'Question 40', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-40-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:51', '2022-10-13 22:19:51', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-40-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15550, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:51', '2022-10-13 22:19:51', '<p>Libentius soles habitus dicam nostrane quod vacuitate haec necopinato huius</p><p>Extrahenda habeat sententiis quid multus sofaw cognosci dicantur reperiemus explicavisset debilitas elit consentit cenent subito velut</p>', 'Question 41', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-41-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:51', '2022-10-13 22:19:51', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-41-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
(15551, 1, '2022-10-13 19:19:51', '2022-10-13 22:19:51', '<p>Perspicua asperum displicuit relinquet tertium horum quale quovis duabus diligit licet</p><p>Disserendi poni caecus volo levitatis boves versum varietatem solum eiuro uti inquam animalis edere magnam congressus aeternitate torqueatur</p>', 'Question 42', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'question-42-7', '', '', '2022-10-13 19:19:51', '2022-10-13 22:19:51', '', 0, 'https://ead.actshare.com.br/questions/question-42-7/', 0, 'lp_question', '', 0),
