(109, 'product_management_card_sorting', 'survey', 'en_US', 'How do you create and edit products?', 'Have a say in the future of WooCommerce. Take part in a brief exercise and help us understand what information is important to you while editing products.', '{}', 'unactioned', 'woocommerce.com', '2023-05-18 23:58:06', NULL, 0, 'plain', '', 0, 0, 'info'),
